      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Officer Sirrikis Ryktor [npc=17794]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 67\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nDark Reign (Min: Amiable)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dark Reign +10\n- Lanys T`Vyl +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Firiona Vie -10\n- Norrath's Keepers -10\n**Quest Items:**\n- Impure Goblin Blood [item=33962]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Stillmoon Temple [zone=275]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Stillmoon dirt tender [npc=18363]\n- a Stillmoon gravel warden [npc=17588]\n- a Stillmoon laborer [npc=17576]\n- a Stillmoon novice [npc=17591]\n- a Stillmoon witchdoctor [npc=17590]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 14 06:21:45 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Officer Sirrikis Ryktor ( **click for map image**) at the Dark Reign camp in the caves, /loc 3050, -350._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 67+\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Dark Reign\n\\- Completion of all Tier 1 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Sirrikis Ryktor'\nOfficer Sirrikis Ryktor says 'Perhaps you will find a path to the higher ranks of the Dark Reign -- a place I'm sure I shall find myself someday... someday.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Blood from Sand'.\nYou already have some experience dealing with goblins, but there seems to be endless hordes of them. Rumor tells us that the goblins in Stillmoon Temple are different than those in Tirranun's Delve. Some say they are earthen somehow. We will need to investigate the rumors and study these creatures to see if perhaps they can be exploited. By any means necessary, preferably the most brutal, go loot 7 Impure Goblin Blood.\n\n---\n\nLoot 7 Impure Goblin Blood 0/7 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_These are an uncommon drop from the following goblin mobs in the non-instanced Stillmoon Temple:_\na Stillmoon dirt tender\na Stillmoon gravel warden\na Stillmoon laborer\na Stillmoon novice\na Stillmoon witchdoctor\n_Upon looting the fifth item, the task completes and you see:_\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign",
