      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Volska's Husk [zone=715]\n**Who:**\n- Gihbra Artinguard [npc=35069]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Mephit Shaman [npc=34929]\n- a bellikos warden [npc=35078]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Gihbra #1: Into The Fire [quest=5023]\n- Gihbra #2: Uncover The Truth [quest=5024]\n- Gihbra #4: The Arms of Brell [quest=5037]\n- Gihbra #5: Brell's Will Be Done [quest=5038]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Feb 22 17:27:23 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the third in a series of five that begins with Gihbra Artinguard in Volska's Husk. He is located at approximately -140, -165, -47. Be careful in this zone as there are no especially safe points, including the locations of task givers._\n_In order to request this task, you must first have completed \"Into the Fire\" and \"Uncover the Truth\"._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'I cannot believe everything that has gone on lately. It is only a matter of time before the Autarchians try to take over the whole of the underfoot. Perhaps we can [slow] them down a bit.'\nYou say, 'Slow them down?'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'The mephits appear to be indigenous to this area. The Bellikos must be controlling them so they may harvest the Greken eggs without the mephits' [interference].'\nYou say, 'Interfence?'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'So will the mephits fight the Autarchians if the Bellikos did not have a hold on them? I guess there is no way to know for sure. But it is worth a [shot].'\nYou say, 'I'll give it a shot'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'So then it is settled. You must go to the mephits' lair and [kill] the Bellikos warden who is influencing them.'\nYou say, 'I'll kill her!'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Thank you. I am sure the mephits will make it difficult to get to the warden. You should go speak to the Mephit Shaman in Lichen Creep first. If you convince him, I am sure it will go a long way to help here.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Autochthonous Support'.\n\n---\n\nSpeak to the Mephit Shaman in Lichen Creep 0/1 (Lichen Creep)\n_The Mephit Shaman is found at location -1035, 920, 40. Two golems that are sometimes see-invis are at either of its sides._\nYou say, 'Hail, Mephit Shaman'\nMephit Shaman says 'Dis Bellikos do not be mess wif da mephits in da husk. I do not allow it. Da mephit in husk dos know better den to be messin wif da Bellikos. More mephits I will send to da husk when I can. For now, da mephits who help da Bellikos should die.'\nKill the Bellikos warden in the mephit's lair 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\n_The Bellikos warden spawns at -161, -625, -133 (in the mephit caves of Volska's Husk -- the southeast corner of the northeast caves in the zone)._\nReturn to Gihbra Artinguard 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nThe mephits are free of Bellikos influence. They should no longer aid the Autarchians, when the shaman sends more mephits to the area.\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Now maybe the mephits will not take too kindly to the Autarchian's presence'\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience\n~40 Brellium Tokens\n_Completion of this task leads into the next one in the series, \"The Arms of Brell\"._\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
