      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Kaelynn Stearns [ _Rank II Spells_]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 89\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Faction Required:**\nDream Delvers (Min: Indifferent)\n**Quest Items:**\n- Greater Nebulous Dream Fragment [item=90069]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Oct 13 21:50:50 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _You can find Kaelynn Stearns ( **click for map image**) the safe area of the northern part of Feerrott, the Dream (approximate location 1150, 1330)._\n_You'll need at least indifferent faction with Dream Delvers in order to get these spells._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kaelynn Stearns'\nKaelynn Stearns says 'Greetings, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Have you found any [dreams] recently?'\nYou say, 'Found any dreams? Have you gone mad?'\nKaelynn Stearns says 'Well, dream fragments. Nebulous fragments, to be exact. I've found that they can be woven into a lesson to learn, like an ability or a [spell].'\nYou say, 'How can I get a spell?'\nKaelynn Stearns says 'If you bring me a nebulous dream fragment, I can weave a new experience for you.'\n_A task window pops up. Pick out which type of dream fragment you have._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Greater Nebulous Dream Fragment'.\nKaelynn will give you a level 89 ability in return for a Greater Nebulous Dream Fragment. Be careful not to choose an ability you have already learned!\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Greater Nebulous Dream Fragment to Kaelynn 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_On turning a fragment, you get your choice out of all your Level 89 spells or tomes. (You can also get your Dream Fragment back by choosing it as a reward.)_\n\n---\n\n_Available Rewards:_\n_NOTE: Each line listed below represents one reward; some spells are rewarded together._\nBard\nSong: Noira's Song of Suffering Rk. II\nSong: Slumber of Sionachie Rk. II\nSong: Voice of Sionachie Rk. II\nSong: War March of Dagda Rk. II\nBeastlord\nSpell: Frozen Venin Rk. II\nSpell: Glacial Lance Rk. II\nSpell: Glacial Roar Rk. II\nSpell: Growl of the Tiger Rk. II\nSpell: Spirit of Kron Rk. II\nSpell: Spiritual Enhancement Rk. II\nBerserker\nTome of Avenging Flurry Discipline Rk. II\nTome of Jarring Slam Rk. II\nTome of Savage Volley Rk. II\nCleric\nSpell: Devout Hammer of Zeal Rk. II, Spell: Chromarend Rk. II\nSpell: Mark of the Devout Rk. II\nSpell: Glorious Censure Rk. II\nSpell: Shining Rampart Rk. II\nSpell: Dissolve Corruption Rk. II, Spell: Purged Blood Rk. II\nSpell: Silent Proclamation Rk. II, Spell: Tectonic Shock Rk. II\nDruid\nSpell: Gelid Moonbeam Rk. II, Spell: Purged Blood Rk. II\nSpell: Polyporous Assault Rk. II, Spell: Summer Prominence Rk. II\nSpell: Shell of the Reptile Rk. II, Spell: Chant of the Tae Ew Rk. II\nSpell: Sunrise Blessing Rk. II, Spell: Talisman of the Relentless Rk. II\nSpell: Sunbrand Rk. II, Spell: Tectonic Shock Rk. II\nSpell: Argent Frost Rk. II\nEnchanter\nSpell: Baffling Constriction Rk. II\nSpell: Color Clash Rk. II\nSpell: Dizzying Helix Rk. II, Spell: Echo of Subjugation Rk. II\nSpell: Legion of Zykean Rk. II, Spell: Manastorm Rk. II\nSpell: Serene Wave Rk. II\nSpell: Brimstone Brawn Rk. II, Spell: Twilight Rune Rk. II\nMagician\nSpell: Burning Veil Rk. II\nSpell: Chaotic Blessing Rk. II\nSpell: Circle of Dreamfire Rk. II\nSpell: Iceflame Ward Rk. II\nSpell: Grant Glacial Paradox Rk. II\nSpell: Rain of Daggers Rk. II, Spell: Scalding Winds Rk. II\nMonk\nTome of Jab Through Rk. II\nTome of Void Body Rk. II\nTome of Six-Step Pattern Rk. II\nNecromancer\nSpell: Arachne's Pallid Haze Rk. II; Spell: Rilfed's Swift Sickness Rk. II\nSpell: Necrotic Boils Rk. II; Spell: Scapegoat Rk. II\nSpell: Darkside Rk. II\nSpell: Pyre of Nos Rk II\nSpell: Tenuous Darkness Rk. II; Spell: Thought Flay Rk. II\nSpell: Thoughtburn Rk. II\nPaladin\nSpell: Brell's Tellurian Rampart Rk. II\nSpell: Mark of the Defender Rk. II\nSpell: Penitence Rk. II\nSpell: Stubborn Stance Rk. II\nSpell: Wave of Penitence Rk. II\nRanger\nSpell: Desperate Deluge Rk. II\nSpell: Devastating Edges Rk. II\nSpell: Eyes of the Wolf Rk. II\nSpell: Fusillade of Arrows Rk. II\nSpell: Mottlecoat Rk. II\nSpell: Summer's Storm Rk. II\nRogue\nTome of Fleet-Footed Discipline Rk. II\nTome of Misdirection Rk. II\nTome of Pinpoint Flaws Rk. II\nShadow Knight\nSpell: Call of Dusk Rk. II\nSpell: Drape of Fear Rk. II\nSpell: Gorgon Spear Rk. II\nSpell: Insidious Blight Rk. II\nSpell: Loathing Rk. II\nSpell: Stubborn Stance Rk. II\nShaman\nSpell: Chant of the Tae Ew Rk. II\nSpell: Talisman of the Relentless Rk. II\nSpell: Hex Rk. II\nSpell: Ice Floe Rk. II\nSpell: Nectar of Torment Rk. II; Spell: Undaleen's Venom Rk. II\nSpell: Wind of Malisene Rk. II\nWarrior\nTome of Forceful Attraction Rk. II\nTome of Jab Through Rk. II\nTome of Wheeling Blades Rk. II\nWizard\nSpell: Blazing Pillar Rk. II; Spell: FlashPyre Rk. II\nSpell: Chaos Char Rk. II; Spell: Magmatic Downpour Rk. II\nSpell: Crystalwing Carapace Rk. II; Spell: Denunciation of Havoc Rk. II\nSpell: Ethereal Glaciation Rk. II\nSpell: Glacial Cascade Rk. II\nSpell: Lithara's Pyroblade Rk. II\n- Greater Nebulous Dream Fragment [item=90069]\n- Song: Noira's Song of Suffering Rk. II [item=90551]\n- Song: Slumber of Sionachie Rk. II [item=93536]\n- Song: Voice of Sionachie Rk. II [item=94810]\n- Song: War March of Dagda Rk. II [item=92813]\n- Spell: Arachne's Pallid Haze Rk. II [item=92877]\n- Spell: Argent Frost Rk. II [item=91864]\n- Spell: Baffling Constriction Rk. II [item=90239]\n- Spell: Blazing Pillar Rk. II [item=93021]\n- Spell: Brell's Tellurian Rampart Rk. II [item=92647]\n- Spell: Brimstone Brawn Rk. II [item=90