      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Vaytok [ _Portal Tender_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dire Tuning Crystal [item=106466]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:31:16 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with a pig named Vaytok in Shard's Landing (in the eastern part of the crater: 200, -640, 1)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Vaytok'\nVaytok says 'Oh, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, how is you? Drakk tell me lots about heroes like you. Also tell me lots about Cazic-Thule, sounds like nice guy. Hey, have you seen my home? This portal take you there if you [attuned] to it. Palace is nice place!'\nYou say, 'Attuned?'\nVaytok says 'Me hope you like palace. Nice place, comfy home. Come back soon and say what you think of home!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth Portal Activation'.\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal while at your destination.\n\n---\n\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\n_Enter Grelleth's Palace from its actual access point. Head to the Resplendent Temple and into the caves to the quest NPC \"Udgar the Brave\" at 2895, 100, -333: This is in the underground network of caves -- in a dead end in the north-central part of the caves (not available on the \"Find\" function)._\n_For your \"resplendent.txt\" map:_\nP -97.8480, -2895.9031, -333.5678, 0, 0, 240, 2, Grelleth's\\_Palace\n_There, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task._\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth",
    },
