      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Master Hunter Jilare [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a slatescale slitherer [npc=41420]\n- an ivyscale slitherer [npc=41448]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Shard's #1: Welcome to Shard's Landing [quest=5978]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 17:46:33 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Master Hunter Jilare ( map in Shard's Landing. She is found at 245, 20, 1 (in the crater, southwest of the crystal shard)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Welcome to Shard's Landing\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Master Hunter Jilare'\nMaster Hunter Jilare sighs, 'Well I guess the management sees fit to keep you around here but I work 'with' them and not 'for' them. You're going to have to prove yourself to 'me'. I have a list of errands that need completing if you're ready to get to [work].'\nYou say, 'What work?'\nMaster Hunter Jilare says 'Here's what I need done. Don't go getting yourself killed on the job.'\n_A task window pops up and offers nine tasks._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Snakes and Snakes'.\nMaster Hunter Jilare needs you to collect oil for Engineer Eilisia, something about keeping her silly clockworks in running order. Clearly the best type of oil for this job is snake oil!\nTravel through the landing and do away with some of the local snakes. You can find them hiding in the grass or sunbathing on stones.\n\n---\n\nGut a few slatescale slitherers 0/10 (Shard's Landing)\nGut a few ivyscale slitherers 0/10 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
