, -203.2414, 127, 0, 0, 1, Captain\\_Nalia\nP -990.5510, -787.8346, -202.6010, 127, 0, 0, 1, Captain\\_Nalia\nP -807.1838, -768.8764, -203.2417, 127, 0, 0, 1, Captain\\_Nalia\nP 579.0501, -1647.6152, -202.6460, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chamberlain\\_Celain\nP 553.3417, -1483.1653, -203.2132, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chamberlain\\_Celain\nP 556.8410, -1985.2354, -203.2139, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chamberlain\\_Celain\nP 562.9944, -747.3876, -252.4594, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chief\\_Warden\\_Varken\nP 756.8528, -568.4000, -248.0761, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chief\\_Warden\\_Varken\nP 877.4445, -407.6827, -252.4591, 127, 0, 0, 1, Chief\\_Warden\\_Varken\nP -591.2670, -2387.2576, -130.8561, 127, 0, 0, 1, Guardian\\_Harell\nP -898.2049, -2344.7622, -130.5676, 127, 0, 0, 1, Guardian\\_Harell\nP -844.4290, -2144.2009, -134.8788, 127, 0, 0, 1, Guardian\\_Harell\nP 1706.7860, -49.7815, -231.0050, 127, 0, 0, 1, Magma\\_Behemoth\nP 2148.4041, -178.7254, -262.4162, 127, 0, 0, 1, Magma\\_Behemoth\nP 1434.6066, -110.4315, -230.9562, 127, 0, 0, 1, Magma\\_Behemoth\nP -1112.5184, -1821.1698, -153.2917, 127, 0, 0, 1, Master\\_Sage\\_Lowenn\nP -632.7309, -1949.2726, -129.7767, 127, 0, 0, 1, Master\\_Sage\\_Lowenn\nP -1039.4434, -2365.3499, -129.8966, 127, 0, 0, 1, Master\\_Sage\\_Lowenn\n_NOTE: \"Councilor Grael\" and \"Inferno Vortex\" are found in instanced zones. \"Councilor Grael\" appears in \"Rings of Fire\" (the first mission for Argin-Hiz), and \"Inferno Vortex\" can spawn in the heroic adventure for Argin-Hiz, \"A Posthumous Preposition\"._",
