      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Leopold Crunchbasher [ _Portal Tender_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dire Tuning Crystal [item=106466]\n**Related Zones:**\n- East Wastes, Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening [zone=868]\n- Eastern Wastes [zone=110]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:31:14 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with a rather well-spoken Ogre named Leopold Crunchbasher ( map) in Shard's Landing (in the southwestern part of the crater: 170, 380, 1)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Leopold Crunchbasher'\nLeopold Crunchbasher says 'A gracious and formal welcome to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, your reputation precedes you. My associate and I have been spearheading an investigation into the nature of these 'new' incarnations of familiar lands. If you are seeking to use this portal as a means of rapid transit to the feartouched lands of Velious then you will first need to [attune] your soul to the portal.'\nYou say, 'Attune?'\nLeopold Crunchbasher says 'The attuning process is rather simple and one you may remember if you were party among the first explorers of the lands after the Icebreaker touched down in Iceclad. Travel to the Eastern Wastes by natural means and make your way through the gate to its feartouched incarnation. Once there, activate the attuning crystal and simply return here. This will be enough to align your being to the magic used in the construction of these portals.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Eastern Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening Portal Activation'.\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal while at your destination.\n\n---\n\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Eastern Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Enter Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening from its actual access point. Head to the Eastern Wastes and to the very far southeastern corner of the zone where you'll find a crystal at -9100, -4200, 143._\n_For your \"eastwastes.txt\" map:_\nP 4191.0000, 9091.0000, 143.0967, 0, 0, 240, 2, Zeixshi-Kar's\\_Awakening\n_There, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task._\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to Eastern Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening",
