      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Argin-Hiz [zone=1004]\n**Who:**\n- Schiornur [npc=47272]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Brilliant Fire Ruby [item=117846]\n- Dim Red Gem [item=117847]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a blaze vortex [npc=47276]\n- a keeper of the flame [npc=47280]\n- a laborer [npc=47282]\n- a soldier [npc=47290]\n- a steward [npc=47291]\n- a warden [npc=47293]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 15 23:46:27 2014\nModified: Tue Jun 25 04:10:57 2024 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is independent from any others (not part of an arc). It begins with Schiornur ( **click for map image**), a fire imp in Argin-Hiz._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n1\\. Explore the shop north of the fountain 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n/loc 1968, -588, -199\n2\\. Explore the shop west of the fountain 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n/loc 1698, -307, -199\n3\\. Explore the shop east of the fountain 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n/loc 1704, -841, -199\n4\\. Explore the shop south of the fountain 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n/loc 1489, -580, -199\n_Simple directional explore steps._\n5\\. Speak to Schiornur 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n6\\. \"Question\" a few Sol`Dal 0/5 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Kill any elves that are NOT named \"an ember \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\"._\n7\\. Speak to Schiornur 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n8\\. Make your way to the mines 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n9\\. \"Search\" the miners for clues 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Kill \"a laborer\" until you get an Brilliant Fire Ruby on your cursor (will take 4-7 kills)._\n10\\. Speak to Schiornur 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n11\\. Explore the Keeper's Tower courtyard 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Updates around /location 2020, 415 -142._\n12\\. Follow the Brilliant Fire Ruby's directions 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n_You'll be led to a blaze vortex in the courtyard area. When you get within 100' range of the mob, it attacks. Upon its death, you get a \"Dim Red Gem\"._\n13\\. Speak to Schiornur 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
