      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Degmar, the Lost Castle [zone=1019]\n**Who:**\n- Ranpodia Stonewalker [npc=47724]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Degmar guard [npc=48061]\n- a Degmar guardian [npc=48051]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:42:13 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo kill task that begins with Ranpodia Stonewalker ( **click for map image**) at the zone-in of Degmar, the Lost Castle._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- No tasks\n_Say \"help\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Ranpodia Stonewalker'\nRanpodia Stonewalker says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Have I seen you before? You seem familiar. You look like you aren't out to [get] me. Prove it and [help] me!'\nYou say, 'I'm not out to get you... Who is?'\nRanpodia Stonewalker says 'Of course. They all are! The overeager [guards]. The complacent [commoners]. The silent [librarians]. The killing [ghosts]. The partying [revelers]. The rude brewery [employees]. And especially the oh so smug [artisans].'\nYou say, 'The guards?'\nRanpodia Stonewalker says 'Yes. They think I don't notice the way they stare at me. The way they envy me. The way they sharpen their blades. They want to kill me, but Alast will not let them... Alast wants the privilege, but I won't let him near me. Maybe I can get him first.'\nYou say, 'I will help!'\nRanpodia Stonewalker says 'Yes. Relief from the constant threat! Go [get] them! You don't need any [help]!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Paranoia: Guards'.\nRanpodia Stonewalker is convinced that everyone is out to kill him. His solution is to have you kill them first.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 guards 0/10 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n_Kill 10 \"guard\" or \"guardian\" mobs. Upon the last kill, you see:_\nRanpodia Stonewalker seems slightly calmer. He eyes you with some suspicion.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n52 platinum, 5 gold",
