      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 103\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Median Writ of the Combine [item=126759]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 6 00:32:31 2016\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Empires of Kunark Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Level 103 Rank II Spells in EoK.**\n_Loot a \" Median Writ of the Combine [item=126759]\" (can drop from nameds AND general mob population in Empires of Kunark), and right-click it to open up a spell reward window._\n_No class should need any more than three Writ's per level to obtain all their spells._\n\n---\n\n**Rewarded Spells**\n**Information needed for each class: Which spells are rewarded together?**\n**Bard** \\- No new songs.\n**Beastlord** \\- No new spells/tomes.\n**Berserker** \\- Tome: Sapping Strikes Rk. II\n**Cleric** \\- Scroll: Divine Alliance Rk. II\n**Druid** \\- No new spells.\n**Enchanter** \\- No new spells.\n**Magician** \\- No new spells.\n**Monk** \\- No new tomes.\n**Necromancer** \\- No new spells.\n**Paladin** \\- Scroll: Harmonious Blessing Rk. II\n**Ranger** \\- Scroll: Bosquestalker's Alliance Rk. II, Tome: Focused Squall of Blades Rk. II, Scroll: Silent Shot Rk. II\n**Rogue** \\- Tome: Poisonous Alliance Rk. II\n**Shadow Knight** \\- Scroll: Harmonious Disruption Rk.II\n**Shaman** \\- Scroll: Ancient Alliance Rk. II\n**Warrior** \\- Tome: Harmonious Precision Rk. II\n**Wizard** \\- No new spells.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Scroll: Ancient Alliance Rk. II [item=126873]\n- Scroll: Bosquestalker's Alliance Rk. II [item=127209]\n- Scroll: Divine Alliance Rk. II [item=127257]\n- Scroll: Harmonious Blessing Rk. II [item=127219]\n- Scroll: Harmonious Disruption Rk. II [item=127162]\n- Scroll: Silent Shot Rk. II [item=127212]\n- Tome: Focused Squall of Blades Rk. II [item=127206]\n- Tome: Harmonious Precision Rk. II [item=127273]\n- Tome: Poisonous Alliance Rk. II [item=126844]\n- Tome: Sapping Strikes Rk. II [item=127046]",
