ome knight in shining armor to go out there and [kill them] before they come.'\nYou say, 'I can kill some of them for you.'\nYou say, 'I can kill some of them for you.'\nCalam says, 'You can? Well, that's a wonder, isn't it?' Calam seems slightly soothed, a little less frightened. He glances at Ansie as if trying to give her some hope too.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Dark Waters.'\n\n---\n\nAnsie and Calam seem extremely terrified that something will attack the inn any time now. Lately their concern has been about the creepy things that always live in dark forests. Their terror might be slightly reduced if someone could go into the nearby forest and ensure that there are no, or at least fewer monsters living there.\n1\\. Kill 10 water-dwelling monsters. 0/10 Laurion Inn\nYou can kill alligators or sharks in the river to update the steps.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n56p, 5g, 8s, 4cp from group split\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
