      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Laurion Inn [zone=1329]\n**Who:**\n- Shalowain - Laurion Inn [ _Mission and Raid_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Pal'Lomen: Final Fugue (Group) [zone=1333]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Captain Kar the Unmovable [npc=59710]\n- Darga Smasher [npc=59730]\n- Firethorn [npc=59732]\n- Margator the Slow [npc=59731]\n- Yarith Wardbreaker [npc=59733]\n- a Rallosian boar handler [npc=59727]\n- a Rallosian hex [npc=59695]\n- a Rallosian hunter [npc=59729]\n- a Rallosian soldier [npc=59700]\n- a Rallosian warlock [npc=59705]\n- a war boar [npc=59726]\n- a war chest - Final Fugue [npc=59719]\n- a war wraith [npc=59728]\n**Era:** | !Laurion's Song\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 2 02:44:10 2023\nModified: Mon Feb 2 14:57:21 2026 | | You say, 'Hail, Shalowain'\nShalowain says, 'Hail, Gidonoranger! Welcome to the [Laurion]! We pride ourselves on offering a place of rest after a heroic adventure. Sit, relax, drink, and regale us with your tales. This is the very place where heroic [deeds] are remembered and cherished.'\nYou say, 'Why is it called Laurion Inn?'\nShalowain says, 'The Laurion is a tree from my home. A special thing that bears fruit, hosts life, and sings its own song. In all my travels I have never seen anything that inspires me more. If you ever get the chance to see one, you certainly should. In fact, if you [visit] room seven you may experience the Laurion directly in the village where I was born.'\nYou say, 'visit'\nShalowain says, 'Of course. I can give you a key if you wish. Are you planning to go with a [smaller] group, or do you travel with a [larger] party?'\nYou say, 'smaller'\nShalowain says, 'Ah, you want to visit the day that all my efforts led to. The day we saved my home from the Rallosians. A brutal event, but one that proves what I mean when I say that you have to try or you can never succeed. You have to pick up a sword to stop evil. We triumphed that day and I am grateful for it. Grateful for my companions and their bravery. Please, visit and see what it really means to be a hero. Good, good. Go on up to room seven and see what I am talking about.'\nYou have received a request timer for 'Final Fugue': 0d:0h:1m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Final Fugue'.\n\n---\n\nThe Rallosian army is preparing to destroy the small village where Shalowain was born. They could certainly use your help.\nGo upstairs in the Laurion Inn and click on door number 7.\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Pal'Lomen: Final Fugue.\n1\\. Defeat Kar the Unmovable and protect Pal'Lomen 0/1 Pal'Lomen\n**(Event details go here)**\n2\\. Open the chest 0/1 Pal'Lomen\nOpen a war chest [npc=59719].\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n350 platinum\nYou gain experience!\n135 Laurion Inn Voucher [item=148084]\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Laurion Inn Voucher [item=148084]",
    },
