      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Harbinger's Cradle [zone=1361]\n**Who:**\n- a norrathian scout [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of The Harbinger's Cradle (20 Points) [quest=13045]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Oct 19 18:46:50 2024\nModified: Tue Dec 3 04:10:04 2024 | | This task can be obtained from a norrathian scout at /way -3, -115, 25. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, a norrathian scout'\nA norrathian scout says, 'Finally some help, I am one of the forward scouts to investigate what is happening here. So far I have gathered this is like a food supply breeding ground. Heavily monitored and guarded by scalewrought. Also deeper in the cavern is their hangar bay where they have mini-leviathans in the docks. So you want to [help]?'\nYou say, 'What can I help with?'\nA norrathian scout says, 'So there is much to do but best method is to slaughter. Go deal with the [food] supply, the [manipulators], the [muscle], and the things [flying] around.'\nYou say, 'I will deal with the manipulators for you'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Blood with love'.\nA norrathian scout says, 'The slim looking scalewrought are the ones that seem to be cultivating and taking care of the food supply. Stop them!'\n\n---\n\nThe Scalewrought herders corral the livestock, the caregivers nurture and feed them, the manipulators like their name states hypnotize them to make them think and act, the ranchers are more of the second in command, and the servitors follow the commands of the rest. The scalewrought seem to have set up a whole breeding plantation to curate and breed food for their army. Your job Is to annihilate them and disrupt their work force.\n1\\. Kill the scalewrought handling livestock 0/3 The Harbinger's Cradle\na scalewrought caregiver and a scalewrought farmhand counted for this.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n178 platinum 8 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
