      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Harbinger's Cradle [zone=1361]\n**Who:**\n- a norrathian scout [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of The Harbinger's Cradle (20 Points) [quest=13045]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Oct 19 18:56:22 2024\nModified: Tue Dec 3 04:09:47 2024 | | This task can be obtained from a norrathian scout at /way -3, -115, 25. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, a norrathian scout'\nA norrathian scout says, 'Finally some help, I am one of the forward scouts to investigate what is happening here. So far I have gathered this is like a food supply breeding ground. Heavily monitored and guarded by scalewrought. Also deeper in the cavern is their hangar bay where they have mini-leviathans in the docks. So you want to [help]?'\nYou say, 'What can I help with?'\nA norrathian scout says, 'So there is much to do but best method is to slaughter. Go deal with the [food] supply, the [manipulators], the [muscle], and the things [flying] around.'\n\n---\n\nThe scalewrought have been breeding carapace to serve as food supply for their army. You will need to go and sever their supply chain.\n1\\. Eliminate livestock 0/8 The Harbinger's Cradle\na softshell carapace, a crownshell carapace both counted for this.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n178 platinum 8 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
