      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Harbinger's Cradle [zone=1361]\n**Who:**\n- Impha Quae [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Carapace Blood [item=153188]\n- Manipulator Blood [item=153187]\n- Mind Neutralizer [item=153189]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Efiren Soltai [npc=60262]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Explosive Start [quest=13017]\n- Partisan of The Harbinger's Cradle (15 Points) [quest=13046]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 20 01:51:42 2024\nModified: Tue Dec 30 03:23:24 2025 | | You can obtain this task from Impha Quae [npc=60193] in The Harbinger's Cradle at /way 17, -122, 25. He is also on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Impha Quae'\nImpha Quae is annoyed by you interrupting their thought. 'Ah, finally some help around here!' I have been waiting here for a long time, don't you know [who] I am.\nYou say, 'Who are you?'\nImpha Quae look at you incredulously after you ask that question, 'What?! Who am I?' he scoffs, 'The name is Impha Quae, scientist extraordinaire!' You hear a loud 'Ha!' in the distance and you see Impha wag their pointed finger at the scout next to them. 'You shut up over there!' They turn their attention back to you. 'Anyways, back to what I was [talking] about...What was I talking about again?'\nYou say, 'I dont know what you were talking about.'\nImpha Quae says, 'Right, right, why did you not say so from the beginning. I need assistance figuring out what the scalewrought are doing in here. I can't do it myself because I am not built for adventure or violence, I am a scientist after all, &smirks. Okay now shoo, [venture] over there.'\nYou say, 'Venture where?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking'.\nImpha Quae says, 'Jeez do I have to hold your hand! Go down the cavern take a left see what they are doing. Don't come back till you figure out their plans.'\n\n---\n\nImpha Quae was chosen to find out is what Is happening in this area. The task that was forced upon him to get him out of his lab, is now asking for help. Since he himself cannot contend with the forces at play he tells you to gather information needed to properly formulate a plan.\nGo and check out the area and find out what they are doing, I am not sure what they are planning but it appears like this cavern is set up to be some sort of breeding production.\n1\\. Go to the southeast area and see what the scalewrought are up to 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nThis is a location update at /way -306, -67, -58\nYou observe the area scattered with eggs. The scalewrought can be seen breeding and herding what are to be carapaces around. They also seem to be manipulating them to bend to their will. The carapace do not appear to have a mind of their own. You have found the scalewrought's food production area. Report back with your findings.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\n2\\. Return to Impha Quae and tell him your findings 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou say, 'Hail, Impha Quae'\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'So they have are breeding their own food. That must mean they were looking to be here for awhile. Hmmmm.... If they are breeding their own food this must be a crucial area so they can keep supplying their army. Alright go find more info on the food production, there must be somewhere in this area where they are processing the food, try the west area from this location.'\n3\\. Impha Quae suggest going west, lets try to find more info. 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nThis step updates at /way 122, 296, -33\nYou have found what seems like a slaughter room. The carapaces seemed to be piled on a table and the bulky scalewrought seem to be chopping them up in the distance. You can see carapace just waiting to be slaughtered. Appears that this is where they are prepped and processed. You also observe that the carapace remains are fed to the other carapace to help nurture their growth. Go back and report what you found.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\n4\\. Report back to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\n5\\. Collect blood from the slim looking scalewrought 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nManipulator Blood drops from a scalewrought farmhand.\n--You have looted a Manipulator Blood from a scalewrought farmhand's corpse.--\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\n6\\. Collect blood from any carapace 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nCarapace Blood drops from a crownshell carapace. They are crab looking creatures. The amount of these that drop are random per mob.\n-You have looted a Carpace Blood from a crownshell carapace's corpse.--\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\n7\\. Deliver the scalewrought blood to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Manipulator Blood to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'Good, good this will help greatly hopefully it is enough to dilute what I need from it. Now bring me the rest of the blood samples and everything will be in order.'\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n8\\. Hand the carapace blood to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Carpace Blood to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nImpha Quae takes blood and waves his hand and stores it into a pouch. 'This pouch is connected to my temporary lab in Hodstock Hills where my assistant,Efiren is in the waiting. They will concoct the remedy in Hodstock Hills where my other supplies are. Go find my assistant and they will hand you the finished product.'\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n9\\. Collect the neutralizer from Efiren in Hodstock Hills 0/1 Hodstock Hills\nYou say, 'Hail, Efiren Soltai'\nYou have been given: Mind Neutralizer\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nEfiren Soltai looks up and stares at you. I assume you are the one I give this neutralizer. to. Can you tell my boss to come back when he is done doing what he is ordered to do. We are backed up on projects and it is tough doing it all by myself. Somebody needs to put food on the table and charity work sometimes does not cut it. One more thing, to use the neutralizer use it on a dead carapace, I am sure there is a pile of remains you can find somewhere and use the neutralizer. My boss stated the neutralizer works best if they consume it, so no need to kill anything if they are already chopping them up. It is best to have them consume the neutralizer through their feed. Best of luck.\n10\\. Use the neutralizer on the dead pile of carapace on the butcher table 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nThis is in the butcher room with the big pile of carapace that you can target. /way 152, 306, -19\nYou will need to clear out around the table to do the trade to the pile. I just cleared one side of the room.\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nPile of carapace says, 'You have neutralized the food supply. It will take awhile for it to spread throughout them all. Return to Impha Quae and report.'\n11\\. Report to Impha Quae on finishing your task 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou say, 'Hail, Impha Quae'\nYour task 'Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking' has been updated.\nYou have disrupted the scalewrought food supply chain. Hopefully this can help the war effort to slow down their invasion.\nImpha Quae says, 'So you have taken care of the food supply, hopefully this will set them back and disrupt their supply. My job here is not done but this has helped. I will need to collect my notes from your findings and will get back to you. It seems the scout has some new info that may help the effort go speak with him.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n267 platinum 1 gold 2 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
