        { id = 151040, name = "Scalewrought Orders", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Harbinger's Cradle [zone=1361]\n**Who:**\n- a norrathian scout [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scalewrought Orders [item=151040]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Maniacal Findings [quest=13022]\n- Partisan of The Harbinger's Cradle (15 Points) [quest=13046]\n- Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking [quest=13002]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Nov 2 22:06:27 2024\nModified: Sat Oct 4 07:01:46 2025 | | **Prerequisite Task:** Smell what the Scalewrought are Cooking [quest=13002]\n\n---\n\nThis task starts with a norrathian scout [npc=60179] in The Harbinger's Cradle at /way -2, -115, 25. He is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, a norrathian scout'\nA norrathian scout says, 'Finally some help, I am one of the forward scouts to investigate what is happening here. So far I have gathered this is like a food supply breeding ground. Heavily monitored and guarded by scalewrought. Also [deeper] in the cavern is their hangar bay where they have mini-leviathan's in the docks. So you want to [help]'\nYou say, 'What is deeper?'\nA norrathian scout says, 'So west from here there appears to be what looks like a hangar. The area is well built out and has a different feel than the current area we are in. The area is crawling with Scalewrought though, there are lots of patrols and workers going through the halls. One notable thing is that there are a series of miniature leviathans, like the behemoth that we currently inside of. They seem idle hovering in separate bays inside the hangar and the scalewrought might be preparing to bring down more troops soon. They must have battle [plans] or any information on their invasion somewhere in the hangar bay.'\nYou say, 'What plans?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Explosive Start'.\n\n---\n\nThe scout relayed you Information on his findings deeper Into the area. There seems to be a hangar bay with troops and what look to be drop ships. This area which resembles a hangar bay seem to be the start of slowing down the scalewrought on their Invasion Into Norrath. There must be ways to stop the scalewrougth somehow.\nFurther into the zone seems to be a hangar bay. The scout mentioned that he saw what looked like miniature leviathans like the one we are currently inside. If this turns out what It looks like we can do some real damage to their forces.\n1\\. Go find the Hangar Bay 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nThis is a location update right as you come up to the hangar bay at /way -57, 409, -10\n2\\. Look for the battle plans the scalewrought could have laying around 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nScalewrought Orders [item=151040] is a ground spawn at /way 164, 1062, 8. It looks like a scroll.\n3\\. Deliver what you found back to the scout 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Scalewrought Orders to a norrathian scout.\nYou have been given: Igniter\nA norrathian scout says, 'Great you found something, let me see here... Oh look here these crates can be used for something exciting. Here luckily I have this, take this igniter create some mayhem. There should be some crates around the hangar bay set them ablaze.'\n4\\. Find crates in the Hangar and Ignite them 0/5 The Harbinger's Cradle\nFind 5 crates in the hangar portion of the zone, target each one and right click the Igniter item the norrathian scout gave you. The crates will disappear but the respawn is just a few minutes.\nThe supply crate is set ablaze and is slowly engulfed in flames. Maybe this one will go out with a bang.\n5\\. Fight your way out 0/6 The Harbinger's Cradle\nKill any of the mobs in the hangar area.\n6\\. Return the igniter to the scout and report what happened 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Igniter to a norrathian scout.\nA norrathian scout says, 'Nice, you did great job creating chaos in the hangar bay. This should slow down their invasion somewhat. That crazy scientist seems to have come up with a way to deal with the miniature leviathans. Go and see what crazy plan he has cooked up.'\n7\\. Impha Quae has a method of handling the drop ships 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou say, 'Hail, Impha Quae'\nImpha Quae laughs hysterically. So you have come. I have been researching the insides of this behemoth. The scalewrought here and this leviathan carry a strand of DNA, and from that I have concocted a vial of poison. If that moron of scout over there says you found miniature versions of this harbinger in the hangar. Then this poison will help, inject it into them and they will have a slow death. With only one strand of DNA, this is the best outcome with what I got from your help earlier. Go and administer the poison. They will barely feel anything happen to them. It is a low dose, but surely after time they will fall from the skies and crash into Norrath.\nYou are given: Poison Mixture\n8\\. Use the item given to you by Impha Quae on the drop ships 0/5 The Harbinger's Cradle\nThis is how I did this step. I wasn't having any luck with trading the Poison Mixture to certain \"a weak point\", it would just say I have no need for this.\nI finally found one that would trade with me.\n/target a\\_weak\nwhen you are facing the row to go up the walkway to the \"a scalewrought shuttle\" go to the left side of the shuttle and click on the left side of chains on the thin link and you will get it every time.\nthen traded in each one of the poisons to it.\nOther group members had to find one that would trade with them.\n9\\. Report back to the scout 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou say, 'Hail, a norrathian scout'\nYour task 'Explosive Start' has been updated.\nYou have slowed down the scalewrought invasion into Norrath. Hopefully the Norrathians on the ground can take a breather. Now to unveil what is really happening. The walls are alive and they seem to beat with an anonymous rhythm.\nA norrathian scout says, 'So that scientist was finally good for something. Great, now that is taken care of, we should have a better hold on the defense of Norrath. Now we can take the fight to them and bring in more troops to gain more ground in infiltration. I will relay this information to my superiors. Thanks for all your help so far. There is more to be done, but this has been a great start. The scientist was mumbling something crazy when you were gone, so check up on him and see if he has finally gone crazy. Thanks again, Gebb.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n267 platinum 1 gold 2 silver\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
