      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Harbinger's Cradle [zone=1361]\n**Who:**\n- Impha Quae [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Quests:**\n- Explosive Start [quest=13017]\n- Partisan of The Harbinger's Cradle (15 Points) [quest=13046]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 17 15:36:52 2024\nModified: Tue Dec 3 03:57:50 2024 | | **Prerequisite Task:** Explosive Start [quest=13017]\n\n---\n\nThis task can be obtained from Impha Quae [npc=60193] in The Harbinger's Cradle at /way 18, -123, 25. He is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Impha Quae'\nImpha Quae says, 'Ah \\_\\_\\_, you're back. Great, I have made a discovery. I have found some interesting wording here on this paper I have found. It looks like a crumpled piece of trash, but the contents on it seem to hold some meaning. With what I have, I need [more]. Would you like to [assist] with discovering what is happening here again?'\nYou say, 'What more do you need?'\nImpha Quae says, 'So I only have this one piece I found lying around here. I need more and a lot more. See this paper here is filled with formulas I am not familiar with, so I need more information to fill the puzzle. I assume that there will be more notes scattered around the caverns. Whoever it is that is scribbling these notes is even more crazy than me. So if it was me, I would not have everything in one place. I would scatter everything, making it hard for others to replicate. Reminds me of another one named Balino Frugrin. What a hack, that guy knows nothing. I would not share anything with him. Anyways, back to the topic at hand. Get me more [notes].'\nYou say, ' Where are the notes?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Maniacal Findings'.\nImpha Quae says, 'I am not sure myself, but the notes could be scattered anywhere around the area. I was lucky enough to find one nearby. I was not able to thoroughly decipher everything, but there was a word I was able to decipher on this paper and that was the color orange. Not sure what it means, but it has to be a clue to figuring out something. Earlier you mentioned there are colorful eggs the scalewrought are tending. Maybe it has something to do with that. Go and check it out.'\n\n---\n\nImpha Quae has deciphered a few words on a parchment he found. The words Indicated that something or someone has been running experiments on the eggs. Impha knows not why or what for. It is your \\|ob to now find more notes that may be lying around the area.\nImpha Quae requests for you to go find more research notes. He mentioned it may have to deal with the orange eggs. Best to check there first.\n1\\. Find more notes 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou can find Burnt Research note on the ground at /way -341, -55, -60 next to some orange eggs.\nIt looks like a rolled up parchment.\n2\\. Deliver the note to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Burnt Research Note to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Maniacal Findings' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'Oh, very nice, you have found another note. The note is burnt, but the writing is still visible. The words I can make out are exhaustion, toxin, and another color, purple. Not sure what to make of the first two, but another color is starting to make a pattern. Possibly around the other color cluster of eggs may have another note. The chances are high, so make haste and see what you can find.'\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n3\\. Explore zone find the next research note 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nSame room as the first note. Bloodied Note is near some purple eggs in the middle of the room at /way -276, -242, 68\n4\\. Deliver the note to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Bloodied Note to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Maniacal Findings' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'As you say, there is a substance on the note, but from the look of things there seems to be parts of it where there is a dried substance. Give me a second to test a theory. Yes, the blood you have given me before matches a part of what is dried on this note. Interesting, the entity who is writing on these notes must have to deal with blood of the scalewrought. If they have to do anything with the eggs, this may tell us how weird some of the creatures are being bred. Well, from what I gathered on the note, other than the blood on it was only one word. I was able to make out another color, the color pink. With that you have your next destination. Good luck \\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n5\\. Explore zone find the next research note 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nSame room, Research Note is at /way -268, -399, -67 near some pink eggs.\n6\\. Deliver the note to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Research Note to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Maniacal Findings' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'How fascinating! Very intricate equations and formulas. At this time there, is no way for me to decipher what is written here but the word that is highlighted with a big circle around it. Luckily I know it, and it is a commonality with the other notes you have given me. The word that is circled could be translated as mana in our basic language. The fact that mana is the one word that is highlighted in this page must mean he came to a conclusion on using some form of mana. Those pink eggs must have been experimented on with some form of mana. Whatever it is, I do not like it. If it were me and I was running experiments, injecting mana into an unborn creature could be very volatile. The wrong dosage or multiple forms of energy infused into one expermiment.' Impha Quae lost in thought rambles muddled words. 'Oh, this does not bode well. Well, there was no other color mentioned, but from what you have seen you can probably figure out where you can find more notes.''\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n7\\. Explore zone find the next research note 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nResearch Diagram can be found near some green eggs at /way -361, -295, -65\n8\\. Deliver the note to Impha Quae 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Research Diagram to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Maniacal Findings' has been updated.\nImpha Quae says, 'How peculiar.' Impha Quae turns the note around and looks at it upside down. 'So it appears to be just this diagram of a circle with an eye on it. Maybe it is a reference to those supervisors or observers. Shake them down and see if they know anything.''\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n9\\. Find research note from Observers or Supervisors 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou're looking for Experimination Research. It drops from,\na scalewrought supervisor\na scalewrought observer\n10\\. Return to Impha Quae with your findings 0/1 The Harbinger's Cradle\nYou offered 1 Expermination Research to Impha Quae.\nYour task 'Maniacal Findings' has been updated.\nYou have learned a name of an Aurelian mad scientist by the name of Brood Architect Hazuri. He has been conducting experiments on the eggs of various scalewrought.\nYou receive 2 silver .\nYou receive 1 gold .\nYou receive 267 platinum .\nYou have gained 2 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience!\nImpha Quae says, 'Great job \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.' Impha Quae snatches the last note from your hand. 'With this we can learn about the green clusters of eggs. From what I can tell, the words that I can decipher currently are stun, mind, and charm. These words must indicate something with manipulating one's body or mind. With all of that, we seemed to glean into what these eggs might become or what kind of power they hold.' Impha Quae looks at all the notes gathered. 'A common word that popped up or an acronym from all the notes was B.A.H. This scientist must be crazier than me. Who signs their own notes? Unless they did it on purpose or just did not care. He must have more of an inflated ego to care about people remembering his name. Anyways, I will keep looking through these notes. Appreciate the help, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Hopefully this also will help you in the future. Farewell \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.''\nYou complete the trade with Impha Quae.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n267 platinum 1 gold 2 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
