      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Scarred Grove [zone=1381]\n**Who:**\n- Grovespeaker Lydora [ _Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Verdant Guardians +150\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- The Burning Host -30\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ambusher's Orders [item=153177]\n- Innoruuk Battle Plans [item=153175]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Grovekeeper Phidus [ _Quest Giver_]\n- Marshal Gulpin [ _Quest Giver_]\n- a grove sentinel corpse [npc=60814]\n- a war caller [npc=60780]\n- a warmonger [npc=60817]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 20 03:46:40 2025\nModified: Mon Aug 17 00:45:01 2026 | | You can obtain this task from Grovespeaker Lydora in Scarred Grove next to Mithaniel Marr at /way -211, -377, -4. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Grovespeaker Lydora'\nGrovespeaker Lydora looks up from the table covered in maps and reports. \"Welcome to the [front lines], \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I am glad you could join us.\"\nYou say, 'front lines'\nGrovespeaker Lydora nods. \"We did not have much warning of Solusek Ro and Rallos Zek's invasion forces, but we were able to muster a defense and hold back their [initial assault] here.\"\nYou say, 'So, they are planning another assault then?'\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'I have no doubt. Their first assault was brutal and caused several breaches in our walls. We are still calculating our casualties, but our early estimates are rather grim. I am still waiting for a [scouting report] before we can have a clear picture, but thanks to the rapid intervention and deployment of the Lightbearer's troops the enemy has not made a significant move yet.'\nYou say, 'scouting report'\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'Yes, I have been expecting a report from [Grovekeeper Phidus], but with the chaos of it all I have not received it yet.'\nYou say, 'I could speak with Grovekeeper Phidus about it.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Missing Scout'.\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'That would be wonderful, thank you.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Report to Grovekeeper Phidus 0/1 Scarred Grove\nGrovekeeper Phidus is a short distant to the northwest of Grovespeaker Lydora. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\n2\\. Locate the missing scout 0/1 Scarred Grove\nThis is a location update at /waypoint -1767, -1077, -75. You'll see a grove sentinel corpse on the ground next to a tree.\n3\\. Inspect the scout's remains 0/1 Scarred Grove\nBefore you /inspect the corpse you might clear out around you, once you inspect a mob will spawn and attack.\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\n4\\. Defeat the ambush 0/1 Scarred Grove\na warmonger ambusher spawns and attacks. It doesn't hit very hard and has very little hp. Kill it.\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\n5\\. Collect the ambusher's orders 0/1 Scarred Grove\nAmbusher's Orders drops from a warmonger ambusher, loot it. 3 of them dropped for the 3 in my group.\n--You have looted an Ambusher's Orders from a warmonger ambusher's corpse.--\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\n6\\. Collect the scout's report 0/1 Scarred Grove\nBloodstained Scout Report dropped from a warmonger and a war caller from in and around the Rallos Zek camp. Only 1 dropped at a time. I'm sure it drops from others in that camp, let us know.\n--You have looted a Bloodstained Scout Report from a warmonger's corpse.--\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\n7\\. Return the scout's report to Grovekeeper Phidus 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou offered 1 Bloodstained Scout Report to Grovekeeper Phidus.\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\nGrovekeeper Phidus looks at the blood stained report. \"I will make sure your death will mean something. Thank you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Did you find anything else?\"\nYou complete the trade with Grovekeeper Phidus.\n8\\. Return the ambusher's orders to Grovekeeper Phidus 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou offered 1 Ambusher's Orders to Grovekeeper Phidus.\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\nGrovekeeper Phidus reads through the orders. \"So, is [Innoruuk] assisting the invaders or betraying them?\"\nYou complete the trade with Grovekeeper Phidus.\n9\\. Investigate the tunnels 0/1 Scarred Grove\nThis is a location update inside the undead tunnel where the river goes underground. Make sure to IVU before going in and watch out for the a corpse golem that seems through even SoS.\nThe location update is at /waypoint -1495, -1368, -106\n10\\. Collect Innoruuk's battleplans 0/1 Scarred Grove\nInnoruuk Battle Plans is in the undead tunnel back in the square room to the north part of the tunnel, On a barrel in the back right part of the room the scroll is on top of it. /way -1054, -1661, -106 Take it.\n11\\. Return battleplans to Grovekeeper Phidus 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou offered 1 Innoruuk Battle Plans to Grovekeeper Phidus.\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\nGrovekeeper Phidus glances over the plans. \"So, Innoruuk is attacking everyone, friend and foe alike. Grovespeaker Lydora will need to know about this. Please inform her about what you found and I will get my official report to her shortly.\"\nYou complete the trade with Grovekeeper Phidus.\n12\\. Report to Grovespeaker Lydora 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou say, 'Hail, Grovespeaker Lydora'\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'Welcome back, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, did you [speak] with Grovekeeper Phidus?'\nYou say, 'I did speak with him. He will be along shortly, but he wanted me to tell you about Innoruuk's forces in the tunnels.'\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'So, Innoruuk's forces are held up in the tunnels to the east, but they may be at odds with the other invading forces. I think we can use this new information to our [advantage], thank you.'\nYou say, 'advantage'\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\nGrovespeaker Lydora says, 'We are primarily focused on defense for now, so it will take us some time to mobilize. Speak with Marshal Gulpin, he may have something for you.'\n13\\. Speak with Marshal Gulpin 0/1 Scarred Grove\nYou say, 'Hail, Marshal Gulpin'\nYour task 'Missing Scout' has been updated.\nThanks to your efforts Grovespeaker Lydora now has the information she needs to start coordinating the Verdant Guardians' defensive preparations. In addition, you found valuable intel indicating there may be a rift forming between the invading forces.\nYour faction standing with Verdant Guardians has been adjusted by 150.\nYour faction standing with The Burning Host has been adjusted by -30.\nYou light a firework.\nMarshal Gulpin salutes you. \"Glad you could come, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I could not help but overhear your conversation with the Grovespeaker. The situation seems dire, but I have a plan.\"\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nYour faction standing with Verdant Guardians has been adjusted by 150.\nYour faction standing with The Burning Host has been adjusted by -30.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
