faction standing with Verdant Guardians has been adjusted by 5.\nYour task 'Construct Deconstruction' has been updated.\nYou have greatly reduced the number of constructs that pose a threat to the grove's defenders.\nYour faction standing with Verdant Guardians has been adjusted by 150.\nYour faction standing with The Burning Host has been adjusted by -30.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nIncreases your faction with Verdant Guardians.\nYour faction standing with Verdant Guardians has been adjusted by 150.\nYour faction standing with The Burning Host has been adjusted by -30.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
