      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Vortex [zone=1385]\n**Who:**\n- Arkahn - The Vortex - SoR [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 3 01:51:41 2025\nModified: Thu Dec 18 06:50:34 2025 | | You can obtain this task from Arkahn in The Vortex not far from the zone in near /way 19, 562, 3. It roams around this area. It is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nArkahn says, ''Ahhhh, who is there? Oh, it is just you, Gebb. I am Arkahn, former gatekeeper of Skylance. I may not look like my former self. I woke up from massive explosion and found myself amoung the rubble here. As you can see what once was the Plane of Magic is now in this state. Some of Druzzil Ro's subspace pocket dimensions she tended to in Relic seemed to have ruptured and created their own physical landmarks branching from here. Would you [help] in finding out what is going on in each area?'\nYou say, 'Yes I'll help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Undiscovered Dimensions'.\n\n---\n\nVortex has become a chaotic vortex of magic. Arkahn who once was the gatekeeper of Skytance has found himself in the middle of this storm.\nPerplexed on how could this happen he directs you to explore each area and scout if anyone survived. Explore the fabric area and find what happened there.\n1\\. Go to cloth area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update. You'll get it around /way 1058, 1155, 64\n2\\. Kill 5 cloth butterflies 0/5 The Vortex\nMobs that counted for this is:\na linen songspinner\na cotten veilwing\na satin monarch\n4\\. Go to frozen area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update at /way 723, 3, 39 at the northern section.\n5\\. Kill 5 scrykin 0/5 The Vortex\nMobs that counted:\na crazed sorcerer\na crazed knight\nI assume any scrykin type mob will count for this.\n6\\. Go to liquid area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update. Go east of the zone in to the swirling area with the jelly fish at /way 562, -718, 72\n7\\. Kill 5 jellyfish 0/5 The Vortex\nMobs that counted:\na swishing warpod\na stroking lifeweaver\nI'm sure other jellyfish mob types count for this step.\n8\\. Go to feather storm area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update near /way -492, -2098, 85 along the feathers in the east southeast portion of the zone.\n9\\. Kill 5 vultures 0/5 The Vortex\nVultures are all along the feather bridge areas on the east southeast portion of the zone.\n10\\. Go to greyscale area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is to the south of the zone in where it looks like grey cloth folding downwards. There are scrykins near /way -754, -326, -310 where the update happens.\n11\\. Go to geiger area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update on the island of mechanized hexaclaw octopus looking like creatures. Which is to the southwest of the zone in, take the first tube that's furthest east and the update happens near /way -898, 590, 225\n12\\. Kill 5 clocktapus 0/5 The Vortex\nThe clocktapus are any of the octopus looking creatures.\n13\\. Head back to Arkahn with your finding 0/1 The Vortex\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nYour task 'Undiscovered Dimensions' has been updated.\nThe explosion of the Plane of Magic have really destroyed Relic and Skylance. Those destroyed parts slammed into Arcstone. With all of that Druzzil Ro and her keepers have tended to many pocket dimensions where they stored sub spaces of species good or bad. Now some of those doorways have now been blown asunder and now come into reality in an amalgamation of areas.\nArkahn says, 'Where we are is a vortex of magic subspace dimensions that have come out from their confinment and now have created new spaces for themselves here in the ruins of Relic. This will take a lot of work to fix and also may not be fixed, but we will have to try.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nEXP for your level\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
