      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Vortex [zone=1385]\n**Who:**\n- Arkahn - The Vortex - SoR [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Items:**\n- Azure Vial [item=152194]\n- Cloth Scrap [item=152195]\n- Jellyfish Goo [item=152198]\n- Mechanical Plating [item=152197]\n- Rainbow Feathers [item=152196]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a cotton veilwing [npc=60940]\n- a linen songspinner [npc=60939]\n- a mechanized sentry [npc=60963]\n- a satin monarch [npc=60961]\n- a skittish vulture [npc=60948]\n- a stroking lifeweaver [npc=60952]\n- a swiping tidebinder [npc=60953]\n- a swishing warpod [npc=60951]\n- a tropicaura vulture [npc=60947]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Nov 8 03:51:47 2025\nModified: Thu Aug 13 21:06:54 2026 | | Prerequisite Task: Undiscovered Dimensions [quest=13402]\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Arkahn in The Vortex. He is near the zone in roaming around the big blue open hole in the ground. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nArkahn says, ''Greetings, Gebb. You have greatly helped on what has happened to the new transformed Plane of Magic. With that I need you to look into my [kin]. '\nYou say, 'What about your kin?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Magic That Lies Within'.\nArkahn says, ''Like myself they have magic scars on their bodies. They seem more of a magical being than a scrykin. Whatever happened in the explosion has drove them mad and crazed. I am not sure why myself am as sane as I am, but I get these vague dreams that I cannot explain currently. First comes understanding what happened to my [brethren].''\nYou say, 'Your brethren?'\nArkahn says, ''Only way I can think of currently with the sparse tools that I have on me is to examine their bodies and blood. Take this vial and use it on the scrykin when you slay them. The vial needs to be used atleast tens time to be filled. Go use the vial on scrykin and come back to me when you have finished. Small warning this vial may not work on every scrykin, but should work on most.''\nYou are given: Azure Vial (Itemid 172580)\n\n---\n\nArkahn has tasked you with finding what happened to his fellow scrykin. After the explosion of the Plane of Magic he does not remember anything but waking up in this chaotic and ruined land. He can see on his own body magic pulsing veins under his skin, but he is not sure why he is the only sane one.\nWith the vials provided by Arkahn collect blood samples from magic Imbued scrykin.\n1\\. Using the vial fill it up 10 times 0/10 The Vortex\nFind any scrykin in the zone and right click Azure Vial on them. Your invisibility will drop when you are successful. Once you click the vial on a scrykin, no one else can click on the same scrykin, they need their own.\nIt seems to have no range limit, so it will work as long as you can target them. This also causes many of the scrykin to already have their blood collected. You might need to clear some out to finish this step.\n2\\. Deliver the vial back to Arkahn 0/1 The Vortex\nYou offered 1 Azure Vial to Arkahn.\nYour task 'Magic That Lies Within' has been updated.\nArkahn says, 'Thanks this will help find out what have become of my brethren. Now I need you to collect some supplies for me.'\nYou complete the trade with Arkahn.\n3\\. Collect 5 scraps of cloth 0/5 The Vortex\nThese drop from the cloth creatures to the northwest of the zone in. It drops random amounts. Each person in the group will need 5.\nMobs that drop Cloth Scrap (Itemid 172581) are:\na linen songspinner\na satin monarch\nOther cloth like mobs should drop this as well.\n4\\. Collect 5 rainbow feathers 0/5 The Vortex\nThe mobs you are looking for are the the east of the zonein where the feathers are.\nRanbow Feathers (Itemid 172582) drops from the following mobs:\na skittish vulture\na tropicaura vulture\nAnd other vulture type mobs.\n5\\. Collect 3 mechanical platings 0/3 The Vortex\nMechanical plating (Itemid 152197) drop from the octopus type creatures to the south. Each person in the group will need to loot 5.\nMobs that drop this are:\na mechanized sentry\n6\\. Collect 5 jelly goo 0/5 The Vortex\nJellyfish Goo (itemid 172584) drops from the jellyfish mob types in the eastern section of the zone that swirls around in the snowy looking area.\nMobs that drop this are:\na swiping tidebinder\na swishing warpod\n7\\. Deliver cloth 0/5 The Vortex\nGo back to Arkahn and turn in all the items.\n8\\. Deliver feathers 0/5 The Vortex\n9\\. Deliver husks 0/3 The Vortex\n10\\. Deliver goo 0/5 The Vortex\n11\\. Speak with Arkahn 0/1 The Vortex\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nYour task 'Magic That Lies Within' has been updated.\nWith Arkahn's new purpose you have helped him with research materials and a start to finding out what will happen to magic imbued scrykin.\nArkahn says, ''With all these materials I will start researching on anything that can be useful. The blood samples of the scrykin will need further help, but you helped more than enough on that matter. We will find a way to get the Plane of Magic back into shape, hopefully.''\n\n---\n\nReward:\nExperience for your level\n**Submitted by:** Gidono, Veludeus\n- Experience",
