      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Vortex [zone=1385]\n**Who:**\n- Arkahn - The Vortex - SoR [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Shade of Darkness [npc=61172]\n- a drifting shade [npc=61157]\n- a wandering shade [npc=61212]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Magic That Lies Within [quest=13405]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Nov 8 21:05:19 2025\nModified: Thu Jul 23 08:43:00 2026 | | Prerequisite Task: Magic That Lies Within [quest=13405]\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Arkahn in The Vortex. He is near the zone in roaming around the big blue open hole in the ground. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nArkahn says, ''Well, welcome back, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Thanks for helping out with everything so far. I am still getting myself adjusted to what happened, but was able to go on reconssiance of my own. Would like to hear what I [found]?''\nYou say, 'Yes, what have you found.'\nArkahn says, ''Well I found a patrolling magic entity or shade so to speak. It was circling a large chunk of a translucent crystal just past the frozen area and close to the cloth area just below it. I did not get close since the scrykin around it do not see me as their own anymore. I saw that there was some magic crystals possibly fragments from the big chunk in the center of that island. I could use that as materials for our continued research on what happened to the Plane of Magic. Would you [get] some for me?''\nYou say, 'Sure I will get you some.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil'.\nArkahn says, ''Marvelous get me those crystals and come back to me when you have some. I will do my own investiagting on that shade.''\n\n---\n\nArkahn mentions he has been seeing something odd nightmares. He cannot explain it but he has spotted some magic shades aimlessly around the ruins. He was not able to speak with them, but suggests to use a source of magic to disrupt them to get their attention.\nTravel past the frozen area to get to the large crystal island to look for magic crystal shards.\n1\\. Go to volatile magic imbued area 0/1 The Votex\nThis is a location update around /way 1707, 1107, 57 which is off in the northwest section of the zone.\n2\\. Collect 5 magic crystals on the ground 0/5 The Vortex\nMagic Crystal (Itemid 172585) is a ground spawn.\nYou can find them at these locations:\n/way 1823, 1356, 11\n/way 1962, 1156, -3\n/way 2119, 1210, -16\n/way 2312, 1523, 31\n/way 2341, 1644, 43\n/way 2222, 1818, 17\n/way 2015, 1852, 16\n/way 1937, 1891, 46\n3\\. Report back to Arkahn 0/1 The Vortex\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nArkahn says, ''I tried interacting with that shade myself but it did not seem to want to say anything. From my memory the large crystal in the middle of the island looks to be an oversized version of the Tear of Veeshan, but not sure on that yet. The explosion could have done anything since magic is very volatile. You can see just by looking around on what happened to the Plane of Magic. The shade did seem interested in the huge chunk of that magic crystal. Maybe giving the crystals you collected to other shades you can find around the area. I spotted what looked a shade in the cloth area that kept to the shadows. Another was in geiger area looking out in the vast space from a high platform. Another was in the greyscale area on a circle platform just standing there. Another was in a lightning cloud at one of the vulture's nests. Another was at the jellyfish pond going in circles. Find out what happens if you give them a crystal and report back to me.''\n4\\. Find a shade in the cloth area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update in the cloth area at /way 1123, 1558, 83 however I think the location update is wherever it is found?\nI found a drifting shade at /way 1214, 1771, 126 in the cloth area up under the red fabric to the northwest of the zone in.\nYou offered 1 Magic Crystal to a drifting shade.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nA drifting shade says, 'You hear a word alongside mumbling, the word \"maze\".'\nYou complete the trade with a drifting shade.\n5\\. Find a shade in the biomechanical area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update at /way -889, 594, 224 in the south part of the zone where the octopus like creatures are.\n6\\. Hand the shade a magic crystal 0/1 The Vortex\na drifting shade can be found at /way -1395, 793, 327 on a platform.\nYou offered 1 Magic Crystal to a drifting shade.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nA drifting shade says, 'You hear a word alongside mumbling, the word \"see\".'\nYou complete the trade with a drifting shade.\n7\\. Find a shade in the greyscale area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update at /way -717, -334, -310 in the south area of where it looks like grey fabric is flowing down and into loops.\n8\\. Hand the shade a magic crystal 0/1 The Vortex\na drifting shade can be found at /way -1138, -339, -356 on a circular platform.\nYou offered 1 Magic Crystal to a drifting shade.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nA drifting shade says, 'You hear a word alongside mumbling, the word \"shrouded\".'\nYou complete the trade with a drifting shade.\n9\\. Find a shade in the feather storm area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update in the feather area just past the skull around /way -547, -2406, 85\n10\\. Hand the shade a magic crystal 0/1 The Vortex\na drifting shade is on the round island just past the skull on a feather at /way -191, -2914, 69\nYou offered 1 Magic Crystal to a drifting shade.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nA drifting shade says, 'You hear a word alongside mumbling, the word \"within\".'\nYou complete the trade with a drifting shade.\n11\\. Find a shade in the liquid area 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update in the jellyfish area. Circle around in that area until you start heading north towards a large opening at /way 997, -1345, 313\n12\\. Hand the shade a magic crystal 0/1 The Vortex\na drifting shade is at the large opening past the location in the previous step. This one roams around so be quick about trading the magic crystal.\nYou can time it and hand in when it's not near anything or kill mobs to clear out. One safe spot for hand in: /way 1615, -1980, 350\nYou offered 1 Magic Crystal to a drifting shade.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nA drifting shade says, 'You hear a word alongside mumbling, the word \"deep\".'\nYou complete the trade with a drifting shade.\n13\\. Go back to Arkahn on what you have learned 0/1 The Vortex\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nYou have been given: Magic Orb\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nArkahn says, 'So my nightmares that I have been related to this. That is very disturbing. I heard mumbling words just like the shades have said in my own dreams. It must mean something surely. There was one last shade but it was so high I almost missed it. When I was gazing at the needle structure that was floating outside of Skylance before the explosion. I could see the needle on its side in the sky surronded by some jellyfish then I saw it. The shade was there like it was looking right through me. Find that shade and give him this magical orb. Giving a shade this much magical energy might be dangerous so be careful. To get there I can see a large jellyfish floating up and down, you could use that to possibly get to where the fallen needle is.''\n14\\. Find the place Arkahn described 0/1 The Vortex\nThis is a location update at /way 2492, -20, 50 on the giant jellyfish elevator to the west of where we handed into the last shade.\nTake the elevator up to the ruins.\n15\\. Give the magic orb to the shade 0/1 The Vortex\nIn the ruins, a wandering shade is roaming around. Give it the Magic Orb. It will count for the whole group and spawn a Shade of Darkness which attacks so be ready.\nYou offered 1 Magic Orb to a wandering shade.\nArkahn was right this much power turned the shade aggressive. Must get rid of it.\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with a wandering shade.\n16\\. Kill the Shade of Darkness 0/1 The Vortex\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nShade of Darkness says, 'All you hear the shade wail repeatedly was the word \"darkness\". Go back to Arkahn and tell him what happened.'\nShade of Darkness's corpse's form scatters in the wind.\n17\\. Let Arkahn know what happens 0/1 The Vortex\nYou say, 'Hail, Arkahn'\nYour task 'Dark Whispers Behind the Veil' has been updated.\nMagic still influences this place and something or someone is interfering. The visions that the scrykin have all point to something within the darkness. The Plane of Magic needs to be restored and this might be the next step to solving it.\nArkahn says, 'I see. I think I can piece together what I have been seeing and hearing from what these shades have been saying. Something or someone is shrouded in darkness in a maze somewhere. I am not sure where, but begs the question why are we seeing and hearing these things. Even from the cries from my fellow scrykin here. Something still does not add up, but in any case what I have for you for now is done. I will contemplate on what has happened so far. Thank you, Gebb.'\nYou have gained 24 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (5.428%)\nYou have completed achievement: Partisan of The Vortex\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono, Veludeus",
