      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ruined Relic [zone=1384]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 9 17:43:03 2025\nModified: Mon Nov 10 00:50:40 2025 | | This task can be obtained by Maniadry in Ruined Relic at /way 325, 956, -273 in the far southwest corner of the zone on the lowest level. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Maniadry'\nManiadry says, 'Snap-snap the shimmer egg, it hatches screams! Hss-[scry]! Hrr-kin! [Bone] clatter-clatter, stomp their hollow hearts! The air drips bright and whispers secrets to my teeth... The [manifest] learns from your eyes! Unmake the [elements], the burn that freezes, the water that cuts, the rock that floats! Stop the hum before it hums you apart! [Chaos] chews the edges of [everything]! The light, the dark, the dream, the dust--it licks the world clean and starts again!'\nYou say, 'I will destroy the magic manifest'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death of Magic'.\nManiadry says, 'It drinks from the well of every spell--stab the shimmer till it goes dark!'\n\n---\n\nManiadry's fear crackles like broken magic. Destroy the Magic Manifest.\n1\\. Kill 10 Made of Magic\nMobs that count:\na vicious whirwind\na living storm\na roving cyclone\na whipping wind\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
