      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ruined Relic [zone=1384]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 9 17:54:26 2025\nModified: Sun Nov 9 22:58:12 2025 | | This task can be obtained by Maniadry in Ruined Relic at /way 325, 956, -273 in the far southwest corner of the zone on the lowest level. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Maniadry'\nManiadry says, 'Snap-snap the shimmer egg, it hatches screams! Hss-[scry]! Hrr-kin! [Bone] clatter-clatter, stomp their hollow hearts! The air drips bright and whispers secrets to my teeth... The [manifest] learns from your eyes! Unmake the [elements], the burn that freezes, the water that cuts, the rock that floats! Stop the hum before it hums you apart! [Chaos] chews the edges of [everything]! The light, the dark, the dream, the dust--it licks the world clean and starts again!'\nYou say, 'I'll kill Scrykin'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death of Self'.\nManiadry says, 'They breathe spells instead of air; choke their magic before it breathes you!'\nYou say, 'I'll kill bone golems'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death of Bone'.\nManiadry says, 'Hear the clack? That's the laugh of stone teeth--break every one!'\n\n---\n\nManiadry mutters of hoolow hearts and stone teeth. It still means: kill the Golems.\n1\\. Kill 10 Golems 0/1 Ruined Relic\nMobs that count for this:\nan untamed golem\na towering bonestich\na crazed flesh horror\na torturing flesh brute\na quivering flesh horror\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
