      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Labyrinth of Spite [zone=1386]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 13 03:01:22 2025\nModified: Fri Nov 14 03:30:44 2025 | | You can obtain this task from Zeivan just outside the cast area's gates down from The Vortex zone line at /way 679, 27, -13. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zeivan'\nZeivan says, 'Isn't this just a friendly group of sunshine and rainbows?' The rogue hisses a chuckle of amusement. 'To get to the bottom of business here, it's best to thin the herd, so to speak. A crude way to put it, but we can afford to be a little [crude] in this realm of envy and spite, don't you think? That's enough rhetorical questions. Do you want a [job]? You'll be paid for your service to Norrath, I assure you.'\nYou say, 'I need a job.'\nZeivan says, 'Take your pick: The [husks], the [spiders], the [elves and gnomes], or perhaps the [minions] beneath our feet.'\nYou say, 'I want to hunt the spiders.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Too Many Legs'.\nZeivan says, 'Between the various spite-filled spiders and their drachnid counterparts, I believe you're going to have a lot of fun with extermination. Try not to scream though; I'm not quite sure you wouldn't be confused for the locals.'\n\n---\n\nWith Norrath's good intentions at heart, and a bit of sass, the rogue Zeivan has a few jobs to reduce the ranks of the locals. She's asked that you take\nout several of the spiders and spider-like creatures around the Labyrinth of Spite.\nTake out six spiders, and four drachnids to thin out the population.\n1\\. Kill 6 Spiters 0/6 Labyrinth of Spite\nMobs that count:\na young spiter\na spiter queen\n2\\. Kill 4 Drachnids 0/4 Labyrinth of Spite\nMobs that count:\na spiteful drachnid\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
