      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Candlemaker's Workshop [zone=1382]\n**Who:**\n- Melandi Sturdyboot [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bag of Materials [item=152130]\n- Broken Carapace [item=152127]\n- Charged Wrench [item=152125]\n- Gnool Tooth [item=152128]\n- Kobold Rough Hide [item=152129]\n- Molten Goop [item=152126]\n- Universal Core [item=152124]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Brell Serilis - Candlemaker's Workshop - SoR [ _God_]\n- The Great Shell [npc=61041]\n- a gnoll leader [npc=60836]\n- a gnoll thug [npc=60835]\n- a kobold scavenger [npc=60854]\n- a kobold scrapper [npc=60855]\n- a kobold zealot [npc=60838]\n- a magma snail [npc=60832]\n- a molten slug [npc=60857]\n- a subterranean digger [npc=60826]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Candlemaker's Workshop (15 Points) [quest=13451]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 19 02:04:25 2025\nModified: Thu Nov 27 14:00:34 2025 | | **Prerequisite Task:** Snuffed But Not Forgotten [quest=13426]\n\n---\n\nThis partisan task can be obtained from Melandi Sturdy boot in Candlemaker's Workshop. She can be found in the southwest corner of the zone at /way -1525, 132, -113. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Melandi Sturdyboot'\nMelandi Sturdyboot says, 'Welcome back, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Finally, another pain point in my things to do is our surveillance network. The [network] needs to be repaired. Can you help with this?'\nYou say, 'I will rebuild the network.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rekindling the Framework'.\nMelandi Sturdyboot says, 'You may have seen scattered throughout the area some broken-down clockwork drones. Well, they will need a core replacement and patching up. I will give you some [cores] from the parts you were able to give me previously. For the patching up part, I will need some time to come up with a method of fixing them.'\nYou say, 'Thanks for the cores.'\nMelandi Sturdyboot says, 'These cores just need to be placed in the broken-down drone. Again, come back to me after you have finished placing all of the cores.'\nYou are given: Universal Core\n\n---\n\nMelandi wants you to reestablish the network of clockwork drones that have been monitoring the state of the area but now have either been tampered with or destroyed from the invasion. They were set up to monitor the denizens of the area, like the candlefolk, and their growth. Brell's faction used to collect the data, but have not been able to since hostiles started roaming the area. Setting up the network again will help them in the long run.\nMelandi gave you cores to slot into inactive clockwork drones.\n1\\. Slot cores into broken down drones 0/4 Candlemaker's Workshop\nThere are many places in the zone where these broken down drones are. They are laying on the ground. Trade a Universal Core to it to update this step.\nEach person in the group can trade to the same drone.\n/way -1934, -492, -119\n/way -1872, -994, -123\n/way -2521, -1585, -122\n/way -434, 508, 20\n2\\. Return to Melandi 0/1 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou say, 'Hail, Melandi Sturdyboot'\nYou have been given: Charged Wrench (Itemid 172185)\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nMelandi Sturdyboot says, 'Return to the drones and use the tool on them.'\n3\\. Use the wrench on the drones 0/4 Candlemaker's Workshop\nTarget the broken down drone's and right click the Charged Wrench.\nThey turn into a clockwork surveillance drone (level 130) and then disappear. I think the broken down drones respawn in their spot after a few minutes.\n4\\. Return the tool to Melandi 0/1 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 1 Charged Wrench to Melandi Sturdyboot.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nMelandi Sturdyboot says, 'Thanks for the wrench back. Hopefully now the drones are back up and running, the security network can come back online.'\nYou complete the trade with Melandi Sturdyboot.\n5\\. Collect slug goo 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nThis drop is from the snails in the central part of the zone. Molten Goop (Itemid 172186) is the drop and the amount of drops is random.\nMobs this drops from:\na magma snail\na molten slug\n6\\. Collect underbulk carapaces 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nThis drop from the shelled creatures in the southeast area and the northwest area of the zone. Broken Carapace (172187) is the drop and the amount of drops is random.\nMobs this drops from:\nThe Great Shell\nsubterranean digger\n7\\. Collect gnoll teeth 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nGnolls can be found in the northeast section down near the water and on the west side of the zone. Gnool Tooth (172188) is the drop and the amount of drops is random.\nMobs this drop from:\na gnoll thug\na gnoll leader\n8\\. Collect kobold hide 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nKobolds can be found on the west side of the zone. Kobold Rough Hide (Itemid 172189) is the drop and the amount of drops is random.\nMobs this drops from:\na kobold scrapper\na kobold zealot\na kobold scavenger\n9\\. Deliver the goo to Melandi 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 5 Molten Goop to Melandi Sturdyboot.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Melandi Sturdyboot.\n10\\. Deliver the carapaces to Melandi 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 5 Broken Carapace to Melandi Sturdyboot.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Melandi Sturdyboot.\n11\\. Deliver the teeth to Melandi 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 5 Gnool Tooth to Melandi Sturdyboot.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Melandi Sturdyboot.\n12\\. Deliver the hide to Melandi 0/5 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 5 Kobold Rough Hide to Melandi Sturdyboot.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Melandi Sturdyboot.\n13\\. Speak with Melandi again 0/1 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou say, 'Hail, Melandi Sturdyboot'\nYou have been given: Bag of Materials (Itemid 172190)\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nWith all the materials having been collected, Melandi now wants you to hand them to Brell.\n14\\. Deliver the bag of items to Brell 0/1 Candlemaker's Workshop\nYou offered 1 Bag of Materials to Brell Serilis.\nYour task 'Rekindling the Framework' has been updated.\nCongratulations. You have helped Brell enough to get passage for the portal to \"Shattered Isles\", the shattered remains of the Plane of Magic.\nYou receive 36 platinum .\nYou gain experience!\nBrell Serilis is amused at the new materials. He eyes toward the doorway, suggesting for you to stop bothering him now.\nYou complete the trade with Brell Serilis.\nYou have gained 24 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience!\nYou have completed achievement: Partisan of Candlemaker's Workshop\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n36 Platinum\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
