      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Candlemaker's Workshop [zone=1382]\n**Who:**\n- Defense Unit CDL [ _Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Adventure\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Candlemaker's Workshop: Waxwork Abolishion [zone=1388]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a wax-splattered chest [npc=61213]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 05:16:55 2025\nModified: Fri Dec 19 17:11:59 2025 | | You can obtain this mission from Defensive Unit CDL in Candlemaker's Workshop at /way -1616, -26, -113 in the southwest corner of the zone. It is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Defense Unit CDL'\nDefense Unit CDL abruptly turns toward you. 'Initiating customary greeting: Greetings dirty traveler, this unit has been given the vital task of informing you, yes you, my dust covered associate, of [wonders] and [dangers] that the workshop has to offer.'\nYou say, ' What dangers?'\nDefense Unit CDL says, 'Searching data bank: Multiple credible threats have been identified in the region. This unit suggests that you focus on the smaller, weaker threats such as mites and leave the more dangerous threats to more [capable] travelers.'\nYou say, ' I am capable of dealing with anything.'\nDefense Unit CDL eyes light up and scan you. 'Analyzing capabilities: ERROR, fault found in logic. Initiating release of liability protocol: This unit is not responsible for any harm that may come about your person or property. This unit is not responsible for death or dismemberment to you or your party. Do you [agree] to the terms?'\nYou say, ' Yes, I agree.'\nDefense Unit CDL says, 'Initiate congratulations protocol: Congratulations on accepting liability.' A simple music tune plays from Defense Unit CDL's chassis. 'Initiating briefing protocol for the Waxwork Abolishion:' Defense Unit CDL's voice takes a lower, more sinister tone. 'Deep within the surrounding tunnels a monstrosity stirs. Once a great creation of Lord Brell, this forgotten relic of a time long past has been reawakened by the candlefolk and now poses a significant threat to the surrounding area.' Defense Unit CDL's voice returns to normal. 'Initiating task acceptance query: Do you [accept] the task to defeat the Abolishion?''\nYou say, ' Yes, I accept.'\nDefense Unit CDL says, 'Initiate congratulations protocol: Congratulations on accepting the task.' Two ports open on Defense Unit CDL's shoulders, but nothing happens. 'ERROR, confetti stock depleted. Initiate distraction protocol: You look strong and fit, so inform this unit when you are [ready] to depart.''\nYou have been assigned the task 'Waxwork Abolishion'.\nPlayer \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ creating instance Candlemaker's Workshop 22282.\nYou say, 'ready'\nDefense Unit CDL says, 'Initiate good luck offering protocol: Good luck and remember, this unit is not responsible for any loss of property, limbs, or life.'\n\n---\n\nA long-abandoned project of Brell's has been reawakened by a group of candlefolk after the invading forces attacked. The creature's uncontrollable rampage destroyed part of the candlefolk's forest, resulting in many avoidable deaths. Defense Unit CDL's records indicate it is a dangerous threat and he does not think you are up to the task. You need to confront the monstrosity before it claims more lives and prove to Defense Unit CLD that you are a true adventurer.\n1\\. Defeat the Waxwork Abolishion 0/1 Candlemaker's Workshop\n2\\. ???\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 59 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\n45 Rift-Touched Sigils\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
