      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ruined Relic [zone=1384]\n**Who:**\n- Gwork [ _Raids_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Adventure\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 14:47:18 2025\nModified: Sun Nov 30 14:59:49 2025 | | You can obtain this mission from Gwork in Ruined Relic at the zone in, he is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Gwork'\nGwork says, 'Hail! Such exciting times! Death! Destruction! Such changes writ all over the world! I'm so glad that I could be here to see it! Take it all in. You'll never see the likes of this again. If whatever exploded here had been just slightly stronger it could be that none of us would see anything again. The whole of existence could have ended! Instead, we get this [glorious] experience.'\nYou say, 'glorious'\nGwork says, 'Everything is changing, everything in motion! Going forward not even the goddess herself could predict what will happen next. Though I could guess where you might be headed. You have the look of an adventurer. I guess that's obvious since you're here after all. My cousins are looking for beings like you to help restore things. They are hopeful fools, but their efforts might change the future, and I can't wait to see what that looks like. [Gwark and Gwyrk] would be happy to meet you. I would be happy if you met them, for destruction and change would surely follow!'\nYou say, 'Gwark and Gwyrk'\nGwork says, 'Gwark and Gwyrk are looking for a group of adventurers to, well, subdue some of the dragons that used to call this place home. They are now, apparently, disturbing efforts to restore the plane. I, for one, think they are foolish to even try to restore this place. Not only do they not have the power, only the goddess can really affect change here, but the current state is so... so beautiful. But my cousins have asked me to help. So I shall. If you have a [large enough] group to assist, please let me know. I can send you to Gwark when you are [ready]. If you only have a [smaller] group, I suppose you can still offer some assistance.'\nYou say, 'smaller'\nGwork says, 'I suppose your efforts alone will cause even greater changes! I can send you on your way when you are [ready].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Shar'Drahn'.\nPlayer \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ creating instance Ruined Relic 12734.\n\n---\n\nDefeat Shar'Drahn\n1\\. Defeat Shar'Drahn 0/1 Ruined Relic\n2\\. ?\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 59 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\n45 Rift-Touched Sigils\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
