      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Scarred Grove [zone=1381]\n**Who:**\n- Lieutenant Lunk [ _Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Burning Host (Min: Amiable)\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 19:13:52 2025\nModified: Fri Jan 23 06:29:42 2026 | | You can obtain this task with Lieutenant Lunk in Scarred Grove in the southern Rallos Zek camp. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Lunk'\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'Too much talkin' and plannin' for my taste. 'Specially when green [golems], puny [defenders], and savage [beasts] are within smashin' range.'\nYou say, 'beasts'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Cull the Grove'.\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'Wild beasts attack our scouts, eat our food, poo in my boots. Enough! You deal with them.'\n\n---\n\nThe animals around the grove are more than a thorn in the side of the invading forces and Lieutenant Lunk is tired of it. He wants you to cull their numbers.\n1\\. Full the local wildlife 0/12 Scarred Grove\nMobs that count:\na bear\na hungry plant\na dire wolf\na poisonous creeper\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 23 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\nIncreases your faction with The Burning Host\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
