      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Scarred Grove [zone=1381]\n**Who:**\n- Lieutenant Lunk [ _Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Burning Host (Min: Amiable)\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 19:18:14 2025\nModified: Fri Jan 23 06:29:09 2026 | | You can obtain this task with Lieutenant Lunk in Scarred Grove in the southern Rallos Zek camp. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Lunk'\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'Too much talkin' and plannin' for my taste. 'Specially when green [golems], puny [defenders], and savage [beasts] are within smashin' range.'\nYou say, 'defenders'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Punch Through'.\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'All this sittin' around is borin'. Maybe if we smash a wedge through them lines, we can start gettn' our forces fightin' again. Yeah, do that.'\n\n---\n\nLieutenant Lunk grows bored of the stalemate and seeks assitance in driving a wedge in the defenders' formation.\n1\\. Eliminate the grove's defenders 0/15 Scarred Grove\nMobs that count:\na grove warden\na lightbearer defenders\na lightbearer warden\na grove cleric\na grove scout\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 23 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\nIncreases your faction with The Burning Host.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
