      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Scarred Grove [zone=1381]\n**Who:**\n- Lieutenant Lunk [ _Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Burning Host (Min: Amiable)\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 30 19:21:31 2025\nModified: Fri Jan 23 06:28:31 2026 | | You can obtain this task with Lieutenant Lunk in Scarred Grove in the southern Rallos Zek camp. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Lunk'\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'Too much talkin' and plannin' for my taste. 'Specially when green [golems], puny [defenders], and savage [beasts] are within smashin' range.'\nYou say, 'golems'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Smash to Mulch!'.\nLieutenant Lunk says, 'I don't like 'em. Smash them to mulch!'\n\n---\n\nLieutenant Lunk ordered you to \"smash the green golems into mulch\" and that is just what you will do.\n1\\. Destroy Forest Golems or Damaged Forest Golems 0/10 Scarred Grove\nMobs that count:\nNul'Kul\na thicket golem\na damaged thicket golem\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 23 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\nIncreases your faction with The Burning Host\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
