      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Labyrinth of Spite [zone=1386]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Adventure\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Labyrinth of Spite: Echo of Hate [zone=1391]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Dec 1 01:42:07 2025\nModified: Tue Apr 7 10:52:09 2026 | | You can obtain this mission from Kerina, Lost Soul in Labyrinth of Spite at the zone in. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kerina, Lost Soul'\nKerina, Lost Soul takes a moment to focus on you. 'Yes?' Her eyes narrow even more. 'You do not belong here. You... you are other. You should go, if you can. There is [nothing] for you here..'\nYou say, 'nothing'\nKerina, Lost Soul says, 'No, nothing. Below lies suffering, the sort that can only come from within. And above exists suffering of a type I have never sensed before. Sitting between is all of Spite, all of what causes one to be lost in one's own mind, seeing the world only as enemy. [Flee] or [fight], only one of those can save you.'\nYou say, 'fight'\nKerina, Lost Soul says, 'Hah!' Kerina's eyes sharpen. 'Foolish.' She seems more present than ever as she continues speaking. 'You choose as many have, wrongly. I can offer you battle and the suffering that comes with it, if that is your desire. After all, your welfare is none of my concern. Choose, if you will, to go forward as a [group] or a [larger] force, neither will matter. You feel safe in yourself, but that is because you do not know who you are, not truly. When you know, you will break.'\nYou say, 'group'\nKerina, Lost Soul says, 'So be it. You too shall be lost. I can send you to your ultimate self-realization when you are [ready].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Echo of Hate'.\nPlayer \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ creating instance Labyrinth of Spite 26551.\n\n---\n\nDefeat Shar'Drahn.\n1\\. Defeat the Echo 0/1 Labyrinth of Spite\n2\\. ?\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 130 - 59 platinum 7 gold 6 silver\nExperience\n45 Rift-Touched Sigils [item=152201]\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Rift-Touched Sigil [item=152201]",
