      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Northern Felwithe [zone=55]\n**Who:**\n- Artisan Elistar Vorann [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 20\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Armour Set\n- Tradeskill\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ancestral High Elven Armor [item=33978]\n- Arachnid Eye Cluster [item=34761]\n- Aviak Talon [item=2720]\n- Blessed Book of High Elven Culture [item=33993]\n- Crushbone Battle Beads [item=18271]\n- Darkbone Marrow [item=13094]\n- Eminent Book of High Elven Culture [item=34038]\n- Fungus Clump [item=17082]\n- Fungus Sap [item=19239]\n- Huge Block of Clay [item=34078]\n- Jade Shard [item=5953]\n- Lake Pebble [item=20318]\n- Large Darkhollow Geode [item=45104]\n- Mold for High Elven Boots [item=34131]\n- Mold for High Elven Chestplates [item=34132]\n- Mold for High Elven Gloves [item=34133]\n- Mold for High Elven Helms [item=34134]\n- Mold for High Elven Leggings [item=34135]\n- Mold for High Elven Sleeves [item=34136]\n- Mold for High Elven Wristguards [item=34137]\n- Pattern for High Elven Boots [item=34138]\n- Pattern for High Elven Gloves [item=34139]\n- Pattern for High Elven Helms [item=34140]\n- Pattern for High Elven Leggings [item=34141]\n- Pattern for High Elven Sleeves [item=34142]\n- Pattern for High Elven Tunics [item=34143]\n- Pattern for High Elven Wristguards [item=34144]\n- Phosphorous Powder [item=17214]\n- Razor-Sharp Drake Claw [item=34878]\n- Revered Book of High Elven Culture [item=34008]\n- Rotting Orc Tooth [item=18277]\n- Sacred Book of High Elven Culture [item=34023]\n- Soft Lotus Petals [item=30404]\n- Undead Froglok Tongue [item=5431]\n- Zombie Skin [item=7772]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Crushbone [zone=59]\n- Estate of Unrest [zone=62]\n- Lavaspinner's Lair [zone=280]\n- Lower Guk [zone=49]\n- Ocean of Tears 2.0 [zone=42]\n- The Fungus Grove [zone=147]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Delve drake - Lavaspinner's Lair [npc=17532]\n- a deep cavern lotus [npc=7153]\n- a small mushroom [npc=7150]\n- dark boned skeleton [npc=3433]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Cultural Equipment [quest=3056]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Cleric\n- Enchanter\n- Magician\n- Paladin\n- Wizard\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- High Elf\nEntered: Mon Feb 21 13:24:19 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _**Click here** [quest=3056] for an overview of cultural armor introduced with Dragons of Norrath._\n_Find Elistar Vorann in Felwithe, located in the building across from the bank._\nYou say, 'Hail, Elistar Vorann'\nElistar Vorann says 'Hello, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Welcome back to the fair city of [Felwithe]. You must tell me of your travels!'\nYou say, 'What of Felwithe?'\nElistar Vorann says 'While you were away, we have made much advancement. Our trade alliance with Kaladim has secured us fresh mithril from their mines. In the meantime, our artisans have been refining our armor [designs] in preparation for the new alloys.'\nYou say, 'What designs?'\nElistar Vorann says 'Yes, our old designs relied too heavily on the stopping power of the materials used in the armor. The new designs promote lighter, more flexible armor suits while providing the same amount of protection. It's difficult to explain until you have worn a new suit yourself. Would you be [interested] in these new armor patterns, or have you heard about the beneficial [symbols] I have discovered?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nElistar Vorann says 'Very well. To make you a pattern book, I'll need some zombie skin and darkbone marrow from the Estate of Unrest. I can use those to create the cover and ink for the book. I'll also need some of the battle beads from Crushbone to help bind the book and a rotting orc tooth to complete the ink. Bring me these things and the pattern book shall be yours.'\n_Hand in the items._\nElistar Vorann says 'Well done, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Here, take this pattern book. It may require some time to master the technique of making armor, but these new patterns should set you out in the right direction. Best of luck!'\n_You receive Ancestral High Elven Armor._\nYou say, 'What symbols?'\nElistar Vorann says 'I have found a great many symbols that can be created and added to our new armor designs. Once you placed these symbols on the armor the effect is nothing short of amazing. The capabilities of the armor are improved beyond the sum of its parts. If you wish I would be willing to part with instructions for these symbols in exchange for some [favors].'\nYou say, 'What favors?'\nElistar Vorann says 'I have several sets of research components I have been after for some time now. Unfortunately I have not had the time to be able to gather them myself. If you would be willing to retrieve them for me they can be found in several areas, the [Ocean of Tears], [Lower Guk], [Fungus Grove], or [Lavaspinner's Lair].'\nYou say, 'Ocean of Tears?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Exploring the Ocean'.\nYou say, 'Lower Guk?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Denizens of Guk'.\nYou say, 'Fungus Grove?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Plants of Fungus Grove'.\nYou say, 'Lavaspinner's Lair?'\n**Dialogue needed. Must be level 70 to obtain the last task.**\n_**Quest Items to get your Ancestral Book:**_\n_Rotting Orc Tooth - Dropped from random orcs in Crushbone_\n_Crushbone Battle Beads - Dropped from random orcs in Crushbone_\n_Dark Bone Marrow - Dropped from Dark Boned Skeleton in Unrest_\n_Zombie Skin - Dropped from random zombies in Unrest_\n_Exploring the Ocean (Journeyman's Book):_\n_1) Kill 15 sharks (in Ocean of Tears)_\n_2) Loot 2 Lake Pebble (off the sharks)_\n_3) Deliver 2 Lake Pebble to Elistar Vorann_\n_4) Kill 10 Aviaks (in Ocean of Tears)_\n_5) Loot 1 Aviak Talon_\n_6) Deliver 1 Aviak Talon to Elistar Vorann_\n_Receive your Journeyman's Book of High Elven Culture._\n_Denizens of Guk (Expert's Book):_\n_1) Kill 50 ghouls in Lower Guk_\n_2) Loot 20 Phosphorous Powder off the ghouls_\n_3) Turn in four Phosphorous Powder to Elistar_\n_4) Kill five ghoul wizards_\n_5) Loot one Undead Froglok Tongue_\n_6) Turn in one Undead Froglok Tongue to Elistar_\n_Receive your Expert's Book of High Elven Culture._\n_Plants of Fungus Grove (Master's Book)_\n_1) Kill 80 small mushrooms in Fungus Grove_\n_2) Loot 40 Fungus Clumps off the mushrooms_\n_3) Turn in four Fungus Clumps to Elistar_\n_4) Kill five A Deep Cavern Lotus in Fungus Grove_\n_5) Loot one Soft Lotus Petals from A Deep Cavern Lotus_\n_6) Turn in one Soft Lotus Petals to Elistar_\n_Receive your Master's Book of High Elven Culture._\n_A Bit of Spider, A Bit of Drake (Grandmaster's Book)_\n_1) Kill 120 Lavaspinner Spiders in Lavaspinner's Lair (instance)_\n_2) Loot 80 Arachnid Eye Clusters_\n_3) Deliver four Arachnid Eye Clusters to Elistar Vorann_\n_4) Kill 10 Delve Drakes_\n_5) Loot one Razor-sharp Drake claw_\n_6) Deliver one Razor-sharp Drake claw to Elistar Vorann_\n_Receive your Grandmaster's Book of High Elven Culture._\n**Types of Armor**\n_Moonglade - Cleric, Paladin_\n_Starglow - Enchanter, Magician, Wizard_\n- Elaborate Moonglade Armband [item=36667]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Boots [item=36668]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Cuirass [item=36439]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Gloves [item=36440]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Greaves [item=36441]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Helm [item=36442]\n- Elaborate Moonglade Sleeves [item=36443]\n- Elaborate Starglow Armband [item=45593]\n- Elaborate Starglow Boots [item=45594]\n- Elaborate Starglow Breeches [item=45591]\n- Elaborate Starglow Cap [item=45595]\n- Elaborate Starglow Gloves [item=45596]\n- Elaborate Starglow Robes [item=45590]\n- Elaborate Starglow Sleeves [item=45592]\n- Elegant Moonglade Cuirass [item=70601]\n- Elegant Starglow Armband [item=71559]\n