k of Dwarven Culture._\n**Elaborate Book of Dwarven Culture**\nYou say, 'Thundercrest Isles.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Thundercrest Expedition'.\n**Need dialogue.**\nTask Details\nThundercrest Isles: Kill 120 thundercrest drakes\nThundercrest Isles: Loot 80 Fractured Drake Claw\nSouth Kaladim: Hand in 4 Fractured Drake Claw to Yar Shiverbrow\nThundercrest Isles: Kill 10 Dirtdigger goblins\nThundercrest Isles: Loot 1 Stone Necklace\nSouth Kaladim: Hand in 1 Stone Necklace to Yar Shiverbrow\n**Need hand-in dialogue.**\n_You receive Elaborate Book of Dwarven Culture._\n**Need all dialogues and faction hits if any.**\n**Types of Armor**\n_Stonetooth - Berserker, Rogue_\n_Stormguard - Cleric, Paladin, Warrior_\n- Elaborate Stormguard Armband [item=47374]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Boots [item=37534]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Cuirass [item=37535]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Gloves [item=47375]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Greaves [item=37536]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Helm [item=47376]\n- Elaborate Stormguard Sleeves [item=37537]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Armband [item=75014]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Boots [item=73721]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Cuirass [item=72287]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Greaves [item=72288]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Helm [item=72613]\n- Elegant Stonetooth Sleeves [item=74184]\n- Elegant Stormguard Armband [item=71511]\n- Elegant Stormguard Boots [item=72289]\n- Elegant Stormguard Cuirass [item=70567]\n- Elegant Stormguard Gloves [item=70492]\n- Elegant Stormguard Greaves [item=71772]\n- Elegant Stormguard Helm [item=72005]\n- Elegant Stormguard Sleeves [item=71768]\n- Intricate Stormguard Armband [item=55074]\n- Intricate Stormguard Boots [item=55075]\n- Intricate Stormguard Cuirass [item=36723]\n- Intricate Stormguard Gloves [item=39178]\n- Intricate Stormguard Greaves [item=55076]\n- Intricate Stormguard Helm [item=55077]\n- Intricate Stormguard Sleeves [item=36664]\n- Ornate Stonetooth Armband [item=37518]\n- Ornate Stonetooth Boots [item=37517]\n- Ornate Stonetooth Cuirass