      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor [npc=17798]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | N/A\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Amiable)\n**Related Zones:**\n- Tirranun's Delve [zone=281]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Emoush the Destroyer [npc=17751]\n- Mystic Braggle [npc=17754]\n- Mystic Griknok [npc=17753]\n- Mystic Shiflor [npc=17752]\n- unconscious mystic [npc=49306]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Defend the Kirin Contact [quest=3126]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Recover the Lost Map [quest=3127]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Turn the Tides of the Sand [quest=3128]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2b: Sickness of the Spirit [quest=3071]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 24\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Mar 9 20:30:03 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This raid task is of Planes of Power elemental difficulty and has a 2-day, 20-hour lockout timer. It begins with Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 68+\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Minimum 6 players; maximum 24 players\n\\- Completion of \"Turn the Tides of Sand\"\n\\- Completion of \"Recover the Lost Map\"\n\\- Completion of \"Defend the Kirin Contact\"\n\\- Completion of \"Sickness of the Spirit\" (group mission)\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor'\nLieutenant Ekiltu Verlor says 'Those faithful to the way of Norrath's Keepers may take on the greatest challenges and prove their worth to Firiona Vie.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Calling Emoush'.\nYou must hurry. The Dark Reign are slowly making their way deeper into Tirranun's Delve. We have heard they seek a magic that the delve goblins possess that allows them to create a great, sentient, and dangerous dervish of stone. This dervish is a danger to anyone in the delve, but if the Dark Reign are able to capture and harness the dervish, they will most certainly use it in the army they build. You must find a way to put an end to this magic posthaste!\n\n---\n\nTouch the portal to Tirranun's Delve 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nConfront Emoush the Destroyer 0/1 (Tirranun's Delve)\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\nKill Emoush the Destroyer 0/1 (Tirranun's Delve)\n\n---\n\n_The entrance to the instanced zone is a cave in the northeastern part of the Broodlands._\n_Once in the zone, make your way to the far north end (general mob population is no more difficult than the standard zone). There, you'll get a location update for the second step (which also locks the task)._\n_You'll see a dervish named Emoush the Destroyer alongside three goblins: Mystic Shiflor, Mystic Griknok and Mystic Braggle._\n_Emoush the Destroyer isn't yet attackable (non-aggro). It will only be active (aggro/attackable) as long as all three goblin Mystics are in their unconscious state. To render a Mystic unconscious, DPS it to 0% at which point it collapses to the ground. Three minutes later, it wakes up again and re-aggros._\n_With this in mind, you'll want to 'kill' the three Mystics as close to the same time as possible so that you have a larger timeframe to DPS Emoush the Destroyer (who regenerates some even while invulnerable). Each Mystic hits for a max ~1,100; has ~90,000 hitpoints; and is immune to all crowd control methods._\nMystic Griknok says 'You no stop us! Emoush will destroy!'\nMystic Braggle says 'You no stop us! Emoush will destroy!'\nMystic Shiflor says 'You no stop us! Emoush will destroy!'\nThe goblin mystic falls to the ground unconscious.\nYour faction standing with Minions of Tirranun has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Tirranun has been adjusted by -1.\n_Once all three Mystics are in their unconscious states, you see:_\nThe cavern trembles as Emoush awakens.\nEmoush the Destroyer swells with magic as it glides toward you.\n_Emoush the Destroyer is undead; hits for a max ~1,500; flurries; has ~300,000 hitpoints; is immune to fire-based damage; and casts \"Rumbling Stone\":_\nRumbling Stone: PB AE 350', Prismatic (-350)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1000\n2: Stun (1.00 sec)\n_If a Mystic wakes up (three minute timer on their deaths), Emoush goes non-aggro / unattackable:_\nEmoush is once again protected by the goblin magic empowering him.\n_Once again, kill all three Mystics to resume attacking Emoush._\n_NOTE: Each time the Mystics wake up, Emoush increases its max hitpoints (health) and increases its max hit._\n\n---\n\n**Completion & Loot**\nEmoush the Destroyer has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nEmoush the Destroyer's corpse falls to the ground inanimate.\nYour faction standing with Minions of Tirranun has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Tirranun has been adjusted by -1.\nEmoush is gone. The goblin's plans now thwarted, you rest safely in the knowledge that your services will not go unrewarded.\n_Emoush the Destroyer drops 6x \"Glowing Stone Fragment\" (progression item) + 1 item from its loot table:_\nBand of Ashen Rain\nLava Crystal Scepter\nRing of Living Malachite\nSpider Queen Incubation Band\n_Task Rewards:_\n11 Radiant Crystals\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3134] item)\n**Submitted by:** Saraban of Darkwind\n- Band of Ashen Rain [item=34937]\n- Glowing Stone Fragment [item=34939]\n- Lava Crystal Scepter [item=34938]\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]\n- Ring of Living Malachite [item=34967]\n- Spider Queen Incubation Band [item=34722]",
    },
