      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Keeper Dilar Nelune [npc=17799]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 68\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Amiable)\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ancient Note [item=35233]\n- Fables of Winged Harmony [item=35234]\n- Perfect Cherry Blossom [item=35232]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Stillmoon Temple: Sickness of the Spirit [zone=701]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Nethran [npc=18626]\n- Stillmoon Forest Keeper [npc=18073]\n- Stillmoon courtyard gardener [npc=18624]\n- Wong Li [npc=18079]\n- a Stillmoon librarian [npc=19483]\n- goblin laborer [npc=18625]\n- scroll thief [npc=18627]\n- scroll thief underling [npc=18628]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Defend the Kirin Contact [quest=3126]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Recover the Lost Map [quest=3127]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 2a: Turn the Tides of the Sand [quest=3128]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Mar 29 18:07:12 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Keeper Dilar Nelune ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Minimum group average level 68+\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Completion of \"Turn the Tides of Sand\"\n\\- Completion of \"Recover the Lost Map\"\n\\- Completion of \"Defend the Kirin Contact\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Keeper Dilar Nelune'\nKeeper Dilar Nelune says 'Should we all perform to Chieftain Aderi's expectations, the races of good and light will bring an end to the threat of evil upon Norrath.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sickness of the Spirit.'\nYou may recall the kirin ally that the chieftain mentioned and that you protected. Well, this same kirin has shied away from us since it felt the anger of its kin. Many have tried and failed to win this kirin's heart to our side once again. Now, we ask that you make an offer of peace as you are the one that protected it. If we can secure this, we might be able to gain an upper hand against the Dark Reign. Within the courtyard of Stillmoon Temple is the keeper of the cherry blossom forest. He will summon the kirin for you if you help him in his quest to find the perfect cherry blossom. You may have luck in finding this blossom upon certain goblins tending the cherry blossom grove.\n\n---\n\n!\n_Map points for \"stillmoona.txt\" map files:_\nP 218.0000, -950.0000, 41.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Librarian\nP 700.0000, -1262.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Scroll\\_Thief\nP -55.0000, -191.0000, -33.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Stillmoon\\_Courtyard\\_Gardener\\_(roam)\nP -381.0000, -194.0000, -33.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Stillmoon\\_Forest\\_Keeper\nP -1000.0000, -450.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Wong\\_Li\nP -700.0000, -630.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, Nethran\\_trigger\n\n---\n\nTouch the portal to Stillmoon Temple 0/1 (The Broodlands)\n_Your compass will direct you to the entrance._\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Perfect Cherry Blossom from Stillmoon courtyard gardener 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_\"Stillmoon courtyard gardener\" is a goblin that wanders around the zone-in courtyard. It hits for a max ~750; has ~35,000 hitpoints; and is mezzable/stunnable. Kill it, and loot a \"Perfect Cherry Blossom\"._\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Perfect Cherry Blossom to Stillmoon Forest Keeper 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_\"Stillmoon Forest Keeper\" is a drake found in the west end of the courtyard._\nStillmoon Forest Keeper says 'Ah! The perfect blossom . . . I can hardly believe my eyes! For years have I searched in vain for those perfect petals only to find out that gardener was keeping it from me all this time. I humbly thank you for your offer, kind adventurers and perhaps I can return the favor for I know who it is you seek. With this in hand I can summon the hidden one for you. Now go and greet him before he hides again!'\n\n---\n\nSpeak with the Kirin Grandmaster 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_The Kirin Grandmaster is a mob named \"Wong Li\", who is in the small garden in the far west end of the zone. It is initially non-KOS._\nYou say, 'Hail, Wong Li'\nWong Li says 'Congratulations for finding me adventurer. I simply could not resist meeting the one who had found the perfect Cherry Blossom. I know your side wishes to unlock the secrets that lay within these temple walls but you must earn my trust before I will part with its treasures. Lately a sickness of the spirit has infected some of my brethren. Those few of us able to resist this illness are too weak to seek the cause of this malady and thus we need you to help us in this endeavor. We think that the new goblin tending to the bath house, Nethran may have something to do with this. Find him and see if he has any clues on his person. Alas, I can not tell you exactly how to bring him out of hiding except to say that he is easily angered. Perhaps you can use this to lure him out. . .'\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Ancient Note from Nethran 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Kill mobs in the bath house area until \"Nethran\" spawns alongside 2x \"goblin laborer.\" They will approach from opposite directions, and do NOT see invisibility. (It only takes 2-3 mob kills to spawn them.)_\nNethran says 'Out! Out! OUT! You be makin' a fine mess of me baths! Get outta here before I make a nice meal o' you!'\n_One laborer is a cleric; the other a pure caster. They each hit for a max ~800; have ~85,000 hitpoints; and are mezzable and stunnable. Nethran hits for a max ~950 and is a wizard. Kill Nethran, and loot an Ancient Note from its corpse._\nNethran has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nNethran walks three steps before collapsing upon himself in a small heap.\nYour faction standing with Stillmoon Acolytes got worse.\nYour faction standing with Kessdona got worse.\nYour faction standing with Rikkukin got worse.\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Ancient Note to Kirin Grandmaster 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Bring the note to Wong Li._\nWong Li says 'Nethran had this on him, you say? This is very dire news indeed. This note speaks of an ancient and powerful curse that long ago descended upon this temple and its inhabitants. I can not translate all of the glyphs though but perhaps if you spoke with the temple librarian we might be able to uncover more about this plague. I will send word ahead so he will be expecting you.'\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Temple Librarian 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_The library is upstairs in the large east room (looks like a \"+\" sign on the map)._\nYou say, 'Hail, a Stillmoon librarian'\na Stillmoon librarian says 'Yes outsider, I have been foretold of your arrival. The scroll you seek, however, was stolen from here but mere moments before you arrived. Find the thieves and you will find the scroll you need!'\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Fables of Winged Harmony from scroll thief 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Head downstairs and into the sand area. In the northeastern corner of the zone are two small rooms. In the southern of those two rooms you will find 1x \"scroll thief\" and 3x \"scroll thief underling\" (/loc 1100, -700). They can be split from one another, each hits for a max ~750 (some are rogues that can backstab for ~2,200) and is mezzable and stunnable. Kill one, and loot \"Fables of Winged Harmony\" from its corpse._\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Fables of Winged Harmony to Kirin Grandmaster 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Take this back to Wong Li, and be ready for a fight._\nWong Li says 'Very good adventurer, very good indeed! You have played your part in my plan most brilliantly but now I am forced to slay you, outsider. You see, I can not risk you upsetting my plans.'\n_He respawns and attacks._\nWong Li says 'Your bones will litter these gardens today!'\nKill 1 Twisted Kirin Grandmaster 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_The aggressive Wong Li is Level 75 and a druid. It hits for a max ~1,100 and has ~47,000 hitpoints. Kill it to complete your task._\nThe Kirin cries out, 'This cannot be! I was destined to rule the temple!'\nYour faction standing with Stillmoon Acolytes got worse.\nYour faction standing with Kessdona got worse.\nYour faction standing with Rikkukin got worse.\n_This completes the task:_\nSurprisingly, the sly Kirin turned to betrayal. Though this journey has ended on a sour note, perhaps there are still others willing to listen to offers of peace.\n_Rewards:_\n48 Radiant Crystals\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3134] item)\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]",
