      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Keeper Dilar Nelune [npc=17799]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 6 Hours\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:45:00\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Indifferent)\n**Related Zones:**\n- Tirranun's Delve: Children of Gimblax [zone=410]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Chieftain Relae Aderi [npc=17800]\n- Gimblax [npc=18091]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 1a: Burning Arrows [quest=3108]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 1a: Creating an Antidote [quest=3107]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 1a: Greed of the Goblins [quest=3103]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Apr 5 17:20:18 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Keeper Dilar Nelune ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Average group level must be at least 68\n\\- Minimum \"indifferent\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Completion of \"Creating an Antidote\"\n\\- Completion of \"Burning Arrows\"\n\\- Completion of \"Greed of the Goblins\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Keeper Dilar Nelune'\nKeeper Dilar Nelune says 'Should we all perform to Chieftain Aderi's expectations, the races of good and light will bring an end to the threat of evil upon Norrath.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Children of Gimblax'.\nRelae must have told you that Gimblax plans to extract vengeance upon you for killing the goblins in the temple. We have learned roughly where this foul goblin is and highly recommend you find your way to him before he finds you.\n\n---\n\nTouch the cave entrance to Tirranun's Delve 0/1 (The Broodlands)\n_The direction to the instanced entrance will be marked on your compass._\n\n---\n\nSlay Gimblax 0/1 (Tirranun's Delve)\n_Upon zoning into Tirranun's Delve, you find yourself in the far northern part of the zone. Gimblax is in the opposite end: Alone in a small cave at the far south. Make your way across the zone. Be careful as some mobs see invis. Charge Gimblax, and kill him. He hits for a max ~1,200; flurries; procs \"Goblin Headbutt\" (3-second stun); and has ~87,000 hitpoints._\nGimblax says 'You will die for your treatment of my children!'\nGimblax has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nGimblax's corpse looks at you in disbelief before collapsing.\nAs news of their leader's death spreads, the remaining goblins of the delve rapidly fall into chaos and disarray. Gimblax's threat is no more. It will likely be some time before you will need to be concerned with them again.\n_This completes the task._\n_Rewards:_\nUp to 25 Radiant Crystals (number varies according to group's level)\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3134] item)\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]",
    },
