      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Captain Areha Burina [npc=17807]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Faction\n- Loot\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 116:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Kindly)\n**Related Zones:**\n- Thundercrest Isles: An End to the Storms [zone=455]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Yar`Lir the Living Storm [npc=17663]\n- a blizzard seeker [npc=23427]\n- a chest - An End to the Storms [npc=37959]\n- an unstable storm [npc=18315]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tokens [quest=3134]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 54\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue May 31 14:19:08 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This raid task begins with Captain Areha Burina ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Minimum 6 players; maximum 54 players\n\\- Must be kindly faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Completion of all Tier 3 tasks and flags\n\\- Completion of \"Guardian of the Sands\" (raid)\n\\- Completion of \"Goblin Dojo\" (raid)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Areha Burina'\nCaptain Areha Burina bows. 'I see a good heart in you and a measure of bravery. Serve Firiona Vie and Norrath's Keepers well!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'An End to the Storms'.\nMake your way to the isles in the sky. There you will find the great tempest dragon. We want to show a hand of good faith, but do proceed with care. We are almost certain this will be a hopeless mission and you will more than likely be required to defend yourself. Should she wish to see the end of the Norrathians for invading her home, then you must do what is necessary to prevent it.\n\n---\n\n**Task Steps**\nTouch the portal to Thundercrest Isles 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nConfront Yar`Lir 0/1 (Thundercrest Isles)\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\nKill Yar`Lir 0/1 (Thundercrest Isles)\n\n---\n\n**The Event**\n_Get everyone inside Yar`Lir's chamber before she reaches 95% health, as the doors to her chamber lock at that point._\nYar`Lir the Living Storm says 'I so seldom receive visitors here. You will be my entertainment!'\n_Yar`Lir the Living Storm hits for a max ~4,800; AE rampages (mitigated to ~900-1000 per hit); and casts \"Wind Shear\", \"Icicle Blizzard\", and \"Yar`Lir's Cone of Storms\":_\nIcicle Blizzard: Targeted AE 75', Cold (-475)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 3000\nWind Shear: Single Target, Chromatic (-425)\n1: SpinStun\nWing Buffet: PB AE 1000', Chromatic (-425)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 2500\nYar'Lir's Cone of Storms: Directional AE 500', Chromatic (-425)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 5000\n_She is permanently rooted in place and sees invisibility (but not Shroud of Stealth). Over the course of the fight, she'll change forms (unique abilities depending on her form):_\n\\- Yar`Lir the Matriarch (spawns several \"a blizzard seeker\" adds)\n\\- Yar`Lir the Hurricane`s Eye (spawns adds called \"an unstable storm\" which AE the DOT \"Force Quake\")\n\\- Yar`Lir the Mistress of Winds (adds \"Tempest Wind\" to her spell lineup)\nTempest Wind: Targeted AE 30', Magic (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 600\n\n---\n\n**Completion & Loot**\n_Kill Yar`Lir to complete the event:_\nYar`Lir the Living Storm has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nYar`Lir struggles for a moment, causing a great torrent of weather to rock her treasure chamber. As the mighty dragon comes crashing down, the wind dies.\nYour faction standing with Yar`lir has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Vishimtar has been adjusted by -1.\nUnfortunately, Yar`Lir could not be reasoned with. You did what must be done to protect the denizens of Norrath from her irresponsible control over wind and weather.\n_Yar`Lir drops 9x \"Yar`Lir's Fang\" (progression) + 1x \"Eye of Yar`Lir\" (turn-in item for **a mask** [quest=3090]). The chest that spawns after her death contains 3 items from this loot table:_\nCrescent Palemoon\nCrystallized Glass Staff\nDrake Scale Tambourine\nDrake Scaled Bracer\nEtched Clay Ornament\nHead of the Putrid Drake\nLightning Singed Mantle\nMask of Raining Tears\nOculus of Yar`Lir\nShroud of the Surging Storm\nStormeye Band\nThundercrash Girdle\nUrazasishi\nWindfury Katana\nWindwatcher Sash\nYarusha, the Storm's Fury\n_Task Rewards:_\n8x \"Radiant Crystal\"\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3134] item)\n_Note: If doing this raid as part of progression, you'll want to check in with some NPCs to make sure your flags are up to date. See **this quest entry** [quest=3061] for more details._\n**Submitted by:** Saraban, Darkwind\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]",
