      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Broken Mask of the Hidden [item=36100]\n- Eye of Vishimtar [item=35555]\n- Eye of Yar`Lir [item=36629]\n- Mask of the Hidden [item=37116]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Accursed Nest: In the Shadows [zone=375]\n- The Ascent [zone=276]\n- Thundercrest Isles: An End to the Storms [zone=455]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Tatsujiro the Serene [ _Norrath's Keepers Merchant_]\n- Vishimtar the Fallen [npc=17716]\n- Xeib Darkskies [ _Dark Reign Merchant_]\n- Yar`Lir the Living Storm [npc=17663]\n- a mysterious chest [npc=18316]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 4b: An End to the Storms [quest=3089]\n- Norrath's Keepers Tier 5b: In the Shadows [quest=3063]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue May 31 14:47:22 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Purchase a Broken Mask of the Hidden from either Tatsujiro the Serene or Xeib Darkskies in Lavastorm Mountains for 500 Radiant Crystals or 500 Ebon Crystals. (No dialogues for this step.)_\n_Both Yar`Lir the Matriarch and Vishimtar will drop an eye every time. When you combine the two eyes in the broken mask, you create a Mask of the Hidden. Wear that when entering the upper half of The Ascent, and you will see:_\nAs you don the mask, your vision blurs for a moment. As your eyes come into focus, you see a glittering path guiding you... somewhere.\n_This path will lead you up to the peak of The Ascent, where you will find \"a mysterious chest\" at +6375, +1330, +755 which contains the quest reward: This chest is on your map and will give you a find path via CTRL F._\n_Bard - Speaker of the Scale_\n_Beastlord - Chain of Dragon Kin_\n_Berserker - Fire Fury Cloak_\n_Cleric - Braided Kirin Mane_\n_Druid - Mask of the Ancients_\n_Enchanter - Chain of Talon's Charm_\n_Magician - Mark of the Last Wing_\n_Monk - Cloak of Scale Spines_\n_Necromancer - Mark of the Grave Finder_\n_Paladin - Mantle of the Wyrmguard_\n_Ranger - Sash of Dragon Kind_\n_Rogue - Dragonshade Mask_\n_Shadowknight - Mark of the Dragon Slayer_\n_Shaman - Mark of the Brood Warden_\n_Warrior - Bladed Fang Mantle_\n_Wizard - Chain of the Kindred Scale_\nYou find an item made solely for you. As it comes into your hands you feel the mask dissolve and slip off your face into oblivion.\n_The mask disappears as soon as its wearer loots the class-specific reward._\n**Submitted by:** Saraban, Darkwind\n- Bladed Fang Mantle [item=37152]\n- Braided Kirin Mane [item=37150]\n- Chain of Dragon Kin [item=37784]\n- Chain of Talon's Charm [item=37121]\n- Chain of the Kindred Scale [item=37117]\n- Dragonshade Mask [item=37151]\n- Fire Fury Cloak [item=37263]\n- Mantle of the Wyrmguard [item=37122]\n- Mark of the Brood Warden [item=37124]\n- Mark of the Dragon Slayer [item=37209]\n- Mark of the Grave Finder [item=37205]\n- Mark of the Last Wing [item=37684]\n- Mask of the Ancients [item=37120]\n- Sash of Dragon Kind [item=37123]\n- Speaker of the Scale [item=37119]",
