      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Private Nylaen Kel`Ther [npc=17801]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 1 Hour\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Firiona Vie +10\n- Norrath's Keepers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Dark Reign -10\n- Lanys T`Vyl -10\n**Quest Items:**\n- Boiling Lavaspinner Blood [item=34721]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Lavaspinner's Lair [zone=280]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a reclusive lavaspinner [npc=17637]\n- an elder lavaspinner [npc=17581]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Jun 9 05:28:37 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther ( **click for map image**) who may be found at the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of the Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 65\n\\- Minimum \"indifferent\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Creating an Antidote'.\nI must ask you to go within the great volcano. We need to obtain a rather potent poison from the lavaspinners there in order to create an antidote. Yes, we have learned the Dark Reign intends to poison us using the lava spiders' venom somehow. Be careful and swift. We are not sure when they may execute their plans!\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Boiling Lavaspinner Blood 0/5 (Lavaspinner's Lair)\n_Most (all?) lavaspinners in the non-instanced Lavaspinner's Lair have a small chance of dropping the blood. Upon looting the fifth blood, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven\n- Cash, experience, faction",
    },
