      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Private Nylaen Kel`Ther [npc=17801]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 1 Hour\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Firiona Vie +10\n- Norrath's Keepers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Dark Reign -10\n- Lanys T`Vyl -10\n**Quest Items:**\n- Delvian Goblin Tooth [item=37195]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Tirranun's Delve [zone=281]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Delve champion [npc=18203]\n- a Delve cleric [npc=17748]\n- a Delve evoker [npc=17928]\n- a Delve shaman [npc=18204]\n- a Delve sneak [npc=17749]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Jun 9 05:43:57 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther ( **click for map image**) who may be found at the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of the Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 65+\n\\- Minimum \"indifferent\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Burning Arrows'.\nNylaen Kel`Ther is glad to see you. 'In the caverns leading to the dragon's lair in Tirranun's Delve are the deadly lava goblins. We have been amassing their teeth, oddly enough, as our archers have been using them for arrowheads to drive back any advancing Dark Reign. They have proven extremely effective. Please gather more so you may aid our efforts!'\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Delvian Goblin Teeth 0/5 (Tirranun's Delve)\n_This item drops from goblins in Tirranun's Delve. Upon looting the last of them, you see:_\n--You have looted a Delvian Goblin Tooth.--\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven\n- Cash, faction",
