      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Private Nylaen Kel`Ther [npc=17801]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 2 Hours\n**Level:** | 67\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Amiable)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Firiona Vie +10\n- Norrath's Keepers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Dark Reign -10\n- Lanys T`Vyl -10\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Ascent [zone=276]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a kirin master [npc=18025]\n- a kirin student [npc=17692]\n- a kirin wanderer [npc=18455]\n- a kirin way keeper [npc=18459]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jun 28 16:32:33 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 67+\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Completion of all Tier 1 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Defend the Kirin Contact'.\nWe'd thought we made headway against the Dark Reign, but it would appear that the source that helped us stay a step ahead is endangered. One of our scouts was able to find a sympathetic ear with a kirin in the mountain pass known as The Ascent. The agreement was that this kirin would warn us of any of the Dark Reign's advances and plans. We were told that some kirin students learned of the arrangement and have been attempting to kill our ally. As beautiful as the creatures are, some are dark and deadly in their intentions. We believe if we protect our source, the other kirin may decide to abandon their anger for our ally.\n\n---\n\nKill 9 kirins 0/9 (The Ascent)\n_Any kirin in the zone counts towards this step. There may be a few spawns in the bottom half of the zone, but they are primarily found in the top half, meaning you need to invis or fight past everything else on the way up._\n_Upon killing the last kirin, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven\n- Cash, faction, experience",
    },
