      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Private Nylaen Kel`Ther [npc=17801]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 67\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Amiable)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Firiona Vie +10\n- Norrath's Keepers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Dark Reign -10\n- Lanys T`Vyl -10\n**Quest Items:**\n- Shredded Map Piece [item=34815]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Ascent [zone=276]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Stillmoon leopard [npc=17593]\n- a cliffside puma [npc=17688]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jun 28 16:43:59 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 67+\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n\\- Completion of all Tier 1 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Recover the Lost Map'.\nAs much as most of us respect and revere all life, we have come up against a problem that does tax our beliefs and we need assistance. The pumas of the temple are not to blame for their anger toward us. Norrathians are to blame for disturbing the sacred lands of the dragons and stirring hatred of us. We must accept this error and deal with the consequences. The pumas have killed one of our cartographers in Stillmoon Temple who was sent to create maps to guide you in tasks there. Sadly, those maps have not been found and may be used against the sacred creatures of the temple, as well as the Keepers.\n\n---\n\nLoot 8 Shredded Map Piece 0/8 (The Ascent)\n_Head to the Ascent, and kill pumas and leopards in the zone until you've looted 8x \"Shredded Map Piece\" (uncommon drop -- about 1-in-3)._\n_Upon looting the last map piece, you see:_\n--You have looted a Shredded Map Piece.--\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven\n- Cash, faction, experience",
    },
    {
      id = "3258",
