      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Private Nylaen Kel`Ther [npc=17801]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 69\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nNorrath's Keepers (Min: Amiable)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Firiona Vie +10\n- Lanys T`Vyl +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Dark Reign -10\n- Lanys T`Vyl -10\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Ascent [zone=276]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Snowfoot antagonizer [npc=18471]\n- a Snowfoot heathen [npc=18468]\n- a Snowfoot mystic [npc=18473]\n- a Snowfoot preserver [npc=18472]\n- a Snowfoot shadow [npc=19545]\n- a Snowfoot warlock [npc=18469]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Norrath's Keepers) [quest=3061]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 13 16:39:18 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther ( **click for map image**) in the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Level 69+\n\\- Must be high amiable faction with Norrath's Keepers (+400)\n\\- Completion of all Tier 2 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Snowfoot Revenge'.\nIt appears as though there are Snowfoot goblins in the Ascent that do not discern between the Norrathians of good and ill will. We have heard that the Snowfoot wanted to punish the creatures that killed the kirin of the mountains. It seems clear that the Dark Reign are responsible for that, or perhaps it was us when we aimed to protect our source. In any case, the do plan an attack on any mortal and our very enclave here. You must go and kill 10 Snowfoot goblins\n\n---\n\nKill 10 Snowfoot Goblins 0/1 (The Ascent)\n_Kill 10x \"a Snowfoot \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" goblins in The Ascent, found towards the summit (you'll need to head up towards the top of the zone before you see these mobs)._\n_Upon killing the 10th snowfoot goblin, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T'Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven",
