ting their duties with the chaos of late. They have become even more unruly servants to the dragons. We hope we can show the creatures of the Temple a kind gesture by aiding the dragons and returning the purified water. We ask that you thin the number of unruly servants, collecting and returning the purified water to the ponds. This will require that you loot 5 Purified Nest Water.\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Purified Nest Waters 0/5 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_This item is known to drop from the following mobs:_\na Stillmoon dirttender\na Stillmoon gravel warden\na Stillmoon laborer\na Stillmoon novice\na Stillmoon witchdoctor\n_Upon looting the last one, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T'Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers\n**Submitted by:** Fleven",
