n the Thundercrest Isles has left many artifacts of sacred knowledge to become strewn about and in disarray. This knowledge is valuable and could be terrifying and dangerous if it fell into the wrong hands. Go to the isles and loot 7 Ancient Scroll of Wisdom so we may protect them from the Dark Reign.\n\n---\n\nLoot 7 Ancient Scroll of Wisdom 0/7 (Thundercrest Isle)\n_The scrolls are known to drop from sentinels of all types in the Thundercrest Isles._\n_Upon looting the last one, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T'Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's Keepers",
