job for you to do, if you manage to not foul that up. It would seem we need some simmering blood from the basilisks in Tirranun's Delve. Bring us five of those as well. Don't even think to ask us what it's for. You're too ignorant to understand. Now remove yourself from my sight and loot 5 Simmering Basilisk Blood.\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Simmering Basilisk Blood 0/5 (Tirranun's Delve)\n_These drop from domesticated basilisks in Tirranun's Delve. The drops from a domesticated basilisk in Lavaspinner's Lair will not count this this task. Upon looting the fifth item, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign",
