 deadly. Don't just stand there. It's not as though I'm going to wish you luck. Go loot 5 Caustic Lavaspinner Venom.\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Caustic Lavaspinner Venom 0/5 (Lavaspinner's Lair)\n_These are known to drop from reclusive lavaspinners and elder lavaspinners in the non-instanced version of the zone. Upon looting the fifth item, you see:_\n--You have looted a Caustic Lavaspinner Venom.--\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign",
