fe that may be of use to us. I've received the commander's permission to investigate and I want you to assist. What we must learn is that if there is a creature that sustains them with geomancy or if they manage to stand on their own. If that is the case then we must dissect that magic and perhaps we may be able to use it to create grand guardians and warriors in our own army -- disposable minions, like yourself. Find what animates them and bring me evidence. Go loot 5 Animated Guardian Essence.\n\n---\n\nLoot 5 Animated Guardian Essence 0/5 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Kill \"a clay sentinel\" mobs in Stillmoon Temple until you've collected five of these. Upon looting the fifth item, you see:_\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign",
