      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Officer Vacax Rol`Tas [npc=17796]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 68\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Faction Required:**\nDark Reign (Min: Amiable)\n**Quest Items:**\n- Stillmoon Drake Egg [item=61113]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Ascent: Drake Eggs [zone=451]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Celrak Blightblood [npc=17791]\n- a drake - The Ascent [npc=33703]\n- a goblin guard [npc=33695]\n- a guardian statue [npc=33694]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dark Reign Tier 2a: Army of Stone [quest=3295]\n- Dark Reign Tier 2a: Blood from Sand [quest=3296]\n- Dark Reign Tier 2a: Reap the Kirin Mind [quest=3297]\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 14 19:19:51 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Officer Vacax Rol`Tas ( **click for map image**) in the Dark Reign camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Minimum group level average 68\n\\- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Dark Reign\n\\- Completion of \"Army of Stone\"\n\\- Completion of \"Blood from Sand\"\n\\- Completion of \"Reap the Kirin Mind\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Vacax Rol`Tas'\nOfficer Vacax Rol`Tas laughs, 'These are indeed good days for the will of hate and fear. We will overcome the races of light and prevail. Pledge allegiance to Lanys T`Vyl!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Drake Eggs'.\nWe believe that eggs from the drakes in The Ascent could be some use in making powerful new potions. Go to The Ascent and collect one of these eggs for study. Once you have it, we will send you to an agent to collect it from you.\n\n---\n\nTouch the cave entrance to The Ascent 0/1 (The Broodlands)\n_The instance entrance is in the Broodlands at approximate location 1590, 680, 52 (a cave in the northwestern part of the zone)._\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Stillmoon Drake Egg from a drake in The Ascent 0/1 (The Ascent)\n_The drake that drops the egg is called simply \"a drake\". You'll find several of these along the path upwards in the zone (usually in groups of 2-3)._\na drake has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\n_Loot a Stillmoon Drake Egg from its corpse (drop is random)._\n\n---\n\nKill 1 goblin guard 0/1 (The Ascent)\n_Task Window Says:_ It appears that the forces of Stillmoon don't like you stealing the drake eggs. They killed our agent and now block your path out. Deal with them as you see fit and bring the eggs back to Celrak Blightblood.\n_The goblin guard spawns at the zone-in along with two guardian statues. They each hit for a max ~700 and are mezzable and stunnable._\na Goblin Guard has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na Goblin Guard's corpse falls forward, clutching its wounds.\nYour faction standing with Stillmoon Acolytes got worse.\nYour faction standing with Kessdona got worse.\nYour faction standing with Rikkukin got worse.\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Stillmoon Drake Egg to Celrak Blightblood 0/1 (Lavastorm Mountains)\n_Upon hand-in, you see:_\nYou have done well. Take your reward and begone.\n_Rewards:_\n29 Ebon Crystals\n1x \"Dark Reign Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3579] item)\n**Submitted by:** Additional info from Yther Ore\n- Dark Reign Token [item=34990]\n- Ebon Crystal [item=34989]",
