on very robust. We want you to go there and kill some of the servants. Without them, the water may become impure and weaken the creatures in the area, so kill 9 Stillmoon water servants as swiftly as you're able.\n\n---\n\nKill 9 Stillmoon water servants 0/9 (Stillmoon Temple)\n_Kill nine of these mobs in the non-instanced Stillmoon Temple. Upon killing the ninth water servant, the task completes and you see:_\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign\n**Submitted by:** Fleven",
