Ancient histories of Norrath and the dragons, and perhaps even some useful information on magic may be found on them. You must gather a good selection for us, so loot 7 Ancient Scrolls of Knowledge.\n\n---\n\nLoot 7 Ancient Scroll of Knowledge 0/7 (Thundercrest Isles)\n_These items drop from the \"a \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ sentinel\" mobs in the zone. Upon looting the seventh item, the task completes and you see:_\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark Reign\n**Submitted by:** Fleven",
