      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Officer Vacax Rol`Tas [npc=17796]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 45 minutes\n**Level:** | 69\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Faction\n- Loot\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:45:00\n**Faction Required:**\nDark Reign (Min: Amiable)\n**Quest Items:**\n- Gilded Scroll of Earth Rending [item=46269]\n- Scroll [Trapped Scroll]\n- Scroll [Scroll of Deadly Venom]\n- Scroll [Labor and inventory documentation]\n- Scroll [item=56248]\n- Scroll [Gilded Scroll of Earth Rending]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Thundercrest Isles: The Gilded Scroll [zone=419]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Daleynn Spiritshadow [ _Missions_]\n- Noble Kirin Scholar [npc=27675]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dark Reign Tokens [quest=3579]\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 14 19:32:24 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Officer Vacax Rol`Tas ( **click for map image**) in the Dark Reign camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Have high amiable faction with Dark Reign\n\\- Completion of all Tier 2 tasks and flags\n\\- Completion of \"Muddy the Waters\"\n\\- Completion of \"Snowfoot Attack\"\n\\- Completion of \"Knowledge is Power\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Vacax Rol`Tas'\nOfficer Vacax Rol`Tas laughs, 'These are indeed good days for the will of hate and fear. We will overcome the races of light and prevail. Pledge allegiance to Lanys T`Vyl!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Gilded Scroll'.\nThe Storm Dragon, Yar'Lir, has caused one of her minions to create a scroll that can tear up the land and toss it into the air. I want that scroll. Find it and bring it back. I also want you to kill the creature that made the scroll. No, not Yar'Lir... the minion. I want to be the only one with such power.\n\n---\n\nTouch the portal to Thundercrest Isles 0/1 (The Broodlands)\n_The zone-in is at 2400, 1865 (northwestern part of the zone). You zone into the building in the far northwestern part of the Thundercrest Isles._\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Scroll 0/1 (Thundercrest Isles)\n_Kill mobs in the zone and loot the items called \"Scroll\". When you loot, you see emotes:_\nAs you take the scroll from the corpse, you pause to take a closer look at it.\n_These scrolls, when looted, transform into different items (useless items). Some of them trigger a detrimental effect on the looter. The scroll that updates the task triggers the same emote and transforms into \"Gilded Scroll of Earth Rending\". It also triggers the spawn of \"Noble Kirin Scholar\" at the location of the loot update. Upon spawn, it begins wandering away, so aggro it quickly (if it's left to wander off, it's not known where it winds up - possibly in the front courtyard outside the building)._\n\n---\n\nKill 1 Noble Kirin Scholar 0/1 (Thundercrest Isles)\n_Task Window Says:_ With the scroll in hand you can vaguely sense the one who created it. Kill everything in the hall if you have to, but destroy that Kirin!\n_The Noble Kirin Scholar hits for a max ~1,200 and procs \"Crushing Blow\"._\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Gilded Scroll of Earth Rending to Daleynn Spiritshadow 0/1 (Lavastorm Mountains)\n_Upon handing in the final scroll, the task completes and you see:_\nWonderful! I can't wait to see what this thing can do! Well done. We won't forget your help here.\n_Rewards:_\n50 Ebon Crystals\n1x \"Dark Reign Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3579] item)\n- Dark Reign Token [item=34990]\n- Ebon Crystal [item=34989]",
