      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Officer Vacax Rol`Tas [npc=17796]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Faction\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nDark Reign (Min: Warmly)\n**Quest Items:**\n- Egg of a Saved Clutch [item=46270]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Accursed Nest: Rival Party [zone=461]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Corgoth of Norrath`s Keepers [npc=24052]\n- Drogorus of Norrath`s Keepers [npc=24051]\n- Pericolo L`Morte [ _Missions_]\n- Syllan of Norrath`s Keepers [npc=24050]\n- Vincent of Norrath`s Keepers [npc=24053]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 14 19:38:35 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Officer Vacax Rol`Tas ( **click for map image**) in the Dark Reign camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Minimum \"warmly\" (770) faction with Dark Reign\n\\- Completion of all Tier 4 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Vacax Rol`Tas'\nOfficer Vacax Rol`Tas laughs, 'These are indeed good days for the will of hate and fear. We will overcome the races of light and prevail. Pledge allegiance to Lanys T`Vyl!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rival Party'.\nOur rogues report that Norrath's Keepers has dispatched an adventuring party into the Nest to acquire a clutch of dragon eggs. We cannot let such powerful creatures, unborn though they may be, fall into the hands of our enemies. You must ambush this group. There are four of them; a wizard named Syllann, a rogue named Corgoth, a warrior named Vincent, and a cleric named Drogorus. Slay them all before they can uncover the dragon eggs and acquire them the eggs yourself. Bring one back to Pericolo L`Morte and destroy the rest!\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nTouch the portal to the Nest 0/1 (The Broodlands)\n_Your compass will point you in the direction. This is the swamp entrance in the southwestern part of the Broodlands._\n\n---\n\nKill 1 Syllann of Norrath's Keepers 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\nKill 1 Corgoth of Norrath's Keepers 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\nKill 1 Vincent of Norrath's Keepers 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\nKill 1 Drogorus of Norrath's Keepers 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\n_These NPCs are located near 25, 1100 (from the zone-in, head west into the tunnel, and then make an immediate turn north)._\nCorgoth of Norrath`s Keepers says 'Gather close, my comrades. Our enemies are near!'\nVincent of Norrath`s Keepers says 'We've got company!'\nSyllan of Norrath`s Keepers says 'Careful. I've heard stories of these ones!'\nDrogorus of Norrath`s Keepers says 'We've got company!'\n_These four are splittable, stunnable, and mezzable. They each hit for a max ~1,000 and don't have any special abilities other than standard class spells._\n\n---\n\nLoot 6 Egg of a Saved Clutch 0/6 (The Accursed Nest)\n_\"Egg of a Saved Clutch\" drop from random mobs in the metallic/springs wing of the zone (northwestern wing)._\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Egg of a Saved Clutch to Pericolo L`Morte 0/1 (Lavastorm Mountains)\n_Hand in one of the eggs to Pericolo L`Morte ( **click for map image**) in Lavastorm._\nExcellent work. We can't let these eggs into the hands of Norrath's Keepers. I'll inform my superiors of your success. They will be most pleased!\n_Rewards:_\n66 Ebon Crystals\n1x \"Dark Reign Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3579] item)\n**Submitted by:** Fleven\n- Dark Reign Token [item=34990]\n- Ebon Crystal [item=34989]",
