      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Elddar Forest [zone=340]\n**Who:**\n- Shalowen the Pure [npc=20348]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 92:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Carved Wooden Key [item=61430]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Tunare's Shrine: The Corruption of Ro [zone=348]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Brazlin the High Priest of Ro [npc=20570]\n- Drekish the Enforcer of Ro [npc=21020]\n- Guardian of the High Priest [npc=20571]\n- The Guardian of the Shrine [npc=20564]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Elddar Corruption #1: Investigating the Elddar [quest=3376]\n- Elddar Corruption #2: Questioning the Priest [quest=3514]\n- Elddar Corruption #3: Key to Corruption [quest=3515]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 36\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Mar 9 00:55:56 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a 36-player raid task (minimum 6). The task locks as soon as it is given, preventing the addition of additional people, so make sure everyone is already in the raid before requesting the task._\n_If you requested this task without finishing the first 3 tasks given by Shalowen the Pure, you can get the task but you can't get through the door at the top._\n_Shalowen the Pure can be found in the Elddar Forest at location -5, -127._\nYou say, 'Hail, Shalowen the Pure'\nShalowen the Pure says 'This key will allow you entry into the top of the shrine. Can you [gather a force] and stop what ever force is behind the corruption at the top of the tree?'\n_The key referred to is the Carved Wooden Key looted from Ograf the Crafter at the end of \"The Key to Corruption\"._\nYou say, 'I can gather a force'\nShalowen the Pure says 'I look forward to seeing you after your victory \\_\\_\\_\\_. '\nWith the key to the top of the shrine in your possession, Shalowen has requested that you gather a force and adventure back into the shrine to stop the corruption. Once inside you must travel to the top in order to stop the corruption before the power grows out of control.\n\n---\n\nSearch for Brazlin in the shrine room 0/1 (Tunare's Shrine)\nConfront the high priest for answers about the corrupted elves 0/1 (Tunare's Shrine)\nSlay the high priest to stop the corruption 0/1 (Tunare's Shrine)\n_The entrance to Tunare's Shrine is located at the base of the massive tree to the south of the Ruins of Takish-Hiz zone-in._\n_Once inside, fight your way to the top of the shrine and confront the high priest._\nYou say, 'Hail, Brazlin the High Priest of Ro'\nBrazlin the High Priest of Ro says 'You fools think that [you can stop the corruption]?'\nYou say, 'We can stop the corruption'\nBrazlin the High Priest of Ro says 'HA HA HA HA HA HA! Well at least you have a sense of humor. I would like you to meet my little friend. Guardian! Show these pathetic souls what pain is.'\n_Guardian of the High Priest, a large sand golem, spawns in the center of the shrine. It needs to be killed._\nGuardian of the High Priest focuses on its master's target and begins to attack.\n_Every 20%, a large number of golems spawns:_\nThe Guardian of the High Priest summons elementals of protection and commands them to attack!\n_If you take too long to kill them, the High Priest will use them to heal the Guardian:_\nBrazlin the High Priest of Ro channels energy from the core golems and heals his guardian.\n_Upon its death:_\nGuardian of the High Priest's corpse falls to the ground no longer able to serve its master.\nBrazlin the High Priest of Ro shouts, 'You weaklings will never stop the corruption, you should give up while you're still alive!'\nThe tree shakes as Brazlin escapes once again.\nYou have stopped the High Priest and the corruption for now. Travel back to Shalowen and tell him of your victory.\n\n---\n\n_Loot consists of 1 Chalice of Life (always) + 2 items from this list:_\nBauble of the Priesthood\nBlessing of Solusek Ro\nLast Blood (used to be Bazu Stone)\nMantle of Ro's Revenge\nPendant of Insurgency\nTrinket of Ro's Folly\n_Task lockout = 3 days and 20 hours_\n_If you have also completed all three of Shalowen's group tasks, hand in Chalice of Life to him (so for this hand-in you can complete the tasks before or after the raid):_\nShalowen says, 'The Chalice of Life, you have done well my friend. The Chalice has been renewed to its original state. The Chalice must be protected at all costs. I trust that you will defend it with your life.'\n_You receive The Chalice of Life_\n- Bauble of the Priesthood [item=47451]\n- Blessing of Solusek Ro [item=47452]\n- Chalice of Life [item=47449]\n- Last Blood [item=45215]\n- Mantle of Ro's Revenge [item=47453]\n- Mask of the Corrupted Priest [item=50998]\n- Pendant of Insurgency [item=47450]\n- The Chalice of Life [item=53673]\n- Trinket of Ro's Folly [item=47454]",
