      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sverag, Stronghold of Rage [zone=341]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Related Zones:**\n- Razorthorn: Hero's Challenge [zone=381]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Broo, the Defender of Solitude [npc=21038]\n- Grigak the Champion [npc=20329]\n- Segnar, Defender of Razorthorn [npc=20347]\n- Uvilan the Tyrant [npc=20879]\n- a minotaur combatant [npc=20887]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Mar 15 15:26:20 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is offered to random people after random kills in Sverag, Stronghold of Rage. ( **Is there anything specific required for the Razorthorn challenge?**) There is a normal mode as well as a hard mode._\n_If you accept the task offered, you, along with your groupmates, will be offered a port into the Tower of Sullon Zek._\nThe first of four challenges lies ahead. Use tact, use strength, use what you will but be warned -- should one of you fall, the essence of your warrior spirit will seek out great champions and infuse them with a disasterous rage.\n\n---\n\nEnter Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek 0/1 (Sverag, Stronghold of Rage)\nDefeat the first challenge within Razorthorn 0/1 (Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek)\nDefeat the second challenge within Razorthorn 0/1 (Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek)\nDefeat the third challenge within Razorthorn 0/1 (Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek)\nDefeat the fourth challenge within Razorthorn 0/1 (Razorthorn, Tower of Sullon Zek)\n_In each challenge, you must clear a number of trash mobs in order to reach a named. Killing the named completes the challenge and moves you on to the next. There are four \"challenges\" in total._\n_If someone dies during the task, the named mob of your current challenge will increase in strength. If you have more than 10 deaths throughout the entire task, you fail._\n_In the first challenge, you will encounter barbarians and dwarves. The final named is Segnar, Defender of Razorthorn, who spawns alongside two champion guardians._\n_In the second challenge, you will encounter kobolds and minotaurs. The final named is Uvilan the Tyrant._\n_In the third challenge, you will encounter Bolvirks, ogres, and trolls. The final named is Broo, the Defender of Solitude._\n_In the fourth challenge, you will encounter Grigak the Champion, who drops the loot rewarded in this task._\n_Loot depends on whether you opted for the normal version or the hard version. Among his drops:_\nTorn Veil of Sanity (normal)\nCracked Stone of Savagery (normal, though reported from hard as well)\nChaotic Shard of Ether (hard)\nJagged Fragment of Bloody Steel (hard)\nTainted Cloak of Cognition (unknown)\nQuiescent Guard of the Forgotten (unknown)\n- Chaotic Shard of Ether [item=49979]\n- Cracked Stone of Savagery [item=48471]\n- Flawless Pearl of Tranquility [item=51414]\n- Jagged Fragment of Bloody Steel [item=49054]\n- Quiescent Guard of the Forgotten [item=47103]\n- Splintered Totem of Rage [item=50626]\n- Tainted Cloak of Cognition [item=47994]\n- Torn Veil of Sanity [item=49980]",
    },
