      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- South Ro 2.0 [zone=43]\n**Who:**\n- Dimbwicket Middifoodle [npc=20336]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 16\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Citizens of Freeport +20\n- Coalition of Tradefolk +20\n- Dismal Rage +20\n- Knights of Truth +20\n- Priests of Marr +20\n- Steel Warriors +20\n- The Freeport Militia +20\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Razortooth - South Ro 2.0 [npc=21060]\n- a caiman - South Ro [npc=2463]\n- a deepwater caiman [npc=2467]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Creepy Concerto [quest=3367]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Apr 4 22:45:15 2006\nModified: Fri Aug 14 04:01:27 2026 | | _**Dimwicket Middifoodle is located on the southern coast of South Ro 2.0.**_\n_**/waypoint +2483, -2662, +4**_\nYou say, 'Hail, Dimbwicket Middifoodle'\nDimbwicket Middifoodle says, 'No, No, No! I don't have time to sit here and chat with you \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! I've come here to help the city of Freeport but I can't get to the city! Do the people of Freeport not realize the [ **caiman problem**] that they have around here?'\nYou say, 'What caiman problem?'\nDimbwicket Middifoodle says, 'What caiman problem? Look up the beach and tell me that you don't see a caiman problem! Enough of this chatting \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Can you help [ **clear the beach**] of this problem so that I can make it to Freeport safely?'\nYou say, 'I will help you clear the beach'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Great Caiman Issue'.\nDimbwicket Middifoodle says, 'Get to it \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ and come back and let me know when it's clear!'\n\n---\n\n_**Task description:**_\nDimbwicket Middifoodle is an expert tinkerer who has traveled from Ak'Anon to help the great city of Freeport. When he got off the boat in the Desert of Ro he realized there was a caiman problem around the docks. Your task is to clear the beach towards Freeport so that he can arrive to the city savely.\n\n---\n\n**Clear the beach to the North of caiman for Dimbwicket - 0/15 - South Desert of Ro**\n_**You have to kill 15 caimans, which are common spawns along the coastline.**_\n\n---\n\n**Return to Dimbwicket and let him know the beach is now clear to Freeport - 0/1 - South Desert of Ro**\n_**Upon completion, return to Dimbwicket and hail him.**_\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Dimbwicket Middifoodle'\nYour task 'The Great Caiman Issue' has been updated.\nDimbwicket Middifoodle says 'Thank you very much but I need to be going now!'\nYou have cleared the beach for Dimbwicket and have helped the great city of Freeport!\nYour faction standing with Citizens of Freeport has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with The Freeport Militia has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Coalition of Tradefolk has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Knights of Truth has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Priests of Marr has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Dismal Rage has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 20.\nYou receive 1 platinum .\nYou gained experience!\n_**A giant caiman named Razortooth will then spawn and chase Dimbwicket up the whole coastline. It is not attackable. Dimbwicket respawns about 2 minutes later on his usual spot.**_\n**Submitted by:** Murril Merryweather ; Revamped by iventheassassin\n- Faction, Experience",
    },
