      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sverag, Stronghold of Rage [zone=341]\n**Who:**\n- Skald Jergald [npc=21351]\n- Skald Vergaldin [npc=21281]\n- a dark initiate [npc=21298]\n- a farspirit [npc=20766]\n- a farspirit [npc=20850]\n- a headhunter [npc=21332]\n- a scout [npc=21282]\n- a visionary [npc=20849]\n- an infiltrator [npc=22297]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Shiliskin Feeding Tentacle [item=48613]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Devastation [zone=339]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Apr 28 15:56:47 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This quest is given by various NPCs, depending on who controls the stronghold, including Skald Jergald, \"a dark initiate,\" \"a headhunter,\" and \"a farspirit\" (The Ragefang). The NPC is non-KoS and is located just beyond the door to the stronghold._\n_You may get the task after having looted the items involved. The only step involved in the actual task is delivery._\nDeliver 4 Shiliskin Feeding Tentacles (0/4) - Sverag, Stronghold of Rage\nHeads, limbs, flesh! Bring whatever it takes to show me that you are willing to fight against our enemy!\n_Upon turning in four Shiliskin Feeding Tentacles, you receive your class spell:_\n_Bard - Spell: Arcane Aria_\n_Beastlord - Skill: Rake_\n_Berserker - Skill: Bloodthirst_\n_Cleric - Spell: Elixir of Divinity_\n_Druid - Spell: Barkspur_\n_Enchanter - Spell: Ward of Bedazzlement_\n_Magician - Spell: Spear of Ro_\n_Monk - Skill: Heel of Kanji_\n_Necromancer - Spell: Grave Pact_\n_Paladin - Spell: Ward of Tunare_\n_Ranger - Spell: Scorched Earth_\n_Rogue - Skill: Raz