      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Lavastorm Mountains 3.0 [zone=31]\n**Who:**\n- Captain Aleeth Zyrv [ _Dark Reign Events_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Faction\n- Loot\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 180:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nDark Reign (Min: Warmly)\n**Related Zones:**\n- Accursed Nest: The Curse of Ju`rek [zone=354]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Ju`rek the Corrupted [npc=17734]\n- a harsh wind [npc=21419]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dragons of Norrath Progression (Dark Reign) [quest=3062]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 24\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri May 12 15:39:05 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**For an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.**\n**For an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].**\n\n---\n\n_This raid task begins with Captain Aleeth Zyrv ( **click for map image**) in the Dark Reign camp of the Lavastorm Mountains._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task:_\n\\- Minimum 6 players; maximum 24 players\n\\- Minimum \"warmly\" faction with Dark Reign\n\\- Completion of all Tier 4 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Aleeth Zyrv'\nCaptain Aleeth Zyrv says 'You must search the blackest recesses of your heart to serve us well, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Our endeavors are not for the frail.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Curse of Ju`rek'.\nThere is a particularly strong drake within the Nest. It seems when the weak hatchlings were corrupted, this one managed to draw more power within himself and grow strong. Defeat this drake so that we may know more of this power.\n\n---\n\n**Task Steps**\nTouch the portal to the Nest 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nConfront Ju`rek the Corrupted 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\nKill Ju`rek the Corrupted 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\n\n---\n\n**The Event**\n_The entrance to the instance is in the southeastern part of the Broodlands._\n_Ju`rek the Corrupted hits for a max ~2,300; flurries; has ~545,000 hitpoints; and casts two spells:_\nDecaying Stench: PB AE 100', Disease (-600)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1800 per tick\n2: Increase Disease Counter by 45\nJu'Ok's Cry: Targeted AE 100', Poison (-550)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1500\n2: Stun (10.00 sec)\n_Also, Ju`rek spawns multiple adds called \"a harsh wind\" in waves as its health goes down. These proc \"Freezing Blast\"; have relatively few hitpoints; and are mezzable, but not stunnable:_\nFreezing Blast: PB AE 100', Magic (-300)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 1000\n2: Decrease Movement by 70%\n\n---\n\n**Completion & Loot**\n_Kill Ju`rek the Corrupted to complete the task:_\nJu`rek the Corrupted has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nJu`rek the Corrupted's corpse falls to the ground, its massive wings beating no more.\nYour faction standing with Cursed Drakes got worse.\nYour faction standing with Vishimtar got worse.\nHe has been slain. You found nothing? How worthless.\n_Ju`rek drops 6x \"Diseased Wing Fragment\" (progression item) + 1 item from this loot table:_\nBlack Banded Ring of Evisceration\nDark-Touched Mantle\nEarring of Contemplation\nHammer of the Last Clutch\n_Task Rewards:_\n18 Ebon Crystals\n1x \"Dark Reign Token\" (faction **turn-in** [quest=3579] item)\n- Black Banded Ring of Evisceration [item=38559]\n- Dark Reign Token [item=34990]\n- Dark-Touched Mantle [item=38536]\n- Diseased Wing Fragments [item=34899]\n- Earring of Contemplation [item=37094]\n- Ebon Crystal [item=34989]\n- Hammer of the Last Clutch [item=34900]",
    },
