      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- North Ro 2.0 [zone=24]\n**Who:**\n- Tak`Valnakor [npc=20551]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Corrupted Priest Signet [item=49768]\n- Crown of Tak`Yaliz [item=49767]\n- Jewel Encrusted Wand [item=49769]\n- Takish-Hiz Royal Scepter [item=49770]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Elddar Forest [zone=340]\n- Ruins of Takish-Hiz: Message to the Past [zone=383]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Maryn Tak`Yaliz [npc=20645]\n- Queen Tak`Yaliz [npc=20324]\n- a chest - Jeweled Wand [npc=21664]\n- a chest - Message From the Past Task [npc=21665]\n- a chest - Royal Scepter [npc=21663]\n- a dusty chest [npc=43898]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Access to the Theater of Blood/Plane of Music [quest=3444]\n- PoR Level 70 Spell #1: The Key To The Past [quest=3390]\n- PoR Level 70 Spell #2: The Burning Prince [quest=3391]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Jun 10 19:15:46 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | This is the final task in a series of three, and is part of the Theater of Blood access quest.\n**(need all dialogues, task text, information on rewards, etc.)**\nFind Tak`Valnakor at location +6880, -1350 in the Northern Desert of Ro.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tak`Valnakor'\nTak`Valnakor says 'Back again \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? I have heard of your work for the Queen's spirit. I wish that I could have met her. Perhaps one day she will speak with me as well. The news that you delivered about the princesses' betrayal must have struck her a devastating blow. I would ask that you [visit her] once again and see if you might be of any aid in her time of need.'\nYou say, 'I will visit her.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Message to the Past'\nUpon being issued the task, he will direct you to Queen Tal`Yaliz at location +5950, -2080. Doing so will result in a Crown of Tak`Yaliz and a group port in to an instanced version of Ruins of Takish-Hiz.\nYou say, 'Hail, Queen Tak`Yaliz'\nQueen Tak`Yaliz says 'Have you any further news of my people \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? If I had only known of this betrayal when I was still alive I may have been able to put a stop to it. There is a chance though. I have heard of a rift opening between here and the Elddar of my past. If someone were able to find my younger self in that time they could warn of this betrayal and possibly prevent such a thing from happening. Would you be [willing] to undertake such an effort \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_?'\nYou say, 'I am willing.'\nQueen Tak`Yaliz says 'Your willingness to help lifts my spirits, perhaps there is hope yet. I would send you straight there, but I doubt that you would receive quite the welcome you would deserve. Before you go talk to my younger self it would be to your benefit to gather some of my lost possessions to serve as proof that I have sent you. To that end I will give you one of my last treasures. You will want to gather another token to show the corruption and betrayal by the priests as well. With all of those you should have small trouble convincing me of the tragedy to come. When you are [prepared] I will show you a secret way into the city.'\nYour task 'Message to the Past' has been updated.\nYour shared task is now locked. You may no longer add or remove players.\nYou say, 'I am prepared.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Ruins of Takish`Hiz.\nYour goal is to loot three items:\nTakish-Hiz Royal Scepter\nJewel Encrusted Wand\nA Corrupted Priest Signet\nLocations vary on NPC's and ground spawns in the zone between different instances of this task. Please report your locations.\nThe scepter has been reported to be found in a chest located in the building at location +100, -960 and -6, -1066, +140\nThe wand has been reported to be found in a chest located in the building at location +260, -460, +140\nThe signet is dropped by High Priest Kelshar whose location varies. One location is in large temple, at the top of the northwest spiral staircase 120, 600, 166 in the southwestern-most section. He is guarded by two sand elves and spawns adds at 80% and again at 40%. Note that these adds may or may not come. However, if they do, be advised they are equivalent to his guards in terms of strength.\nOnce you have looted all three items, enter The Elddar Forest and enter the first building on your left upon zoning in.\nSpeak with Maryn Tak`Yaliz and give her the crown, wand, signet, and scepter.\nYou say, 'Hail, Maryn Tak`Yaliz'\nMaryn Tak`Yaliz says 'You there! Leave here at once! Your kind is not welcome in here. Now leave before I call for the guards!'\nMaryn Tak`Yaliz says 'These items lend some credence to your claims. I don't know that I believe that such a terrible fate will befall us, but there have been some disturbing occurrences lately. While what you claim will happen could be responsible for part of them, there may be more to this tragedy than we realize.'\nYour task 'Message to the Past' has been updated.\nWith the message received in good faith things can only begin to improve. However, as Maryn said, there seems to be more to this corruption than was initially thought.\nA dusty chest spawns with loot which will be one of:\nForest Moss Belt (please upload this to Lucy)\nRoot Tender Mace\nRoot Tender Necklace\nRoot Tender Veil\nSome classes receive their 70th level spell / skill.\nCleric: Spell: Aura of the Pious\nDruid: Spell: Aura of Life\nEnchanter: Spell: Illusionist's Aura\nMagician: Spell: Rathe's Strength\nNecromancer: Spell: Death Rune\nShaman: Spell: Idol of Malos\nWizard: Spell: Fine Rune\n- Root Tender Mace [item=49243]\n- Root Tender Necklace [item=49239]\n- Spell: Aura of Life [item=47604]\n- Spell: Aura of the Pious [item=47605]\n- Spell: Death Rune [item=47053]\n- Spell: Fire Rune [item=53672]\n- Spell: Idol of Malos [item=51198]\n- Spell: Illusionist's Aura [item=50879]\n- Spell: Rathe's Strength [item=50736]",
