      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Elddar Forest [zone=340]\n**Who:**\n- Shalowen the Pure [npc=20348]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scorned Wood of Agrel [item=50728]\n- Scorned Wood of Drekin [item=50729]\n- Scorned Wood of Remlin [item=50730]\n- Scorned Wood of Zorbig [item=50731]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Agrel the Scorned [npc=20643]\n- Drekin the Scorned [npc=20644]\n- Orgaf the Crafter [npc=20269]\n- Remlin the Scorned [npc=20499]\n- Zorbig the Scorned [npc=20646]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Elddar Corruption #1: Investigating the Elddar [quest=3376]\n- Elddar Corruption #2: Questioning the Priest [quest=3514]\n- Raid Task: The Corruption of Ro [quest=3398]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Jul 22 17:08:11 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is the third group task in a series of three in which corruption among some Elddar elves is exposed. Completing this third task will allow you to request the raid task, The Corruption of Ro._\n_Find Shalowen the Pure in Elddar Forest at location -5, -127._\nYou say, 'Hail, Shalowen the Pure'\nShalowen the Pure says 'I have looked at the sealed document \\_\\_\\_\\_. Unfortunately there is no information about who made the figurine for Nalderin. However it did contain information about a [key] to enter the top portion of the shrine.'\nYou say, 'What key?'\nShalowen the Pure says 'The document says that the key can be created by fusing four pieces of scorned wood. Once you have this scorned wood you must take it too a [crafter] that I know.'\nYou say, 'What crafter?'\nShalowen the Pure says 'This crafter is a powerful orc. His name is Orgaf. Once you gather the magical pieces of wood, take them to him.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Key to Corruption'.\n\n---\n\nSearch for Agrel the Scorned 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nRecover a magical piece of wood from Agrel 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nSearch for Drekin the Scorned 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nRecover a magical piece of wood from Drekin 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nSearch for Remlin the Scorned 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nRecover a magical piece of wood from Remlin 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nSearch for Zorbig the Scorned 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nRecover a magical piece of wood from Zorbig 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nFind Orgaf the great orc crafter 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\nGet Orgaf to craft the wooden key to unlock the shrine door 0/1 The Elddar Forest)\nRecover the shrine door key 0/1 (The Elddar Forest)\n\n---\n\n_This task takes place in The Elddar Forest. You must find and kill the following treants:_\nRemlin the Scorned: _stationary and spawns many mezzable adds._\nDrekin the Scorned: _has five Protectors; located at +1119.71, -932.71, -56.17 facing east by Northeast._\nAgrel The Scorned: _a roamer near location -284.75, -841.00, -29.88 - roams around in a circle going towards the pond._\nZorbig the Scorned: _Probably the easiest fight, located at -197.09, +1028.66, +14.00 (no adds, but has an AE root)._\n_All of the named have an AE root DoT spell named Creeping Oak. They hit for 2200 while adds hit for 1400. Attacking adds will also provoke nearby forest animals to attack as well, so be prepared for that._\n_Each of the treants drops a scorned piece of wood. Bring the pieces to Orgaf the Crafter._\nYou say, 'Hail, Orgaf the Crafter'\nOrgaf the Crafter says 'What you want with Orgaf?'\nYou say, 'Shalowen sent me'\nOrgaf the Crafter says 'Shalowen! I can make a special key out of wood for friends of Shalowen. Only if you bring me the magical pieces of wood for key.'\n_Hand in all four pieces of scorned wood._\nOrgaf the Crafter says 'You got the magical wood for Orgaf. Wait here and Orgaf make key.'\n_Orgaf now stands and flaps his arms for a couple of minutes. Then..._\nOrgaf the Crafter says 'Orgaf done with key. Orcs need it more.'\nOrgaf the Crafter says 'The Tribe of the Nodgha shall crush you!'\n_He attacks. Kill him and loot the key._\nOrgaf the Crafter's corpse says 'Lugnah curse your clan!'\nYour task 'The Key to Corruption' has been updated.\n--You have looted a Carved Wooden Key.--\nYour task 'The Key to Corruption' has been updated.\nYou have recovered the key to the shrine. Travel back to Shalowen and speak with him. He will have further instructions for you.\n_an old chest containing one item of loot spawns by the corpse of Orgaf_\n- Carved Wooden Key [item=61430]\n- Mask of the Underhanded [item=50988]\n- Sceptre of Corruption [item=60349]\n- Sinister Beaded Necklace [item=64560]",
