      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Elddar Forest [zone=340]\n**Who:**\n- Speaker Grayleaf [npc=20325]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 66\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Pouch of Treant Spirit Seeds [item=49920]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Plane of Growth [zone=103]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dryad of Tunare [npc=21969]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Jul 27 02:00:23 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Speaker Grayleaf may be found at +880, -305, +15. You must be at least 55th level and have at least indifferent faction **(with which faction?)** in order to request this task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Speaker Grayleaf'\nSpeaker Grayleaf says 'A [curse] is settling in on these woods. Nothing can be done to stop this.'\nYou say, 'What curse?'\nSpeaker Grayleaf says 'Although it has not yet come to pass, I have heard of this curse whispered by the wind and the river. Our roots are too deep to leave. I understand you are from another time? Maybe you will be able to give our spirits [rest] after these woods are enveloped by sand.'\nYou say, 'Rest?'\nSpeaker Grayleaf says 'Good luck, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Here is what must be done.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Tree Heaven'.\nDeliver the Ancient Treant Spirit Seeds to the Dryad of Tunare - Plane of Growth\nSpeaker Grayleaf says, 'Our spirits must be returned to the source. Take these seeds to the Dryad of Tunare in the Plane of Growth. She lives high in the ancient tree that towers above the rest. Look for it in the northeast. She will reward you for your journey.\n_You receive a Pouch of Treant Spirit Seeds to deliver to the Dryad of Tunare in the Plane of Growth. The Dryad is on the high platform in the giant Tree of Tunare in the northeast part of the zone, at +1295, -1555, +205._\n_Hand in the seeds to receive your reward._\nThe dryad asks, 'What are these? By Tunare! The spirits of the ancient grove have returned at last. Bless you, traveler.'\n_Melee/hybrid reward: Belt of the Rainmakers_\n_Caster/priest reward: Crimson Cloak of Moonwaters_\n**Submitted by:** Odia, Final Door, Stromm\n- Belt of the Rainmakers [item=47896]\n- Crimson Cloak of Moonwaters [item=50811]",
