      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sverag, Stronghold of Rage [zone=341]\n**Who:**\n- Skald Jergald [npc=21351]\n- Skald Vergaldin [npc=21281]\n- a farspirit [npc=20850]\n- a headhunter [npc=21332]\n- a scout [npc=21282]\n- a visionary [npc=20849]\n- an acolyte [npc=23969]\n- an infiltrator [npc=22297]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Undead Legionnaire's Skull [item=48804]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Sep 2 00:28:51 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is given by various NPCs, depending on who controls the stronghold, unless the **(which race?)** control it (in which case **(which mob?)** does not give the task). The NPC is non-KOS and is located just beyond the door to the stronghold, at +990, -10._\n_You may get the task after having looted the items involved. The only step involved in the actual task is delivery._\nYou say, 'Hail, an infiltrator'\nan infiltrator says 'I shall only hold my rage back if you [can prove] your worth.'\nYou say, 'I can prove my worth.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bring Me Their Skulls!'\nDeliver 4 Undead Legionnaire's Skull to **[your contact]** \\- Sverag, Stronghold of Rage\nHead, limbs, flesh! Bring whatever it takes to show me that you are willing to fight against our enemy!\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!!\n_Hand in four:_\nYour task 'Bring Me Their Skulls!' has been updated.\nYour task 'Bring Me Their Skulls!' has been updated.\nYour task 'Bring Me Their Skulls!' has been updated.\nYour task 'Bring Me Their Skulls!' has been updated.\nHrrmph. You have done much to prove your worth, but I still don't trust you.\n_Upon turning in four, you receive your class spell:_\n_Bard - Spell: Arcane Aria_\n_Beastlord - Skill: Rake_\n_Berserker - Skill: Bloodthirst_\n_Cleric - Spell: Elixir of Divinity_\n_Druid - Spell: Barkspur_\n_Enchanter - Spell: Ward of Bedazzlement_\n_Magician - Spell: Spear of Ro_\n_Monk - Skill: Heel of Kanji_\n_Necromancer - Spell: Grave Pact_\n_Paladin - Spell: Ward of Tunare_\n_Ranger - Spell: Scorched Earth_\n_Rogue - Skill: Razorarc_\n_Shadowknight - Spell: Theft of Agony_\n_Shaman - Spell: Nectar of Pain_\n_Warrior - Skill: Mock_\n_Wizard - Spell: Ice Block_\n**Submitted by:** Lakah SiNafay, Ancient Dominion, Antonius Bayle\n- Skill: Bloodthirst [item=48658]\n- Skill: Heel of Kanji [item=48650]\n- Skill: Mock [item=48638]\n- Skill: Razorarc [item=48646]\n- Spell: Arcane Aria [item=48629]\n- Spell: Barkspur [item=48631]\n- Spell: Elixir of Divinity [item=48587]\n- Spell: Grave Pact [item=48630]\n- Spell: Ice Block [item=48628]\n- Spell: Nectar of Pain [item=47712]\n- Spell: Scorched Earth [item=48626]\n- Spell: Spear of Ro [item=48859]\n- Spell: Theft of Agony [item=48584]\n- Spell: Ward of Bedazzlement [item=48639]\n- Spell: Ward of Tunare [item=48632]\n- Tome of Rake [item=47705]",
