      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Mark of Ashengate [item=64888]\n- Mark of Vergalid [item=66231]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Ashengate East (Raid) [zone=446]\n- Ashengate North (Raid) [zone=457]\n- Ashengate West (Raid) [zone=456]\n- Ashengate, Reliquary of the Scale [zone=442]\n- Direwind Cliffs [zone=441]\n- Vergalid Mines [zone=440]\n- Vergalid Mines: Into the Leviathan's Lair [zone=445]\n- Vergalid Mines: Vergalid's End [zone=444]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Ashengate Access: A Complex Diversion [quest=4158]\n- Ashengate Access: Ghosts from the Past [quest=4159]\n- Ashengate Access: Severing the Strings [quest=3911]\n- Ashengate Access: The Pretender [quest=3900]\n- Locate Drizzlorn (Raid Access) [quest=4478]\n- Raid Expedition: Ashengate East [quest=4245]\n- Raid Expedition: Ashengate North [quest=4247]\n- Raid Expedition: Ashengate West [quest=4246]\n- Raid Expedition: Vergalid Mines: Vergalid's End [quest=3930]\n- Vergalid Mines: Into the Leviathan's Lair [quest=3668]\n- Zheren #1: Scouting Sunderock [quest=3646]\n- Zheren #2: Dyn`leth's Artillery [quest=3692]\n- Zheren #3: The Ashengate Orders [quest=3693]\n- Zheren #4: Dyn`Leth's Mine [quest=3697]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Apr 2 17:24:25 2007\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **NOTE: As of a December 2008 patch, all players at least Level 74 can participate in Ashengate raids without any prior flagging. If anyone under Level 74 wants to participate, they would need the flags.**\n**Anyone who wants to request the raids (regardless of level) must have completed all original flags.**\n\n---\n\n**Raid Participation**\n_In order to participate in the Ashengate West raid, you must:_\n\\\\* Have ally faction with Scholars of Solusek.\n\\\\* Have received a character flag upon Vergalid's death in the \"Vergalid's End\" raid.\n_In order to participate in the Ashengate East raid, you must:_\n\\\\* Have ally faction with Infiltrators and Traitors of Ashengate.\n\\\\* Have received a character flag upon Vergalid's death in the \"Vergalid's End\" raid.\n\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* There is no bypass for faction, but you may be 85'd into the zone and gain faction hits from defeating the raid encounters here.\n\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* Bypass for the Vergalid kill is a \"Mark of Vergalid\", which drops from all events in both Ashengate East and Ashengate West raids.\n_In order to participate in the Ashengate North raid, you must:_\n\\\\* Have killed Sothgar the Twiceborn in the Ashengate West instance.\n\\\\* Have killed Stitch in the Ashengate East instance.\n\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* Bypass for those two kills is a \"Mark of Ashengate\", which drops from all events in Ashengate North.\n\n---\n\n**Requesting Raids**\n_In order to request the Ashengate East and Ashengate West raids, you must:_\n\\\\* Have completed flagging outlined above.\n\\\\* Have completed Captain Zheren's first four tasks:\n\\- Scouting Sunderock [quest=3646]\n\\- Dyn`leth's Artillery [quest=3692]\n\\- The Ashengate Orders [quest=3693]\n\\- Dyn`Leth's Mine [quest=3697]\n\\\\* Have completed the 24-player raid task Vergalid Mines: Into the Leviathan's Lair [quest=3668].\n\\\\* Have completed the task Severing the Strings [quest=3911] in conjunction with the 54-player raid task Vergalid's End [quest=3930].\n\\\\* Have completed the task The Pretender [quest=3900] in conjunction with the 54-player raid task Vergalid's End [quest=3930].\n_In order to request the Ashengate North raid, you must:_\n\\\\* Have completed all of the above flagging process.\n\\\\* Have completed the task A Complex Diversion [quest=4158] in conjunction with the Ashengate: East raid instance.\n\\\\* Have completed the task Ghosts of the Past [quest=4159] in conjunction with the Ashengate: West raid instance.\n\\\\* Have completed the task The path begins with a single step... [quest=4478].",
