      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- North Ro 2.0 [zone=24]\n**Who:**\n- Tarakix V`Rasyrn [ _Raid Recruiter_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Related Zones:**\n- Takish-Hiz: The Sunken Library (Raid) [zone=702]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Flowkeepers Chest of Knowledge [npc=33939]\n- Flowkeepers Chest of Life [npc=33940]\n- Geomancer Paara [npc=33914]\n- Jeweled Champion Ridhaz [npc=33920]\n- Jeweled Champion Wayvia [npc=33921]\n- Jeweled Guardian Bathas [npc=33923]\n- Jeweled Guardian Faetran [npc=33924]\n- Jeweled Guardian Myriana [npc=33925]\n- Paaras Chest of Renewal [npc=33938]\n- the Flowkeeper of Knowledge [npc=33933]\n- the Flowkeeper of Life [npc=33934]\n- the Sands of Knowledge [npc=33935]\n- the Sands of Life [npc=33936]\n**Era:** | !Lost Dungeons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 54\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Sep 28 23:23:20 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This raid expedition begins with Tarakix V`Rasyrn at the Wayfarer camp in North Ro and takes place in an instance called Sunken Library._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tarakix V`Rasyrn'\nTarakix V`Rasyrn glares at you, as if sizing you up. 'Well, are you going to stand there and gawk at me like a severed fishhead, or do you possess some minor semblance of skill and intellect? If you can rally the call of your friends perhaps you can help us with a serious [problem].'\nYou say, 'I can help with your problem.'\nTarakix V`Rasyrn says 'Well then, 'friend'. We have recently discovered that the sand elves within Takish-Hiz are planning to perform a ritual ceremony soon. We will need a raid of foolish . . . Er, brave adventurers to head into the depths of the sandy caves to investigate and bring a halt to the ceremony, if possible. Be on your guard, for there are sure to be many guards and other insidious traps in place to stop you. Are you [interested]?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nTarakix V`Rasyrn says 'Good luck, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You will need it.'\n_You receive the \"Sunken Library\" expedition (zone-in marked on compass)._\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Takish-Hiz: Sunken Library.\n\n---\n\n_You'll want to clear through the zone until you reach Geomancer Paara._\n_Throughout the zone there are golem model NPCs named \"the Sands of Knowledge\" and \"the Sands of Life\". When all of the golems of one type are killed \"The Flowkeeper of Knowledge\" or \"The Flowkeeper of Life\" will spawn._\n_The Sands of Knowledge cast:_\nSand Curse of Knowledge: PB AE 50', Prismatic (-275)\n1: Decrease Mana by 500 per tick\n2: Increase Curse Counter by 24\n_The Sands of Life cast:_\nSand Curse of Life: PB AE 50', Prismatic (-275)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 500 per tick\n2: Increase Curse Counter by 24\n_The Flowkeeper of Knowledge casts:_\nGreater Sand Curse of Knowledge: PB AE 150', Unresistable (-325)\n1: Decrease Spell Haste by 50%\n2: Decrease Mana by 1000 per tick\n3: Limit: Combat Skills Not Allowed\n_The Flowkeeper of Life casts:_\nGreater Sand Curse of Life: PB AE 150', Prismatic (-325)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1000 per tick\n2: Decrease ATK by 500\nYou have slain the Sands of Life!\nVisions of all things life and growth flash through your mind. The Flowkeeper of Life has come.\nYou have slain the Sands of Knowledge!\nVisions of endless knowledge and lore flash through your mind. The Flowkeeper of Knowledge has come.\n_Killing the Flowkeepers unlocks the extra two chests at the end of the zone._\nthe Flowkeeper of Life's corpse says 'The Jeweled Guard will make short work of you!'\nThe ground rumbles and shakes, a mystic veil has been lifted revealing the hidden treasure of the sand elves.\nthe Flowkeeper of Knowledge's corpse says 'The Jeweled Guard will make short work of you!'\nThe ground rumbles and shakes, a mystic veil has been lifted revealing the hidden treasure of the sand elves.\n\n---\n\n_In addition to the Golems and Flowkeepers there are three \"Jeweled Guardian \\_\\_\\_\\_\" NPCs between the entrance and Geomancer Paara. It is likely they all need to be cleared in order for the raid to be able to engage Paara at the end of the instance._\n_Bathas casts \"Radiant Vexation\":_\nRadiant Vexation: PB AE 100', Prismatic (-300)\n1: Increase Spell Damage by 0%\n2: Decrease ATK by 300\n3: Increase Curse Counter by 24\n4: Limit: Combat Skills Not Allowed\n_Faetran casts \"Sand Quake\":_\nSand Quake: PB AE 300', Magic (-325)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1000\n2: Stun (1.00 sec)\n_Myriana casts \"Brilliant Fury\":_\nBrilliant Fury: Single Target, Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 2000\n2: Stun (5.00 sec)\n_Upon killing the third guardian:_\nShouts are heard from further in and a voice stands above the rest saying, 'My brethren of the Jeweled Guard prepare yourselves! We must not allow the Ceremony to be stopped!' Guards have come to stop the adventurers from interrupting the ceremony.\n\n---\n\n_There are two final NPCs guarding Geomancer Paara: Jeweled Champion Ridhaz and Jeweled Champion Wayvia, each of whom can be single-pulled and killed individually. Ridhaz casts \"Entrapping Sands\"; Wayvia casts \"Senseless Sands\":_\nEntrapping Sands: PB AE 125', Prismatic (-300)\n2: Decrease Movement by 36% (L1) to 65% (L30)\n3: Decrease Hitpoints by 600 per tick\nSenseless Sands: PB AE 125', Chromatic (-300)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 1000\n2: Decrease INT by 250\n3: Decrease WIS by 250\n4: Increase Curse Counter by 72\n_When both champions are dead, the fight with Paara begins._\nJeweled Champion Ridhaz's corpse says 'The Jeweled Guard will make short work of you!'\nFrom nearby Geomancer Paara stirs from her trancelike state stopping her continual chanting and says, 'Fools you will come no further those that disturb the Ceremony of Renewal will pay with their lives!'\n_Throughout the fight Geomancer Paara summons waves of Geomantic Pact sentinels. This occurs five times at roughly 20% increments of her health. There are four sentinels spawned per wave except in the final wave, where eight are spawned._\nSands swirl around as the Geomantic Pact sends some sand constructs to aide Geomancer Paara in her battle.\n_In addition to the adds, Paara casts three AEs:_\nGrip of Stone: PB AE 125', Chromatic (-300)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 500 per tick\n2: Decrease Mana by 500 per tick\nPetrifying Blast: PB AE 125', Chromatic (-300)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1000\n2: Stun (10.00 sec)\nRain of Stone: Targeted AE 125', Chromatic (-300)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1500\nGeomancer Paara has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nGeomancer Paara's corpse says 'The Jeweled Guard will make short work of you!'\nYour faction standing with Citizens of Takish-Hiz got worse.\nYour victory has shattered the shroud of magic surrounding the dungeon's treasure\nThe mighty Geomancer whispers something intelligble as she falls to the ground in defeat. You have accomplished a mighty feat in stopping the Ceremony of Renewal. The lost treasures of the sand elves is yours for the taking.\n_Three chests spawn with loot._\n\n---\n\n_Known Loot:_\nPaaras Chest of Renewal (2 items per raid)\nFlowkeeper's Shard of Knowledge\nFlowkeeper's Shard of Vitality\nGolden Chain Gauntlets\nHardened Stone Gauntlets\nRuned Leather Gloves\nSmooth Silk Gloves\nFlowkeepers Chest of Knowledge (2 items per raid)\nElaborate Silk Shawl\nGem Studded Pauldron of Stone\nRing of Prophetic Visions\nShimmering Jeweled Veil\nWretched Chain Mask\nFlowkeepers Chest of Life (2 items per raid)\nAncient Hide Mantle\nReinforced Mithril Mask\nVicious Leather Mask\nSilvery Chain Mantle\n**Submitted by:** Zeemus the Arch`Knight, Drinal Server\n- Ancient Hide Mantle [item=76757]\n- Elaborate Silk Shawl [item=76349]\n- Flowkeeper's Shard of Knowledge [item=57954]\n- Flowkeeper's Shard of Vitality [item=85508]\n- Gem Studded Pauldron of Stone [item=76756]\n- Golden Chain Gauntlets [item=76352]\n- Hardened Stone Gauntlets [item=74500]\n- Jeweled Ring of Mastery [item=85158]\n- Reinforced Mithril Mask [item=84830]\n- Ring of Prophetic Visions [item=76759]\n- Runed Leather Gloves [item=76758]\n- Shimmering Jeweled Veil [item=76350]\n- Silvery Chain Mantle [item=84829]\n- Smooth Silk Gloves [item=76351]\n- Vicious Leather Mask [item=85147]\n- Wretched Chain Mask [item=85146]",
    },
