        { id = 85738, name = "Mnemenic Device", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Brell's Rest [zone=704]\n**Who:**\n- Berrina Saltidnarik [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 60\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Mnemenic Device [item=85738]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dorrvix [npc=34036]\n- The Gatekeeper [npc=34033]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Berrina #2: Clash of the Kobolds [quest=4913]\n- Berrina #3: Gnoll With the Punches [quest=4914]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 10 14:47:33 2009\nModified: Wed Sep 10 06:35:37 2025 | | This shared task (3-6 players) is the first in a series of three. It begins with Berrina Saltidnarik [npc=34042] at location -650, 200, 37 in Brell's Rest.\nYou say, 'Hail, Berrina Saltidnarik'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Hello there, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You look like you're a [visitor] to this realm.'\nYou say, 'Yep, I'm a visitor'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Not all of us are here by choice. Some who dwell in this realm are bound to it due to our devotion to Brell. That is the position that I find myself in, for example. Still, one does what one [can], no?'\nYou say, 'They do what they can'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Even in the realm of a god, there is always work that can be done. I pride myself on being a problem solver, personally. I try to find and fix [problems] whenever someone comes to me with one.'\nYou say, 'Problems?'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Take, for example, a gnoll named Dorrvix. He wants to be a part of the Shining City so bad, it hurts him. The poor thing spends all his days looking up and dreaming. The Gatekeeper just says that it isn't Brell's will for Dorrvix to enter. It feels like there's more to the story, but the Gatekeeper and I don't often see eye to eye. Would you be [willing] to go find out what the trouble is?'\nYou say, 'I'd be willing'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Wonderful. Go speak with Dorrvix near the gnoll camp to the west. If you must speak with him, the Gatekeeper is located at the top of the great bridge under Brell's Temple to the north.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gnoll Who Your Friends Are'.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\nBerrina Saltidnarik has befriended a gnoll named Dorrvix who is living amongst the warring clans to the west. Dorrvix wishes to be allowed to enter the shining city, but the way is blocked to him. Berrina would like you to intervene on Dorrvix's behalf, as your powers may be sufficient to remove some of the obstacles that lie in his path.\nMake contact with Dorrvix in the gnoll's camp. He will be able to explain himself better.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with Dorrvix 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\nDorrvix [npc=34036] is located in the gnoll camp in the western part of the zone. Location: -170, 685, 31.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dorrvix'\nDorrvix says 'You want help Dorrvix? Find out why Dorrvix can't get in [city]! Dorrvix deserve city! City is shiny! Dorrvix is good. Dorrvix deserve city.'\nYour task 'Gnoll Who Your Friends Are' has been updated.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\nYou say, 'Tell me about the city'\nDorrvix says 'Shining city! Look up! Gate man keeps Dorrvix out, Dorrvix can't get to the shiny! Talk to gate man on the bridge. Help Dorrvix get to shiny. Dorrvix not bad, bad things happen to Dorrvix.'\n2\\. Speak with the Gatekeeper 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Contact the Gatekeeper to the Shining City and see if you can find out what blocks Dorrvix's path.\nThe Gatekeeper [npc=34033] is located at the entrance to Kernagir, the Shining City (go up one of the two ramps around the lava in the northern part of the zone). Location: 515, 45, 153.\nYou say, 'Hail, The Gatekeeper'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'Ah, Dorrvix, another of the tough luck club. Well, I have to give him credit for being persistent. If this will stop people from bothering me, I will allow you to act on his behalf, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You must give this [device] to Dorrvix's peers. Find five gnolls who are willing to record their testimony and then bring the device back. If you can bring me information that was not considered earlier, perhaps Brell will change his decision.'\nYour task 'Gnoll Who Your Friends Are' has been updated.\nYou say, 'I need the device...'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'Here you are, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou receive Mnemenic Device [item=85738].\nYou say, 'Hail, The Gatekeeper'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'I am known as The Gatekeeper. I allow those Brell desires to [enter] his Shining City. Anyone else is refused entry. If the underfoot is too much for you I can [send you] back to the way people enter here. I believe you mortals from your plane call it Paineel.'\nYou say, 'I wish to enter!'\nThe Gatekeeper whispers to you, 'I don't say this to everyone, but if you want to enter Kernagir, you must prove that you understand the values that are important here. Perhaps if you speak to Algera Chindlebolt she can put you to work. Work ethic is one of the prime virtues valued by those in the Underfoot. Or if you are overendowed with allies, perhaps Algera has something more dangerous you could assist with.'\n3\\. Find some gnolls who are willing to testify about Dorrvix 0/5 (Brell's Rest)\n4\\. Defend yourself from gnolls who are unwilling to help 0/4 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ The Gatekeeper did not seem to be too eager to help, but he is allowing you to seek the testimony of five of Dorrvix's peers. See if you can find five willing volunteers.\nHand the Mnenemic Device to any gnoll to get these updates. They'll give an update for either step. If the latter step, they'll attack, so be ready. They hit for a max ~5,500 and have a good amount of hps.\nResponses you'll see:\na gnoll charger says 'Dorrvix wants fight, but he hate losing, so he no fight. He just mad when others fight now.'\na gnoll charger says 'Dorrvix takes food first, and he mean when he does it. He says it because he got food taken away, but he do it all the time.'\na gnoll brawler says 'Dorrvix drink water all time, and he push others away. He tell me to go drink down by lava, where it hot!'\na gnoll guardian says 'When something bad, it never Dorrvix fault. He always say someone else do it even when he do it.'\na gnoll assassin says 'No! No helping the gate man! Fight now!'\na gnoll charger says 'No! I answer already. Go away now.'\n5\\. Deliver 1 Mnemenic Device to the Gatekeeper 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ You've collected the testimonies of five gnolls. Bring the recording back to the Gatekeeper.\nYour task 'Gnoll Who Your Friends Are' has been updated.\nYour collected testimony did not present any information of which the Gatekeeper was unaware. Dorrvix must first take responsibility for his own actions before he can begin his journey of change.\n_Rewards:_\n157 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
