      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Brell's Rest [zone=704]\n**Who:**\n- Berrina Saltidnarik [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Tattered Runecloth [item=85852]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Parrmug [npc=34070]\n- a frail gnoll reaver [npc=34072]\n- a gnoll protector [npc=34071]\n- an unyielding gnoll reaver [npc=34073]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Berrina #1: Gnoll Who Your Friends Are [quest=4912]\n- Berrina #2: Clash of the Kobolds [quest=4913]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 10 15:22:47 2009\nModified: Sun Oct 12 06:51:12 2025 | | This shared task (1-6 players) is the third in a series of three. It begins with Berrina Saltidnarik [npc=34042] at location -650, 200, 37 in Brell's Rest.\nCompletion of this task (and the previous two) allows you to request the group mission Don't Fear the Destroyer [quest=4919] from Algera Chindlebolt.\nYou say, 'Hail, Berrina Saltidnarik'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Hello there, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You look like you're a [visitor] to this realm.'\nYou say, 'Yep, I'm a visitor'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Not all of us are here by choice. Some who dwell in this realm are bound to it due to our devotion to Brell. That is the position that I find myself in, for example. Still, one does what one [can], no?'\nYou say, 'They do what they can'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Even in the realm of a god, there is always work that can be done. I pride myself on being a problem solver, personally. I try to find and fix [problems] whenever someone comes to me with one.'\nYou say, 'Problems?'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'The gnolls haven't been their normal selves recently. They're less likely to engage anyone in conversation, and they haven't been fighting the Kobolds like they usually do. Are you [willing] to investigate?'\nYou say, 'I'm willing'\nBerrina Saltidnarik says 'Their leader is named Parrmug, and you can find him around the Gnoll camp to the west. He isn't that talkative with me, but he might open up to someone who isn't so familiar to him.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gnoll with the Punches'.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\nThe kobolds, without their regular sparring with the gnolls, have become restless, but the gnolls have not. Berrina wants you to find out why they are acting so strangely.\nFind and speak with the gnoll leaders. See if you can discover the cause of their odd behavior.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with Parrmug 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\nParrmug [npc=34070] is found in the gnoll camp in the western part of the zone. Note: If another group is in the midst of this task, he will be elsewhere and unavailable (only one group at a time can do this task). He respawns in the gnoll camp immediately after a group wins or fails their task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Parrmug'\nParrmug says 'Grrrrr... No talking. Is too [close].'\nYou say, 'Close?'\nParrmug says 'Nothing! No talking! Behind you! Look!'\nYour task 'Gnoll with the Punches' has been updated.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\n2\\. Speak with Parrmug 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Quickly! Catch him and find out what the problem is!\nYou say, 'Hail, Parrmug'\nParrmug says 'Yap! No! Guards! Get them!'\nYour task 'Gnoll with the Punches' has been updated.\na gnoll protector pounces!\na gnoll protector pounces!\nParrmug runs as two gnoll protectors [npc=34071] attack. They hit for a max ~4,800.\n3\\. Kill Parrmug's Guards 0/2 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ An unwarranted attack! Defend yourselves!\na gnoll protector has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na gnoll protector's corpse falls in defeat.\nYour task 'Gnoll with the Punches' has been updated.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\n4\\. Speak with Parrmug 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Chase down Parrmug and get an answer from him!\nYou say, 'Hail, Parrmug'\nParrmug says 'Never! Barrrrk!'\na gnoll protector pounces!\na gnoll protector pounces!\n_Another two gnoll protectors attack._\n5\\. Kill Parrmug's Guards 0/2 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ More guards! Defend yourselves!\n6\\. Speak with Parrmug 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Find Parrmug again and make him talk!\nNote: Hailing here will result in his attacks.\nYou say, 'Hail, Parrmug'\nParrmug says 'No more running. Now is fighting!'\nYour task 'Gnoll with the Punches' has been updated.\nParrmug says 'No! Too close, too close! Bark!'\n7\\. Kill Parrmug 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Perhaps some force will make him tell you why he's doing this.\nParrmug hits for a max ~6,000. Beat him to 30%, at which point he'll go inactive.\nParrmug says 'Okay, okay, I [talk!]'\nYou say, 'Then talk!'\nParrmug says 'We found it, a [secret]. It make power!'\nYou say, 'What secret?'\nParrmug says 'It not take long now, not long. It [grow!] Bark!'\nYou say, 'Grow?'\nParrmug says 'You see what it is, it come for you! It the Destroyer! It come very [soon!]'\nYou say, 'How soon?'\nParrmug says 'No! Too close, too close! Bark!'\nAt this point, he resumes attacking. At the same time, a large number of undead gnolls spawn around you (23 to be exact). They are 2x \" an unyielding gnoll reaver [npc=34073]\" (yellow-con; max hit ~6,500) and 21x \" a frail gnoll reaver [npc=34072]\" (blue-weak-con; max hit ~900).\n8\\. Kill the unyielding gnoll reavers 0/2 (Brell's Rest)\n9\\. Kill the frail gnoll reavers 0/21 (Brell's Rest)\n_Task Window Says:_ Defend yourselves from the horde of undead, and see if any of them leave a clue for you.\nYou must kill Parrmug along with the 23 adds.\nParrmug has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nParrmug says 'Keep it safe, just a little longer...'\n10\\. Find a clue regarding Parrmug's strange behavior 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\nParrmug drops a Tattered Runecloth [item=85852].\n11\\. Deliver 1 Tattered Rune Cloth to Berrina 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\nBerrina tells you,\"This is a very troubling story. Undead have strange properties in this realm, and I'm not quite sure what to do with this knowledge. Perhaps Algera will be able to make sense of it.\"\nYour task 'Gnoll with the Punches' has been updated.\nCompletion of this task series allows you to request the group mission Don't Fear the Destroyer [quest=4919] from Algera Chindlebolt.\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience",
    },
