      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Cooling Chamber [zone=706]\n**Who:**\n- Rodrick Cleanheart [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Amulet Sliver I [item=85825]\n- Amulet Sliver II [item=85895]\n- Amulet Sliver III [item=85828]\n- Amulet Sliver IV [item=85885]\n- Amulet Sliver V [item=85838]\n- Restored Amulet [item=85893]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Rodrick #2: Hunt the Dead [quest=4922]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 12 15:27:52 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the first of two such tasks that begin with Rodrick Cleanheart at location -170, -320, -25 in the Cooling Chamber._\nYou say, 'Hail, Rodrick Cleanheart'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Greetings \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I am pleased to see you, although my heart is [heavy].'\nYou say, 'Why is your heart is heavy?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Everyone around you has a story to tell, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, and I am no different. My tale, however, is full of [glory] and the favor of Brell. My spirit was shaped by a life lived behind the keen edge of the blade of Justice, and undead horrors from all corners of Norrath learned to tremble at the sound of my boots.'\nYou say, 'Glory?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Aye, glory! I've campfire tales a'plenty I could share, young one, but the days are too [dark] for boastful tales of victory. I'll tell no tales, at least not while these halls are filled with the shuffling steps of death.'\nYou say, 'Too dark?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Dark indeed, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, dark days indeed! In flat contradiction of the will of my Lord Brell, the dead roam these halls! My stomach turns just to think of it. Any hour I can spare from my post finds me in the depths, blade in hand, vanquishing the dead as I can. But it never seems to be [enough] - each abomination slain is replaced by two more the next day. It's getting worse, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou say, 'What's enough?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'My blade will never be enough, I know that now. Will you [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Praise be to Brell! None of these other sheep will raise so much as an axe, so focused are they on the temperature of the waters. Fah, I say! What does that matter in the face of a Banshee? But enough of that, let's get to business, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. We must find the [source] if we are to have any chance at stopping this threat.'\nYou say, 'The source?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Journey to the depths of the Chamber and destroy the dead. As you kill them search for a clue that will tell us who the Master is. Once we know that we can resolve this situation.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Investigate the Dead'.\nRodrick Cleanheart, the noble paladin, has enlisted you in the effort to cleanse the Cooling Chamber of the undead infestation. Destroy any undead you encounter and search the corpses for any clues or items of power that might be on them that might point towards the Master of this infestation.\n\n---\n\nFind a Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nFind a Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nFind a Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nFind a Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nFind a Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Almost half the zone (in the deepest part, beyond the main hallways) is full of undead creatures. They drop items called \"Amulet Sliver X\" where \"X\" can be I, II, III, IV, or V. These items update the above steps._\n_All are pre-lootable._\nAssemble the amulet 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Click on any of the Amulet Slivers to produce \"Restored Amulet\"._\nReturn to Rodrick and give him the Restored Amulet 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Reward:_\n105 platium\nExperience",
    },
