      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Cooling Chamber [zone=706]\n**Who:**\n- Rodrick Cleanheart [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Rodrick's Cleansed Amulet [item=85929]\n- Signet Amulet [item=85898]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a hand of death [npc=34538]\n- an undead lieutenant [npc=34537]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Rodrick #1: Investigate the Dead [quest=4921]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 12 15:27:55 2009\nModified: Sun Mar 2 13:14:04 2025 | | This solo task is the second of two such tasks that begin with Rodrick Cleanheart [npc=34158] at location -170,-320,-25 in the Cooling Chamber.\nYou say, 'Hail, Rodrick Cleanheart'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Welcome back, Retired. The amulet you found has been very instructive. This reminds me of similar [devices] I have encountered before. You may yet help me lift my [heavy] burden.'\nYou say, 'What devices?'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'In my experience an amulet like this one is used by a powerful Necromancer to control undead creatures. When whole, it can be used to dominate a very powerful creature, but it can also be split into pieces to control lesser creatures, as you saw. I think we can [use] this.'\nYou say, 'I will use it'\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'I have blessed this trinket, and I have removed the dark taint. It should now serve as a beacon for you. Activate the amulet if you lose your way, and it will guide you to one of the Master's chief thralls. Destroy what you find, and we may be one step closer to locating the source of this scourge.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Hunt the Dead'.\nReceive Rodrick's Cleansed Amulet [item=85929].\n\n---\n\n1\\. Find the next Clue! 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Click the amulet and you'll see an emote indicating how far away you are from the location you need to be in. The emotes will change in color (similar to the /consider system) as you get closer to the location you need._\nThe location is random: One location is 2530, -1583, -489; another is -1900, -1500, -382, and also -2054, 159, -379.\nUpon successful click, \"an undead lieutenant\" appears. Four adds called \"a hand of death\" spawn during the fight (at about 65%). The undead lieutenant hits for a max ~11,500 and has ~950,000 hitpoints.\n_Loot a Signet Amulet [item=85898] from the named or the adds._\n2\\. Give the Signet Amulet to Rodrick Cleanheart 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nRodrick Cleanheart says 'Oh, the treachery! I recognize the mark on this amulet! The foul source of this corruption is none other than Tasnise Underbelly! We must deal with this! Return later, friend, and we will discuss how we can best crush this evil scourge in our midst.'\n_Reward:_\nYou gain experience!!",
    },
