_\nYou say, 'Hail, Holdegar Bairdun'\nHoldegar Bairdun says 'Well met! I am Holdegar Bairdun, last of the Bairdun line of gem-polishers. I spend my blissful eternity here in Brell's Rest practicing my trade, which means polishing up the green magic gems that are sometimes carried around by denizens of the Underfoot. If you could, er, cajole a few of these gems away from their owners somehow and bring them to me, I'll give you an improvement to one of your advanced magic spells.'\n_Rank II spells (or in this case, Trade-In Gems) seem to be localized to certain zones or NPC types (much moreso than in previous expansions). Known drop data can be found on the gem item pages._\n_Upon handing him a \"Trade-In Gem: \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ Rk. II\":_\nHoldegar Bairdun says 'A fine specimen, yes, I wish I had more to give you in trade but all I have is this spell scroll.'\n_In return, you receive a No-Trade Rk. II spell._\n\n---\n\n_Known Rewards:_\nBard\nSong: Autarchian Mindwrack Rk. II\nSong: Venimor's Insult Rk. II\nSong: Wave of Slumber Rk. II\nBeastlord\nSpell: Friendly Pet Rk. II\nSpell: Frozen Venom Rk. II\nSpell: Haergen's Feralgia Rk. II\nBerserker\nTome of Shared Bloodlust Rk. II\nTome of Vigorous Axe Throw Rk. II\nCleric\nSpell: Erud's Retort Rk. II\nSpell: Glorious Denunciation Rk. II\nSpell: Holy Contravention Rk. II\nSpell: Holy Intervention Rk. II\nDruid\nSpell: Blast of Hypergrowth Rk. II\nSpell: Remote Manaflux Rk. II\nSpell: Surge of Ironvines Rk. II\nEnchanter\nSpell: Arcane Disjunction Aura Rk. II\nSpell: Chaotic Befuddling Rk. II\nSpell: Compliant Lurch Rk. II\nSpell: Hypnotic Stare Rk. II\nMagician\nSpell: Arcane Distillect Rk. II\nSpell: Chaotic Boon Rk. II\nSpell: Surge of Thaumacretion Rk. II\nSpell: Thaumatize Pet Rk. II\nMonk\nTome of Flinch Rk. II\nTome of Vigorous Shuriken Rk. II\nTome of Drunken Monkey Rk. II\nNecromancer\nSpell: Bestow Undeath Rk. II\nSpell: Necrotic Pustules Rk. II\nSpell: Necrotize Ally Rk. II\nPaladin\nSpell: Glorious Vindication R