      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Brell's Rest [zone=704]\n**Who:**\n- Dwekvard Gravelpick [ _Spell Merchant_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scintillating Obsidianite Rune [item=88293]\n- Sparkling Precandescent Rune [item=89161]\n- Twinkling Hyperfiligreed Rune [item=89473]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Raid Expedition: A Cunning Plan [quest=5072]\n- Raid Expedition: An Audience with Brell Serilis [quest=5084]\n- Raid Expedition: Arthicrex [quest=5032]\n- Raid Expedition: Brell's Trials [quest=5079]\n- Raid Expedition: Convorteum [quest=5085]\n- Raid Expedition: Fippy's Revenge [quest=4940]\n- Raid Expedition: Masked Invaders [quest=5031]\n- Raid Expedition: The Beast Below [quest=4957]\n- Raid Expedition: The Fungal Corruption [quest=5071]\n- Raid Expedition: The Unburrowing [quest=4977]\n- Raid Expedition: The Wrath of Brath [quest=5030]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 18 16:17:17 2009\nModified: Sat Feb 3 18:13:17 2024 | | Rank III spells in Underfoot are obtained through Trade-In gems which drop in various places throughout the expansion.\nDwekvard Gravelpick [npc=34044] is a dwarf found just west of the zone-in of Brell's Rest (entering from the Hole or Guild Hall portal).\nYou say, 'Hail, Dwekvard Gravelpick'\nDwekvard Gravelpick says 'You have the honor of speaking with Dwekvard Gravelpick, one-time rune advisor to none other than Ugen Proudhammer himself! I've found eternity with Ugen in the Shining City of Kernagir to be a bit stifling in Brell's absence, shall we say. I'm now here in Brell's Rest for a time, practicing my study of Underfoot runestones. Bring me one of these if you should find one during your raids into Underfoot, and I'll give you a premium improvement to one of your advanced magic spells.'\n_There are three types of runes:_\n_Scintillating Obsidianite Runes (dropped from lower tier raids in the Underfoot expansion) which are used for level 83 spells and tomes._\n_Sparkling Precandescent Runes (dropped from mid tier raids in the Underfoot expansion) which are used for level 84 spells and tomes._\n_Twinkling Hyperfiligreed Runes (dropped from Convorteum raids) which are used for level 85 spells and tomes._\n**Please let us know, only what you can confirm firsthand, the order of spells you receive and which rune type was used to obtain them.**\n\n---\n\n**Bard**\n_Scintillating:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (3):_ Song: Wave of Slumber Rk. III; Song: Autarchian Mindwrack Rk. III; Song: Venimor's Insult Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Beastlord**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Friendly Pet Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Frozen Venom Rk. III\n_Twinkling:_ Spell: Haergen's Feralgia Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Berserker**\n_Scintillating:_ Tome of Vigorous Axe Throw Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Tome of Axe of Rallos Rk. III; Tome of Shared Bloodlust Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Cleric**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Holy Intervention Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Glorious Denunciation Rk. III\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Erud's Retort Rk. III; Spell: Holy Contravention Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Druid**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Remote Manaflux Rk. III\n_Sparkling (2):_ Spell: Sundew Blessing Rk. III; Spell: Blast of Hypergrowth Rk. III\n_Twinkling:_ Spell: Surge of Ironvines Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Enchanter**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Chaotic Befuddling Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Arcane Disjunction Aura Rk. III\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Compliant Lurch Rk. III; Spell: Hypnotic Stare Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Magician**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Thaumatize Pet Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Chaotic Boon Rk. III\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Arcane Distillect Rk. III; Spell: Surge of Thaumacretion Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Monk**\n_Scintillating:_ Tome of Vigorous Shuriken Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Tome of Flinch Rk. III; Tome of Drunken Monkey Style Rk. III\n**\n---\n**\n**Necromancer**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Bestow Undeath Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Necrotic Pustules Rk. III\n_Twinkling:_ Spell: Necrotize Ally Rk. III ; Summon Skeleton Swarm Rk.III\n**\n---\n**\n**Paladin**\n_Scintillating (2):_ Spell: Splash of Sanctification Rk. III; Tome of Honorific Mantle Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Glorious Vindication Rk. III; Protective Confession Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Ranger**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Swarm of Bees Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Storm of Arrows Rk. III; Spell: Focused Storm of Arrows Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Rogue**\n_Scintillating:_ Tome of Vigorous Dagger-Throw Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Tome of Desperate Escape Rk. III; Tome of Assault Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Shadow Knight**\n_Scintillating (2):_ Tome of Malarian Mantle Rk. III; Spell: Unsavory Sacrifice Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Dire Implication Rk. III; Spell: Dire Constriction Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Shaman**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Healing Counterbias Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Wind of Malis Rk. III\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Frost Gift Rk. III; Spell: Splash of Runedust Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Warrior**\n_Scintillating:_ Tome of Lionhearted Rally-Cry Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ You'll get nothing and like it!\n_Twinkling (2):_ Tome of Bracing Defense Rk. III; Tome of the Field Armorer Rk. III\n\n---\n\n**Wizard**\n_Scintillating:_ Spell: Crystallizing Circle Rk. III\n_Sparkling:_ Spell: Malediction of Havoc Rk. III\n_Twinkling (2):_ Spell: Self-Immolation Rk. III; Spell: Splash of Brimstone Rk. III\n- Song: Autarchian Mindwrack Rk. III [item=89678]\n- Song: Venimor's Insult Rk. III [item=89677]\n- Song: Wave of Slumber Rk. III [item=89674]\n- Spell: Arcane Disjunction Aura Rk. III [item=89201]\n- Spell: Arcane Distillect Rk. III [item=89572]\n- Spell: Bestow Undeath Rk. III [item=88833]\n- Spell: Blast of Hypergrowth Rk. III [item=89243]\n- Spell: Call Skeleton Swarm Rk. III [item=89776]\n- Spell: Chaotic Befuddling Rk. III [item=88777]\n- Spell: Chaotic Boon Rk. III [item=89245]\n- Spell: Compliant Lurch Rk. III [item=89555]\n- Spell: Crystallizing Circle Rk. III [item=88471]\n- Spell: Dire Constriction Rk. III [item=89749]\n- Spell: Dire Implication Rk. III [item=89814]\n- Spell: Erud's Retort Rk. III [item=89786]\n- Spell: Focused Storm of Arrows Rk. III [item=89494]\n- Spell: Friendly Pet Rk. III [item=88549]\n- Spell: Frost Gift Rk. III [item=89747]\n- Spell: Frozen Venom Rk. III [item=89273]\n- Spell: Glorious Denunciation Rk. III [item=89197]\n- Spell: Glorious Vindication Rk. III [item=89696]\n- Spell: Haergen's Feralgia Rk. III [item=89693]\n- Spell: Healing Counterbias Rk. III [item=88302]\n- Spell: Holy Contravention Rk. III [item=94861]\n- Spell: Holy Intervention Rk. III [item=88458]\n- Spell: Hypnotic Stare Rk. III [item=89554]\n- Spell: Malediction of Havoc Rk. III [item=89166]\n- Spell: Necrotic Pustules Rk. III [item=89383]\n- Spell: Necrotize Ally Rk. III [item=89775]\n- Spell: Protective Confession Rk. III [item=89715]\n- Spell: Remote Manaflux Rk. III [item=88678]\n- Spell: Self-Immolation Rk. III [item=89686]\n- Spell: Splash of Brimstone Rk. III [item=89689]\n- Spell: Splash of Runedust Rk. III [item=89748]\n- Spell: Splash of Sanctification Rk. III [item=88724]\n- Spell: Storm of Arrows Rk. III [item=89493]\n- Spell: Sundew Blessing Rk. III [item=89198]\n- Spell: Surge of Ironvines Rk. III [item=89719]\n- Spell: Surge of Thaumacretion Rk. III [item=89573]\n- Spell: Swarm of Bees Rk. I