      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kernagir, the Shining City [zone=713]\n**Who:**\n- Schelly Starflight [npc=34653]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Worn Note [item=86979]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bitter cleanliness technician [npc=34706]\n- a brooding genati [npc=34677]\n- a contemptuous mystic [npc=34757]\n- a cynical heating supervisor [npc=34667]\n- a despondent tinker - gnome [npc=34743]\n- a discontent fabricator [npc=34695]\n- a distrustful guard - dwarf [npc=34680]\n- a scornful work supervisor [npc=34692]\n- a wary guard - gnome [npc=34674]\n- an arrogant craftsman - gnome [npc=34751]\n- an egotistical artificer - gnomework [npc=34752]\n- an imperious crystalline sphere [npc=34678]\n- an irate accountant - gnomework [npc=34697]\n- an irritable miner [npc=34719]\n- an unhappy builder - gnomework [npc=34710]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Schelly #2: Where Did It Come From? [quest=4979]\n- Schelly #3: Sifting for Clues [quest=4980]\n- Schelly #4: The Scrying Game [quest=4981]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 30 15:31:32 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the first of four in a task arc from Schelly Starflight in Kernagir, the Shining City. She is located at approximately 405, 60, -50 (first floor, northern building)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Schelly Starflight'\nSchelly Starflight says 'I greet you on behalf of the council, outsider. I have heard much about your feats outside the Shining City. As I'm sure you are aware, Brell's presence has been absent for some time now. Shortly after this occurred though, I began to notice some [strange] things in Kernagir.'\nYou say, 'Strange things?'\nSchelly Starflight says 'For the first time in our history, some of those who live here began behaving in a manner not consistent with the will of Brell. Usually it would be a minor issue such as not wanting to perform their assigned duties. With others it was more disturbing; they would become [secretive] and withdraw completely from the other workers.'\nYou say, 'Secretive?'\nSchelly Starflight says 'At first these were isolated incidents, but as more time passed without Brell's guidance, the number of workers showing these symptoms began to increase alarmingly. As it stands now, our once brilliant city of Kernagir has been divided in two - those of us who still follow Brell's will and those who have succumbed to whatever [disease] has infected them.'\nYou say, 'A disease?'\nSchelly Starflight says 'If not a disease then what could it possibly be? It spreads like a plague and if it is not checked, I fear the Shining City will be brought to ruin. Our attempts thus far to identify the source of this aberrant behavior have met with failure. We cannot wait for Brell to return. Given your efforts in the realms outside Kernagir, I think you may be our last hope. Will you [aid] us?'\nYou say, 'I'll aid you'\nSchelly Starflight says 'I am greatly relieved that you will be assisting us in this matter. Unfortunately we have exhausted all our leads so you will need to start anew by gathering information. As an outsider, I think you may be more likely to succeed in your efforts than we were. You should begin by speaking to those who are acting strangely. They can be found all over the city. When you feel you have gained sufficient information to act on, return to me and we will decide your next course of action.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Is it Contagious?'.\nSchelly wants you to question various workers who appear to be infected with something that has been altering their behavior.\n\n---\n\n_15 \"Question ...\" steps open up. These mobs are located in various areas around the zone (you'll find some are more commonly spotted than others)._\nQuestion a wary guard 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an arrogant craftsman 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a bitter cleanliness technician 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a brooding genati 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an imperious crystalline sphere 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a distrustful guard 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an egotistical artificer 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a discontent fabricator 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a scornful work supervisor 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an irritable miner 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a despondent tinker 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a contemptuous mystic 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion a cynical heating supervisor 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an unhappy builder 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nQuestion an irate accountant 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\n_Some locations for your shiningcity map file ( **others needed**):_\nP 24.1599, -952.5431, 155.1933, 0, 0, 0, 1, an\\_egotistical\\_artificer (Roamer)\nP -1413.9674, -1241.4655, 74.7987, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_distrustful\\_guard\nP -1493.4564, -1397.2704, 82.8576, 0, 0, 0, 1, an\\_imperious\\_crystalline\nP -1338.0381, -1358.0383, 82.8588, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_brooding\\_genati\nP -1564.8485, -1453.2439, 172.1955, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_bitter\\_cleanliness\nP -163.0892, -757.1714, 179.9451, 0, 0, 0, 1, an\\_arrogant\\_craftsman\nP -1542.0306, -682.1804, 211.8040, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_wary\\_guard\n_The last mob you hail (whichever it may be) will attack you (difficulty on par with regular trash mobs in the zone)._\nDefeat your attacker 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\n_Upon this mob's death, you receive A Worn Note._\nReturn the note you discovered to Schelly 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\n_Hand in the note:_\nYour questioning didn't amount to much but the note you found was certainly an important piece of evidence.\nSchelly Starflight carefully examines the note as you explain the results of your questioning and its discovery. 'This is most disturbing! Who ever heard of such a thing as putting yourself above everything else? I will need some time to think about what you have brought me. Please return in a short while.'\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n~20 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
