      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kernagir, the Shining City [zone=713]\n**Who:**\n- Schelly Starflight [npc=34653]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Box of Reagents [item=86983]\n- Chemical Analysis Report [item=86987]\n- Left Part of a Worn Note [item=86980]\n- Magical Analysis Report [item=86986]\n- Right Part of a Worn Note [item=86981]\n- Worn Note [item=86979]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Chamberlain Scrimble [npc=34732]\n- Lindwiss Solvolysis [npc=34754]\n- Wimzig Manasieve [npc=34760]\n- an assassin [npc=35117]\n- an evil eye - Kernagir, the Shining City [npc=35116]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Schelly #1: Is it Contagious? [quest=4978]\n- Schelly #3: Sifting for Clues [quest=4980]\n- Schelly #4: The Scrying Game [quest=4981]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 30 15:31:37 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | This solo task is the second of four in a task arc from Schelly Starflight in Kernagir, the Shining City. She is located at approximately 405, 60, -50 (first floor, northern building).\nPre-requisite for requesting this task: Is it Contagious? [quest=4978]\nYou say, 'Hail, Schelly Starflight'\nSchelly Starflight says 'Greetings again Ogre. I am greatly disturbed by the words on this note. Although your previous questioning did not reveal anything pertinent, I would guess the problems with the workers are related to this note. I want you to continue investigating the cause of the odd worker behavior by finding where this [note] came from.'\nYou say, 'What note?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Where Did It Come From?'.\nSchelly Starflight hands you the Worn Note. 'I want you to take this to Chamberlain Scrimble. You can find him in the Arbiter's Chamber above us. Tell him I want a full analysis of the note to determine its origins. He will know how best to pursue this. Given your performance thus far, the council feels you can be trusted with this task. We look forward to the results.'\nYou receive Worn Note [item=86979].\n\n---\n\n1\\. Take the Worn Note to Chamberlain Scrimble 0/1 (Kernagir)\n2\\. Listen to Scrimble's instructions on how he wants the note analyzed 0/1 (Kernagir)\nChamberlain Scrimble may be found at 382, 181, 56. Give him the Worn Note:\nChamberlain Scrimble says, 'So, the council wants a full analysis of this to determine its origins? Hmm...I think it will be best if we conduct two separate analyses. I know just the gnomes, Wimzig Manasieve will conduct a magical analysis, and Lindwiss Solvolysis will conduct a chemical analysis. Unfortunately this will require some {alterations} to the original note.\nYou say 'alterations\"\nChamberlain Scrimble rips a piece from the left side of the note and another from the right. 'That should do it, Here are two pieces from the note. Take the left peiece to Wimzig. You can find him on the top floor of the armory, just northwest of the central tower. Take the right piece to Lindwiss. You can find her in the basement of the Forge, just north of the central tower/ Once you have the final analyses, you should bring them back to Shelly. Good luck!'\nYou receive Right Part of a Worn Note [item=86981] and Left Part of a Worn Note [item=86980].\n3\\. Bring the left part of the note to Wimzig Manasieve for magical analysis 0/1 (Kernagir)\nWimzig Manasieve [npc=34760] may be found at 1189, 902, 346, on the top floor of the first building to the west of true north. Give Wimzig the Left Part of a Worn Note.\nWimzig Manasieve listens as you explain what Scrimble requested. 'A magical analysis to determine the origin of the note? That shouldn't be a problem. I'll get to work right away.'\n4\\. Destroy the magical creatures spawned by the curse on the note 0/3 (Kernagir)\n_Three mezzable an evil eye [npc=35116] spawn at Wimzig._\nWimzig Manasieve says 'Oh my!'\n_They spawn right at him and do not aggro anything else in the room. If you die, they will repop when you approach Wimzig again._\n5\\. Speak to Wimzig and get the results of the magical analysis 0/1 (Kernagir)\n_You receive Magical Analysis Report [item=86986]._\n6\\. Bring the right part of the note to Lindwiss Solvolysis for chemical analysys 0/1 (Kernagir)\nLindwiss Solvolysis [npc=34754] may be found at 972, 564, 136, at the bottom of building on true north (east of Wizmig's building).\n7\\. Pick up the reagent box Lindwiss stored in the freezer 0/1 (Kernagir)\n_This is Box of Reagents [item=86983] \\-\\- a groundspawn at 167, 1004, 143, at the bottom of the building to the west of true south._\n_Two dwarf assassins spawn upon picking up the groundspawn. Before doing this, it's recommended you kill the roaming mob that comes out of the room where you pick up the groundspawn. She is the only one that will aggro and you can fight right in the hall._\n_If you fail, pick up the groundspawn again to make them spawn._\n8\\. Kill the assassins 0/2 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\n_2x an assassin [npc=35117] spawn in the hall outside the door._\n9\\. Give the box of reagents to Lindwiss 0/1 (Kernagir)\nLindwiss Solvolysis says 'You were attacked? How dreadful! Let me get this analysis finished before anything else bad happens.'\n10\\. Speak to Lindwiss and get her results of the chemical analysis 0/1 (Kernagir)\nYou say, 'Hail, Lindwiss Solvolysis'\n_Receive Chemical Analysis Report [item=86987]._\n11\\. Take the magical analysis report to Schelly 0/1 (Kernagir)\nSchelly Starflight says 'Thank you for this report. I we eagerly await the second as Scrimble has advised me to expect two reports.'\n12\\. Take the chemical analysis report to Schelly 0/1 (Kernagir)\nSchelly Starflight says 'Thank you for this second report. Now that we have both, the council will go over the data and decide on the next course of action. Please return shortly and I should have another assignment for you.'\nYou were able to get the worn note analyzed despite encountering some obstacles along the way.\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n140 platinum\nYou gain experience! (~1.5 AAs at Level 85)\n~26 Brellium Tokens [item=88944]\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
