      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kernagir, the Shining City [zone=713]\n**Who:**\n- Schelly Starflight [npc=34653]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Chunk of Basalt [item=86990]\n- Lichenash [item=86839]\n- Living Lava [item=86991]\n- Molten Skin [item=86988]\n- Sessiloid Shard [item=86989]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Lichen Creep [zone=714]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Lindwiss Solvolysis [npc=34754]\n- a hungry sessiloid [npc=34919]\n- a lava golem [npc=34908]\n- a lava mephit guard [npc=34897]\n- a lava mephit worker [npc=34896]\n- a magma golem [npc=34895]\n- a rock golem guardian [npc=34899]\n- a rock golem smasher [npc=34900]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Schelly #1: Is it Contagious? [quest=4978]\n- Schelly #2: Where Did It Come From? [quest=4979]\n- Schelly #4: The Scrying Game [quest=4981]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 30 15:31:40 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the third of four in a task arc from Schelly Starflight in Kernagir, the Shining City. She is located at approximately 405, 60, -50 (first floor, northern building)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task: \"Is it Contagious?\"; \"Where did it Come From?\"_\nYou say, 'Hail, Schelly Starflight'\nSchelly Starflight says 'Greetings again \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! We have been going over the reports you brought us and I must say they contain some very interesting information. It seems someone has gone through a great deal of trouble to remain anonymous while spreading their vile messages. We must [uncover] their identity!'\nYou say, 'Uncover?'\nSchelly Starflight says 'Fortunately we got some very good leads from the analyses of the note. At some point the note was in Lichen Creep for a short while. Also, there was a strong curse placed on the note while in Pellucid Grotto. After some deliberation we have decided to pursue the [Lichen Creep] lead first.'\nYou say, 'Lichen Creep?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sifting for Clues'.\nSchelly Starflight says 'Please return to Lindwiss Solvolysis and consult with her on the best way to use the data gained from the previous analysis. Your assistance has been a boon to the council and we are confident you will turn up something substantial. We eagerly await your return.'\n\n---\n\nHail Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/1 (Kernagir)\nYou say, 'Hail, Lindwiss Solvolysis'\nLindwiss Solvolysis says 'I knew you would be back. I was certain that given the results of my previous analysis, a follow up investigation was inevitable. Since our last meeting I have been formulation a course of action. If I had a larger group of samples from various places in Lichen Creep, I could pinpoint a more specific location where the note was. Here is a list of what I need. Good luck out there.'\nHead to Lichen Creep! 0/1 (ALL)\nLoot 4 Chunks of Basalt from rock golems 0/4 (Lichen Creep)\nLoot 4 Samples of Living Lava from lava golems 0/4 (Lichen Creep)\nLoot 4 Pieces of Molten Skin from lava mephits 0/4 (Lichen Creep)\nLoot 4 Sessiliod Shards from hungry sessiloids 0/4 (Lichen Creep)\n_NOTE: Someone must have the task in order for the mobs to drop these items._\nObtain 4 Lichenash from ground spawns 0/4 (Lichen Creep)\nDeliver 4 Chunks of Basalt to Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/4 (Kernagir)\nDeliver 4 Samples of Living Lava to Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/4 (Kernagir)\nDeliver 4 Pieces of Molten Skin to Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/4 (Kernagir)\nDeliver 4 Sessiloid Shards to Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/4 (Kernagir)\nDeliver 4 Lichenash to Lindwiss Solvolysis 0/4 (Kernagir)\nReturn to Lichen Creep 0/1 (ALL)\nSearch the Lodestone living quaters for anything unusal 0/1 (Lichen Creep)\n_In Lichen Creep, there are portals laid out in a clockwise manner. These each lead to the room. Which portal you need to take may be random._\n_You are looking for a Cryptic Scroll, which spawns in one of these rooms. The portal room known to have the scroll was the \"one at about 2 o'clock\" (if looking at the portals as a clock). Portal location: -1090, +568, 31._\n_NOTE: At least one named mob in Lichen Creep is known to have a PH in one of the portal rooms, so there is a slim chance you could encounter a named upon porting up._\nReturn to Schelly with the scroll 0/1 (Kernagir)\nYou say, 'Hail, Schelly Starflight'\nYou managed to locate a scroll in lichen creep which contained useful evidence.\nSchelly Starflight says 'What's this?' Shelly reads over the note. 'This is certainly a damning piece of evidence if we can ever discover who R.I. might be. The council will hold on to this scroll until additional evidence is located. Speak to me again when you are ready to follow the next lead.'\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (2.2 AAs at Level 85)\n40 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
