      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kernagir, the Shining City [zone=713]\n**Who:**\n- Schelly Starflight [npc=34653]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scrying Device [item=87053]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Pellucid Grotto [zone=707]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Sidara the Beguiler [npc=35262]\n- Wimzig Manasieve [npc=34760]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Schelly #1: Is it Contagious? [quest=4978]\n- Schelly #2: Where Did It Come From? [quest=4979]\n- Schelly #3: Sifting for Clues [quest=4980]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 30 15:31:43 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the fourth of four in a task arc from Schelly Starflight in Kernagir, the Shining City. She is located at approximately 405, 60, -50 (first floor, northern building)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting this task: \"Is it Contagious?\"; \"Where did it Come From?\"; \"Sifting for Clues\"._\nYou say, 'Hail, Schelly Starflight'\nSchelly Starflight says 'All right \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, this is the last lead we have. I hope you can find something regarding the identity of R.I. or we'll be out of options. Are you ready to investigate [Pellucid Grotto]?'\nYou say, 'I am ready to investigate Pellucid Grotto.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Scrying Game'.\nSchelly Starflight says 'Excellent! Head back to Wimzig Manasieve and consult with him on how you should proceed in Pellucid Grotto. It is vital that we find out who is behind the workers corruption so we can put a stop to it. Go with the blessing of the council.'\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Wimzig Manasieve 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\nYou say, 'Hail, Wimzig Manasieve'\nYour task 'The Scrying Game' has been updated.\nWimzig Manasieve says 'Pleasure to see you again \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! So you wish to delve deeper into the curse on the note? Hmm...if you wanted to locate the exact spot where the curse was placed on the note, you would need to triangulate it using one of my scrying devices. Here you go. Just follow the instructions and you should have no trouble finding the location. Have fun out there!'\nFind a suitable point near Brell's Rest 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Location: -193, -530, -12_\nUse the Scrying Device near Brell's Rest 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nFind a suitable point near Fungal Forest 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Location: 1453, 511, 5_\nUse the Scrying Device near Fungal Forest 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nFind a suitable point near Kronk Kollus 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Location: 165, 1103, 5_\nUse the Scrying Device near Kronk Kollus 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nSearch the passage just northeast of Kronk Kollus' chamber 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Location: 613, 883, -8 (NOTE: This location update triggers the spawn of a KOS \"Sidara the Beguiler\".)_\nKill Sidara the Beguiler 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nSidara the Beguiler says 'Rock Icewalker was right; he knew you wouldn't stay out of our business. When you triggered my curse on the note, I knew if I waited here you would show up eventually. Too bad you won't be leaving!'\nReturn the scrying device to Schelly Starflight 0/1 (Kernagir, the Shining City)\n_On hand-in:_\nYou have learned that Rock Icewalker is involved in the corruption of workers in Kernagir.\nSchelly Starflight looks stricken. 'Rock Icewalker? This is worse than I could ever have imagined! To think that one of the council is the source of this corruption is unthinkable, yet the evidence is compelling. We will have to bring this evidence before the council at once!'\n_Rewards:_\n140 platinum\nExperience (1.4 AAs at Level 85)\n26 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
