oblem, but he has locked himself away inside the room behind me.'\nYou say, 'One?'\nGotonur says 'The Font Guardian was the last to interact with Brell before something happened and then he locked himself in the room behind me. The only way inside is by creating a key to open the door. We are not capable of retrieving the necessary part to create the key but you may be [able] to.'\nYou say, 'Of course I'll be able to'\nGotonur says 'Before I allow you to take on that challenge you must [prove] to me you can master the powers of creation. This is not a simple task and as such completing it will prove that you have a good chance of surviving the Vault of Stone.'\nYou say, 'I'll prove myself'\nGotonur says 'The first task is to prove you can master physical manipulation. You must gather parts from certain inhabitants in the Underquarry and Foundation, then build your creation in Lichen Creep. When you have done this you can return to me for your next task.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Laws of Physics'.\nGotonur wants you to gather parts from various beings throughout Underfoot and past the test of physical manipulation.\n\n---\n\nCollect a ball of dung from an odd looking beetle in the Foundation 0/1 (The Foundation)\n_Odd looking beetles hit for a max ~8,000. They can spawn anywhere in place of \"a small beetle\"._\nCollect 10 metal essence cores from metal golems in the Underquarry 0/10 (The Underquarry)\n_These drop from golems in the southern caves of the Underquarry (southern tunnel from the large room with stone genaris and Goralf)._\nCreate a golem, activate it, and destroy it 0/1 (Lichen Creep)\n>Head to Lichen Creep and right-click the dung. This creates an Inactive Corporeal Golem. Click this item around location -1280, 900, -100. You see:\nYou manipulate the ball of dung and essence cores in your hands. Contact with the dung makes it very easy to shape the cores into a rudimentary golem figure.\nThis spawns a Corporeal Construct (max hit ~8,500).\nThe golem begins to animate and attacks you on sight.\nKill this for the update.\nReturn to Gotonur 0/1 (Brell's Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gotonur'\nGotonur says 'Your mastery of physical manipulation can be felt in the aura radiating from your spirit. It seems you were successful in your attempts, which is very good news. Hail me when you are ready for your next task.'\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience\n~40 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
