      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Brell's Temple [zone=711]\n**Who:**\n- Gotonur [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Inactive Incorporeal Golem [item=86916]\n- Spark Essence [item=86792]\n- Synovium Membrane [item=86704]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Arthicrex [zone=710]\n- Fungal Forest [zone=712]\n- Lichen Creep [zone=714]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Incorporeal Construct [npc=34946]\n- a cliknar eucryptoid [npc=34402]\n- a lava mephit worker [npc=34896]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Gotonur #1: The Laws of Physics [quest=4989]\n- Gotonur #3: Give my creation. . . Life! [quest=4991]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Jan 4 14:34:45 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the second of three tasks (plus a group mission) that begin with Gotonur, a telmiran in Brell's Temple (location: 655, -10, 21 -- in the large room north of the zone-in; same room as Brell Serilis)._\n_Be on the lookout for wandering see-invis KOS mobs while speaking with Gotonur._\n_You are automatically assigned this task at the end of the previous one._\nYou have been assigned the task 'This Magic Moment'.\n\n---\n\nCollect a piece of synovium membrane from a cliknar eucryptoid in Arthicrex 0/1 (Arthicrex)\n_Cliknar eucryptoids are always found in the hive itself and occasionally outside it. Or head to the NW part of Arthicrex. Fight up the ramps then down. At the bottom floor are plenty of the Clicknars you need._\nCollect 10 spark essence from lava mephits in Lichen Creep 0/10 (Lichen Creep)\n_Spark Essences are dropped by lava mephit workers in Lichen Creep. Note: These are not pre-lootable._\nCreate a golem, activate it, and destroy it 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\n_Head to Fungal Forest and right-click the Synovium Membrane to create an Inactive Incorporeal Golem. Go to -560, -560 and right-click this item to spawn an Incorporeal Construct. This hits for a max ~8,500. Kill this for the update._\nReturn to Gotonur 0/1 (Brell's Temple)\n_On hailing Gotonur, you are automatically assigned the next task in the series._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gotonur'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Give my creation. . . Life!'.\nGotonur says 'Your mastery of magical manipulation can be felt in the aura radiating from your spirit. You were successful in your attempts it seems, which is very good news. Hail me when you are ready for the final test.'\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (2.2 AAs at Level 85)\n40 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
