      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Brell's Temple [zone=711]\n**Who:**\n- Gotonur [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Inactive Homunculus [item=86923]\n- Shard of Coherence [item=86922]\n- Spirit Orb [item=86586]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Fungal Forest [zone=712]\n- The Underquarry [zone=708]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Twisted Homunculus [npc=34945]\n- a coherent growth [npc=34944]\n- a surly genati [npc=34340]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Fire in the Hole [quest=4992]\n- Gotonur #1: The Laws of Physics [quest=4989]\n- Gotonur #2: This Magic Moment [quest=4990]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Jan 4 14:34:48 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the third of three tasks (plus a group mission) that begin with Gotonur, a telmiran in Brell's Temple (location: 655, -10, 21 -- in the large room north of the zone-in; same room as Brell Serilis)._\n_Be on the lookout for wandering see-invis KOS mobs while speaking with Gotonur._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gotonur'\nGotonur says 'You have mastered the manipulation of both the physical and magical, and now it is time to put these two together and add the final ingredient of life. I warn you that continuing on from here is dangerous and only those who are are serious should attempt this [final] test.'\nYou say, 'What is the final test?'\nGotonur says 'The process of adding life involves imbuing an incorporeal soul with a physical body. This requires a portion of your own life essence. Doing this takes absolute concentration and if failed will result in a twisted homunculus that is doomed to walk this plane for eternity. Knowing this do you still [desire] this task?'\nYou say, 'I desire it.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Give my creation. . . Life!'.\nGotonur says 'If you are ready then please proceed to find the components needed. Return to me with your results. We are counting on you.'\n\n---\n\nRetrieve a Shard of Coherence from a coherent growth in Fungal Forest 0/1 (The Fungal Forest)\nCollect 10 Spirit Orbs from genati in the Underquarry 0/10 (The Underquarry)\n_Note: These items are NOT pre-lootable._\nCreate a golem, activate it, and destroy it 0/1 (Brell's Temple)\n_After collecting the above 11 items, go to the northernmost room in Brell's Temple (in which you'll find a statue of Brell Serilis). Right-click the shard to create an Inactive Homunculus. Right-click this item to spawn a Twisted Homunculus. It hits for a max ~9,500. Killing this updates this step._\nReport to Gotonur 0/1 (Brell's Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gotonur'\nGotonur says 'I can see that you failed at your task which is what I was expecting. You see only a god can truly take that final step of adding life to a body. The last test was merely to see how willing you were to find out the truth. You passed my friend and now you are ready to enter the Vault of Stone. Hail me again when you have gathered some friends and are ready to take on this dangerous mission.'\n_(If you happen to be in a group at the time you do the final hail, you are automatically assigned the \"Fire in the Hole\" group mission as well.)_\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n20 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
