      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Volska's Husk [zone=715]\n**Who:**\n- Gihbra Artinguard [npc=35069]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Quests:**\n- Gihbra #2: Uncover The Truth [quest=5024]\n- Gihbra #3: Autochthonous Support [quest=5036]\n- Gihbra #4: The Arms of Brell [quest=5037]\n- Gihbra #5: Brell's Will Be Done [quest=5038]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Jan 25 21:28:51 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the first in a series of tasks that begins with Gihbra Artinguard in Volska's Husk. He is located at approximately -140, -165, -47. Be careful in this zone as there are no especially safe points, including the locations of task givers._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Greetings overlander! I have something most urgent that I can use your [help] with. I'd do it myself if it weren't for these blasted [pests]!'\nYou say, 'My help?'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'We've been having many problems with these so called Autarchians, but we are [concerned] about why they seem to be congregating here.'\nYou say, 'Concerned?'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'This many Autarchians in one place? Surely that cannot be a good thing! No, they must be [stopped]! '\nYou say, 'They must be stopped!'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'I am completely out of my element here. This heat is almost unbearable! Will you help us with the [Autarchians]?'\nYou say, 'I'll help you with those Autarchians'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Thank you! For now, all I need from you is to gauge their strength and locations. I need to know what we are dealing with.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Into The Fire'.\nGihbra needs to find out the overall strength of the Autarchians that have come to the husk. He will need you to recon the area and assess the races and their numbers.\n\n---\n\nMake sure to take levitation off as the below locations are at ground level.\nInvestigate the Mephit's lair 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nInvestigate the Fungi colony 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nThis updates near -545, -475, -145.\nInvestigate the main body of the Autarchian den 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nInvestigate the lava pool 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\n_If you look at your map, there are several obvious points of interest. The mephit lair update is in one of the first clearings in the northeastern tunnels. The fungi colony is the east-central tunnel system. The Autarchian update is deep in the southwestern tunnels. The lava pool is at the end of the \"husk\" - the southeast part of the zone._\nMephit's lair: 42, -422, -55\nFungi colony: -487, -481, -147\nAutarchian den: -902, 274, -38\nLava pool: -1006, -171, -56\nReturn to Gihbra Artinguard 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nRecon of the Autarchians is complete\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Interesting. . . I wonder why the fungi are separated from the others. It seems there is much more to do before I can leave.'\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience\n40 Brellium Tokens\n_This leads into the next task in the series, \"Uncover the Truth\"._\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
    },
