      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Volska's Husk [zone=715]\n**Who:**\n- Gihbra Artinguard [npc=35069]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Talbot Roaringhead [npc=34165]\n- a sessiloid [npc=35090]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Gihbra #1: Into The Fire [quest=5023]\n- Gihbra #3: Autochthonous Support [quest=5036]\n- Gihbra #4: The Arms of Brell [quest=5037]\n- Gihbra #5: Brell's Will Be Done [quest=5038]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Jan 25 21:29:02 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task is the second in a series of tasks that begins with Gihbra Artinguard in Volska's Husk. He is located at approximately -140, -165, -47. Be careful in this zone as there are no especially safe points, including the locations of task givers._\n_In order to request this task, you must first have completed \"Into the Fire\"._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'It is hard to imagine that so many have turned from Brell. But there is still much to do, if you are still [willing] to help.'\nYou say, 'I'm willing'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Something tells me that the [Bellikos] are doing much to keep the Autarchians on task. We need to find out why they have the Autarchians here.'\nYou say, 'The Bellikos?'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'I'd look for any Autarchians that are separated from the [main] group. '\nYou say, 'I'll find the ones separated from the main group...'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'Be careful out there. They will no doubt be very aggressive to anyone poking around.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Uncover The Truth'.\nGihbra needs you to find out why the Autarchians have come to the husk and what the Bellikos involvement is with them.\n\n---\n\nInvestigate the autarchians in the greken's heart 0/1 (Volksa's Husk)\nInvestigate the autarchians in the greken's nest 0/1 (Volksa's Husk)\n_The above steps update at locations -625, -124, -149 and -343, +38, -99 respectively._\n_For in-game map:_\nP -38.9723, 343.7516, -99.2554, 0, 0, 0, 1, nest\nP 124.6466, 625.3701, -149.5591, 0, 0, 0, 1, heart\n_Note that the update location is very specific and small. You can walk a few steps beside these locations without the task updating._\nReturn to Gihbra Artinguard 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nGihbra Artinguard says 'They are harvesting eggs? Go back and kill the sessiloids they are using, then take one of their shards to the Cooling Chamber and speak with Talbot Roaringhead. He might know what these eggs are.'\nLoot a fractured sessiloid shard 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\n_This is the regular, common Fractured Sessiloid Shard from sessiloid mobs that is otherwise a vendor loot item. It is not pre-lootable._\nGive the fractured sessiloid shard to Talbot Roaringhead 0/1 (Cooling Chamber)\n_Talbot is found at location -150, -435, -25 in the Cooling Chamber._\nReturn to Gihbra Artinguard 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gihbra Artinguard'\nYou've found out that the Autarchians are trying to harvest the greken eggs.\nGihbra Artinguard says 'They are trying to harvest the greken eggs? Oh my! We must do what we can to stop them. '\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience\n~40 Brellium Tokens\n_Completion of this task leads into the next one in the series, \"Autochthonous Support\"._\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
    },
