      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Convorteum [zone=733]\n**Who:**\n- Delth [npc=35252]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bellikos' Mantra [item=88523]\n- Focus of Self [item=86612]\n- Teachings of the Apexi [item=88550]\n- Teachings of the Bellikos [item=87194]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Arthicrex [zone=710]\n- Volska's Husk [zone=715]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bellikos Lecturer [npc=34790]\n- a bellikos recruiter [npc=34380]\n- a bellikos sermonizer [npc=35234]\n- an apexus scholar [npc=35230]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Delth #2: I, Bellikos [quest=5056]\n- Delth #3: Convorteum Coercion [quest=5057]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Mar 12 00:09:22 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the first in a series given by a bellikos named Delth in the Convorteum. She is located in the zone-in area, below the fortress at about -1380, 365, -65._\n_KOS mobs wander close to her, so keep a lookout while speaking with her._\nYou say, 'Hail, Delth'\nDelth says 'Many are the teachings of the First. Be warned, outsider, for while I appear weak I am one of the Bellikos, elite creations of the First and I have the power to kill you where you stand. Word has travelled of the outsiders from above and, while I have begun to have [doubts], I am still compelled to uphold the teachings of the First and stop any who will oppose him.'\nYou say, 'Doubts?'\nDelth says 'For ages I have thought that there were some discrepancies between what the Apexus creations, which reside within the pyramid, and those of us out here are taught. From what I have heard you may be able to [help] me.'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nDelth says 'As one of the trainers for the Bellikos envoys, I have seen and heard much. I have picked up on many things since I first became aware, and they all seem to point to the same [conclusion].'\nYou say, 'What conclusion?'\nDelth says 'That our creator has some very sinister plans and we, the Bellikos, are but pawns in it all. I need to find a way to prove to the Apexus that something is awry and I think the first step is to compare what is being taught to the Apexus and the Bellikos. Would you be willing to [investigate]?'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to investigate'\nDelth says 'Excellent. Now I will need you to retrieve the teachings of Bellikos, the teachings of Apexus, the Bellikos mantra, and a focus of self. If I look at these things together I should be able to identify the discrepancies that I suspect are there.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Different Point of View'.\nDelth wants you to gather the teachings of the Apexus and Bellikos so that she can examine them.\n\n---\n\n_Each step in the task opens up one by one as you complete them. None of the items in this task are pre-lootable._\nRetrieve a copy of the Bellikos Mantra from a Bellikos Sermonizer 0/1 (The Convorteum)\n_Bellikos sermonizers are one of the less common bellikos spawns and seem to be more common the higher into the fortress you go._\nRetrieve the Teachings of the Bellikos from a Bellikos Lecturer 0/1 (Volska's Husk)\n_The Bellikos Lecturer is found in the sporali caves of Volska's Husk. She has a PH and is the only bellikos spawn in there._\nRetrieve the Teachings of the Apexi from an Apexus Scholar 0/1 (The Convorteum)\n_Apexus scholars, like sermonizers, seem to be found most often in the higher parts of the fortress, but occasionally spawn in the lower parts. They see invisibility._\nCollect a Focus of Self from a Bellikos Recruiter 0/1 (Arthicrex)\n_Bellikos recruiters can be found in the zone-in area of Arthicrex. They spawn in and around the house across the dry ravine._\nReturn to Delth so that she can investigate the items 0/1 (The Convorteum)\n_With the items in inventory, return to Delth and hail her._\nYou say, 'Hail, Delth'\nDelth says 'Excellent \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Now give me a moment to research these.'\n_Reward:_\n105 platinum\n40 Brellium Tokens\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n_Completion of this task leads into a second task, \"I, Bellikos\"._\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
    },
