      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Convorteum [zone=733]\n**Who:**\n- Delth [npc=35252]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Animated Bellikos Arms [item=87163]\n- Animated Bellikos Head [item=87195]\n- Animated Bellikos Legs [item=87193]\n- Animated Bellikos Torso [item=87218]\n- Discolored Cosgrove Clay Residue [item=88712]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Delth #1: Different Point of View [quest=5045]\n- Delth #3: Convorteum Coercion [quest=5057]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Mar 25 21:02:25 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the second of three solo tasks that begin with a bellikos named Delth in the Convorteum. She is located in the zone-in area, below the fortress at about -1380, 365, -65._\n_KOS mobs wander close to her, so keep a lookout while speaking with her._\nYou say, 'Hail, Delth'\nDelth says 'First protect you outsider, your efforts have proven fruitless as there is not enough proof to convince those inside. We will have to do [more] in order to prove to them that something strange is going on.'\nYou say, 'More?'\nDelth says 'I think that the only way to truly find out what has happened is by going through the [process] of creation yourself.'\nYou say, 'What process?'\nDelth says 'I believe that our creator uses a byproduct of the process used to create Bellikos to create Apexus. Of course the only way to get a hold of this ingredient would be to [create] a Bellikos.'\nYou say, 'How do we create one?'\nDelth says 'The process of putting together one of my kind will require you to gather parts from others like me who have already been animated. Unfortunately, trying to create one of us from scratch is impossible for a mere mortal. You will have to gather [parts] that are already imbued with the animation magic used by our creator.'\nYou say, 'Parts?'\nDelth says 'You will need to gather Bellikos parts, assemble them, and then bring me the byproduct produced by that process.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'I, Bellikos'.\nDelths wants you to gather Bellikos parts, assemble a Bellikos, and bring her the byproduct.\n\n---\n\nRetrieve an Animated Bellikos Torso from Bellikos in Volska's Husk or Convorteum (ALL)\nRetrieve Animated Bellikos Legs from Bellikos in Volska's Husk or Convorteum (ALL)\nRetrieve Animated Bellikos Arms from Bellikos in Volska's Husk or Convorteum (ALL)\nRetrieve an Animated Bellikos Head from Bellikos in Volska's Husk or Convorteum (ALL)\n_The above four items drop commonly from bellikos in either zone. They are not pre-lootable._\nAssemble a partially animated Bellikos 0/1 (ALL)\n_Right-click the torso to create a Discolored Cosgrove Clay Residue._\nDeliver a sample of Discolored Cosgrove Clay residue to Delth 0/1 (The Convorteum)\nDelth says 'Now I see, this strange colored clay must be how he is doing it. Thank you for this. Now I may have enough to convice those inside.'\n_Completion of this task leads into a third task, \"Convorteum Coercion\"._\n_Reward:_\n105 platinum\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n40 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
    },
