      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Rupkerr [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Missing Journal Page [item=90638]\n- Restored Expedition Journal [item=92257]\n- Tae Ew Ritualist Grimoire [item=90297]\n- Tattered Expedition Journal [item=90063]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Tae Ew ritualist [npc=35814]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Rupkerr #1: An Expedition Gone Awry [quest=5125]\n- Rupkerr #3: A Cursed Cure [quest=5127]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 15 18:15:22 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the second in a series of three that begins with Rupkerr ( **click for map image**) is found in the safe area in the north-central part of Feerrott, the Dream at approximate location 1175, 1340._\n_You must have completed his first task, \"An Expedition Gone Awry\" in order to request this one._\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'This doesn't seem right. While my brethren's mission was of the utmost importance, it wasn't an expedition of force. Who or what could be responsible for their deaths? You say that you were [attacked] by a lizardman when you found the journal?'\nYou say, 'I was attacked!'\nRupkerr says 'It's certainly strange that the lizardmen were lingering so close to the froglok corpses. While not known for their shining intellect, the lizardmen have ascended beyond being just simple scavengers. Regardless, they obviously had an interest in the expedition journal. If you could recover the [pages], maybe I could make sense of their hasty scribbling.'\nYou say, 'I'll recover those pages'\nRupkerr says 'If you find the lizardmen, I am sure you will also find the pages. They have multiple camps scattered around the Feerrott. Good luck to you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Uncovering the Truth'.\nFind the Missing Journal Pages 0/4 (The Feerrott)\n_Loot four Missing Journal Pages (dropped randomly by \"a lizardman \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" mobs in the zone). Note: These are not pre-lootable._\nReassemble the Journal 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDeliver 1 restored expedition journal to Repkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nRupkerr thumbs through the journal pages with unnerving trepidation. Rupkerr says 'Quite disturbing, indeed. It seems the expedition force stumbled upon an ancient lizardman clan, whose beliefs delve into dark ritual and sacrifice. The bloodstained scrawling is hard to make out, but I believe my brethren have been cursed. By what, I'm afraid that knowledge escapes me. However, if these journals are correct, I'd wager a Tae Ew ritualist would have a grimoire that could identify the curse.'\nRecover the ritualist's grimoire 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_You'll find some Tae Ew ritualists near the Cazic Thule ramp area. Kill them until you loot a Tae Ew Ritualist Grimoire. NOTE: This is not pre-lootable._\nReturn the grimoire to Repkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nThanks to your efforts, Rupkerr now has the ritualist's grimoire in his possession, and can hopefully find a way to remove the froglok's curse.\nRupkerr says 'I'm amazed you that got your hands on this book! Rarely do we have the chance to get such an intimate look at the Tae Ew. I'm sure I'll find what we need in here to lift the curse.'\n_Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience (8% regular exp or about 20 AAs at Level 85)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n10 Dream Motes\n_Completion of this task leads into the third in the arc, \"A Cursed Cure\"._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
