      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Rupkerr [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/3**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 3 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Adder Egg [item=91537]\n- Flesh Feeder's Fang [item=90224]\n- Orbweaver Venom Sac [item=90298]\n- Rot Dog Saliva [item=91225]\n- Tae Ew Ritual Incantation [item=91644]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a flesh feeder [npc=35852]\n- a restless spirit [npc=35843]\n- a rotdog scavenger [npc=35847]\n- a sinuous adder [npc=36146]\n- a tainted orbweaver [npc=35835]\n- a toxic orbweaver [npc=35836]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Fall of the Tae Ew [quest=5136]\n- Rupkerr #1: An Expedition Gone Awry [quest=5125]\n- Rupkerr #2: Uncovering the Truth [quest=5126]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 15 18:15:25 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the third in a series of three that begins with Rupkerr ( **click for map image**) is found in the safe area in the north-central part of Feerrott, the Dream at approximate location 1175, 1340._\n_You must have completed his first two tasks prior to requesting this one._\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'According to the [details] contained within ritualist grimoire the curse can be lifted, but it will require a great effort on your part, for I cannot do much of this alone.'\nYou say, 'What details?'\nRupkerr says 'The spell book speaks of an ancient ointment, which is mixed from an odd list of ingredients found here in the Feerrott. Once mixed, the potion is applied to the skin and the person must incant a spell to activate it. This will make them capable of sending spirits to the afterlife for short time. Are you [willing] to help?'\nYou say, 'I'm willing'\nRupkerr says 'My thanks! To create the ointment, you'll need to bring me the fang of a flesh feeder, a liberal sample of rot dog saliva, an orbweaver's venom sac, and the egg of an adder. I eagerly await your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Cursed Cure'.\nRupkerr has asked that you assist him in breaking the curse on the slain expedition members and put their souls to rest.\n\n---\n\nLoot 1 Flesh Feeder's Fang 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nLoot 1 Rot Dog Saliva 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nLoot 1 Orbweaver Venom Sac 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nLoot 1 Adder Egg 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n**NOTE: Since the launch of heroic characters and changes to the Feerrott zone in 2014, \"relatively weak\" /con mobs do NOT drop the above items.**\n_This is in particular an issue with the \"Adder Egg\" - it appears to only drop from \"a sinuous adder\" (uncommon roamer in the southeastern quadrant of the zone). Don't bother killing weak /con \"a slithering adder\" because they won't drop it. If there are any regular /con \"slithering\" mobs, those may still count._\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Flesh Feeder's Fang to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDeliver 1 Rot Dog Saliva to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDeliver 1 Orbweaver Venom Sac to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDeliver 1 Adder Egg to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nRupkerr says 'Ah, you have the ingredients! Thank you for your diligence. I'll be careful to mix these exactly as the spell book says. It should only take a moment.' Rupkerr applies the ointment to your skin. 'The book mentions a waterfall, sacred to the Tae Ew, and a source of mystical power. Recite the incantation within the mists of the waterfall. I have written it on this paper. Once you have done this, please send my brothers to their final resting place, where their souls may know peace at last.'\n_You receive a Tae Ew Ritual Incantation._\nRead the incantation in the mists of the waterfall 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_You can do this at location 1560, 2140, -18 (north end of the river). Right-click the note from your inventory._\nRelease the spirits of slain expedition members (0/10) (The Feerrott)\n_Kill 10x \"a restless spirit\" (found in great numbers around the ruins in the northeast part of the zone)._\nYou have slain a restless spirit!\na restless spirit's corpse lets out a sigh of relief, as its spirit is finally put to rest.\nInform Rupkerr that you have done as he asked 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'Excellent work, friend! I can feel the weight lifted from my heart, knowing that my froglok brothers are finally at peace. However, there is more to be done.'\nYou broke the curse on the slain expedition members and put their souls to rest.\n_Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience (about 3% at Level 87 -- accurate post-exp nerf)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n10 Dream Motes\nHeroic Everburning Jewel (heroic characters only)\n_Completion of this task leads into Rupkerr's mission (a progression mission), \"Fall of the Tae Ew\"._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n- Heroic Everburning Jewel [item=116461]",
    },
