      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Dorran Flightfoot [npc=35861]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a lizardman brute [npc=35829]\n- a lizardman mystic [npc=35832]\n- a lizardman patroller [npc=35831]\n- a lizardman scrapper [npc=35830]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 18 20:49:39 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill quest offered by Dorran Flightfoot at approximate location 1240, 245 in the Feerrott._\nYou say, 'Hail, Dorran Flightfoot'\nDorran Flightfoot says 'Renn, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, to our humble home away from home. My mate, Kavri, and I are here on a little adventure of our own. Unfortunately, it's not as pleasant as I had hoped. There's some tension in the area regarding the [lizardman patrols].'\nYou say, 'What about the lizardman patrols?'\nDorran Flightfoot says 'The lizardman patrols are becoming problematic. They simply have no respect for the other beings in the area and seem to be causing an imbalance. Could you [thin them out] a little? That might even things up a bit and allow us to continue our work.'\nYou say, 'I'll help thin them out'\nDorran Flightfoot says 'Your help is much appreciated, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Please let us know how it goes.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Panting Lizard'.\nThe drakkin Dorran Flightfoot is worried the lizardmen patrols are a little out of control in the Feerrott and has request your help in thinning their ranks.\n\n---\n\nKill lizardman patrollers 0/4 (The Feerrott)\nKill lizardman mystics 0/4 (The Feerrott)\nKill lizardman brutes 0/4 (The Feerrott)\nKill lizardman scrappers 0/4 (The Feerrott)\n_Lizardmen have camps throughout the center area of the Feerrott._\nReturn to Dorran Flightfoot 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n( **Closing dialogues?**)\n_Rewards:_\n? platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n_As of a March 2014 patch, this rewards the aug \"Heroic Rockomancy Diamond\" as well (possibly only available to Heroic Characters, but not confirmed)._\n- Heroic Rockomancy Diamond [AC: 30, AGI: +3]",
