      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Kavri Flightfoot [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/4**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 4 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Tanglefang Pelt [item=90555]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a tanglefang hunter [npc=35870]\n- a tanglefang prowler [npc=35825]\n- a tanglefang stalker [npc=35859]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 18 20:52:10 2010\nModified: Sat Jan 1 22:16:51 2022 | | _This is a solo kill quest offered by Kavri Flightfoot at approximate location 1240, 245 in the Feerrott._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kavri Flightfoot'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'Ah, if it isn't the renowned \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! Vasha! I was hoping I'd get a chance to meet you. It's an honor. A great, great honor.' She stretches out her hand to meet yours. 'In case you're curious about what I'm doing here, I'm actually gathering materials from the [wolves] and [spiders] in the area, as the material is very strong and good for my projects. Although, I'm sure you've more heroic things to do...'\nYou say, 'What about the wolves?'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'The wolves, that is the tanglefang wolves of the Feerrot, have a very strong hide can be extremely easy to work with for equally making armor and bedspreads. Oddly enough, these pelts are far superior to bovine and bear pelts once we discovered how to treat them. Would you be [willing to get] a few fine pelts for me? If it's not too much to ask, that is.'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to get a few!'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'Karui. Having a person of your stature help me with this is quite humbling. I hope to see you soon, then. Udra, friend!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Tangling With Wolves'.\nThe young drakkin Kavri Flightfoot has heard about your previous conquests and has humbly requested your help with the quite simple task of obtaining pelts from the tanglefang wolves in the Feerrott for use in making armor.\n\n---\n\nKill tanglefang stalkers 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nKill tanglefang prowlers 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nKill tanglefang hunters 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nGather some quality Tanglefang Pelts from the tanglefang wolves 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nDeliver the Tanglefang Pelts to Kavri Flightfoot 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nKavri Flightfoot says 'This pelt is perfect. Karui!'\nKavri Flightfoot says, 'Renn, and you returned in record time. Your selflessness will be remembered for helping with such a humble task. Here is your reward. Karui and udra, my friend.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n- Heroic Icy Heart [item=116319]\n- Heroic Signet of Devotion [item=116462]",
