      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Kavri Flightfoot [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Orbweaver Silk [item=90295]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a tainted orbweaver [npc=35835]\n- a toxic orbweaver [npc=35836]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 18 20:52:40 2010\nModified: Sat Oct 4 08:01:16 2025 | | This is a solo kill quest offered by Kavri Flightfoot [npc=35860] at /way +1250,+254,+52.89 near the PoK book in Feerrott, The Dream.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kavri Flightfoot'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'Ah, if it isn't the renowned \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! Vasha! I was hoping I'd get a chance to meet you. It's an honor. A great, great honor.' She stretches out her hand to meet yours. 'In case you're curious about what I'm doing here, I'm actually gathering materials from the [wolves] and [spiders] in the area, as the material is very strong and good for my projects. Although, I'm sure you've more heroic things to do...'\nYou say, 'Spiders?'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'There is a specific type of spider, the orbweaver spiders, that have extremely strong silk webbing. Cloth as protective as steel if properly worked. I hate to ask, but [would] you mind getting some silks from the orbweavers for me?'\nYou say, 'I would do that for you'\nKavri Flightfoot says 'Karui. Having a person of your stature help me with this is quite humbling. I hope to see you soon, then. Udra, friend!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Strong Silk'.\nKavri Flightfoot has requested your assistance in obtaining some strong silk from orbweaver spiders in the Feerrott. One day, they will make very fine cloth armor, but for now she needs the materials.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill tainted orbweavers 0/8 (The Feerrott)\n2\\. Kill toxic orbweavers 0/8 (The Feerrott)\n3\\. Gather some quality Orbweaver Silks from the orbweaver spiders 0/2 (The Feerrott)\n4\\. Deliver the Orbweaver Silks to Kavri Flightfoot 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nKavri Flightfoot says 'Karui for bringing me such wonderful silk!'\nKavri Flightfoot says, 'Karui, the silks you have provided are perfect. These will make some fine robes. Udra, friend.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n+5 faction with Dream Delvers\n- Heroic Bleakburn Goo [item=125086]\n- Heroic Bleakburn Goo [item=116981]\n- Heroic Bleakburn Goo [item=118321]\n- Heroic Bleakburn Goo [item=122719]\n- Heroic Bleakburn Goo [item=116606]\n- Heroic Signet of Devotion [item=116626]\n- Heroic Signet of Devotion [item=116462]\n- Heroic Signet of Devotion [item=116813]",
