      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Ashrin T`Vahn [npc=36059]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Tae Ew aggressor [npc=35812]\n- a Tae Ew devotee [npc=35816]\n- a Tae Ew disciple [npc=35815]\n- a Tae Ew drudge [npc=35817]\n- a Tae Ew enforcer [npc=35813]\n- a Tae Ew exalter [npc=35824]\n- a Tae Ew invoker [npc=35823]\n- a Tae Ew ritualist [npc=35814]\n- a Tae Ew scavenger [npc=35821]\n- a Tae Ew worshiper [npc=35818]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 18 21:59:56 2010\nModified: Sat Feb 18 07:48:00 2012 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Ashrin T`Vahn in the Feerrott (location 1020, 845)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Ashrin T`Vahn'\nAshrin T`Vahn growls as he pulls you into the hut. 'For Thex, you'd think you'd be a little more [incognito] if you're going to just out my name like that, and so loudly. Who in Norrath are you, anyways, to just waltz to my hut and greet me so openly? In better parts of Norrath, I'd have taken you down on the spot.'\nYou say, 'Incognito?'\nAshrin T`Vahn says 'Are you mad? Do you have to ask?' He sighs softly and rubs at a temple. 'Adventurers like you give me such a headache. Well, since you're no doubt at a loss for things to do to such an extent that you're bothering a random stranger about it, I suppose I'll tell you a little of [what is going on].'\nYou say, 'What is going on?'\nAshrin T`Vahn says 'Impatient, are we? You know I'm only doing this to get you out of my hair, right? Well, there's the group of lizardmen to the south, the Tae Ew, that are spreading some very nasty rumors as to the politics of Oggok and the Feerrott right now. I've been sent here to [investigate]. . . before you so rudely broke my cover.'\nYou say, 'Investigate what?'\nAshrin T`Vahn says 'At this point, it's useless to investigate further. The lizardmen should be brought down before they cause an uproar in Oggok itself, and in turn, Neriak. Take down the Tae Ew lizards that roam this swampy forest. Dead men tell no tales. I hope you're [up to it], for all the trouble you've put me through.'\nYou say, 'I'm up to it'\nAshrin T`Vahn says 'Good. Now get out there. And \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? I don't want to hear you back here until the deed is done. Have I made myself clear?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Appeasing a Teir'Dal'.\nAshrin T`Vahn is afraid the Tae Ew lizardmen of the Feerrott are getting some wrong ideas about the goings on in the Feerrott. Before they spread their rumors to Oggok, he requests their extermination before his own cover is blown.\n\n---\n\nSilence the Tae Ew by killing several of them 0/16 (The Feerrott)\n_The Tae Ew are found throughout the area outside the Temple of Cazic Thule (south-central part of the zone)._\n_Note: \"a frenzied Tae Ew\" does not update this task._\nInform Ashrin that the deed is done 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nYou say, 'Hail, Ashrin T'Vahn'\nAshrin T'Vahn says, 'Well done, I suppose. I'm glad you acknowledged the threat they could have become. Such pesky troublemakers. I suppose you now want your reward, adventurer, and so you shall have it.' The dark elf sneers as he passes it over.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers",
    },
