      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Rupkerr [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/6**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 6 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +20\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Zones:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream: Fall of the Tae Ew [zone=760]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Amygdalan Guardian [npc=36079]\n- Rupkerr [npc=36062]\n- Sentinel Quilaztli [npc=36066]\n- Temilotzin the Zealot [npc=36067]\n- Terror Lord [npc=36069]\n- Xiucozcatl the Feared [npc=36068]\n- a Tae Ew aggressor [npc=36063]\n- a Tae Ew enforcer [npc=36064]\n- an ornate chest - Fall of the Tae Ew [npc=36061]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 19 02:06:03 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a group progression mission (3-6 players) that begins with Rupkerr ( **click for map image**) is found in the safe area in the north-central part of Feerrott, the Dream at approximate location 1175, 1340._\n_You must have completed his three solo tasks prior to being able to request this task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'What the Tae Ew have done to the expedition force is unforgivable. It is time their empire of fear came to an end. Will you be the [instrument of their destruction]? I could also use your assistance to [help] locate the missing expedition, [investigate] rumors, recover the missing journal [pages], or collect ingredients if you're [willing].'\nYou say, 'I'll be the instrument of their destruction...'\nRupkerr says 'Very well. Please let me know when you are ready to [depart].'\nYou say, 'Ready to depart!'\nAfter putting to rest the members of the froglok expiditionary force, Rupkerr wants you to destroy the Tae Ew. Their rites of fear cannot be allowed to continue.\n_In this instanced zone, you can expect trash mobs to hit for a max ~6,000. The Amygdalan Guardians and nameds hit for a max ~8,000._\n\n---\n\nDefeat all the Tae Ew at the first pyramid 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat the first pyramid Amygdalan Guardian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat all the Tae Ew at the second pyramid 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat the second pyramid Amygdalan Guardian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat all the Tae Ew at the third pyramid 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat the third pyramid Amygdalan Guardian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat all the Tae Ew at the fourth pyramid 0/5 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat the fourth pyramid Amygdalan Guardian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_The above-mentioned Amygdalan Guardians spawn at the top of their pyramids once the last of the Tae Ews for that specific pyramid is killed. They don't auto-aggro, so you can rest in between pulls if needed._\n_The remaining mobs (along with the rest of the named and guards in the task) spawn on the ramp to the temple. They have average aggro ranges and are not linked to each other (can be split)._\nDefeat Sentinel Quilaztli's guards 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat Sentinel Quilaztli 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Sentinel Quilaztli casts \"Precision Strike\":_\nPrecision Strike: Single Target, Magic (-650)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 20000\n2: Stun (2.00 sec)\nDefeat Temilotzin the Zealot's guards 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat Temilotzin the Zealot 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Temilotzin the Zealot casts \"Blood Rites\" and \"Gripping Fear\":_\nBlood Rites: Single Target, Magic (-650)\n1: Hitpoints unknown calc: 1999 range: 1 -> 0\n2: Increase Curse Counter by 30\nGripping Fear: Single Target, (-20)\n1: Fear up to level 0\n2: Decrease Movement by 90%\nDefeat Xiucozcatl the Feared's guards 0/2 (The Feerrott)\nDefeat Xiucozcatl the Feared 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Xiucozcatl the Feared casts \"Critical Strike\":_\nCritical Strike: Single Target, Magic (-650)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 20000\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 8000 per tick\nDefeat Terror Lord 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_NOTE: The task locks upon the Terror Lord's death._\n_The Terror Lord casts the spell \"Gazerbeam\":_\nGazerbeam: Unknown(44) 30', Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 18000\nTerror Lord has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nTerror Lord's corpse glares at you in death, the hate still in its eye.\nClaim your reward from the ornate chest 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Opening the chest completes the task._\nYou destroyed the Tae Ew Empire, silencing their rites of fear.\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers has been adjusted by 20.\n\n---\n\n_Task Rewards:_\nExperience (about 6% regular exp at Level 86 or 4-14 AAs worth depending on your current AA count)\n315 platinum\n20 Dream Motes\n+20 faction with Dream Delvers\n_Known chest rewards (1 item + 1 spell per task):_\nBrutal Enforcer\nChipped Shards of Dread\nHealer's Gorget of Aid\nJumping Axe\nPatches' Gnarled Bone\nScale of the Dark Serpent\nSilken Collar of the Jungle Arachnid\nSword of the Specter\nTerror Infused Linked Boots\nTerror Infused Linked Coat\nMinor Nebulous Dream Fragment\nLesser Nebulous Dream Fragment\nMedian Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGreater Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGlowing Nebulous Dream Fragment\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
