      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n**Who:**\n- Rupkerr [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 80\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Faction\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +20\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Essence of Fear [item=92563]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream: A Tearable Fear [zone=763]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Blackbones [npc=36329]\n- Cyndreela [npc=36326]\n- Fearful Spectre [npc=36330]\n- Rupkerr [npc=36327]\n- Terror Unleashed [npc=36328]\n- a portal guardian [npc=36613]\n- an ornate chest - A Tearable Fear [npc=36331]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 25 20:47:53 2010\nModified: Fri Sep 13 06:38:21 2024 | | This is a non-progression group task that begins with Rupkerr ( **click for map image**) is found in the safe area in the north-central part of Feerrott, the Dream at approximate location 1175, 1340.\nThere are no pre-requisites (other than level) for requesting this task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'It's such a relief to come across a friendly traveler. I was sent here to determine the whereabouts of a missing [expedition crew], and found myself quite lost in this jungle, exposed to all its dangers. My own search has been halted, due to [rumors] of wandering undead.'\nYou say, 'What rumors?'\nRupkerr says 'Oh, the rumors have been coming in from all over, as far north as the waterfall, to the southern border of Innothule Swamp. The Feerrott has its fair share of undead, but these recent [sightings] have been far more fearful.'\nYou say, 'Sightings?'\nRupkerr says 'Normally the undead tend to linger not far from the portal to the Plane of Fear, leaving the rest of the jungle relatively free of skeletons and specters. The recent reports I've heard detail a myriad of fearful [creatures], unlike anything that's ever been seen before in the Feerrott.'\nYou say, 'What creatures?'\nRupkerr says 'Indescribable creatures, looking as if they crawled straight through the Fear portal itself! Of course, there simply cannot be any truth to these rumors, as it is common knowledge the portal to Fear is a one-way trip. Nonetheless, someone should [investigate] these sightings.'\nYou say, 'I'll investigate for you'\nRupkerr says 'Very well, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You're far braver than the adventures that passed this way before you. I'll take extra care to scribe the sighting locations in your journal exactly as they were reported to me. Let me know when you are ready to [begin] your investigation.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Tearable Fear'.\nYou say, 'I am ready to begin.'\nYou are teleported into an instanced version of Feerrott, the Dream.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Investigate the rumors of undead near Innothule Swamp 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n2\\. Vanquish the undead from the area 0/4 (The Feerrott)\n3\\. Investigate the rumors of undead near the Temple of Cazic Thule Swamp 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n4\\. Vanquish the undead from the area 0/4 (The Feerrott)\n5\\. Investigate the rumors of undead west of the waterfall 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n6\\. Vanquish the undead from the area 0/4 (The Feerrott)\n7\\. Speak to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nHe is near the Rathe Mountains zone line.\n8\\. Speak to Cyndreela 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n9\\. Collect fear essences from creatures in the area 0/8 (The Feerrott)\n_The item you're looking for is \"an essence of fear\"._\n10\\. Give the fear essences to Cyndreela 0/8 (The Feerrott)\n11\\. Speak to Rupkerr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nHe is near the Rathe Mountains zone line.\n12\\. Defeat the portal guardians near Innothule 0/3 (The Feerrott)\n_The Innothule portal is by the zoneline at /waypoint -977, -2670, 3_\n_When you run past one of the portals, you instantly aggro the first portal guardian. The aggro range is pretty far, so be ready for a fight._\n_The second and third guardian spawns are on a timer. They're each mezzable and snareable._\n13\\. Destroy the Portal 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Blackbones spawns and rushes you after you kill the last guardian. He casts a large knockback._\n14\\. Defeat the portal guardians near the Temple of Cazic Thule 0/3 (The Feerrott)\n_Temple of CT portal base of the ramp /waypoint -1003, 52, -9_\n15\\. Destroy the Portal 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Terror Unleashed spawns and attacks after you kill the last guardian here._\n16\\. Defeat the portal guardians west of the waterfall 0/3 (The Feerrott)\n_Waterfall portal is against the Zone wall nw corner, but near the waterfall._\n17\\. Destroy the Portal 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_The Fearful Spectre spawns and attacks after you kill the last of this portal's guardians. It has two AEs:_\nDread Pulse: PB AE 100', Magic (-650)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 23000\n2: Decrease Movement by 50%\n3: Stun (2.00 sec)\nTouch of Fear: Single Target, Magic (-650)\n1: Fear up to level 0\n18\\. Defeat Cyndreela 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Cyndreela doesn't see invis and won't aggro until you pull her. She is undead. She has an AE Soul Devour (hits everyone in range for 5,000 and heals herself for that amount)._\nSoul Devour: PB AE 40', Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 5000\nThe task locks.\n19\\. Claim your reward from ornate chest 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n\n---\n\n_Task Rewards (note: to get experience, you have to be near the chest when opened):_\nExperience (about 3% regular exp at Level 86 or 7 AAs worth)\n315 platinum\n20 Dream Motes\nFaction with Dream Delvers +20\n_Known chest rewards [npc=36331] (1 item + 1 spell per task):_\nClurg's Prized Stein\nDagger of Rotting Flesh\nDeadman's Battleaxe\nEye of Rot\nFeartouched Fang of Ferociousness\nGem of Unwavering Tenacity\nIntricate Scarlet Rod\nKrupp's Drape of Exploration\nShield of Rituals\nTerror Infused Battleskirt\nMinor Nebulous Dream Fragment\nLesser Nebulous Dream Fragment\nMedian Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGreater Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGlowing Nebulous Dream Fragment\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
    },
