      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Dagda Icefury [npc=36433]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Mammoth Meat [item=93642]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a barbarian refugee [npc=36476]\n- a snow orc warrior - Al'Kabor's Nightmare - 1 [npc=36435]\n- a wooly mammoth - Al'Kabor's Nightmare [npc=36434]\n- an enraged mammoth [npc=36436]\n- an ice goblin thief [npc=36439]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Faydark's Shadow [quest=5210]\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 10 06:49:36 2010\nModified: Wed Nov 10 07:12:55 2010 | | _This solo task is the second in a series of three that will grant you access to the different islands in Al'Kabor's Nightmare (as well as lead into the group progression mission for the zone)._\n_This task begins with Dagda Icefury who's located at the port-up to Everfrost._\nYou say, 'Hail, Dagda Icefury'\nDagda Icefury says haggardly, 'Things are bad. I won't deny that. But I won't stop fighting until I'm [dead]. I'll protect everyone until I draw my last breathe! You there. Are you here to lend a hand, or are you just [passing] through?\nYou say, 'Dead?'\nDagda Icefury says 'Well, I do not know how much longer we can hold out. Orcs and goblins are hunting my people to extinction. We have no food, and we can spare no hunters. Are you able to lend us [aid]?'\nYou say, 'I'll aid you'\nDagda Icefury says 'Then we might have a chance. Gather some meat from the mammoths that still roam the lands, and if you can, do what you can to stop the goblins and orcs. You can rest assured I will do my part from this end!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Wastelands of Everfrost'.\nThe remaining barbarians on Everfrost are out of food, weakening their efforts to defend against the orcs and goblins that swarm the landscape. Dagda needs your help to gather some mammoth meat to feed her people, and drive off the snow orcs and ice goblins that threaten the barbarians.\n\n---\n\nHunt wooly mammoths and collect their meat 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_\"Mammoth Meat\" is a common drop from mammoths._\nGive the mammoth meat to Dagda 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nDrive off the snow orc warriors 0/3 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nDrive off the ice goblin thieves 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSpeak to Dagda 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dagda Icefury'\nDagda Icefury says 'Excellent work, my friend. You've brought us enough food for awhile. And your heroism in defeating those orcs and goblins will not be forgotten. Could you spread the good news to my people? I'll wait here for your return.'\nConvince the barbarian refugees not to give up 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_You can simply hail the refugee that stands nearby._\nYou say, 'Hail, a barbarian refugee'\na barbarian refugee says 'We've heard of what you've done for us! You have our thanks. We won't ever surrender. If we are to die, we will take the lot of them with us!'\nSpeak to Dagda 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dagda Icefury'\nDagda Icefury says 'You've given us the respite we needed, and you have our gratitude. We'll continue the fight here. The world may be shattered, but nothing shall shatter our spirit! I will die protecting my friends if need be. \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I know you are needed elsewhere. I can arrange a guide to take you over the remains of this world and transport you to Faydark, if you so desire. We will be fine here.'\nYou've given Dagda and her people the reprieve they need. Their struggles will no longer be in vain. You can now travel to the remains of Faydark.\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers got better.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nFaction with Dream Delvers\nExperience\n20 Dream Motes\n_Note: You also gain access to the third island in the zone (Faydark). To get there, say \"Faydark\" to Dagda or Dreezil._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
    },
