      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Sionachie Heartsinger [npc=36450]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Felwithe Military Documents [item=93650]\n- Memory Tonic [item=93657]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Firiona Vie [npc=36453]\n- a high elf guard [npc=36460]\n- a high elf sentry [npc=36462]\n- a high elf wizard [npc=36461]\n**Related Quests:**\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n- Wastelands of Everfrost [quest=5209]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 10 06:49:40 2010\nModified: Wed Nov 10 07:15:12 2010 | | _This solo task is the third in a series of three that will grant you access to the different islands in Al'Kabor's Nightmare (as well as lead into the group progression mission for the zone)._\n_This task begins with Sionachie Heartsinger who's located at the port-up to the Faydark._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sionachie Heartsinger'\nSionachie Heartsinger seems to look right through you as she speaks, 'Thubr is gone, and now Firiona Vie is [unwell]. I never thought I'd be here to see the world end like this. Al'Kabor, what happened?' With a few heavy blinks, Sionachie refocuses her attention. 'Pardon me, are you here to help? Or are you just [passing] through?\nYou say, 'Unwell?'\nSionachie Heartsinger says 'The situation could not be worse. I cannot understand Firiona's actions, and the efforts of what remains of Felwithe and Kelethin are not stopping the Crushbone orcs.' Sionachie peers at you with silent understanding. 'You are not what you seem. Others may be fooled by this clever ruse, but I sense you are not my enemy. If you are offering your [help], we could use it.''\nYou say, 'I will help'\nSionachie Heartsinger says 'Thank you. I've been warned by the Felwithe guard to stay away from Firiona. They claim she has no wish to see me. Their actions are desperate and corrupt. If they are allowed to continue on without any accountability for their actions, who knows what kind of irreparable damage they may do. I need you to lessen the Felwithe guard numbers, and retrieve any military documents you may find while doing so. Do you think you can handle this?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Faydark's Shadow'.\nSionachie Heartsinger has asked you to speak to Firiona Vie. Firiona has refused to meet with Sionachie and has asked she be denied access to Felwithe. Sionachie has asked for your help while she takes care of the Crushbone orc assaults. Investigate the ruins of Felwithe and Kelethin and look for any documents that might shed light on Firiona's plans.\nThe documents have likely been littered around Al'Kabor's Nightmare, in the ruins of Kelethin and Felwithe, or they may still be in the hand of those that guard what's left of Felwithe.\n\n---\n\nInvestigate the ruins of Felwithe 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nInvestigate the ruins of Kelethin 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_These steps update as you approach the ruins of Felwithe and, to the west, the ruins of Kelethin._\nCollect Felwithe Military Documents and deliver them to Sionachie 0/5 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Military documents drop from the high elves in the area and are also groundspawns. Known locations (in the ruins behind the main area of Felwithe):_\n_In-game /loc:_\n-265, -5080, -334\n-330, -5070, -333\n-550, -5120, -333\n-445, -5120, -335\n-300, -5220, -333\n_For alkabormare.txt map file:_\nP 5080.0000, 265.0000, -334.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, document\nP 5070.0000, 330.0000, -333.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, document\nP 5120.0000, 550.0000, -333.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, document\nP 5120.0000, 445.0000, -335.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, document\nP 5220.0000, 300.0000, -333.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, document\nEliminate members of the Felwithe guard 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Kill four of the high elves in and around Felwithe._\nSpeak with Sionachie 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sionachie Heartsinger'\nSionachie Heartsinger looks over the documents, frowning. 'I see. Firiona is even worse off than I thought. Apparently those who hold the reigns of power in Felwithe are using her as nothing more than a figurehead. Could you do me a favor? I have a potion here that may help her regain part of her memory. When you ready, please take it and give it to her.\"\nGive the Memory Tonic to Firiona Vie 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Firiona Vie is found inside a building just inside the front gate of Felwithe at location -400, -5000. You may need to clear a mob or two to get to her._\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie says 'Oh, hello there. I don't think I've seen you before. Can you tell me where I might find my friends? I have a feeling I should be doing something useful, but I've been having trouble remembering lately.'\n_On handing her the potion:_\nFiriona Vie looks slightly more lucid after consuming the potion. 'Sionachie, of course. Yes, I remember her. Tell her she can come speak to me. We have much to do. Something about Al'Kabor. Do I know him?' Firiona pauses. While the magical tonic helped, she is still in no condition to do much of anything.\nSpeak with Sionachie 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sionachie Heartsinger'\nSionachie Heartsinger listens as you describe what happened. 'So that is that,' she says with a sigh. 'Well, I appreciate what you've done. Her slight improvement may be all I need to start making a real difference here. Maybe Felwithe will listen to me now. I am grateful for your help. If you would like to go, I can give you access to the Dreadlands where Al'Kabor is held captive. You need but ask.\"\nFiriona appears to have lost her grip on sanity, though you've given her enough clarity to recognize her friend. She is now a figurehead for what remains of the elven fighting force, but nothing more. Sionachie will try to help her friend. You've done all you can here. You can now go to the Dreadlands where Al'Kabor resides.\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers got better.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nFaction with Dream Delvers\nExperience\n20 Dream Motes\n_Note: You also gain access to the final island in the zone (Dreadlands). To get there, say \"Dreadlands\" to Sionachie, Dagda, or Dreezil. You can travel to any island by speaking to one of these NPCs (or to Al'Kabor on the Dreadlands island). You can also say \"leave\" to zone back out into the Upper Floors of the House of Thule._\n\n---\n\n_Completion of this task allows you to request the group progression mission for Al'Kabor's Nightmare (from Elard Velsorn outside the zone-in in the House of Thule's Upper Floors)._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
    },
