      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Serllis [npc=36487]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Drachnid Venom [item=93736]\n- Meager Rations [item=94622]\n- Nettlevine [item=94621]\n- Vial of Yeti Blood [item=94623]\n- Viskal's Research [item=94620]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Interrogator Silth [npc=36486]\n- Viskal the Apothecary [npc=36474]\n- Zisak [npc=36493]\n- a drolvarg thief [npc=36489]\n- an iksar torturer [npc=36485]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 11 07:30:33 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo task that begins with Serrlis in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. He's found in the southeastern pyramid on the Dreadlands isle._\nYou say, 'Hail, Serllis'\nSerllis says 'If you have come to raid our house, I'm afraid you've picked a poor target. Any items of value were ruined when Al'Kabor destroyed our home. Resources are scarce, and what little we have is used to nourish those who are [ill].'\nYou say, 'How did they become ill?'\nSerllis says 'The lands weren't the only thing devastated when Al'Kabor lost his grip, many iksar have suffered as well. Of the few that remain, several have fallen gravely ill. Viskal, our apothecary, has been working diligently to find a [cure], but hasn't had much luck.'\nYou say, 'Find a cure?'\nSerllis says 'I'm curious as to why you have such an interest? Do you intend to [help] us, rather than harm us? Viskal hasn't been heard from in days. He's been conducting his research in the temple just west of here.'\nYou say, 'I intend to help...'\nSerllis says 'Could you check-in with Viskal and see what progress he has made?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Struggle to Survive'.\nSerllis is surprised you are interested in the iksar who have fallen ill, but humbly accepts your help anyway.\n\n---\n\nFind Viskal the Apothecary 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Viskal is found in the next pyramid over. He's not in very good shape._\nKill the iksar torturers 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill Interrogator Silth 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_These three mobs surround Viskal's corpse. The torturers each hit for a max ~3,100 while Silth hits for a max ~6,500._\nInterrogator Silth has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nInterrogator Silth's corpse falls to the ground with a loud crash.\nLoot Viskal's Research 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nDeliver Viskal's Research to Serllis 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSerllis says 'It's a tragedy that Al'Kabor's errors have caused my fellow iksar to turn on each other. Our survival comes at a great cost. Although we have suffered a great loss with the passing of Viskal, his death will not be in vain. It appears that he concluded his research, and found a possible cure, but I'll need a few ingredients before I'm able to craft the antidote.'\nCollect Nettlevine 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_These are ground spawns within the spire compound where plantation grows._\nLoot Drachnid Venom 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_This is a common drop from drachnids._\nGive the Nettlevine to Serllis 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nGive the Drachnid Venom to Serllis 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSerllis says 'Your help so far has been invaluable, but it seems the last ingredient I need to concoct a cure will be difficult to obtain. The apothecary's research calls for yeti blood, but the only known supply lies in the hands of the iksars that murdered Viskal. I know they will not hear my appeals, but they might be willing to barter with you.'\nSpeak to Zisak 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Zisak is in the northeastern-most structure._\nYou say, 'Hail, Zisak'\nZisak says 'Who has sent you? It is Serllis, is it not? Why should I help her when she so blatantly steals from our meager food supply! My people suffer, too, from sickness and starvation. Serllis will never have her cure if our rations keep disappearing.'\nSpeak to Serllis 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Serllis'\nSerllis says 'So Zisak blames us for his dwindling food supply? That is absurd! My people are too sick and weak to steal anything. Someone else must be behind this heartless theft. Is it too much to ask for you to sneak into the food supply room to the northwest and find out who is responsible? Maybe if we can correct the situation for Zisak, he'll be willing to part with the yeti blood.'\nHead to the store room to investigate 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_This is the northwestern-most structure. You'll be jumped by 2x \"a drolvarg thief\" which hit for a max ~3,300 and have relatively few hitpoints._\nKill the drolvarg thieves 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\na drolvarg thief has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na drolvarg thief's corpse crumples to the floor.\nLoot a Meager Ration 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nDeliver the Meager Rations to Zisak 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nZisak says 'Serllis' kindness shall be repaid with kindness. Please see to it that she receives this vial of yeti blood, along with my gratitude.'\nDeliver the Vial of Yeti Blood to Serllis 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSerllis says 'Many thanks, friend. You bring us hope; and perhaps a cure for the many that have fallen ill.'\nThanks to your efforts, an antidote can be created to cure the many iksar who have fallen ill in the Dreadland ruins.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
