      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Chorra Clearsky [npc=36430]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a black wolf - Al'Kabor's Nightmare [npc=36428]\n- a giant snake - Al'Kabor's Nightmare [npc=36419]\n- a giant wasp - Al'Kabor's Nightmare [npc=36415]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 12 07:34:53 2010\nModified: Sun Oct 14 03:01:51 2012 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Chorra Clearsky in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. She's located in the northeast area of the Rivervale isle (close to the island's end at 450, -390)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Chorra Clearsky'\nChorra Clearsky says 'Greetings, adventurer! It's quite nice seeing a fresh face around here. It gives hope to our dire situation. Did you come for the [hunt]?'\nYou say, 'What hunt?'\nChorra Clearsky says 'Well, at the moment we're forced to make due with what we have right now for meat and supplies. There's a number of animals about that we can make do with. Unfortunately, we're down to, well... me... for hunting. It's so hard to [keep up]!'\nYou say, 'Keep up?'\nChorra Clearsky says 'You wouldn't mind helping, would you? All you have to do is the killing, and I can manage the skinning and gathering the essential supplies from the bodies. What do ya say? You'll [do it]?'\nYou say, 'I'll do it'\nChorra Clearsky says 'Thank you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! You are so great. Thank you, thank you. Here's a list of the animals we require supplies from. I'll await your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Aiding the Hunt'.\nA young and oddly cheerful halfling Chorra Clearsky has requested assistance for hunting meat and supplies, particularly for the dirty part of the killing itself. She's supplied the list of creatures to go for, which has been scribbled down in your journal.\n\n---\n\nKill a few black wolves for Chorra 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill a few giant snakes for Chorra 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill a few giant wasps for Chorra 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nReturn to Chorra 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Chorra Clearsky'\nChorra Clearsky looks out over the field at the bodies before her, and slips her skinning knife out of its sheath. 'Well, lookie there! It looks like it's time to get to work. I appreciate the help, friend. Return to me later and I may have more for you to do.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
    },
