      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Tresla McKindle [npc=36447]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Thick Everfrost Pelt [item=93648]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a polar bear - Al'Kabor's Nightmare - 1 [npc=36443]\n- a snow wolf [npc=36437]\n- a wooly mammoth - Al'Kabor's Nightmare [npc=36434]\n**Related Quests:**\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 12 07:34:56 2010\nModified: Fri Nov 12 07:38:21 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Tresla McKindle in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. She's located in the building in the northeast corner of the Everfrost isle (485, -2700, -225)._\n_Note: You must have completed the task \"The Rivervale Ruins\" in order to access the Everfrost island._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tresla McKindle'\nTresla McKindle says 'You don't look like you're in very good shape. But then again, I suppose we don't look so hot, either. There's so few of us left since... it happened. What is worse, what has survived outside these walls is strong; we barely can keep up with food and warmth. Since you're here, since you have survived outside in the remnants of Everfrost, could you do us a [favor]?'\nYou say, 'A favor?'\nTresla McKindle says 'A favor is all I can ask at the moment. No major quest of glory or honor, full of riches and powerful artifacts. Gone are those days... No, we just need some [pelts] to fashion armor, clothing, and bedding so that perhaps we can survive another night. We don't have much to offer in return...'\nYou say, 'I'll get some pelts'\nTresla McKindle says 'You're very gracious, friend. I await your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'EverWarmth'.\nThe Wayfarer Tresla McKindle is holed up in one of the remaining buildings of the Everfrost ruins, and has requested a favor of you to grab Thick Everfrost Pelts from the various animals of the tundra. Polar bears, mammoths, and snow wolves appear to have the proper thickness required.\n\n---\n\nLoot several Thick Everfrost Pelts 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nHunt animals of the tundra for their pelts 0/10 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nDeliver 2 Thick Everfrost Pelts to Tresla 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
    },
