      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Lyrin Woodsong [npc=36452]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a half elf guard [npc=36468]\n- a half elf scout [npc=36467]\n- a high elf guard [npc=36460]\n- a high elf sentry [npc=36462]\n- a high elf wizard [npc=36461]\n- a wood elf druid [npc=36465]\n- a wood elf ranger [npc=36466]\n- a wood elf seer [npc=36470]\n- a wood elf warden [npc=36469]\n**Related Quests:**\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n- Wastelands of Everfrost [quest=5209]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 12 21:02:48 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Lyrin Woodsong in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. She's located in one of the buildings in the ruins of Kelethin on Faydark island (-280, -3450, -311)._\n_Note: You must have completed the tasks \"The Rivervale Ruins\" and \"Wastelands of Everfrost\" in order to access the Faydark island._\nYou say, 'Hail, Lyrin Woodsong'\nLyrin Woodsong shrinks back, throwing her instrument to the side and brandishing a weapon in a very futile and fearful stance. 'Aaaaaghhh! Eeeeee! Don't [hurt] me! Please, please, please. I have nothing left!'\nYou say, 'Hurt you?'\nLyrin Woodsong shakes her sword at you, tears streaming down her face. 'Bandits. Everywhere. You! You're here to kill me and take my foodstores, aren't you? You're like every other [elf] out there.'\nYou say, 'Every other elf?'\nLyrin Woodsong screams, the discussion seeming to distress the young bard further. Her eyes grow wide and crazed. 'I can't even trust my brother anymore. [Everyone] wants to kill me. Everyone is evil!'\nYou say, 'Everyone?'\nLyrin Woodsong says 'Evil, evil! If you're truly good, [destroy the evil]. Destroy the evil and I may trust you!'\nYou say, 'I'll destroy the evil'\nLyrin Woodsong shakes her head wildly. 'Leave! Leave me to my music. Only when you return with their blood on your hands will I trust you! Only then!' She rushes over to her instrument and picks it up once more, cradling it like a child.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dangerous Dissonance'.\nOne of the few wood elves left to the remnants of the tree city of Kelethin itself, Lyrin Woodsong is afraid for her life at the hands of every other elf who survived. Clearly traumatized by the event, Lyrin has requested you slaughter fellow elves for her trust.\n\n---\n\nKill a few wood elves 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill a few high elves 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill a few half elves 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nReturn to Lyrin 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Lyrin Woodsong'\nYour task 'Dangerous Dissonance' has been updated.\nLyrin Woodsong just sees the blood and screams, tears running down her face once more. 'Who are you? Who ARE you? Murderer!' She seems to have forgotten who you are and what she had even sent you to do.\nAfter claiming the reward:\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers could not possibly get any better.\nYou have gained an ability point! You now have XX ability points.\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Dangerous Dissonance",
    },
