      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Raobez Kraykru [npc=36492]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a drachnid knight [npc=36484]\n- a drachnid necromancer [npc=36481]\n- a drachnid priest [npc=36480]\n- a drachnid soldier [npc=36483]\n- a drachnid sorcerer [npc=36482]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Faydark's Shadow [quest=5210]\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n- Wastelands of Everfrost [quest=5209]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 12 21:12:58 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Raobez Kraykru in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. He's located in the north-central pyramid on the Dreadlands island (-475, -6400, -707)._\n_Note: You must have completed the tasks \"The Rivervale Ruins\", \"Wastelands of Everfrost\", and \"Faydark's Shadow\" in order to access the Dreadlands island._\nYou say, 'Hail, Raobez Kraykru'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'Well, you've some guts, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I sure hope you're here to [relieve the strain] on the Iksar imprisoned here.'\nYou say, 'I'm here to relieve the strain on you'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'Good, good. Else I might have killed you on the spot, otherwise. There are those [guarding] the pyramids, as well as those [wandering] the edges of the spires. No matter whom you intend to slaughter, it will probably do us no good, as we've met the end of the world, as you know. If I can breathe another day, however, it may be worth it in the end.'\nYou say, 'Who's guarding the pyramids?'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'The drachnids, of course. A whole army of them, unfortunately. If you care to take some down, you may. I'll be waiting.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Drachnicide'.\nRaobez Kraykru is stuck within the pyramids, as are the rest of the Iksar, and he has requested you to slaughter any drachnid you see guarding the pyramids.\n\n---\n\nSlay a few drachnid priests 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSlay a few drachnid soldiers 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSlay a few drachnid knights 0/2 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSlay a few drachnid necromancers 0/3 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSlay a few drachnid sorcerers 0/3 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nReport back to Raobez 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Raobez Kraykru'\nYour task 'Drachnicide' has been updated.\nRaobez Kraykru nods. 'I heard their screams. You have done well. Thank you.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
    },
