      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Al'Kabor's Nightmare [zone=754]\n**Who:**\n- Raobez Kraykru [npc=36492]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a drolvarg [npc=36771]\n- a plaguebone skeleton - Al'Kabor's Nightmare - 1 [npc=36477]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Faydark's Shadow [quest=5210]\n- The Rivervale Ruins [quest=5208]\n- Wastelands of Everfrost [quest=5209]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 12 21:13:42 2010\nModified: Sun Oct 14 03:00:52 2012 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Raobez Kraykru in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. He's located in the north-central pyramid on the Dreadlands island (-475, -6400, -707)._\n_Note: You must have completed the tasks \"The Rivervale Ruins\", \"Wastelands of Everfrost\", and \"Faydark's Shadow\" in order to access the Dreadlands island._\nYou say, 'Hail, Raobez Kraykru'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'Well, you've some guts, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I sure hope you're here to [relieve the strain] on the Iksar imprisoned here.'\nYou say, 'I'm here to relieve the strain on you'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'Good, good. Else I might have killed you on the spot, otherwise. There are those [guarding] the pyramids, as well as those [wandering] the edges of the spires. No matter whom you intend to slaughter, it will probably do us no good, as we've met the end of the world, as you know. If I can breathe another day, however, it may be worth it in the end.'\nYou say, 'Wandering the edges?'\nRaobez Kraykru says 'Two major foes out beyond the pyramids are the plaguebone skeletons and the drolvargs. Both equally need slaughtered. I'll be mighty disappointed if you come back without their deaths hanging over you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death to the Dead'.\nThe iksar Raobez Kraykru is holed up in the library, and he simply has requested the slaughter of the plaguebone skeletons and drolvargs that seem to have overpopulated the outer reaches of the remnants of the Dreadlands.\n\n---\n\nKill some plaguebone skeletons 0/8 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nKill some drolvargs 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nReport back to Raobez 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Raobez Kraykru'\nRaobez Kraykru laughs heartily, sounding much like a hiss through his lizard-like maw. 'I can smell the plague on you. Your assistance is much appreciated.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
    },
