      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Miragul's Nightmare [zone=755]\n**Who:**\n- Yilian [npc=36499]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bottle of Enchanted Water [item=93425]\n- Pail of Water [item=93382]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a colorful flower [npc=36858]\n- a shadowed flower [npc=36513]\n- a shadowy lurker [npc=36520]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 16 00:30:01 2010\nModified: Tue Jan 18 20:58:10 2011 | | _This is one of five pre-requisite tasks leading up to the Miragul's Nightmare mission, \"Miragul's Vendetta\". There are no pre-requisites for requesting this task._\n_This is a solo task that begins with Yilian in Miragul's Nightmare. He's a shade that roams the valleys and clearings in the western half of the zone. He'll stop if you hail him._\nYou say, 'Hail, Yilian'\nYilian says 'This place. . . So devoid of life. . . Of beauty. For so long I have been [here].'\nYou say, 'Here?'\nYilian says 'Here? I do not ponder where or what this place may be. I only long to see [beauty] once again, even if it is only for a short time.'\nYou say, 'What beauty?'\nYilian says 'There are flowers nearby. They are shadow just like almost everything else here. There is something that is still living, full of beauty here though; The water in the fountains to the north. Their [water] can bring back a glimpse of beauty.'\nYou say, 'Water?'\nYilian says 'Would you [help] me? I was going to collect some water from the fountains, but the shadowy lurkers took my pail.'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nYilian says 'If you could get my pail back from the lurkers in the fountains to the north and bring it back to me, perhaps we can bring back a touch of color to this place.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Beauty Lost'.\nA shade named Yilian wishes to see the beautiful flowers once again in this shadowy place. If you were able to water the flowers, perhaps this could be accomplished.\n\n---\n\nCollect a pail of water from shadowy lurkers 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_Shadowy lurkers are elementals found in the entrance room of the castle. The pail drops very commonly._\nReturn the pail of water to Yilian 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak to Yilian 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Yilian'\nYilian says 'Take these bottles of water and give them to the shadowed flowers. With some luck they may just change into their once colorful versions for a short time.'\nGive a bottle of enchanted water to 10 shadowed flowers 0/10 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_Shadowed flowers are found throughout the zone. Give a bottle to 10 of them to change them into \"a colorful flower\". They respawn a few minutes after a turn-in. (Note: The flowers will give the bottle back to you, so you can just use the same bottle over and over.)_\nSpeak with Yilian 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Yilian'\nYilian says 'They were so wonderful. The colors hurt my eyes but it is worth it to look upon such beauty once again. Thank you. Your simple task has brought me more joy than you will ever know.'\n_Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n30 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
    },
