      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Morell's Castle [zone=757]\n**Who:**\n- Braelin Arden [npc=36851]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Candied Bunny Skin [item=94470]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Morell's Castle: Hippity Hoppity Kill [zone=780]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Alyss [npc=37035]\n- Alyss chest [npc=37034]\n- Creepy Alyss [npc=37054]\n- Haezra [npc=37039]\n- Nalder Rallin [npc=37042]\n- Piper Nasscul [npc=37045]\n- Playful Alyss [npc=37040]\n- Saena Kinde [npc=37041]\n- Tergan Norwath [npc=37043]\n- Thaelin Mhorna [npc=37044]\n- a blue demon [npc=37050]\n- a blue imp [npc=37046]\n- a candied bunny [npc=37037]\n- a green demon [npc=37051]\n- a green imp [npc=37047]\n- a rabid rabbit - Morell's Castle [npc=37038]\n- a red demon [npc=37052]\n- a red imp [npc=37048]\n- an orange demon [npc=37053]\n- an orange imp [npc=37049]\n- an unknown entity [npc=37036]\n**Related Quests:**\n- A Few Buckets of Sand [quest=5241]\n- Gouzah Safari [quest=5238]\n- Pirate's Blues [quest=5242]\n- Satyrical Riddles [quest=5240]\n- Suspiciously Sweet Treats [quest=5239]\n- The Staff Retreat [quest=5243]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 23 07:30:05 2010\nModified: Sat Sep 28 07:37:05 2024 | | _This is a group progression mission (3-6 players) that begins with Braelin Arden in Morell's Castle (due north of the zone-in, up the stairs on either side of the marionette room)._\n_You must have completed all six partisan tasks for Morell's Castle to being able to request this one:_\n\\- Gouzah Safari\n\\- A Few Buckets of Sand\n\\- Pirate's Blues\n\\- Satyrical Riddles\n\\- Suspiciously Sweet Treats\n\\- The Staff Retreat\nYou say, 'Hail, Braelin Arden'\nBraelin Arden says 'You have to help me! [They] will not live much longer if you do not help.'\nYou say, 'Who is they?'\nBraelin Arden says 'My friends! That [girl], but not really a girl, took them!'\nYou say, 'What girl?'\nBraelin Arden says 'An evil thing she is! There is no communicating with her, no clear logic in which she [speaks]. She does things with no rhyme or reason!'\nYou say, 'Speaks?'\nBraelin Arden says 'Imagine giving more power than you can think of, to a child! You would then know what insanity is... You would then know the whims of a [demon]!'\nYou say, 'A demon?'\nBraelin Arden says 'Will you [help] then?'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nBraelin Arden says 'I thank you, as no doubt my friends will when you free them. Let me know when you are [ready] so that I may send you to that wretched girl's location.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Hippity Hoppity Kill'.\nBraelin Arden asks you to help him retrieve his friends who have been taken by the demon Alyss. She will not release them until she has the bunnies she so desperately wants!\n\n---\n\nTalk to Alyss 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n_A Bellikos named Alyss is found in the southwest corner of the forest._\nYou say, 'Hail, Alyss'\nAlyss says '[Hello]!'\nYou say, 'Hello...'\nAlyss says 'Are you here to [play] with me?! It has been a very long time since I had someone to play with.'\nYou say, 'I'm not here to play'\nAlyss says 'I don't think I like you. You're not going to play with me! Just like the [others]!'\nYou say, 'Others?'\nAlyss says 'You don't need to know what happened to them. If they won't play with me, then they cannot play with anyone! That's only [fair]!'\nYou say, 'Fair?'\nAlyss says 'Oh, so now you want to be nice. Okay, I'll tell you what. Bring me some of soft and fluffy fur of those candied [bunnies] and I'll let your friends come out and play. I do not like those nasty rabid rabbit things though. So kill them so that they do not infect the others.'\nYou say, 'What bunnies?'\nAlyss says 'I would get them myself, but that evil witch, Haezra, is too [scary]! She'll cook me in her oven and eat me if I set foot over there!'\nYou say, 'Scary?'\nAlyss says 'It doesn't matter what I am! And don't make fun of me! Now, bring me those little bunnies!'\n_Nearby, you'll see \"an unknown entity\" (you don't actually have to talk to it, but if you do...):_\nYou say, 'Hail, an unknown entity'\nan unknown entity says 'Ti si a eil! Od ton tsurt reh!'\nan unknown entity says 'Uoy era gnillaf otni a part!'\n_(Translation: \"It is a lie! Do not trust her!\"; \"You are falling into a trap!\")_\nRetrieve 4 candied bunny furs 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nKill those foul rabid rabbits 0/10 (Morell's Castle)\n_You'll find rabid rabbits and candied bunnies in the candyland area a short distance away._\n_NOTE: You'll have a banshee called \"Haezra\" spawn when you loot a Candied Bunny Fur. She'll keep spawning in this manner until you kill her while the next step in the task is open to you (at which point she'll stop appearing)._\nDefeat the Haezra 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n_The Haezra spawn is triggered by the looting of a candied bunny fur. She hits for a max ~8,500._\nDeliver 4 candied bunny furs to Alyss 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nAlyss says 'Oooooo! Look how soft! Gimme, gimme, [gimme]!'\nYou say, 'Gimme'\nAlyss says 'What [people]?'\nYou say, 'People?'\nAlyss says 'I don't think I wanna play with you anymore!'\n_She attacks as \"Playful Alyss\"._\nDefeat Playful Alyss 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n_At 50%, she goes inactive and says:_\nPlayful Alyss says 'Hahahaha! It doesn't matter what you do, you know. You will never find them, and I will have you to play with forever!'\n_The four \"Find...\" steps open up. You'll find these NPCs at these locations (for your morellcastle.txt map file):_\nP -1085.0000, -2055.0000, 95.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, tergan\nP -435.0000, -2210.0000, 98.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, nalder\nP 70.0000, -1600.0000, 290.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, thaelin\nP 435.0000, -525.0000, 3.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, saena\n_In-game /locations:_\nTergan: 2055, 1085, 95 (forest)\nNalder: 2210, 435, 98 (forest)\nThaelin: 1600, -70, 290 (shellscale area)\nSaena: 525, -435, 3 (the sand pile connected to the marionette room)\n_WARNING: Four mephits spawn around each of these NPCs and attack right after you hail them. They each hit for a max ~9,000._\n_You can avoid their aggro by doing the hails while invisible._\nFind Tergan Norwath 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Tergan Norwath'\nTergan Norwath says 'You've come for me? Thank you! I must get back! I must get back!'\nKill Alyss' blue imps 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nFind Nalder Rallin 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Nalder Rallin'\nNalder Rallin says 'I told them you'd come for me. I told them! '\nKill Alyss' green imps 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nFind Thaelin Mhorna 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Thaelin Mhorna'\nThaelin Mhorna says 'It's about time! I didn't think I could wait anymore! I... Uh... I guess I'll head back home now. Thanks.'\nKill Alyss' red imps 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nFind Saena Kinde 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Saena Kinde'\nSaena Kinde says 'Braelin sent you, did he? I guess I should be grateful that he sent someone so... capable. I'll have to thank him when I get back. Bye now.'\nKill Alyss' orange imps 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nSpeak to Alyss 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n_WARNING: Speaking to Alyss here will turn her into \"Creepy Alyss\". Also, the four NPCs around her turn into demons and attack along with her. They all summon at 100% health._\nYou say, 'Hail, Alyss'\nAlyss says 'I'll have to thank Braelin! You're the best one yet! Most, so-called adventurers, don't last nearly as long as you have. But, it is time to go now. Let's wish our good friend here a happy goodbye!'\nDefeat Creepy Alyss 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n_Creepy Alyss hits for a max ~12,500 and has a lot of hitpoints. The demons each hit for a max ~8,000. You don't have to kill the demons, however they do not despawn._\n_After defeating Alyss, the unknown entity turns into \"Piper Nasscul\". The task locks._\nSpeak to Piper Nasscul 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Piper Nasscul'\nPiper Nasscul says 'I tried to warn you! Her power kept me from communicatiing more clearly to you earlier. Here's a chest of things she brought with. You're welcome to anything you find inside. I will help you get out of here. Just let me know when you'd like to go [back].'\nCollect your reward from Alyss' chest 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou have defeated Alyss and put an end to her games.\n_Task Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n60 Dream Motes [item=90255]\n_Known Chest Loot [npc=37034] (1 item + 1 spell per task):_\nBlood-Soaked Spellstone\nFaceplate of Inflammatory Nightmares\nLifeweaver's Symbol\nNightmarish Greataxe\nPlaguescale Rod\nSatin Gloves of the Hag\nSimple Chest of Construction\nSoulmage's Leathers\nVenomous Shards of the Damned\nWicked Axe of Deconstruction\nMinor Nebulous Dream Fragment\nLesser Nebulous Dream Fragment\nMedian Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGreater Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGlowing Nebulous Dream Fragment\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
