      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Miragul's Nightmare [zone=755]\n**Who:**\n- Axiyiln [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a feasting raven [npc=36515]\n- a skyshadow raven [npc=36510]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 7 07:47:35 2010\nModified: Sun May 11 15:22:04 2025 | | This is a solo kill task that begins with Axiyiln [npc=36496] in Miragul's Nightmare. It's a shade located beside the house in the northwest part of the first clearing from the zone-in.\nYou say, 'Hail, Axiyiln'\nAxiyiln says '[No].'\nYou say, 'No?'\nAxiyiln says '[Yes].'\nYou say, 'Yes?'\nAxiyiln shivers, sending ripples of cold air about it. 'You heard me. No. Why do you bother me? This is my [existence], stay out of it.'\nYou say, 'What is your existence?'\nAxiyiln says '[Feasting], haunting, occupying, existing.'\nYou say, 'Feasting?'\nAxiyiln says 'The ravens feast. It is what they do. The bodies of the dead forever consumed. You [want] nothing to do with it, else you will become their next meal.'\nYou say, 'I want something to do with it...'\nAxiyiln says 'You are persistant to meddle where you do not belong. If you survive, return to me. My grey existance could use some amusement.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'To Eat or Be Eaten'.\nOne of the many shades in the area would rather you leave it to its pitiful existence, but seems to think you might offer it some amusement if you actually managed to slay some of the ravens that inhabit this nightmare.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill some skyshadow ravens 0/6 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n2\\. Kill some feasting ravens 0/6 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n3\\. Report back to Axiyiln 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Axiyiln'\nAxiyiln considers the report for a moment, a cool hmph flowing out towards you.\n_Rewards:_\nYou gain experience! (about 1 AA worth)\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers has been adjusted by 5.",
