      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Morell's Castle [zone=757]\n**Who:**\n- Havrin [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a shellscale diver [npc=36835]\n- a shellscale hunter [npc=36833]\n- a shellscale occultist [npc=36832]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 10 04:09:21 2010\nModified: Fri Dec 10 04:29:09 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Havrin in Morell's Castle. He's a satyr located at the entrance to the shellscale area in the northeast part of the forest._\n_Note: Two roaming mobs (including a see invis daydream) path into the room he's in._\nYou say, 'Hail, Havrin'\nHavrin says 'Hail and well met, adventurer. Enjoying your romp through the stuff dreams are made of? Well, I do have some things to [keep you occupied], if you so wish.'\nYou say, 'Yes, keep me occupied...'\nHavrin says 'I figured you might enjoy that. There are two issues of note that you might find relaxing as you dream, away from the slaughter of the waking world. The native flora and fauna are [out of control] in population. Unfortunately, you could say the same for the [shellscales], which are intent on encroaching on our area.'\nYou say, 'What about the shellscales?'\nHavrin says 'They are not native to the green fields outside, however they have grown in number so much that they are trying to depart the great tree. This is not where they belong. If you shall [fight them] back, they will probably cease their movements.'\nYou say, 'I'll fight them'\nHavrin says 'You're very honorable. Please report back to me on your progress when you get a chance.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Clearing the Waterways'.\n\n---\n\nKill shellscale divers 0/6 (Morell's Castle)\nKill shellscale hunters 0/3 (Morell's Castle)\nKill shellscale occultists 0/3 (Morell's Castle)\nReport back to Havrin 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Havrin'\nHavrin says, 'Done already? You're a quick one, and a helpful one, at that. Please return to me later, and I may have more for you to do.'\n_Task rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
