      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Morell's Castle [zone=757]\n**Who:**\n- Sluggurth [npc=36813]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Candy Assortment [item=94139]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a candy hoarder [npc=36334]\n- a crazed candy hoarder [npc=36335]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 10 04:09:25 2010\nModified: Wed Jun 22 15:27:23 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Sluggurth in Morell's Castle. He's a goblin located in the southwestern corner of the candyland area._\n_Note: A KOS gingerbread man roams nearby._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sluggurth'\nSluggurth says 'Shhh, keep your voice down; I cannot be SEEN. I need you to do me a [favor], big favor.'\nYou say, 'What favor?'\nSluggurth says 'I make candies, lots of candies. Different candies than the ones here. I need you to [bring me samples] of the candies here from the little candy hoarders, and I will do my best to repay you.'\nYou say, 'I'll bring you samples'\nSluggurth says 'That's a good \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Bring them to me. Do not tell anyone I spoke to you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Candy Caper'.\n\n---\n\nKill some candy hoarders and search their corpses 0/10 (Morell's Castle)\nLoot 4 Candy Assortments 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nDeliver 4 Candy Assortments to Sluggurth 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\n_Task rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
