      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\n**Who:**\n- Fisherman Ludwigvon [npc=38389]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a great white shark - Sarith [npc=38447]\n- a hammerhead shark - Sarith - 1 [npc=38446]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 23:32:54 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Fisherman Ludwigvon in Sarith (located at -755, -165, -4 along the dock in the southeastern part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- Level 91\n\\- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Fisherman Ludwigvon'\nFisherman Ludwigvon says, in Alaran, 'Not another [pole]!'\nYou say, 'What happened to your pole?'\nFisherman Ludwigvon says, in Alaran, 'These damned sharks have been snapping my fishing poles whenever I've tried to fish. Since the arrival of the Orator, hordes of sharks have been swarming into our city state. I could really [use some help] here.'\nYou say, 'Use some help? OK!'\nFisherman Ludwigvon says, in Alaran, 'Excellent! I need you to kill the sharks for me. They're all over the water of Sarith, just watch out for the giant sea creatures while you're out there.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sharks in the Water'.\nFisherman Ludwigvon is having trouble fishing because the sharks are breaking their fishing poles. You've been asked to kill the sharks.\n\n---\n\nKill 4 great white sharks 0/4 (Sarith)\nKill 4 hammerhead sharks 0/4 (Sarith)\nSpeak with Fisherman Ludwigvon 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fisherman Ludwigvon'\nThe number of sharks has been reduced.\n_Rewards:_\n123pp 3gp 3sp 3cp\nExperience",
