      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\n**Who:**\n- Chef Rolland [npc=38390]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an Orator`s army soldier [npc=38469]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 23:33:29 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Chef Rolland in Sarith (located at 100, -450, -1 -- inside a building: from inside the front gate, head east -- it's the second building on your left)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- Level 91\n\\- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Chef Rolland'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'I'm so busy holding down the fort here \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, but I want to help the [rebels] out! Would you mind going out and fishing up what I need to prepare a proper meal for them? If you could, I've got a [list] and could make it worth your time!'\nYou say, 'What rebels?'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'The rebels are high in spirit, but not strong enough to take out the [Orator]. This may very likely be their last meal.'\nYou say, 'The orator?'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'Orator's army is from the City of Bronze. The rebels are outnumbered and underpowered compared to them. They could really [use your hand].'\nYou say, 'Use my hand?'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'I'm just a simple chef with pots and pans, but I'm sure getting rid of a few of Orator`s soldiers can help with the rebel's effort. Let no one know I sent you though.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Pots and Pans Fighter'.\nChef Rolland wishes to prepare a special meal for the Sarith rebels. Seeing how the strength of the Orator's army greatly exceeded the rebels, you've been asked to weaken their force by killing several soldiers. Chef Rolland wished to remain anonymous in this.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 Orator`s Army Soldiers 0/10 (Sarith)\n_Upon the last death, you see:_\nThe Orator`s army has been weakened.\n_This completes the task._\n_Rewards:_\n61pp 6gp 6sp 7cp\nExperience",
