      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\n**Who:**\n- Kayquon [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Sarith guardsman [npc=38463]\n- a Sarith guardsman veteran [npc=38480]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 23:34:29 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Kayquon in Sarith (located at 615, 655, -2 -- in the zone-in area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- Level 91\n\\- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Kayquon'\nKayquon says, in Alaran, 'My pal was taken [prisoner] by the Orator, I need to get in [town] to save ali!'\nYou say, 'Prisoner?'\nKayquon says, in Alaran, 'When the Orator took our city over, our city guard tried to stop them. We were vastly outnumbered by their army. Those that weren't killed were taken to [jail] or forced to join the Orator.'\nYou say, 'What jail?'\nKayquon says, in Alaran, 'I need to sneak into the jail to save my pal, al saved me once. I'm afraid the jail is heavily guarded by the Sarith guardsmen. I need you to [take out] as many of them as you can for me.'\nYou say, 'I'll take out the guards'\nKayquon says, in Alaran, 'Excellent! I'll make the move into the jail once you've taken them out!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Clearing the Path - Guardsmen'.\nKayquon is trying to sneak into the prison, but it is heavily guarded by Sarith's guardsmen. You've been asked to take out as many guardsmen as you can to clear the path for Kayquon.\n\n---\n\nKill 7 Sarith guardsmen 0/7 (Sarith, City of Tides)\n_Upon the last death, you see:_\nThe path to the prison has been cleared for Kayquon.\n_This completes the task._\n\n---\n\n_Reward:_\n123 pp, 3gp, 3sp, 3cp\nExperience",
