      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\n**Who:**\n- Captain Lonz Duran [npc=38385]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 70\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Makeshift Firebomb [item=99975]\n- Poisoned Soup [item=99964]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Captain Ullas [npc=38428]\n- Commander Marrien Kavus [npc=38387]\n- Falthen Berros [ _Quests_]\n- a great white shark - Sarith [npc=38447]\n- a hammerhead shark - Sarith - 1 [npc=38446]\n- a large squid [npc=38445]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 18 21:55:01 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Captain Lonz Duran in Sarith (found on board a ship in the northeast part of the dock area at about -70, -1055, -10)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Lonz Duran'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'Ahoy there, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Sorry, I can't take passengers anywhere. Not with the seas [a mess] as they are right now, with this Prexus attacking, and the little Kedge creatures following it in the robes, and the Hadal making a ruckus over at Rubak Oseka. All this is way out of my league. So what can I do for you?'\nYou say, 'A mess?'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'Yer damned right it's a mess! These City of Bronze invaders, these so-called Orator's soldiers, are the crux of the problem. Say, you're just the person to help me out! If I were to oppose Vyers outright, I'd be killed. But I think you and me together can make some trouble for them. I have a plan I got ready to put into action, but to be honest I can't do it myself. Someone like you, however, could. What do you say? Let me know when you want the details.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Captain's Orders'.\nCaptain Duran has enlisted your help in aiding Sarith by defeating sea creatures and impairing the Orator's army.\n\n---\n\nChat with Captain Lonz Duran 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Lonz Duran'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'I knew you had fire in you when I met you. And we need some of that passion. First things first though, these sea creatures are making it impossible to do anything. Those fishmen called Kedge have been killing some of them, but they're more than busy with the Hadal. Think you could kill a few of them? Then we can move on to more important things.'\nKill some of the squid serving High Priest Vyers 0/2 (Sarith)\nKill some of the sharks serving High Priest Vyers 0/2 (Sarith)\n_The squids and sharks are found in the water in the east part of the zone. They hit for a max ~11,500 and have typical hps for trash mobs._\nTalk to Captain Lonz Duran 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Lonz Duran'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'Thanks for cleanifg those monster-fish out. Now we'll start dealing with the Orator's army. I can't think of a proper way to get at many of the high ranking commanders, except one. Captain Ullas stays on alir room and orders soup delivered to alir room every night while al's staying at Falthen Berros' inn. I talked with Falthen, and al managed to get a good poison, but al can't deliver it himself. Al's afraid of the consequences. That's why we need someone like you. Go talk to Falthen.'\nGet the poison soup from Falthen Berros, the Innkeeper 0/1 (Sarith)\n_Falthen is in a building at location -115, -340, -2 (near the city's front gates)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Falthen Berros'\nFalthen Berros says, in Alaran, 'Here, everything is all ready. Please, be quiet. I can't risk this being traced back to me. That soldier is a terror. Good luck. Thank you for helping our city.'\n_You received \"Poisoned Soup\"._\nServe the poison soup to Captain Ullas in their inn room 0/1 (Sarith)\n_Ullas spawns in the same building._\nCaptain Ullas says, in Alaran, 'Mmm, this soup is delicious as always. Urk. Wait, what's that? I feel sick.'\n_The Captain keels over._\nTell Captain Lonz Duran what happened 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Lonz Duran'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'That should keep Captain Ullas out of our way for a nice, long time. I'm sorry if that task offended you, but it's important to do what must be done. Now, we'll be playing with fire. The rebels have been so kind as to offer me access to a few of their homemade firebombs. Could you go talk to Marrien at the drydocks? Marrien will have some key locations that'll do the most damage.'\nAcquire a few firebombs from Marrien Kavus, the Rebel Commander 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Commander Marrien Kavus'\nCommander Marrien Kavus says, in Alaran, 'Glad to see you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! I have the firebombs the old Captain asked me to get together. I almost wish I could go with you. Now, if I were you, I'd hit the barracks, the city plaza, and the library. Be careful of the citizens. Oh, and don't worry about burning the books. They're magically protected. You'll be burning up the damned priests and battlemages from the City or Bronze instaad.'\n_You receive 3x \"Makeshift Firebomb\"._\nFirebomb the Sarith city plaza 0/1 (Sarith)\nFirebomb the guard barracks 0/1 (Sarith)\nFirebomb the lighthouse library 0/1 (Sarith)\n_The above three steps updates automatically as you approach the three locations:_\n\\- The plaza, as you approach the large building in the zone's far southwest (-935, 350, -3).\n\\- The barracks, in the building northeast of Guard Captain Reles' building (-7, 190, -5).\n\\- The lighthouse library, inside the base of the lighthouse along the east dock area (-525, -165, -3).\nInform Captain Lonz Duran of the results 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Lonz Duran'\nCaptain Lonz Duran says, in Alaran, 'I'm really grateful for what you've done, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. My home means everything to me. It's my favorite thing next to my ship and the sea. It's not right that the City of Bronze invaded and Vyers is lording alir Oseka-powers over us, it's unsettling to know the creature called Prexus will destroy this city to get at Vyers, and it isn't fair you have to clean up our messes. But I appreciate it. Take care. You're always welcome on my ship.'\nYou've cleared out the seas of dangerous creatures and firebombed the Orator's forces.\n_Rewards:_\n123 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Time and Tides\n- Eltarki's Diary - Time and Tides [item=98630]",
    },
