      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Braxi Keeper Yubai [npc=38619]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Binaesa Venom Sac [item=99812]\n- Braxi Stomach [item=99848]\n- Filthy Ape Liver [item=99553]\n- Mortar and Pestle [item=99551]\n- Sample of Selyrah Saliva [item=99816]\n- Weedkiller [item=99868]\n- Wyvern Scent Gland [item=99552]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a deadly bristlepoint weed [npc=38635]\n- a filthy ape [npc=38694]\n- a foul bristlepoint weed [npc=38638]\n- a giant binaesa [npc=38682]\n- a poisonous bristlepoint weed [npc=38636]\n- a selyrah forestwalker [npc=38655]\n- a sick braxi [npc=38657]\n- a wilting bristlepoint weed [npc=38637]\n- a wyvern scent tracker [npc=38668]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 18:56:54 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with Braxi Keeper Yubai in the Beasts' Domain, located at -850, -95, -6 (southeastern part of the upper-third of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Braxi Keeper Yubai'\nBraxi Keeper Yubai says, in Alaran, 'What do you want, outsider? Your influence on the wilderness worries me. In fact, I think you and your kind are to blame for the braxi becoming [sick].'\nYou say, 'Sick?'\nBraxi Keeper Yubai says, in Alaran, 'Some of the braxi in the wilderness have become ill, and I am unable to investigate further, but I think it has something to do with the arrival of your kind. If the sickness continues to spread, we will have no braxi to tame as mounts. As this is most likely your fault, you will [investigate] the illness, or you can leave and stay out of my sight.'\nYou say, 'I'll investigate'\nBraxi Keeper Yubai says, in Alaran, 'Find one of the sick braxi and after you have slain it, take its stomach. Perhaps we can see if it is something they have been eating that is making them ill.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Braxi Trouble'.\nSomething in the wilderness is making the braxi ill. Braxi Keeper Yubai blames outsiders for the sickness. You have agreed to track down the true cause.\nObtain a braxi stomach from a sick braxi.\n\n---\n\nObtain a Braxi Stomach from a sick braxi 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_\"a sick braxi\" is found mostly in the south-southwestern area of the zone's upper-third. It drops the stomach very commonly (if not 100%)._\nDeliver the Braxi Stomach to Braxi Keeper Yubai 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nBraxi Keeper Yubai takes the stomach from you and slices it open. A nauseating stench overcomes you as bits of undigested plant matter pour from the stomach. Yubai takes some of the plany matter and sniffs it. 'I do not recognize this plant. It is foreign to me. Your kind must have introduced this plant species to our wilderness. I was right to cast judgement upon you. The spread of this foreign plant must be stopped. We will need to make some [weed killer]. Also, if you happen to lose your mortar and pestle, just let me know, and I can [give] you a new one.'\nCollect a Binaesa Venom Sac 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect a Wyvern Scent Gland 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect a Sample of Selyrah Saliva 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect a Filthy Ape Liver 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Task Window Says:_ It appears that a plant, foreign to the wilderness has been introduced to the ecosystem and is making the braxi sick. You recognize this plant from Antonica. It is a common weed known as Bristlepoint. Yubai has asked you to collect a binaesa venom sac, wyvern scent gland, a sample of selyrah saliva, and a filthy ape liver.\n_The above four items are common drops from the said mob types (all found throughout the upper half of the zone), and may be looted ahead of time._\nUse the mortar and pestle and create the weedkiller 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_NOTE: This combine must be performed in the Beasts' Domain. This step will not update if you do it in any other zone._\n_Combine the four items in the container to produce 4x \"Weedkiller\"._\nGive a dose of the weed killer to a wilting bristlepoint weed 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nFound at -3161, +316.\nGive a dose of the weed killer to a poisonous bristlepoint weed 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nFound at -2551, -422.\nGive a dose of the weed killer to a foul bristlepoint weed 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nFound at -2996, -426.\nGive a dose of the weed killer to a deadly bristlepoint weed 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nFound at -3049, -108.\nThe weeds appear as flowers on the floor of the zone (known to spawn in the zone's upper and middle sections). Their spawn table seems to be random, so just roam around until you've come across and handed the Weedkiller into all four types.\nSpeak with Braxi Keeper Yubai 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Braxi Keeper Yubai'\nBraxi Keeper Yubai says, in Alaran, 'Perhaps I can forgive you and your kind for what has happened. Thank you. I was planning on trading this to the Domain clan for some supplies, but I think you should have it for helping.'\n_Rewards:_\n273 platinum\nExperience - 18% to 19% in level 97\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]",
    },
