      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Mea Treg [npc=38606]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 94\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Beast Carcass [item=99788]\n- Bloodbeet [item=99550]\n- Windberries [item=99405]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a domain hunter [npc=38676]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #2: A Question of Integrity [quest=5441]\n- Beasts' Domain #3: Message of Faith [quest=5442]\n- Beasts' Domain #4: Trial of the Beast [quest=5443]\n- Beasts' Domain #5: One to Lead Them [quest=5444]\n- Pups of War [quest=5445]\n- The King of the Beasts [quest=5446]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:21:56 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the first in a series of five; a solo task that begins with Mea Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at 315, 2800, 10 (far northwestern part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Mea Treg'\nMea Treg nods to acknowledge your presence, 'I see you there. Why is it that your people need to be acknowledged so often? You should come to me with something specific to say, or not come to me at all. If you need something of me, tell me. If I need something of you, I will tell you, if you are [willing].'\nYou say, 'I'm willing'\nMea Treg looks at you questioningly, 'So you say. Well then, we need food. My people don't eat your food. It has been known to make us ill. We need food from out there.' Mea points out into the forest. 'If you want to help us, go out there and gather some for us. This is no simple thing. The Domain is deadly, and you don't know our ways. If you return, I will be surprised.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Beasts for the Stew'.\nGather some food for Mea's tribe and beware of any domain hunters that may be hunting nearby.\n\n---\n\nHunt the creature of Beasts' Domain and collect some carcasses 0/4 (Beasts' Domain)\n_These are dropped by the animal creatures of the Beasts' Domain, and are prelootable._\nDefeat any domain hunters that stand in your way! 0/4 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Kill any four \"a domain hunter\" (found throughout the northern part of the zone). Note: While the animals can be safely kited, the domain hunters summon when damaged._\nCollect some Windberries from the jungle floor 0/6 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect some Bloodbeets from the jungle floor 0/6 (Beasts' Domain)\n_The above items are ground spawns throughout the northwestern and north-central part of the zone (appear as small green and small red items on the ground)._\nDeliver the carcasses to Mea Treg 0/4 (Beasts' Domain)\nDeliver the Windberries to Mea Treg 0/6 (Beasts' Domain)\nDeliver the Bloodbeets to Mea Treg 0/6 (Beasts' Domain)\n( _There is no turn-in dialogue._)\n_Rewards:_\n246 platinum\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n_NOTE: Druids also receive their Beasts' Domain port spell set._\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]\n- Scroll: Circle of the Domain [item=99978]\n- Scroll: Ring of the Domain [item=99977]\n- Scroll: Zephyr: Beasts' Domain [item=99979]",
    },
