      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Mea Treg [npc=38606]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Wyvern Skull [item=99845]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #1: Beasts for the Stew [quest=5440]\n- Beasts' Domain #3: Message of Faith [quest=5442]\n- Beasts' Domain #4: Trial of the Beast [quest=5443]\n- Beasts' Domain #5: One to Lead Them [quest=5444]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:22:04 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is task is the second in a series of five; it's a shared task that can be obtained solo. It begins with Mea Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at 315, 2800, 10 (far northwestern part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Beasts for the Stew\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Mea Treg'\nMea Treg says, in Alaran, 'You are not weak. I will consider trusting you. I need you to [find] a Domain clansman for me. His name is Kar, and he could be anywhere in the jungle.'\nYou say, 'I'll find him!'\nMea Treg says, in Alaran, 'Find Kar and ask him about the razor teeth and the stone skull. I need to know about these things, and he is the one best suited to provide the answers I need.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Question of Intergrity'.\nMea Treg has asked you to seek out Kar of the Domain Clan and ask about the razor teeth and stone skull. You are unsure why you are to ask him this. Is this perhaps some sort of test?\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Kar 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Find Kar of the Domain Clan at about -2900, 2600, -7 (southwestern part of the zone's middle section)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kar of the Domain Clan'\nKar of the Domain Clan says, in Alaran, 'Have you come to tease me about the wyvern sinking its teeth into my skull? Of course you have. I tire of this childish teasing. You're lucky I don't run my spear through your heart. I think however, that you can be of use to me. Make amends for your insult by bringing me the skull of a wyvern. Only a wyvern skull will do. Yes. Bring one to me.'\nLoot a Wyvern Skull from a Wyvern 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_As you may have guessed, these drop from wyverns (known to drop off any mob in the zone with \"wyvern\" in its name)._\nGive the Wyvern Skull to Kar 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nKar of the Domain Clan says, in Alaran, 'Something is in the bushes nearby. I think it is coming our way. I know that smell. That's Etani Treg.'\nEtani Treg says, 'Such strange company you keep, Kar.'\nReturn to Mea Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Rewards:_\n205 platinum\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]",
    },
