      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Mea Treg [npc=38606]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bamboo Shoot [item=99407]\n- Giant Leaf [item=99406]\n- Message from Mea [item=99768]\n- Windberries [item=99405]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Elder Giaborn [npc=38625]\n- Elder Hilnaah [npc=38623]\n- Elder Poanag [npc=38624]\n- Etani Treg [ _Quests_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #1: Beasts for the Stew [quest=5440]\n- Beasts' Domain #2: A Question of Integrity [quest=5441]\n- Beasts' Domain #4: Trial of the Beast [quest=5443]\n- Beasts' Domain #5: One to Lead Them [quest=5444]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:22:13 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of five; a solo task that begins with Mea Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at 315, 2800, 10 (far northwestern part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Beasts for the Stew\"\n\\- Completion of \"A Question of Integrity\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Mea Treg'\nMea Treg glares it you. 'Always meaningless greetings from you. You have proven yourself brave enough, it seems. I don't know that your values match mine or those of my people, but perhaps that doesn't matter, as long as you remain willing to [help] us.'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nMea Treg says, in Alaran, 'I have a favor to ask of you. My people can't or won't enter the forest again, and I need someone to carry a [message] for me.'\n_You receive 3x \"Message from Mea\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Message of Faith'.\nMea disagrees with the religious views of the domain clan and subsequently decided to leave and form a new clan. Mea has asked you to deliver a message to some Elders of the Domain clan to perhaps persuade them to change their views.\nYou say, 'What about this message?'\nMea Treg says, in Alaran, 'I believe that the way our people worship Kolos is wrong. I don't think that we reed to be beasts in order to show our faith. We have become feral monsters, and such monsters have no ability to worship what they are. In order to be able to worship something, you have to be separate from that thing. Somehow we need to make them understand this. I need you to deliver some messages for me.'\n\n---\n\nDeliver Mea's message to Elder Giaborn of the Domain clan 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_The three elders are found in the eastern part of the upper section of the zone, in a camp of hunters at about -45, -380. Be advised there are several KOS NPCs in their proximity._\nElder Giaborn says, in Alaran, 'I have no need for Mea's rhetoric. Begone, outsider.'\nDeliver Mea's message to Elder Hilnaah of the Domain clan 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nElder Hilnaah says, in Alaran, 'Mea is a traitor to the Domain clan. I will not be swayed by her ramblings.'\nDeliver Mea's message to Elder Poanag of the Domain clan 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nElder Poanag says, in Alaran, 'What does Mea know about Kolos? She is a traitor and a blasphemer.'\nSpeak with Etani Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'Why to you preach Mea's religion to a people you do not know? Who are you to say that the ways of the Domain clan are wrong? You should not judge my people until you have lived the life of the clan. You should try to live for a day or two in the forest. Let us just see how you can survive. Collect enough windberries and beast flesh to survive on for one day. Next gather enough materials to build a shelter. I will not ask you to build the shelter; just bring the materials back to me.'\n_This opens up the next four steps:_\nCollect Windberries from the forest floor 0/5 (Beasts' Domain)\nKill the beasts of the forest and scavenge some of their flesh 0/4 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect some Giant Leafs from the forest floor 0/3 (Beasts' Domain)\nCollect some Bamboo Chutes from the forest floor 0/3 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Task Window Says:_ Collect enough Windberries Beast Flesh _(sic)_ to survive on for one day. The Windberries grow on the forest floor. Etani Treg would also like you to collect some Large Leafs and Bamboo Chutes from the forest floor to prove that you can gather adequate materials to build a shelter.\n_As in the previous task, windberries are known to spawn throughout the northern part of the zone (ground spawn). The \"kill\" step updates randomly as you kill creatures in the zone (there are no items involved). The Giant Leafs and Bamboo Chutes are ground spawns found throughout the northern part of the zone._\nGive the Palm Fronds to Etani Treg 0/3 (Beasts's Domain)\nGive the Bamboo Chutes to Etani Treg 0/3 (Beasts's Domain)\nSpeak with Etani Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'Perhaps you are not as ignorant of the ways of the forest as I thought you were. However, my people and I will not adopt Mea's religious views.'\nSpeak with Mea Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mea Treg'\nMea Treg says, in Alaran, 'It is as I thought. They are too ignorant and beast-like to listen to reason.'\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n273 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]",
    },
