      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Etani Treg [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dark Ape's Head [item=100033]\n- Grall's Lost Spear [item=99986]\n- Ripclaw Raptor Head [item=100002]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a ripclaw raptor [npc=38660]\n- great dark ape [npc=38680]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #1: Beasts for the Stew [quest=5440]\n- Beasts' Domain #2: A Question of Integrity [quest=5441]\n- Beasts' Domain #3: Message of Faith [quest=5442]\n- Beasts' Domain #5: One to Lead Them [quest=5444]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:22:21 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the fourth in a series of five; a solo task that begins with Etani Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at -170, -380, -10 (eastern part of upper section of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Beasts for the Stew\"\n\\- Completion of \"A Question of Integrity\"\n\\- Completion of \"Message of Faith\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'You have proven something to me, but not very much. At least you got here alive. But you haven't done enough. If you really want me to trust you, then you will have to. . . you will have to pass our trials, and you can't possibly survive them. It you are [willing to die], then at least you will die in the proper fashion.'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to die...'\nEtani Treg looks surprised. 'You seem certain. That also makes you seem foolish. Very well. You are to seek out a vicious beast known as a ripclaw raptor and obtain its head. One of our hunters, Grall, also thought he was brave and decided go hunt for ripclaws. He never returned. If you find his spear, return it to me. Lastly, you are to hunt down the great dark ape and obtain its head. I shall burn a sprig of sweetleaf on your pyre, as I suspect you will not return to me.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Trial of the Beast'.\nEtani Treg has a trial for you to undertake before he fully trusts your capabilities.\nFind a Ripclaw Raptor and obtain its head. Grall, a member of the Domain clan set off long ago to hunt the Ripclaw Raptors. He never returned. See if you can find his lost spear.\n\n---\n\nFind the Ripclaw Raptors' lair and obtain one of their heads 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_The Ripclaw raptors can be found in the east-central part of the zone's middle section._\nFind Grall's lost spear. 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_This is a ground spawn in the middle of the raptor camp._\nGive the Ripclaw Raptor Head to Etani Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nGive Grall's lost spear to Etani Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nFind the great dark ape and obtain its head 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Task Window Says:_ You are to hunt the might beast known as the great dark ape and obtain its head.\n_The great dark ape spawns in the north-northeastern part of the zone's middle section._\nGive the great dark ape's head to Etani Treg. 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n( _There is no turn-in dialogue._)\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n205 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]",
    },
