      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Etani Treg [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- A Dowry Kit [item=100039]\n- Bloodbeet [item=99550]\n- Chunk of Obsidian [item=99558]\n- Clear Ocean Quartz [item=99560]\n- Dowry for Yurv [item=100043]\n- Grendlaen Scent Gland [item=99843]\n- Raptor Bone [item=99556]\n- Spear Making Kit [item=99559]\n- Strong Vine [item=99557]\n- Warleader's Spear [item=100036]\n- Windberries [item=99405]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bale [npc=38630]\n- Breinne [npc=38626]\n- Klar [npc=38627]\n- Supplies [npc=38631]\n- Wart [npc=38628]\n- Yurv [npc=38629]\n- a filthy ape [npc=38694]\n- a grendlaen scent tracker [npc=39204]\n- a hungry raptor [npc=38670]\n- a lashtail crocodile [npc=38641]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #1: Beasts for the Stew [quest=5440]\n- Beasts' Domain #2: A Question of Integrity [quest=5441]\n- Beasts' Domain #3: Message of Faith [quest=5442]\n- Beasts' Domain #4: Trial of the Beast [quest=5443]\n- Pups of War [quest=5445]\n- The King of the Beasts [quest=5446]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:22:33 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the fifth in a series of five; a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Etani Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at -168, -389 in the northeastern part of the zone._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Beasts for the Stew\"\n\\- Completion of \"A Question of Integrity\"\n\\- Completion of \"Message of Faith\"\n\\- Completion of \"Trial of the Beast\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'You return. Perheps tyat is yood. I need an agent that might be able to speak with other clan leaders. My own people would be attacked on sight. You cou d approach the others more easily. Will you [speak to them] on my behalf?'\nYou say, 'I'll speak to them'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'That is good. Here is what I need you to do for me. Bale is the youngest of the Domain clan leaders but al lacks the status to rule more than alis own small clan. I plan on making Bale my warleader. Al will need a proper symbol of that office though. There is a very old tradition among my people of granting a finely crafted warspear to all new warleaders. Make one and offer it to Bale. If you have [lost] your spear making kit, let me know, and I will give you another one.'\n_You receive a 3-slot container called \"Spear Making Kit\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'One To Lead Them'.\nEtani Treg wishes to become the leader of all the clans in the Domain. To do so, Etani Treg needs the backing of the four most powerful clan leaders. You will need to convince them that having Etani Treg lead them to the control of the Domain is better than things as they are. Killing them will do nothing to help. If they are to be killed Etani Treg must do it aleself.\nObtain a Raptor Bone, a Strong Vine, and a Chunk of Obsidian. The apes might possess a strong vine, and the crocodiles have been known to swallow obsidian. Once you have these items, use the spear making kit to construct a Warleader's Spear. If you lose your Spear Making Kit, let Etani know you've lost it so Etani can give you a new one.\n\n---\n\nAssemble the Warleader's Spear 0/1 (ALL)\n_Combine the Raptor Bone, the Strong Vine, and the Chunk of Obsidian to produce the Warleader's Spear._\nGive the Warleader's Spear to Bale 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Bale is located in the southestern part of the upper-third of the zone (a little ways west of Braxi Keeper Yubai)._\nBale says, in Alaran, 'You saw this is from Etani Treg? Me be warbeeder of the Domain clan? Tell Etani Treg I accept!'\nTell Etani Treg that Bale has accepted the offer of warleader 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'Bale has accepted my offer? That is most fortunate. Next, you will be speaking to Yurv. Yurv is clever and will be difficult to sway. All the clans know of Mea's betrayal. I am willing to offer myself to Yurv. Yurv will require some serious proof of my willingness in the form of a dowry. Collect the items for the dowry and present it to Yurv. If you lose your dowry kit and [need] another one, let me know.'\n_You receive \"A Dowry Kit\"._\nAssemble a dowry for Yurv 0/1 (ALL)\n_Task Window Says:_ Obtain two Clear Ocean Quartz, two Windberries, and two Bloodbeets. The quartz can be found on the ocean floor in Sarith, near the temple of Rubak Oseka. The Windberries and Bloodbeets grow on the wildness floor of the Beasts' Domain.\n_Combine the items to create \"Dowry for Yurv\"._\nGive the dowry to Yurv 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Yurv is located at -1065, 1010, 25 (in the south-central part of the upper-third of the zone)._\nYurv says, in Alaran, 'Etani Treg is a clever one. Tell Etani Treg that I accept alis offer.'\nTell Etani Treg that Yurv has accepted the dowry 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'Yurv accepted the dowry? Good. Now we must convince Wart to join my side. This, I fear will not be so easy. Wart is an ugly, nasty individual. Al is rumored to possess magical powers that rival most and rules alis clan by fear. Wart will need to be tricked into joining my side, and I just so happen to have a plan. Gather a scent gland from a Grendlaen. Put it inside the supplies in Wart's camp. This should bring Grendlean from all over to Wart's camp. You can then conveniently step in and offer to help get rid of the Grendlaens, only if Wart agrees to join my side that is.'\nPlace a grendlaen scent gland inside some supplies at Wart's camp 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Loot the scent gland from any grendlaen and give it to \"Supplies\" in Wart's camp (located in the north-northeastern part of the zone's middle-third -- -1600, 600, -12)._\nSpeak to Wart 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_NOTE: The task locks upon hail._\nYou say, 'Hail, Wart'\nWart says, in Alaran, 'Etani Treg wants me to join alis clan? I have no time for such things! Can you not see that my camp is being overrun by [grendlaens]?'\nYou say, 'I'll get rid of those grendlaens for you, if...'\nWart says, in Alaran, 'You will get rid of the grendlaens if I join Etani Treg's clan? Ok, ok! Just get rid of them before they tear us all to shreds!'\nKill the grendlaens that have come to Wart's camp 0/3 (Beasts' Domain)\n_The grendlaens (which do NOT auto-aggro and are splittable) hit for max ~10,000; and are rootable and stunnable (but NOT mezzable)._\n_Note that if you leave them idle for too long, they may despawn._\nLet Etani Treg know that Wart has accepted the offer 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Etani Treg'\nEtani Treg says, in Alaran, 'So my plan worked on Wart? That was almost too easy. It is good al agreed to join. There is one more clan leader you must speak with. Klar is old and wise and has ruled alis clan for a very long time. The only thing I can think of that might persuade Klar to join me is the promise of a prolonged life. I believe that those that worship the goddess Lunanyn might know of such a thing.'\nSpeak to Klar 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Klar spawns at about -2325, 1200, -9 (central part of the zone's middle section)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Klar'\nKlar says, in Alaran, 'Etani Treg wishes for me to join alis clan? I am not interested. Actually, if you care to help me obtain something, I might reconsider. A follower of Lunanyn named Breinne has been seen wandering the southern parts of the wilds. I hear alis may be able to know how to make a potion of youth. If you obtain such a potion, return it to me, and I will agree to join Etani Treg.'\nSpeak with Breinne, a follower of Lunanyn 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Breinne can be found roaming around the lake area in the far southeastern part of the zone (about -5600, -550, -2)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Breinne'\nBreinne says, in Alaran, 'You seek a potion of youth? If there were such a thing, don't you think I would use it for myself?'\nTell Etani Treg of your failure 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Task Window Says:_ You have failed in getting Klar to join Etani Treg's side. Let Etani Treg know of your failure.\nEtani Treg was unhappy at your failure to get agreement from all of the clan leaders, but does not seem surprised.\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n273 platinum\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]",
    },
