      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Kalda Treg [npc=38607]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Beasts' Domain: King of the Beasts [zone=826]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kalda Treg [npc=39823]\n- King of the Beasts [npc=38811]\n- a beast [npc=39826]\n- a hunter [npc=39824]\n- a moss covered trunk [npc=38810]\n- a trailblazer [npc=39825]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Beasts' Domain #1: Beasts for the Stew [quest=5440]\n- Beasts' Domain #2: A Question of Integrity [quest=5441]\n- Beasts' Domain #3: Message of Faith [quest=5442]\n- Beasts' Domain #4: Trial of the Beast [quest=5443]\n- Beasts' Domain #5: One to Lead Them [quest=5444]\n- Pups of War [quest=5445]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:24:20 2011\nModified: Fri Feb 20 05:04:35 2026 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n**NOTE: This is the quest entry for the group version of \"King of the Beasts\". See this quest entry [quest=5539] for the raid version.**\n\n---\n\n_This group mission begins with Kalda Treg in the Beasts' Domain, located at 315, 2800, 10 (far northwestern part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Beasts for the Stew\"\n\\- Completion of \"A Question of Integrity\"\n\\- Completion of \"Message of Faith\"\n\\- Completion of \"Pups of War\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Kalda Treg'\nKalda Treg says, in Alaran, 'Do you know how this great land works? The Domain has a King. A King of Beasts. A King that takes power from the echo of Kolos in these lands. It takes a powerful creature to dethrone the current beast, and when it does it grows even stronger. However, the current King has reigned too long. And he drains the power of the Domain, rather than using it. We need your help to defeat him, as we are not capable alone. If you agree, there are two ways we can deal with this threat: a small [group] to attack by stealth, or a large group to [assault] the King directly.'\nYou say, 'A small group'\n_Without pre-requisites:_\nKalda Treg says, in Alaran, 'It does not seem right at this moment. We need more time to prepare. Continue to assist Mea Treg, and then we can talk.'\n_With pre-requisites:_\nKalda Treg says, in Alaran, 'That might be best. I will gather a few hunters. Keep your own group small and agile. Let me know when you are [ready].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'King of the Beasts'.\nThe King of the Beasts has reigned for over a decade and must be deposed. The hunters of the Beasts' Domain have requested help.\nTalk to Kalda and lead the hunters to victory.\nDefeat the King of the Beasts. The creature must be prevented from draining the Domain.\n\n---\n\nTalk to Kalda Treg 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Hailing Kalda Treg triggers the event, so don't hail Kalda until ready._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kalda Treg'\nKalda Treg shouts, 'Be wary! The strongest opponent of the King will draw powers from the Domain. It will empower you, but shortly after it will start to control you! Be agile! Now, the beast must be destroyed! Attack!'\nThere appears to be a storm overhead.\nChallenge the King of the Beasts 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\n_Kalda Treg and the hunters charge the King of the Beasts and assist you in attacking._\n_The King hits for a max ~12,500 and has several AEs:_\nEntangling Domain Vines: Single Target, Chromatic (-900)\n1: Root\nKing's Charge: PB AE 20', (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 50347\nKing's Quake: PB AE 100', (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 36763\n2: Stun (0.30 sec)\nKing's Roar: PB AE 100', (0)\n1: Inhibit Melee Attacks by 1%\n2: Silence\nKing's Slam: Single Target, (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 58346\nKing's Toss: Single Target, (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 58346\nMagic of the Domain: Single Target, Unresistable (-650)\n1: Increase Attack Speed by 35%\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 3200 per tick\n3: Decrease AC by 225\n4: Increase STR by 250\n5: Increase DEX by 250\n6: Increase ATK by 100\n7: Trigger Effect: Call of the Domain on Fade\n8: Increase corruption counter by 40\n_About every minute (or longer), the King spawns an add called \"a beast\" (hits for a max ~8,500; stunnable). If this isn't killed within about 60 seconds, the King consumes it and regenerates 5% health:_\nThe King of the Beasts snaps up another beast and eats it whole!\n_Midway through this encounter (or, this may be a timed mechanism), you'll see a power-up emote:_\nThe King is highly agitated! It appears to be building up power!\n_This step updates as you kill the King._\nSearch the chest found in the King's lair 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nThe King of the Beasts has been defeated. The draining effect the creature has harmed the land with will reverse itself, and a new King of the Beasts will rise to power.\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More\n68 platinum\nPossible Chest Loot (1 Item + 1 Cantrip Per Task)\nBeast King's Claws\nDirk of the Groundskeeper\nHeartwood Splinter\nJoceil's Exquisite Plate Mask\nKarn's Carved Jade Ring\nRibcrusher's Amice\nScepter of the Rat Queen\nScum-Covered Crystal\nShield of Blightwing\nStonebark's Protective Amulet\nMedian Alaran Cantrip\nGreater Alaran Cantrip\n- Eltarki's Diary - Beasts Know More [item=99366]\n- Median Alaran Cantrip [item=98717]",
