      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- a tame braxi [npc=38639]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a hungry raptor [npc=38670]\n- a terrible raptor [npc=38683]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:27:37 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with a tame braxi in Beasts' Domain at location -850, -95, -6 (southeastern part of the upper-third of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, a tame braxi'\na tame braxi turns sharply at a rustling in some nearby bushes. Turning quickly, you spot a raptor staring intently at the tethered braxi, which stands petrified with fear. It seems to need [help].\nYou say, 'Hmmm, how to help...'\na tame braxi snorts and stamps anxiously.\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Hunter Becomes The Hunted'.\nBraxi Keeper Yubai's mounts don't seem to keen on raptors. Maybe you could teach those raptors what it feels like to be the one who's being hunted...\n\n---\n\nKill 5 raptors 0/5 (Beasts' Domain)\nReturn to the tame braxi 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, a tame braxi'\nThe braxi leans toward you snuffling and snorting, taking in the scent of raptor blood on your clothes. It lets out a short wuffing sound and appears to relax; it seems to know what you've done and is grateful for your help.\n_Rewards:_\n136 platinum\nExperience",
