      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Yurv [npc=38629]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a goral hunter [npc=38677]\n- a goral leafstalker [npc=38672]\n- a goral predator [npc=38671]\n- a goral scavenger [npc=38693]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:28:55 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Yurv in the Beasts' Domain, located at -1065, 1010, 25 (in the south-central part of the upper-third of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Yurv'\nYurv says, in Alaran, 'Go out into the forest, they said. It'll be great, they said.' al pauses as al notices you. 'Oh, I'm sorry! I didn't realize anyone else was here. I'm just a little preoccupied with having to hunt these [disgusting gorals] - ew!''\nYou say, 'Disgusting gorals?'\nYurv says, in Alaran, 'They give me the shivers! They're so slimy and their toes -- you've seen their toes, right? They look swollen as though they're ready to burst! The thought of touching them makes me want to cry - let alone [hunting] them!''\nYou say, 'How about I go hunting?'\nYurv says, in Alaran, 'Oh, that's a great idea! How about you go hunt them for me?! I'm sure you'll love it! The elders just said I had to thin their numbers, which should be easy enough for a big, strong Halfling like you! Good luck!''\nYou have been assigned the task 'Eewww!'.\nYurv wishes you luck with these gorals. (Go get 'em tiger!)\n\n---\n\nKill 5 gorals 0/5 (Beasts' Domain)\nSpeak with Yurv 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Yurv'\nGreat job! I'll tell the Elders it's done when I get home. Thanks so much!'\n_Rewards:_\n136 platinum\nExperience",
