      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Blackwort [npc=38615]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a colossal crocodile [npc=38640]\n- a lashtail crocodile [npc=38641]\n- a primeval crocodile [npc=38642]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 19:31:52 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Blackwort in the Beasts' Domain, located at -3900, 1185, 16 (at the far southern part of the upper half of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Blackwort'\nBlackwort says, in Alaran, 'Yes. Yes, I know my name sounds like something you'd find on a goral's bottom.' Al sighs, twitching alir tentacles, 'Hmph! If you must know, I was named after a [medicinal herb] - NOT a foot sore.'\nYou say, 'A medicinal herb?'\nBlackwort says, in Alaran, 'I'm actually hunting for herbs which grow near the river, but I'm not much of a fighter, and the river is swarming with crocodiles! Unless I can find some way to [fight them off], I may not get any herbs today.'\nYou say, 'I'll fight them off'\nBlackwort toys with a stray tentacle, giving you a skeptical look. 'That's very kind of you to help, I suppose..', al says with a final shrug. It's clear that al doubts you'll survive, but al's willing to let you go if you're foolish enough to try.\nYou have been assigned the task 'At The Water's Edge'.\nBlackwort needs you to kill nearby crocodiles so that he can gather herbs from the river's edge.\n\n---\n\nKill 12 crocodiles 0/12 (Beasts' Domain)\nSpeak with Blackwort 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Blackwort'\nI can finally go collect my herbs!' It pauses, 'Hmm, now where's my basket?'\n_Rewards:_\n136 platinum\nExperience",
