      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- Hykast the Tone-Deaf [npc=39224]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a silent worshipper [npc=39246]\n- a silentsong worshipper [npc=39250]\n- a soundless devotee [npc=39254]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 21:45:37 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo kill task that begins with Hykast the Tone-Deaf in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about 1300, -645, 40 (east-central part of the inner area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Hykast the Tone-Deaf'\nHykast the Tone-Deaf says, in Alaran, 'Leave me be, Outsider. I have enough [troubles] without adding yours. Whatever it is you want, go seek someone else.'\nYou say, 'What troubles?'\nHykast the Tone-Deaf says, in Alaran, 'I have no need for the sympathy of an Outsider! I seek only vengeance against those who shunned me; they said my song lacked intonation! Instead of your pity, Outsider, lend me your [aid]!'\nYou say, 'I'll come to your aid!'\nHykast the Tone-Deaf says, in Alaran, 'Thank you, Outsider. I will not forget your kindness in helping me - a total stranger! May the Wind guide your footsteps, always.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Preaching To The Choir'.\nHykast has asked you to slay the worshippers who cast him out for being tone-deaf.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 worshippers 0/10 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSpeak with Hykast 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hykast the Tone-Deaf'\nHykast thanks you for avenging it.\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
    },
