      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- a cacophony of sound [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a flowing wind elemental [npc=39241]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 21:45:42 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo kill task that begins with a cacophony of sound in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about 920, -1285, -35 (south-central part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, a cacophony of sound'\na cacophony of sound howls and twangs, discordantly, causing a flowing wind elemental to laugh mercilessly. As you listen, you realize the howling is not from the wind alone; it sounds like a myriad of voices, pleading for [help] - as though dozens of musical spirits have been imprisoned within the whirling column of air, and are trapped!\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Raising A Ruckus'.\nYou've decided to slay the wind elementals that have imprisoned musical spirits within the cacophony of sound!\n\n---\n\nKill the flowing wind elementals that have trapped spirits in the violent windstorm! 0/10 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSpeak with the cacophony of sound 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, a cacophony of sound'\nThe funnel of wind continues to whip violently, borne on by its own momentum, but the spirits within seem to have been appeased by the deaths of the elementals.\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
