      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- Clusterchord [npc=39226]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a musical spirit [npc=39235]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 21:45:47 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo kill task that begins with Clustercord in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about -435, 775, -25 (southwestern edge of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Clusterchord'\nClusterchord says, in Alaran, 'What do you seek, Unharmonious one? Is it that you wish to [become one] with us?'\nYou say, 'Become one?'\nClusterchord says, in Alaran, 'Although of many bodies, we have become as one, through our perfection of harmony. Sadly, we do not think you are capable of such perfection, being a mere mortal creature - however, you may still be of [use] to us.'\nYou say, 'Use to you?'\nClusterchord says, in Alaran, 'The musical spirits that dwell in this valley clash with our harmonics, creating overtones that could tear us asunder! If we are to maintain our perfect chorus, they must be slain!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'In Perfect Harmony'.\nClusterchord has asked you to slay the musical spirits that roam the edges of the valley.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 musical spirits 0/10 (Windsong Sancturary)\nSpeak with Clusterchord 0/10 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Clusterchord'\nThe Clusterchord chimes with approval, 'We thank you for your help, friend. You may yet prove to be harmonious to our cause, after all.'\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
