      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- Kiroptik [npc=39258]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a filqua glider [npc=39252]\n- a filqua winddrifter [npc=39248]\n- a filqua windrider [npc=39247]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 21:45:55 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo kill task that begins with Kiroptik in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about 2225, -155, 21 (north-central part of the grassy area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Kiroptik'\nKiroptik says 'Kiroptik is my old Ak`Anonian name. I prefer to be known by my new name, [Thelibraxi].' Kiroptik pulls herself up proudly. 'I think it means something about those haze jumper creatures.''\nYou say, 'Thelibraxi?'\nKiroptik says 'It's the name some of the locals gave me the first time we met,' she beams with pride, 'As I recall, they tried to bludgeon me with a horn, [that time]. Fortunately, for me, though, I'm pretty quick on my feet!'\nYou say, 'That time?'\nKiroptik says 'Oh, yes. The worshippers try to kill me whenever we meet, but I'm hoping that eventually they'll come to realize I mean them no harm, and will come to accept me. Until then, I've decided to live out here in the wilds, despite the wild beasts and those [filquas] that make me absolutely neurotic!'\nYou say, 'Filquas?'\nKiroptik says 'Haven't you seen them? They're terrifying - it gives me goosebumps just thinking about them! In fact, if you [kill] them, I'd be more than happy to reward you for your troubles.'\nYou say, 'I'll kill some of them!'\nKiroptik says 'Excellent! You've no idea how many times I've had nightmares about those things swooping down on me and getting tangled in my hair.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Going Native'.\nKiroptik has asked you to kill the filquas so that she can sleep at night.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 filquas 0/10 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSpeak with Kiroptik, er 'Thelibraxi' 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kiroptik'\nKiroptik showers you with praise and thanks for your assistance!\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
