      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- Gibbledon Cogboggle [ _Quests, Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- First Piece of Gibbledon's Schematics [item=101005]\n- Fourth Piece of Gibbledon's Schematics [item=101051]\n- Second Piece of Gibbledon's Schematics [item=101055]\n- Third Piece of Gibbledon's Schematics [item=101054]\n- Windsong Drum [item=101052]\n- Windsong Flute [item=101004]\n- Windsong Horn [item=100994]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a silent worshipper [npc=39246]\n- a soundless devotee [npc=39254]\n- a wind archer [npc=39259]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Windsong #1: Stranger in a Strange Land [quest=5499]\n- Windsong #3: Making Music [quest=5501]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 22:19:53 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the second in a series of three; a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Gibbledon Cogboggle in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about 20, -185, -32 (due west of the zone-in -- the southern entrance to the inner grassy area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Stranger in a Strange Land\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Gibbledon Cogboggle'\nGibbledon Cogboggle says 'So eager! I like that. Yes, what were we discussing last? Oh, yes, the [instruments] that the Alarans here carry.'\nYou say, 'What instruments?'\nGibbledon Cogboggle says 'Get me some so that I can examine them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Getting Down to Business'.\nYou have agreed to help Gibbledon Cogboggle with his research in Windsong Sanctuary.\n\n---\n\n_NOTE: All items in this task are pre-lootable._\n1\\. Deliver the Windsong Horn to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n2\\. Deliver the Windsong Flute to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n3\\. Deliver the Windsong Drum to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n_The above three items are dropped randomly by Alarans in the zone._\n4\\. Speak with Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gibbledon Cogboggle'\nGibbledon Cogboggle examines the instruments at great length. 'I feel a tinge of magic in these instruments, but nothing too extraordinary. Interesting none the less though. I feel I can trust you with my [secret] now.'\nYou say, 'What secret?'\nGibbledon Cogboggle says 'I came here to see if I could somehow reverse engineer one of these instruments and use it to disrupt the communication between Ryken and the Alarans. Things haven't gone as planned however. Not only were my tools stolen, but my schematics for my device as well. I think you can be trusted to help me complete my research. Am I [correct]?'\nYou say, 'Correct'\nGibbledon Cogboggle says 'I knew I was right about you. When I arrived, I was immediately attacked by a vicious wind elemental. Its strong winds blew my schematics out of my backpack and tore them into pieces. If you could find the pieces, perhaps I could salvage them.'\n5\\. Deliver the first piece of the schematics to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n6\\. Deliver the second piece of the schematics to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n7\\. Deliver the third piece of the schematics to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n8\\. Deliver the fourth piece of the schematics to Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\n_These are dropped by mobs in the inner area of the zone (animal types)._\n9\\. Speak with Gibbledon Cogboggle 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gibbledon Cogboggle'\nGibbledon Cogboggle says 'You actually found them? I was right in trusting you! You are amazing! The pieces look a bit worse for wear, but I think I can read them.'\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (about 1 AA at Level 95)\nEltarki's Diary - Music of the Mind\n- Eltarki's Diary - Music of the Mind [item=99795]",
    },
