      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Windsong Sanctuary [zone=813]\n**Who:**\n- Wilmina [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Black Speckled Egg [item=101136]\n- Blue Speckled Egg [item=61542]\n- Brown Speckled Egg [item=101144]\n- Green Speckled Egg [item=59727]\n- Orange Speckled Egg [item=101259]\n- Purple Speckled Egg [item=100729]\n- Red Speckled Egg [item=101139]\n- Violet Speckled Egg [item=101269]\n- Yellow Speckled Egg [item=59726]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Incubate O Matic [npc=39225]\n- a breezerunner [npc=39249]\n- a fluttering kangon [npc=39251]\n- a wind strider [npc=39240]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 1 22:20:03 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Wilmina in Windsong Sanctuary, located at 650, -800, -42 (southeastern part of the inner area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Wilmina'\nWilmina says 'Hello! It's so nice to see someone from our homeland. Just between you and me, these Alarans kind of creep me out. Now that you're here, would you like to help my business [venture]?'\nYou say, 'What business venture?'\nWilmina says 'I believe I can make a killing back home selling kangon mounts. The kangon are swift and sturdy. Perfect attributes for a mount. Unfortunately, the wild ones are too hard to tame. If I could get my hands on some of their [eggs] though, I believe I could raise them to become trusty mounts.'\nYou say, 'Their eggs?'\nWilmina says 'If you could get me some of their eggs, I could pop them into the Incubate-O-Matic next to me that I constructed. It will speed up the incubation of the eggs by at least 95 percent. Unfortunately to obtain the best quality eggs, the kangons will need to be put down. What do you say? Can you [help] me out?'\nYou say, 'I'll be happy to help!'\nWilmina says 'Excellent! Now get out there and get some eggs! I can't wait to try out my Incubate-O-Matic!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Eggscellent Eggs'.\nWilmina needs you to collect some different colored Kangon eggs so that she can try to incubate them in her Incubate-O-Matic.\nObtain a Yellow Speckled Egg, a Blue Speckled Egg, a Green Speckled Egg, a Red Speckled Egg, a Purple Speckled Egg, a Brown Speckled Egg, an Orange Speckled Egg, a Black Speckled Egg, and a Violet Speckled Egg by killing wind striders, fluttering kangons, and breezerunners. Wilmina will want the eggs to be delivered to her in a certain order, so she will only ask for one egg at a time. Once you deliver an egg to Wilmina, select the correct power level so that it can be successfully incubated in the Incubate-O-Matic. When you are done incubating all the eggs, speak with Wilmina.\n\n---\n\n_All items in this task are pre-lootable._\n_You'll need nine colored eggs (Yellow; Blue; Green; Red; Purple; Brown; Orange; Black; Violet). These are dropped by kangons (\"a wind strider\" drops yellow, blue, and green eggs; \"a fluttering kangon\" drops red, purple, and brown eggs; \"a breezerunner\" drops orange, black, and violet eggs)._\n_You'll need to deliver them one at a time to Wilmina. For each one, you'll have to say the correct \"Incubate-O-Matic\" power level, otherwise you get an add spawn. Power levels are low, medium, or high._\n_As you turn in the eggs, say the following phrases:_\n\\- \"yellow medium power\"\n\\- \"blue high power\"\n\\- \"green low power\"\n\\- \"red low power\"\n\\- \"purple medium power\"\n\\- \"brown high power\"\n\\- \"orange high power\"\n\\- \"black low power\"\n\\- \"violet medium power\"\nDeliver a Yellow Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nWilmina says 'Nice find! Now let me just put the egg into the Incubate-O-Matic. Next, I need to tune the the Incubate-O-Matic to just the right setting. Let's see. . . I need to turn this dial to yellow and then set the correct power setting. What setting do you think we should try? [Low yellow power], [medium yellow power], or [high yellow power]?'\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Yellow Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Medium yellow power'\nWilmina says 'The egg is hatching! It's a miracle! Er, I mean, I knew my Incubate-O-Matic would work!'\nDeliver a Blue Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Blue Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Green Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Green Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Red Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Red Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Purple Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Purple Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Brown Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Brown Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Orange Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Orange Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Black Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Black Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nDeliver a Violet Speckled Egg to Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSelect the correct power level to successfully incubate the Violet Speckled Egg 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSpeak with Wilmina 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, Wilmina'\nWilmina says 'That was quite a task, but we did it! I have several, healthy young kangon hatchlings that I can take home to sell. Thank you for your help!'\n_Rewards:_\n450 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Music of the Mind\n- Eltarki's Diary - Music of the Mind [item=99795]",
