      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Prisoner Ii`iv Vio`i [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a dutiful guard [npc=39403]\n- a guard - Erillion, City of Bronze [npc=39397]\n- a solemn guard [npc=39404]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 2 20:01:25 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Prisoner Ii`iv Vio`i in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at about -330, 280, -41 -- in the southwestern jail block in the lower level of the main building)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Prisoner Ii`iv Vio`i'\nPrisoner Ii`iv Vio`i says, in Alaran, 'I honestly don't know why I'm in here, I didn't [steal] anything! They've got the wrong person.'\nYou say, 'Steal?'\nPrisoner Ii`iv Vio`i says, in Alaran, 'Alright, well maybe I did technically take a loaf of bread that wasn't mine, but I wouldn't call that stealing, per say. More like [borrowing].'\nYou say, 'Borrowing?'\nPrisoner Ii`iv Vio`i says, in Alaran, 'Yes, I borrow things all the time. I once borrowed a half dozen braxi from a total stranger and sold them to another fellow three towns away!' It cackles, 'Oh, that was a great day! On the downside, though, it does mean I have to [move] around a lot. \\*sigh\\* In hindsight, I think coming to here was a bad idea after all.'\nYou say, 'Move around a lot?'\nPrisoner Ii`iv Vio`i says, in Alaran, 'Indeed, friend, I'm not from this city. I'm an outsider much like you.' It gives you a conspiratorial wink, 'Hey! I don't suppose you could [help] me out by killing a few of the guards so I can get out of here?'\nYou say, 'I can help'\nPrisoner Ii`iv Vio`i says, in Alaran, 'Wonderful! No need to bother with a key, though,' it pats a pocket, meaningfully, 'I've got that covered.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'It's Only a Crime If You're Caught!'.\nIi`iv has asked you to slay the guards so that it can let itself free.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 guards 0/10 (Erillion)\nSpeak with Ii`iv Vio`i 0/1 (Erilliion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Prisoner Ii`iv Vio`i'\nIi`iv salutes you, 'Thank you, friend! And er-' it rummages in its pocket for a moment, then hands you what appears to be one of your own rings, 'Here! You can have this back. I wasn't going to keep it, really. I was just admiring it.'\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
