      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Culdylri [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bloodthirsty carnifex [npc=39405]\n- a carnifex [npc=39406]\n- a cruel carnifex [npc=39407]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 2 20:01:31 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Culdylri in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at about -235, 200, -41 -- in the south-central jail block on the lower level of the main building)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Culdylri'\nCuldylri says, in Alaran, 'No! Please, do not [take] me - I beg of you!'\nYou say, 'I'm not going to take you...'\nCuldylri says, in Alaran, 'You- you're not here to take me away?' It stares unbelievingly, its tentacles quivering with fear, 'How did you get into this place? No, never mind - I don't care. Just please, do not release me! These bars are all that stands between me and those [carnifex] fiends!'\nYou say, 'What are the carnifex?'\nCuldylri says, in Alaran, 'Don't ask me about them!' It shudders violently, and lowers its voice as it continues, 'Do not speak of them. Do not think of [them]. And above all else, never give them reason to speak, or think of you!'\nYou say, 'Them?'\nCuldylri says, in Alaran, 'You must be mad to keep pursuing this subject! Do you not understand that if they find you here, you're worse than dead? If you have such a curiosity to find out what is beyond this world, then question me no more; go find them and see for yourself!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'They Who Must Not Be Named'.\nCuldylri has sent you to satisfy your curiosity of what horrors the carnifex inflict.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 carnifex 0/10 (Erillion)\n_The carnifex are found throughout the rooms in the northern part of the main building's lower level._\nSpeak with Culdylri 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Culdylri'\nCuldylri stares at you, its tentacles frozen in shock and horror. 'Guards-' it croaks, its voice dry and cracking with terror, 'Guards! Come quick, there's a murderer on the loose!'\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
