      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Merchant Oarryn [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a merchant [npc=39401]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 2 20:01:42 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Merchant Oarryn in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at -240, -1040, 1 -- in the northeastern part of the city's southeastern quadrant)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Merchant Oarryn'\nMerchant Oarryn says, in Alaran, 'Shoo! Get away from me, Outsider. It will ruin my business, if I'm seen talking to you! Go pester someone else - in fact, please go bother some other merchant! I could certainly use the [help].'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nMerchant Oarryn says, in Alaran, 'You just don't go away, do you? \\*sigh\\* Being a traveling merchant, I'm already scorned by most of the residents here. If I can't sell my wares, though, I won't have coin enough to support myself. If you could just take slim down the competition, I would appreciate it. If you hang around me though, we could both wind up in trouble.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Soliciting Trouble'.\nMerchant Oarryn has asked you to help take out the competition.\n\n---\n\nKill 7 merchants 0/7 (Erillion)\nSpeak with Merchant Oarryn 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Merchant Oarryn'\nMerchant Oarryn thanks you warmly for the services you've rendered it.\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
