      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Caindi [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Briltimore Weed [item=101490]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Guard Kalinir [npc=39328]\n- Jerinos [npc=39319]\n- Lijkas Braxi [npc=39321]\n- Tyzen [npc=39304]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Bronze #1: Dreams of Chaos [quest=5513]\n- Bronze #2: A Spy Among Us [quest=5514]\n- Bronze #4: Political Favors [quest=5516]\n- The Order of Three [quest=5520]\n- The Traitor Revealed [quest=5519]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Dec 5 01:02:40 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of four; a solo task that begins with Caindi in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at location 400, 630, 1 -- in the southern part of the city's northwestern quadrant, by a fountain)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completed \"Dreams of Chaos\"\n\\- Completed \"A Spy Among Us\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Caindi'\nCaindi scowls at you. 'I don't trust you, but if Tyzen trusts you, then I won't question alis judgement. I was approached not long ago by a guard named, Kalinir. They promised aleself a large sum of gold if I agreed to spy on the group. I declined. I would never betray the group. Find [Kalinir] and see if you can find out who alis is working for.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Restoring Order'.\nTyzen's group has been infiltrated by a spy, and even worse, it was one of Tyzen's most trusted group members. Tyzen has asked you to get to the bottom of this and see who convinced Verobi to betray his group.\nYou say, 'Where is Kalinir?'\nCaindi says, in Alaran, 'Kalinir can most likely be found in the government offices in the city hall.'\n\n---\n\nQuestion Guard Kalinir 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Guard Kalinir spawns in the government office building. From the entrance, head north to the last room on the left. Be ready for a fight._\nYou say, 'Hail, Guard Kalinir'\nGuard Kalinir says, in Alaran, 'Jerinos will praise me for killing you!'\nDefeat Guard Kalinir 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Kalinir would rather fight, than speak. Kill them.\n_Guard Kalinir hits for a max ~12,500 (stunnable; slowable). NOTE: If doing this as a group, you'll have to kill him once for every member of your group. Whoever is on the step \"Defeat Guard Kalinir\" must be the first to aggro him. Only the first on his aggro will get credit for this step._\n_(He has a quick respawn time.)_\nSpeak with Tyzen 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Tyzen'\nTyzen says, in Alaran, 'Jerinos, eh? Funny you should mention that name. A courier just dropped off a letter for you and it says that Jerinos would like to meet with you.'\nSpeak with Jerinos 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Jerinos is found on the second floor of the government building in a room located at about 25, 180, 42. (You'll have to kill several see invis mobs to him.)_\nYou say, 'Hail, Jerinos'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'So you received my invitation. I apologize for the inconvenience of reaching me. Stay your sword. I am not your enemy. I have some [information] I think you will find quite interesting.'\nYou say, 'What information?'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'It's unfortunate you got mixed up with Tyzen's rebel group. If you knew their true plans, you would not have done so. They don't trust you. In fact, they are planning on handing you over to the guards. I on the other hand can [help] you if you do as I say.'\nYou say, 'How can you help?'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'One of Tyzen's members, Lijka, has been sniffing around and getting a bit too nosy for my liking. They need to be taken out. It needs to look like an [accident] however. Take care of this and then return to me.'\nYou say, 'An accident?'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'You didn't hear this from me, but in the hills outside the city gates, a weed known as Briltimore grows. This particular weed is known to have strange effects on braxi. Lijka works as a merchant during the day and always has alis trusty braxi along with alis. If the braxi were to unfortunately eat the Briltimore weed, who knows what would happen.'\nPick some Briltimore Weeds 0/4 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Obtain some Briltimore Weeds that grow in the hills outside the city.\n_This is a ground spawn throughout the area outside the city's boundaries. There are several different types of plants growing on the ground. This one is entirely green._\nWeeds are located at:\n-158, +1742\n-999, +1517\n-1719, +1326\n-1450, +1567\nGive the Briltimore Weeds to Lijka's Braxi 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Give the Briltimore Weeds to Lijka's braxi. This should send the braxi into a rage, hopefully killing Lijka in the process.\n_Lijka's Braxi is found at about 1050, -420, 2 (northwest part of the city's northeastern quadrant)._\nSpeak with Jerinos 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Jerinos'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'Did you do as I asked? Excellent work. Some of my guards recovered a letter that Tyzen was trying to send out to alis group. It details how they are going to betray you once you uncover who is behind the spy ring. Do not worry. You are safe as long as you work for me. Unfortunately I must attend to other matters at this time, but I have given my assistant, Vinloi instructions on how you are to proceed. Talk to them when you are ready to continue.'\n_Reward:_\n225 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Rule by Order\n- Eltarki's Diary - Rule by Order [item=100888]",
    },
