      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Vinloi [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- A Stone Horn [item=101492]\n- Falsified Government Records [item=101493]\n- Vial of Deadly Poison [item=101491]\n- Wanted Poster [item=101494]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Krosek [npc=39323]\n- Rulbik`s box of files [npc=39766]\n- a boulder [npc=39441]\n- a citizen [npc=39394]\n- a jug of cider [npc=39767]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Bronze #1: Dreams of Chaos [quest=5513]\n- Bronze #2: A Spy Among Us [quest=5514]\n- Bronze #3: Restoring Order [quest=5515]\n- The Order of Three [quest=5520]\n- The Traitor Revealed [quest=5519]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Dec 5 01:02:43 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the fourth in a series of four; a shared task that begins with Vinloi in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found on the second floor of the main building at about 10, 150, 42)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completed \"Dreams of Chaos\"\n\\- Completed \"A Spy Among Us\"\n\\- Completed \"Restoring Order\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Vinloi'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'Master Jerinos believes alis has uncovered the truth behind the strange dreams the citizens of our fine city are having. Before we can reveal more however, there are a couple of [favors] I must ask of you on behalf of Jerinos.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Political Favors'.\n_You receive \"A Vial of Deadly Poison\"._\nYou are now working for a politician named Jerinos who believes they have uncovered the cause of the citizens' dreams. Before you get more information on that, you will need to take care of some favors for Jerinos though.\nYou say, 'What favors?'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'If Jerinos is to take action against the cause of these dreams, then alis must do so without interference. Some of Jerinos' political rivals are becoming quite a nuisance and need to be dealt with. I trust that you can [take care] of this?'\nYou say, 'I can take care of this'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, '[Olosir], a running mate in the upcoming elections has been causing much trouble in Jerinos' investigation of the dreams. Olosir must be taken out, but it must look like an accident. Jerinos cannot afford to be involved in his unfortunate demise if alis is to win the upcoming election.'\nYou say, 'Who is Olosir?'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'Olosir likes good food and drink, and has a personal chef prepare them every day. It would be unfortunate if Olosir's apple cider were to be poisoned. Find the jug of apple cider that is being prepared for Olosir and drop this poison into it.'\n\n---\n\nPut the Deadly Poison into the Olosir's Jug of Apple Cider 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Locate the jug of cider being prepared for Olosir and put the poison that Vinloi gave you in it.\nOlosir says, in Alaran, 'Make sure you cut my hurpuc fruit into four slices. Not two, not three, but four slices!'\n_Olosir can be found on the second floor of building in the city's northeastern cluster of buildings (about 845, -830, 34). Give the poison to \"a jug of cider\"._\nSpeak with Vinloi 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Vinloi'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'Next up is one of Jerinos' political rivals named, Krosek. Krosek enjoys collecting insects in the hills outside of the city. Alis favorite spot to collect insects is near a field of boulders. I just so happen to know a shamanistic chant that will cause one of the boulders to roll down the hill and hopefully crush alis. Take this horn and speak this chant to the boulder: Bala Danee Kula.'\n_You receive \"A Stone Horn\"._\nUtter the phrase: Bala Danee Kula to the boulder near Krosek and watch it roll down the hill and crush alis 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Krosek and \"a boulder\" can be found outside the city boundaries in the southeastern part of the zone (about -1900, -1500). Target the boulder and say \"Bala Danee Kula\"._\nSpeak with Vinloi 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Vinloi'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'Next you are to take out Jerinos' strongest opposition. Rulbik has a flawless record as far as the public knows. After you replace Rulbik's government records with these false ones, alis won't any longer.'\nPlace the Falsified Government Records into Rulbik's box of files 0/1 (Erillion)\n_\"Rulbik`s box of files\" can be found on the ground floor of the government building. From the entrance, it's two rooms south._\nSpeak with Vinloi 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Vinloi'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'You are doing well. Next I want you to hand out this wanted poster to a citizen. Maybe they have seen Tyzen or someone else in the group so we can try to apprehend them.'\n_You receive \"A Wanted Poster\"._\nGive the Wanted Poster to a citizen 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Hand this to any \"citizen\" mob._\nA citizen says, 'Lawbreakers cannot be tolerated. I will let the guards know if I see anything.'\nSpeak with Vinloi 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Vinloi'\nVinloi says, in Alaran, 'With Jerinos' opposition out of the way, I believe we can get down real business. We must stop the dreams the citizens are having. Go speak with Archon Xalvir down in the prisons. It appears they have some useful information for you.'\n_Rewards:_\n300 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Rule by Order\n- Eltarki's Diary - Rule by Order [item=100888]",
