      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Alchemist Xortiv [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Hurpuc Fruit [item=101168]\n- Mortar and Pestle [item=101074]\n- Patch of Braxi Fur [item=100717]\n- Potion of Dreamless Sleep [item=101169]\n- Selyrah Tooth [item=100718]\n- Strangleweed Seeds [item=100715]\n- Vial of Grendlaen Blood [item=100713]\n- Vial of Oashim Saliva [item=100716]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Alijara [npc=39324]\n- Donair [npc=39325]\n- Plonari [npc=39326]\n- Wanidor [npc=39327]\n- a busy cook [npc=39430]\n- a cook [npc=39435]\n- a diseased oashim [npc=39423]\n- a feral grendlaen [npc=39390]\n- a strangleweed [npc=39393]\n- a tired cook [npc=39433]\n- a wild braxi [npc=39392]\n- a wild selyrah [npc=39391]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Dec 5 01:02:46 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Alchemist Xortiv in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at about 400, 260, 1). Items for this are pre-lootable._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Alchemist Xortiv'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'Nobody [listens] to me! I believe I found a list of ingredients to concoct a potion that just may end the strange dreams the citizens are having.'\nYou say, 'No one listens?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'I have told various members of the government about my potion, but they don't seem to care! Do you think you could try to [make] the potion for me?'\nYou say, 'I could make it...'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'Great! Go forth and collect two [Strangleweed Seeds], a [Vial of Oashim Saliva], two [Hurpuc Fruits], a [Vial of Grendlaen Blood], a [Patch of Braxi Fur], and a [Selyrah Tooth]. Combine all of these ingredients in the mortar and pestle I gave to you to make the potions. Some citizens have agreed to test the potions. Once you make the potions, give them to Alijara, Plonari, Donair, and Wanidor.'\n_You receive a Mortar and Pestle (an 8-slot container)._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Stop the Dreams'.\nYou have met an alchemist who believes they may have found a cure for the dreams that the citizens are having. Make the potion and give it to some of the citizens to see if it works or not.\nYou say, 'Strangleweed Seeds?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'You can get the seeds from the strangleweeds that inhabit the hills outside of the city.'\nYou say, 'Vial of Oashim Saliva?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'You should be able to get a sample of oashim saliva from the oashim outside of the city.'\nYou say, 'Hurpuc Fruits?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'The cooks in the city often have hurpuc fruit. Perhaps you can get some fruit from them.'\nYou say, 'Vial of Grendlaen Blood?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'Get a sample of grendlaen blood from the grendlaens outside of the city.'\nYou say, 'Patch of Braxi Fur?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'Any of the braxi outside of the city will do. Just get a patch of their fur.'\nYou say, 'A Selyrah Tooth?'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'Get a tooth from any of the selyrah outside of the city.'\n\n---\n\nCollect some Strangleweed Seeds 0/2 (Erillion)\nCollect a Vial of Oashim Saliva 0/1 (Erillion)\nCollect some Hurpuc Fruit 0/2 (Erillion)\nCollect a Vial of Grendlaen Blood 0/1 (Erillion)\nCollect a Patch of Braxi Fur 0/1 (Erillion)\nCollect a Selyrah Tooth 0/1 (Erillion)\n_These are a very common drop from the above mob types. All but the cooks are found roaming about outside the city's boundaries. The cooks can be found in the second floors of baking buildings (one in the north-central cluster of buildings and another in the northeastern cluster)._\nCombine the items in the mortar and pestle to create the Potion of Dreamless Sleep 0/1 (Erillion)\nTest one of the Potions of Dreamless Sleep on Alijara 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Alijara is found in the northwestern cluster of buildings at about 620, 780, 1._\nYou gently tilt Alijara's head back and give them a sample of the potion. Nothing appears to happen.\nTest one of the Potions of Dreamless Sleep on Plonari 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Plonari is in found in the south-central cluster of buildings at about -840.82, -110, 1. NOTE: There is a guard outside Plonari's room._\nYou gently tilt Plonari's head back and give them a sample of the potion. Nothing appears to happen.\nTest one of the Potions of Dreamless Sleep on Donair 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Donair is found in the northeastern cluster of buildings at about 685, -780, 1._\nYou gently tilt Donair's head back and give them a sample of the potion. Nothing appears to happen.\nTest one of the Potions of Dreamless Sleep on Wanidor 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Wanidor is found in the southeastern cluster of buildings at about -620, -855, 1._\nYou gently tilt Wanidor's head back and give them a sample of the potion. Nothing appears to happen.\nSpeak with Alchemist Xortiv 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Alchemist Xortiv'\nAlchemist Xortiv says, in Alaran, 'The potion didn't work? It's back to the drawing board I guess. Thanks for trying.'\n_Rewards:_\n375 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Rule by Order\n- Eltarki's Diary - Rule by Order [item=100888]",
