      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erillion, City of Bronze [zone=814]\n**Who:**\n- Archon Xalvir [npc=39309]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Erillion: The Traitor Revealed [zone=837]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Caindi [npc=40022]\n- Jerinos [npc=40032]\n- Morell Thule [npc=40034]\n- Srezen [npc=40023]\n- Tyzen [npc=40018]\n- Uyyina [npc=40024]\n- a chest - The Traitor Revealed [npc=39458]\n- a citizen [npc=40033]\n- a forlorn prisoner [npc=40019]\n- a prisoner [npc=40020]\n- a woeful prisoner [npc=40021]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Bronze #1: Dreams of Chaos [quest=5513]\n- Bronze #2: A Spy Among Us [quest=5514]\n- Bronze #3: Restoring Order [quest=5515]\n- Bronze #4: Political Favors [quest=5516]\n- The Order of Three [quest=5520]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Dec 5 01:02:54 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a group mission that begins with Archon Xalvir in Erillion, the City of Bronze (found at about 50, -90, -43 on the bottom floor of the central building -- if you look at the map once at the bottom of the stairs, he's in the room directly north of that area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completed \"Dreams of Chaos\"\n\\- Completed \"A Spy Among Us\"\n\\- Completed \"Restoring Order\"\n\\- Completed \"Political Favors\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Archon Xalvir'\nArchon Xalvir says, in Alaran, 'I have been expecting you. Jerinos would like you to know that your services have been [appreciated].'\nYou say, 'Appreciated?'\nArchon Xalvir says, in Alaran, 'Jerinos would like you to be a guest of honor at the speech alis will be holding in front of the citizens of our fine city. I am to be your personal escort. When you are ready, we can get [going].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Traitor Revealed'.\nJerinos would like to thank you for all your hard work.\n\n---\n\nLet Archon Xalvir escort you 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Let's get going'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Erillion, City of Bronze.\n_This step updates as you enter the instance._\nSpeak with Tyzen 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ You have woken up in the jails of the City of Bronze. You remember Archon Xalvir landing a heavy blow against your head, and then darkness. Tyzen stands next to you, a dead guard at their feet. Speak to Tyzen to figure out what is going on.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tyzen'\nTyzen says, in Alaran, 'Thanks to you idiots we are all in jail now. Jerinos used you to take out anyone that stood in alis way; that included Lijka, who you murdered in cold blood! You got us into this mess, now you're going to get us out of it. I already took care of the guard who was guarding our cell. Now you need to go and rescue Caindi, Srezen, and Uyyina. If you wish to [leave] without helping us, like the true coward I believe you are, then I can make that happen.'\nFind Caindi and speak with them 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Jerinos used you to do alis work and now you are trapped in jail. Tyzen asks you to help redeem your foul deeds by rescuing Caindi, Srezen, and Uyyina from their captors. Find them and speak with them. A large number of Archons are guarding the jail to prevent your escape. Take some of them out to make it easier to get out of the jail.\n_Caindi is found in one of the cells by the zone-in._\nYou say, 'Hail, Caindi'\nCaindi says, in Alaran, 'Thank goodness you came. I don't fancy the thought of rotting away in here.'\nFind Srezen and speak with them 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Srezen is found in one of the cells by the zone-in._\nYou say, 'Hail, Srezen'\nSrezen says, in Alaran, 'I cannot forgive you for betraying Tyzen and our group, but you have my thanks for rescuing me.'\nFind Uyyina and speak with them 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Uyyina is found in one of the four circular rooms in the center of the jail area, along with two carnifex._\nYou say, 'Hail, Uyyina'\nUyyina says, in Alaran, 'You have a lot of explaining to do. I'm glad you came along to rescue me again though. The carnifex were getting ready to carve me up.'\nDefeat archons to make escaping the prison easier 0/10 (Erillion)\n_You'll find no shortage of archons in the area._\nSpeak with Tyzen 0/1 (Erillion)\n_NOTE: The task locks upon this hail._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tyzen'\nTyzen says, in Alaran, 'Jerinos must be stopped! I believe alis is about to give a speech. Find Jerinos and stop alis!'\nSpeak with Jerinos 0/1 (Erillion)\n_You'll find Jerinos above-ground outside Sepulcher of Order (eastern part of the city)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Jerinos'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'Looks like someone didn't want to miss my speech! Well step aside, because I am about to begin.'\nListen to Jerinos' speech 0/1 (Erillion)\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'Citizens of Erillion! It has been a difficult time for our city. The dreams have invaded many of your minds and unrest has infiltrated our orderly ways. I am here to assure you however, that this will soon stop!'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'There have also been several suspicious deaths as of late. Several of my colleagues in the government have died in mysterious ways. Fear not! The perpetrators of these foul deeds stand before you and will be punished! The Norrathians you see here are the cause of all your troubles! You have counted on your elected officials to find the cause of your troubles and now I count on you to kill them and end the chaos our city has been suffering!'\nDefeat the hostile citizens 0/10 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Jerinos has whipped the crowd into a frenzy. Kill them or be killed!\n_All of the citizens aggro you and need to be killed. They are grey-cons and don't hit too hard._\nSpeak with Jerinos 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Jerinos'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'I know that your god, Morell Thule, is in our city. Now you will tell me where he is, or you die. . . So you claim ignorance? Very well then, I shall beat the answer out of you!'\nFight Jerinos 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Task Window Says:_ Jerinos believes that you know the whereabouts of Morell Thule. You don't, however. Jerinos is furious that you would defy alis. Fight Jerinos!\n_Jerinos hits for a max ~17,500 and casts \"Jerinos' Punishment\":_\nJerinos' Punishment: Single Target, (-50)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 8000 per tick\n2: Silence\n3: Amnesia (Silence vs Melee Effect)\n_When low in health, he goes inactive and Morell Thule appears..._\nMorell Thule has appeared!\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'Morell! How nice of you to finally visit!'\nSpeak with Morell Thule 0/1 (Erillion)\nYou say, 'Hail, Morell Thule'\nMorell Thule says 'Jerinos is correct. I am indeed here. Jerinos is incorrect in thinking that alis will win this battle however.'\nMorell Thule says 'It is I that has been causing the dreams the citizens have been experiencing and I need your help to fulfill my plans. Now is not the time however. I shall speak with you again later. When you are ready to [leave] this place, just let me know.'\nJerinos says, in Alaran, 'I have been chosen by the Prophet! You cannot stop me!'\nMorell Thule utters an incantation. Jerinos falls into a deep slumber!\nLoot the chest for your reward 0/1 (Erillion)\n_Reward:_\n375 platinum\nEltarki's Diary - Rule by Order\nPossible Chest Loot (1 Item + 1 Cantrip Per Task)\nArctender's Signet of Station\nDouble Pronged Grendlaen Incisor\nEnvenomed Goral-Prod\nFeatherweight Drape of Harmony\nGlacial Stone of Fury\nGuggles' Mangy Hide\nJagged Tooth Necklace\nRadiant Visor of Construction\nRiffmaz's Urn-Shield\nShorn Ut`len Tentacle\nGreater Alaran Cantrip\nGlowing Alaran Cantrip\n- Arctender's Signet of Station [item=101968]\n- Double Pronged Grendlaen Incisor [item=100274]\n- Eltarki's Diary - Rule by Order [item=100888]\n- Envenomed Goral-Prod [item=101336]\n- Featherweight Drape of Harmony [item=101039]\n- Glacial Stone of Fury [item=101360]\n- Glowing Alaran Cantrip [item=99752]\n- Greater Alaran Cantrip [item=99412]\n- Guggles' Mangy Hide [item=101501]\n- Jagged Tooth Necklace [item=100271]\n- Radiant Visor of Construction [item=100953]\n- Riffmaz's Urn-Shield [item=100903]\n- Shorn Ut`len Tentacle [item=101744]",
