      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sepulcher West [zone=816]\n**Who:**\n- Sentry Stone of Illdaera [npc=39345]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Aggregate Alsa Thel Droplet [item=50541]\n- Alsa Thel of Battle [item=101468]\n- Alsa Thel of Beasts [item=101499]\n- Alsa Thel of Decay [item=101466]\n- Alsa Thel of Fertility [item=101498]\n- Alsa Thel of Magic [item=101497]\n- Alsa Thel of Oratory [item=101470]\n- Alsa Thel of Splendor [item=101469]\n- Alsa Thel of Tides [item=101465]\n- Rod of Alsa Thel [item=57558]\n- Vaskerin's Hollow Rod [item=101683]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sepulcher East [zone=817]\n- Sepulcher of Order [zone=815]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breaching the Barrier [quest=5537]\n- Sepulcher #1: The Fracturing of Order [quest=5531]\n- Sepulcher #3: Resurrecting the Gods [quest=5533]\n- The Triune God [quest=5538]\n- To Kill a Thel Ereth Ril [quest=5534]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 13 22:01:26 2011\nModified: Mon Oct 7 15:36:03 2024 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis task is the second in a series of three; a solo task that starts with Sentry Stone of Illdaera in Sepulcher West (located at about 895, 1085, 8 -- in one of the large rooms in the north-central part of the zone).\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n\\- Completed The Fracturing of Order [quest=5531]\n\\- 88 skill level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Sentry Stone of Illdaera'\nKnow this;' the stone speaks with a warm, living voice, 'we took no part in stealing your god's power. Ryken and the Alsa Ril planned such treachery. Oseka, Alra, and they regained their power more quickly than Lunanyn, Kolos, or I, for their followers were more numerous. They could inhabit and control the statues called [blind dreamers]. We could not.\nYou say, 'Control the blind dreamers?'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'We are still unable to do so. And that is why I turn to you. I trust you more than I do my own people, for you have proven yourself more fierce, cunning, and worthy than any inhabitant of Argath. You must construct for Lunanyn, Kolos, and me statues that can accept our [spirits].'\nYou say, 'What spirits?'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'To compensate for our weakened state, the statues must be constructed using the purified thel of the Alsa Ril. You have seen the thel ereth ril wandering these halls? It carries the purified essence of thel, but because of this, it is far too strong for you to [overcome].'\nYou say, 'How do we overcome it?'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'You must fashion a weapon that can break the defenses of the thel ereth ril. Throughout this sepulcher, the blood of the Three infuses living creatures, invading through the lungs and skin. It binds with their own blood and becomes amenable to living bodies. If you can [gather] enough of this alsa thel, the weapon can be constructed.'\nYou say, 'I'll gather some'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'Both Lunanyn and I know of ways to collect the larger portions of alsa thel. The smaller ones I leave for you to gather. We have thelasas loyal to us within these halls. Speak to them to find out more.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Crafting the Triumvirate's Downfall'.\nIn order to craft bodies the gods can inhabit for a short while, Illdaera needs you to collect enough infused alsa thel from each of the areas near the relics of the gods. Speak to the thelasas of Illdaera and Lunanyn that reside near each area. They will assign tasks that will grant you infused alsa thel. You will also need to craft the Rod of Alsa Thel, a weapon capable of weakening the thel ereth ril, which carries the Essence of Purified Alsa Thel. Speak to Alchemist Vaskerin and Infiltrator Tesara to find tasks that will lead you to crafting the rod.\n_Note: This task is not repeatable._\n\n---\n\n1\\. Craft the Rod of Alsa Thel 0/1 (ALL)\n2\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Fertility 0/1 (ALL)\n3\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Beasts 0/1 (ALL)\n4\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Magic 0/1 (ALL)\n5\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Oratory 0/1 (ALL)\n6\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Decay 0/1 (ALL)\n7\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Tides 0/1 (ALL)\n8\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Battle 0/1 (ALL)\n9\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Splendor 0/1 (ALL)\nAll items are pre-lootable. The task will update based on how many you have in your inventory when you request the task.\nUpon collecting all items, you see:\nYou have collected enough infused alsa thel for Illdaera to create the Combined Alsa Thel Octets. You also crafted the Rod of Alsa Thel, which will be instrumental in defeating the thel ereth ril. You can now seek to construct bodies for Illdaera, Lunanyn, and Kolos.\n_Rewards:_\n900 platinum\nYou gain experience! (approximately 6 AAs at level 95)\n\n---\n\n1\\. Craft the Rod of Alsa Thel 0/1 (ALL)\nThis item is crafted via the solo task \" To Kill a Thel Ereth Ril [quest=5534]\" from Alchemist Vaskerin (no pre-requisites for requesting).\n\n---\n\n2\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Fertility 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Lunanyn\" in the Sentry Stone of Lunanyn's room in Sepulcher East (southernmost sentry room) at about 100, -900, 4._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Fertility: All Tangled Up [quest=5735]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 4 creatures of Lunanyn that are buffed with \"Vine Lace\"._\n\\- Relic of Fertility: Be Not Swift to Anger [quest=5736]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 3 Alarans successively while not aggro'ing any plants or animals._\n\\- Relic of Fertility: The Poisoned Pit [quest=5737]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Pull creatures into the pit and kill them (5 mobs)._\n\\- Relic of Fertility: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5738]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill the thelasa of fertility._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n3\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Beasts 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Illdaera\" in the Sentry Stone of Kolos's room in Sepulcher East (the lower of the two middle sentry rooms) at about 275, -1280, 8._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Beasts: Come Into My Lair [quest=5739]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Use the \"Kangon Lyre\" to lure Alaran followers of Kolos into the tunnel-caves and kill them (2 mobs)._\n\\- Relic of Beasts: Culling the Herd [quest=5740]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 6 lesser creatures of Kolos (beasts)._\n\\- Relic of Beasts: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5741]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 2 thelasas of beasts._\n\\- Relic of Beasts: Usurping a Champion [quest=5742]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Discover and kill the beasts who have become champions (2 mobs -- beasts fight in the pit; sometimes, one will become a champion)._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n4\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Magic 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Lunanyn\" in the Sentry Stone of Alra's room in Sepulcher East (the upper of the two middle sentry rooms) at about 800, -1020, 11._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Magic: Seperated From Your God [quest=5743]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill the denizens of magic (non-Alarans) when they are not strengthened by Alra (5 mobs)._\n\\- Relic of Magic: Resonant Destruction [quest=5744]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill the casters of Alra while they are resonating near the crystals (4 mobs)._\n\\- Relic of Magic: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5745]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 4 thelasas of magic._\n\\- Relic of Magic: Unbalancing the Forces [quest=5746]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill enough followers of light to make dark stronger; touch the dark crystal._\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill enough followers of dark to make light stronger; touch the light crystal._\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill enough followers of nature to make arcane stronger; touch the arcane crystal._\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill enough followers of arcane to make nature stronger; touch the nature crystal._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n5\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Oratory 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Illdaera\" in the Sentry Stone of Ryken's room in Sepulcher East (the northernmost sentry room) at about 1550, -750, 9._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Oratory: Blood on the Wind [quest=5747]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Collect 5 samples of alsa-infused wind from the creatures of Ryken._\n\\- Relic of Oratory: Philosophical Rejection [quest=5748]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 8 denizens of wind (any mobs)._\n\\- Relic of Oratory: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5749]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 3 thelasas of oratory._\n\\- Relic of Oratory: Time Trial of Wind [quest=5750]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Reach the Relic of Oratory within 10 minutes._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n6\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Decay 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Lunanyn\" in the Sentry Stone of Sholoth's room in Sepulcher West (southernmost sentry room) at about 0, -1000, 4._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Decay: Bone Density [quest=5751]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 4 creatures of bone that have gained peak strength (skeletal mobs with both spells on them)._\n\\- Relic of Decay: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5752]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 2 thelasas of decay._\n\\- Relic of Decay: Sweeping up the Dead [quest=5753]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 7 denizens of decay (any mobs will do)._\n\\- Relic of Decay: Filthy Lure [quest=5754]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Use the \"Decaying Pumpkin\" you receive to plant a pumpkin on the ground. When a swinetor arrives, kill it (3 kills)._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n7\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Tides 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Illdaera\" in the Sentry Stone of Oseka's room in Sepulcher West (lower of the two sentry rooms) at about 560, 1260, 9._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Tides: Coastal Extinction [quest=5755]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 6 underwater creatures (any shark, kraken, or turtle updates)._\n\\- Relic of Tides: Tainting the Pools [quest=5756]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Use the \"Vial of Poisoned Tides\" you receive to poison the tidepools near the Relic of Tides._\n\\- Relic of Tides: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5757]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 2 thelasas of tides._\n\\- Relic of Tides: Decimating the Vanguard [quest=5758]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 7 tide fighters (Alarans or Hadal update this step)._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n8\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Battle 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Lunanyn\" in the Sentry Stone of Illdaera's room in Sepulcher West (upper of the two middle sentry rooms) at about 930, 1000, 8._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Battle: Time Trial of Steel [quest=5759]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Reach the Relic of Battle within 6 minutes._\n\\- Relic of Battle: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5760]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 2 thelasas of battle._\n\\- Relic of Battle: Winning the Battle [quest=5761]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 6 denizens of steel (any mob)._\n\\- Relic of Battle: Steel Reclamation [quest=5762]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Weaken the juggernauts or gigyns to near-death and click the \"Steel Repulsion\" on them (3 mobs)._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._\n\n---\n\n9\\. Collect 50 Alsa Thel of Splendor 0/1 (ALL)\n_See \"a thelasa ereth of Illdaera\" in the Sentry Stone of Ladrys's room in Sepulcher West (northernmost sentry room) at about 1425, 700, 9._\n_When hailed, this mob will offer (at random) one of four shared tasks:_\n\\- Relic of Splendor: The Purest Splendor [quest=5763]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 2 shards of pure splendor (these appear when crystalline golems are killed)._\n\\- Relic of Splendor: Time Trial of Resplendence [quest=5764]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Reach the Relic of Splendor within 8 minutes._\n\\- Relic of Splendor: Thelasas of the Relic [quest=5765]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 3 thelasas of splendor._\n\\- Relic of Splendor: The Lost Initiate [quest=5766]\n\\-\\-\\-------- _Kill 1 lost initiate (these are summoned when Alarans are killed; they wander the area)._\n_NOTE: Each of these four tasks gives 3-7 \"Alsa Thel\" vials of its type and shares a one-hour lockout timer._",
    },
