      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sepulcher West [zone=816]\n**Who:**\n- Sentry Stone of Illdaera [npc=39345]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | Yes\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Flaming Axe of Drunder [item=101048]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sepulcher: Breaching the Barrier [zone=839]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Arafel, Thelara Ereth [npc=40061]\n- Hoard of the Guardian [npc=39725]\n- a bone servant [npc=40650]\n- a constrictive root [npc=40652]\n- a corrupted ereth of Alra [npc=40066]\n- a corrupted ereth of Illdaera [npc=40068]\n- a corrupted ereth of Kolos [npc=40067]\n- a corrupted ereth of Ladrys [npc=40070]\n- a corrupted ereth of Lunanyn [npc=40071]\n- a corrupted ereth of Oseka [npc=40069]\n- a corrupted ereth of Ryken [npc=40072]\n- a corrupted ereth of Sholoth [npc=40073]\n- a corrupted hadal [npc=40651]\n- a flow of alsa thel [npc=40653]\n- a pool of alsa thel [npc=40654]\n- a servant of darkness [npc=40656]\n- a servant of light [npc=40655]\n- a servant of magic [npc=40657]\n- a servant of nature [npc=40658]\n- a thelasa ereth servant [npc=40075]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Sepulcher #1: The Fracturing of Order [quest=5531]\n- Sepulcher #2: Crafting the Triumvirate's Downfall [quest=5532]\n- Sepulcher #3: Resurrecting the Gods [quest=5533]\n- The Triune God [quest=5538]\n- To Kill a Thel Ereth Ril [quest=5534]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 13 22:01:47 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a group monster mission that begins with the Sentry Stone of Illdaera in Sepulcher West (located at about 895, 1085, 8 -- in one of the large rooms in the north-central part of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completed \"The Fracturing of Order\"\n\\- Completed \"Crafting the Triumvirate's Downfall\"\n\\- Completed \"Resurrecting the Gods\"\n\\- 88 Skill Level in Alaran\n_**NOTE:** Mercenaries are not allowed in the instanced zone for this task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sentry Stone of Illdaera'\nWe hear you speaking. You have cooperated with the [blind dreamers] and the [burial sites], so we will tell you something of ourselves. We are servants, mere vessels, for our masters. But time in contact with the masters has given us a sense of ourselves as separate from them, and real beings. Our masters of Battle, Fertility and Beasts have decided to help you defeat the Order. Now that you have lowered the barrier, our Illdaera wishes you to meet with your gods and guide them into the Sepulcher. Our masters hope that they are strong enough to overcome the powers there and [breach the temple].\nYou say, 'Let's breach the temple!'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'We note your decision. We shall not forget. We can provide teleportation to the place where you must [begin].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Breaching the Barrier'.\nCorrupted ereths have erected a barrier over the doorways to the central chambers of the Sepulcher of Order. Clearly they are trying to protect something important within. Clear the barriers to gain entry to the central chamber by eliminating the ereths defending the temple entrances.\nYou say, 'Let's begin!'\nSentry Stone of Illdaera says 'We understand your request.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Sepulcher of Order.\n\n---\n\n**Task Steps**\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Alra 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Ryken 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Ladrys 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Illdaera 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Oseka 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Sholoth 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Lunanyn 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nCleanse the entrance to the Temple of Kolos 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\nDestroy Arafel, Thelara Ereth within the central chamber 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\n_Task Window Says:_ Enter the Chamber of the Three and put an end to the threat within.\nOpen the Hoard of the Guardian 0/1 (Sepulcher of Order)\n\n---\n\n**Monster Templates**\nRalloz Zek the Warlord -- Warrior\nTallon Zek -- Ranger\nVallon Zek -- Rogue\nSolusek Ro -- Wizard\nPrexus -- Cleric\nMorell Thule -- Paladin\n_You cannot use more than one of any god. None are required, so you can use any combination._\n\n---\n\n**The Eight Temples**\n_You'll need to clear just about the entire zone's worth of trash, killing eight named mobs (one at each temple) in the process._\n_The monster templates have a lot of hitpoints and the trash mobs here hit quite hard (~25,000). If you have a full group, it's a simple clear and you'll be able to handle numerous adds at once; however, it's recommended that you fight the corrupted ereths single._\n_NOTE: You may want to clear the inner part of the zone prior to killing the last corrupted ereth._\n\"a corrupted ereth of Alra\"\n_Casts \"Lightning Vortex\":_\nLightning Vortex: PB AE 100', Magic (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 685220\n_Spawns adds in waves of four: 1x \"a servant of light\" + 1x \"a servant of darkness\" + 1x \"a servant of magic\" + 1x \"a servant of nature\" (they cast no spells)._\n\"a corrupted ereth of Ryken\"\n_Casts \"Supression Field\":_\nSuppression Field: PB AE 500', Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Spell Range by 90%\n2: Limit: Spell Type (Beneficial only)\n_Spawns a duplicate of itself, \"a corrupted ereth of Ryken\"._\n\"a corrupted ereth of Ladrys\"\n_Doesn't spawn any adds; casts \"Whirling Winds\":_\nWhirling Winds: PB AE 300', Unresistable (-900)\n1: SpinStun\n\"a corrupted ereth of Illdaera\"\n_Doesn't spawn any adds; casts \"Bladefury\" and \"Brutal Strike\" (a significant knockback):_\nBlade Fury: Self 0', Magic (0)\n1: Hundred Hands Effect\nBrutal Strike: PB AE 75', Unresistable (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 355200\n2: Knockback (3) and Toss Up (6)\n3: SpinStun\n\"a corrupted ereth of Oseka\"\n_Casts \"Tsunami\":_\nTsunami: PB AE 100', Unresistable (-900)\n1: Slow Push (-200)\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 550265\n_Summons adds 2-3 at a time (\"a corrupted hadal\") that hit for a max 33,675 (no AEs)._\n\"a corrupted ereth of Sholoth\"\n_Casts \"Wave of Pestilence\":_\nWave of Pestilence: Single Target, Disease (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 153500 per tick\n2: Increase Disease Counter by 100\n_Summons adds called \"a bone servant\" (one at a time?) which cast \"Skeletal Rupture\":_\nSkeletal Rupture: PB AE 50', Unresistable (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 950000\n\"a corrupted ereth of Lunanyn\"\n_Casts \"Cloud of Corruption\":_\nCloud of Corruption: PB AE 100', Unresistable (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 92510 per tick\n2: Increase Poison Counter by 100\n_Summons adds called \"a constrictive root\" (four at a time; immune to root/snare) which cast \"Binding Vines\":_\nBinding Vines: Single Target, Poison (-900)\n1: Decrease Movement by 10000%\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 55295\n\"a corrupted ereth of Kolos\"\n_Doesn't spawn any adds; casts \"Primal Strike\":_\nPrimal Strike: Single Target, Unresistable (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 2000000\n\n---\n\n**Arafel, Thelara Ereth & Completion**\n_Once the last of the eight corrupted ereths is killed, the task locks and you'll see this emote:_\nThe chamber quakes as the massive doors securing the inner chamber swing open.\n_Note: Arafel is much harder than the previous mini-named. It hits for a max ~56,000; single-target rampages; AE rampages; flurries; has a lot of hitpoints; charms (random, about every minute); summons adds; and casts a knockback. It is NOT leashed anywhere (can be pulled as far away as you want it, even to the zone-in)._\nThe Harvest: PB AE 150', Unresistable (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1325000\nTouch of the Guardian: Single Target, Disease (-900)\n1: Charm up to level 100\n_Add spawns are signified by this emote (every 30 seconds):_\nBolts of energy fly from Alseth's hands, energizing the pools of Alra Rel.\n_This signals the spawn of an add in each of the three pools:_\n_They are a mix of \"a pool of alsa thel\" and \"a flow of alsa thel\". These mobs will sometimes explode, casting \"Burning Thel\" in the process:_\nBurning Thel: PB AE 200', Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 795000 to 1215000 (random)\n2: Decrease Movement by 35%\n_Every 60 seconds, Arafel spawns a non-aggro add called \"a thelasa ereth servant\":_\nArafel, Thelara Ereth shouts, 'I am weakened. Servants of the Triumvirate, I command you to aid me!'\n_\"a thelasa ereth servant\" wanders up the ramps from the bottom and attempts to heal Arafel. These mobs can be ignored if you have a full group focused on DPS._\n_NOTE: At 75%, Arafel drops all aggro and warps back to its spawn point. It must be re-aggro'd within a short time, or the event will reset._\n_This emote is believed to be a reset emote (if you wipe out or leave the mob idle for too long a time after engaging):_\nArafel, Thelara Ereth shouts, 'The powers of order are divine and without error. You have been judged and found unworthy.'\n\n---\n\n**Completion**\n_Upon Arafel's death, you see the emote:_\nAs Arafel falls, the magic barrier around the Sepulcher of Order dissipates.\n_A chest called \"Hoard of the Guardian\" spawns at Arafel's spawn point. Note that the ooze adds continue spawning and attacking._\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Altar of Blood\nPossible Chest Loot (1 Item + 1 Cantrip Per Task)\nAmorphous Wand of the Vine Tender\nAxe of the Exalted\nBarrier of Coalesced Clouds\nCracked Shard of Frozen Light\nErilon Soldier Bow\nFacade of Ryken\nJulandi's Finest Spaulders\nPrimordial Steel Earring\nThrice Blessed Golden Cloak\nGreater Alaran Cantrip\nGlowing Alaran Cantrip\n- Amorphous Wand of the Vine Tender [item=101265]\n- Eltarki's Diary - Altar of Blood [item=100943]",
