      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Achievement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ancient Amber Faycite [item=71109]\n- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection [item=69998]\n- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection [item=69999]\n- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection [item=69997]\n- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection [item=70000]\n- Ancient Amethyst Faycite [item=71788]\n- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection [item=71781]\n- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection [item=71783]\n- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection [item=71746]\n- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection [item=71760]\n- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite [item=71741]\n- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection [item=71509]\n- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection [item=69888]\n- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection [item=71822]\n- Ancient Citrine Faycite [item=71716]\n- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection [item=71704]\n- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection [item=70914]\n- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection [item=71494]\n- Ancient Emerald Faycite [item=71821]\n- Ancient Emerald Faycite Bisection [item=70509]\n- Ancient Emerald Faycite Bisection [item=71277]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [7/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [4/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [3/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [5/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [2/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [6/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum [1/7]\n- Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp [item=71097]\n- Ancient Faycite Recrystallizer [item=70885]\n- Ancient Garnet Faycite [item=71759]\n- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection [Zeka #4]\n- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection [Zeka #5]\n- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection [item=71700]\n- Ancient Sapphire Faycite [item=71110]\n- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection [Zeka #2]\n- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection [Zeka #3]\n- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection [Zeka #1]\n- Crusty Were-Orc Claw [item=69893]\n- Dirty Were-Orc Claw [item=70040]\n- Dull Were-Orc Knuckle Bone [item=70854]\n- Grimy Were-Orc Claw [item=70484]\n- Grubby Were-Orc Claw [item=70518]\n- Grungy Were-Orc Claw [item=70485]\n- Knuckle Bone Extractor [item=70807]\n- Knuckle Bone Stringing Cord [item=70866]\n- Normal Were-Orc Knuckle Bone [item=70852]\n- Polished Were-Orc Knuckle Bone [item=70853]\n- Smooth Were-Orc Knuckle Bone [item=70855]\n- Were-Orc Bone Circum [item=70901]\n- Worn Were-Orc Knuckle Bone [item=70856]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Bloodmoon Keep: Bronzebeard's Fate [zone=545]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: Moonfang [zone=550]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: The Bloodmoon [zone=543]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: The Broodmother [zone=542]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: The Dark Crystals [zone=549]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: The Departed [zone=546]\n- Bloodmoon Keep: Walking Into Spider Webs [zone=544]\n- Gyrospire Beza: End the Return [zone=568]\n- Gyrospire Beza: How Does Your Garden Grow [zone=566]\n- Gyrospire Beza: It's All in Your Head [zone=569]\n- Gyrospire Beza: Sand in the Gears [zone=567]\n- Gyrospire Beza: Scout Gyrospire Beza [zone=560]\n- Gyrospire Zeka: Cut Off the Head [zone=564]\n- Gyrospire Zeka: Did We Forget the Cheese [zone=561]\n- Gyrospire Zeka: Intelligence Gathering [zone=563]\n- Gyrospire Zeka: To Climb a Spire [zone=562]\n- Gyrospire Zeka: You Might Poke an Eye Out [zone=565]\n- Loping Plains [zone=529]\n- Mechamatic Guardian: Disposing of Things [zone=553]\n- Mechamatic Guardian: Engine Room [zone=554]\n- Mechamatic Guardian: Mechamatic Memory [zone=572]\n- Mechamatic Guardian: Security, Yeah Right [zone=570]\n- Mechamatic Guardian: Tracking the Steamworks [zone=571]\n- S.H.I.P. Workshop: Administrative Assassination [zone=584]\n- S.H.I.P. Workshop: Deception and Interception [zone=580]\n- S.H.I.P. Workshop: Mechalossus [zone=582]\n- S.H.I.P. Workshop: S.H.I.P Sabotage! [zone=581]\n- S.H.I.P. Workshop: Tactical Teleportation [zone=583]\n**Era:** | !Secrets of Faydwer\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Mar 16 00:29:46 2012\nModified: Sat Feb 8 09:02:56 2025 | | **This is a \"Conquest\" achievement under the \"Hero's Journey\" tab.**\n**For an overview and listing of Hero's Journey achievements, click here [quest=5553].**\n_For this achievement, you must complete the following (follow links for details):_\n\n---\n\n**Preliminary Combines**\n_Gather:_\n\\- Crusty Were-Orc Claw\n\\-\\-\\- The Bloodmoon [quest=4354]\n\\- Dirty Were-Orc Claw\n\\-\\-\\- Walking Into Spider Webs [quest=4359]\n\\- Grimy Were-Orc Claw\n\\-\\-\\- Bronzebeard's Fate [quest=4360]\n\\- Grungy Were-Orc Claw\n\\-\\-\\- The Departed [quest=4361]\n\\- Grubby Were-Orc Claw\n\\-\\-\\- The Dark Crystals [quest=4376]\n\\- Buy Knuckle Bone Extractor from Derak Fangbreaker (requires apprehensive faction with Fang Breakers)\n\\- Combine each of the above claws (individually) inside the container to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Dull Were-Orc Knuckle Bone\n\\-\\-\\- Polished Were-Orc Knuckle Bone\n\\-\\-\\- Smooth Were-Orc Knuckle Bone\n\\-\\-\\- Worn Were-Orc Knuckle Bone\n\\-\\-\\- Normal Were-Orc Knuckle Bone\n\\- Buy Knuckle Bone Stringing Cord from Derak Fangbreaker (requires indifferent faction with Fang Breakers)\n\\- Combine the above five Knuckle Bones to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Were-Orc Bone Circum\n\n---\n\n**First Version**\n\\- Ancient Emerald Faycite Bisection\n\\-\\-\\- Moonfang [quest=4377]\n\\- Ancient Emerald Faycite Bisection\n\\-\\-\\- The Broodmother [quest=4358]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II in Dragonscale Hills (requires indifferent faction with Ak'Anon Strike Force V)\n\\- Combine the above two Bisections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Emerald Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II (requires indifferent faction with Ak'Anon Strike Force V)\n\\- Combine the Were-Orc Bone Circum + Ancient Emerald Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum\n\n---\n\n**Second Version**\n\\- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Disposing of Unwanted Things [quest=4382]\n\\- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Engine Room Schematics [quest=4383]\n\\- Ancient Citrine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Security? Yeah Right! [quest=4486]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above three Trisections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Citrine Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Citrine Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(updated version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n**Third Version**\n\\- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Tracking the Steamworks [quest=4521]\n\\- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Mechamatic Memory Manipulation [quest=4522]\n\\- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Scout Gyrospire Beza [quest=4450]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above three Trisections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Aquamarine Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Aquamarine Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(updated version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n**Fourth Version**\n\\- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- How Does Your Garden Grow [quest=4461]\n\\- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- Sand in the Gears [quest=4462]\n\\- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- End the Return [quest=4463]\n\\- Ancient Amber Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- It's All in Your Head [quest=4464]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above four Quadsections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Amber Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Amber Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(updated version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n**Fifth Version**\n\\- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Did We Forget the Cheese [quest=4451]\n\\- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- To Climb a Spire [quest=4457]\n\\- Ancient Sapphire Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Intelligence Gathering [quest=4458]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above three Trisections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Sapphire Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Sapphire Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(updated version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n**Sixth Version**\n\\- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Cut off the Head [quest=4459]\n\\- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- You Might Poke an Eye Out [quest=4460]\n\\- Ancient Garnet Faycite Trisection\n\\-\\-\\- Deception and Interception [quest=4544]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above three Trisections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Garnet Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Garnet Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(updated version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n**Final Version**\n\\- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- S.H.I.P Sabotage! [quest=4545]\n\\- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- Mechalossus [quest=4546]\n\\- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- Tactical Teleportation [quest=4547]\n\\- Ancient Amethyst Faycite Quadsection\n\\-\\-\\- Administrative Assassination [quest=4548]\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Recrystalizer from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine the above four Quadsections to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Amethyst Faycite\n\\- Buy Ancient Faycite Mounting Clasp from Automated Vending Unit II\n\\- Combine Ancient Faycite Bone Circum + Ancient Amethyst Faycite to produce:\n\\-\\-\\- Ancient Faycite Bone Circum _(the final version of the item)_\n\n---\n\n_There is no reward for the actual achievement; however, the final result is:_\nAncient Faycite Bone Circum [item=72220]\nLORE ITEM NO TRADE QUEST ITEM\nLore Group: Circum\nSlot: AMMO\nCharges: Unlimited\nEffect: Ancient Faycite Resonance Barrier (Any Slot/Can Equip, Casting Time: 2.0) at Level 80\nRecast Delay: 2600 seconds\nWT: 0.6 Size: TINY\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALL",
