-2105.6968, 37.9033, 127, 0, 0, 1, Polluter\\_Slaunk\nP 421.8936, -5863.8618, 290.3503, 127, 0, 0, 1, Cook\\_Mul\nP -535.9616, -3182.2971, 9.1717, 127, 0, 0, 1, Stitches\\_(roams)\nP -59.0828, -2375.8335, 10.3524, 127, 0, 0, 1, Beast\\_Caller\\_Plakt\\_(roam)\nP -541.6297, -5218.6670, -4.8171, 127, 0, 0, 1, Rotblade\\_Klonda\\_(roam)\n_Note: This is not a complete spawn list._",
