      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Bygral Tamescale [ _Portal Tender_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dire Tuning Crystal [item=106466]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n- Evantil, the Vile Oak [zone=873]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:31:07 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with an Iksar named Bygral Tamescale in Shard's Landing (in the northeastern part of the crater)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Bygral Tamescale'\nBygral Tamescale says 'Greetings to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. As you can see we are stationed here as the portal tenders for the gate that leads to Evantil the Vile Oak. Should you require fast travel to the ancient tree you will need to [attune] your body to the area.'\nYou say, 'Attune?'\nBygral Tamescale says 'Simply take the attuning crystal with you as you travel to the ancient tree in Beasts' Domain and activate it once you have arrived. Return here and the attuning process should be complete.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Evantil, the Vile Oak Portal Activation'.\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal while at your destination.\n\n---\n\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Enter Evantil from its actual access point. Head to the very southern part of Beasts' Domain to -6100, 3345, 40, where you'll find the roots of a giant tree. Head up the roots to zone in:_\n_For your \"beastsdomain.txt\" map:_\nP -3345.0874, 6106.0879, 40.8294, 0, 0, 240, 2, Evantil,\\_the\\_Vile\\_Oak\n_There, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task._\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to Evantil, the Vile Oak",
