      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Sir Delvas [ _Portal Tender_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dire Tuning Crystal [item=106466]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n- Commonlands [zone=463]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:31:12 2012\nModified: Sat Jan 18 12:18:33 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with Sir Delvas in Shard's Landing (in the northwestern part of the crater: 880, 75, 1)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sir Delvas'\nSir Delvas says 'Greetings to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I am Delvas of Erollisi. I have come to serve as portal tender for the Harbingers so that adventurers like you could seek safe passage to the Fallen Chapterhouse. Despite their initial impressions the congregation here is quite respectable. Though I do not subscribe to their doctrine I nonetheless respect their dedication to their deity. If you seek fast travel to the Chapterhouse you will first need to [attune] yourself to this portal, an unfortunate necessity of the teleportation magic imbued in the portals the Harbingers have constructed.'\nYou say, 'Attune?'\nSir Delvas says 'May the Queen of Love guide your path and keep you safe.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Chapterhouse of the Fallen Portal Activation'.\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal while at your destination.\n\n---\n\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Enter the Chapterhouse of the Fallen from its actual access point. Head to the Commonlands and to the entrance of Befallen (but not inside). Outside Befallen is a crystal at -1055, 975, 41._\n_For your \"commonlands.txt\" map:_\nP -975.0684, 1054.1019, 41.6716, 0, 0, 240, 2, Chapterhouse\\_of\\_the\\_Fallen\n_There, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task._\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to Chapterhouse of the Fallen",
