      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Tomekeeper Kerkaz [ _Spell Runes_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 97\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Lesser Dreadmote [item=132283]\n- Lesser Dreadmote [item=106476]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:59:21 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_Find Tomekeeper Kerkaz in Shard's Landing. He's at /location 435, 25, 0 (in a tent in the southwestern portion of the crater, slightly north of the quest NPC camp)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tomekeeper Kerkaz'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Who dares disturb my... oh, forget it. What do you want? Have you made yourself useful and found a [Dreadmote] or [Terrormote] for me, or did you simply want to [chat]?'\nYou say, 'Let's chat...'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Oh, wonderful. How has your day been? What brings you to the area? Are you sightseeing, perhaps? Or are you attempting to heal the very fabric of our existence and bring the Pantheon back in to balance? That's what I am here to do.'\nYou say, 'I have a Dreadmote'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Fear is a many-faceted concept. Pure Dread can drive the weak-minded to attempt foolish, foolish deeds in order to ensure what they think is their own safety. Dread is powerful for what it makes the weak do to themselves.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lesser Dreadmote'.\nTomekeeper Kerkaz in Shard's Landing has asked you to return any Dreadmotes you find as a reward.\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Lesser Dreadmote 