llage.\nMake your way to the village and take out a few of the garbage-dwelling vermin that have made the area their home.\n\n---\n\nExterminate about a dozen oashim 0/10 (Shard's Landing)\nTake out a handful of devourers 0/5 (Shard's Landing)\nSmash a pair of clickshell pests 0/2 (Shard's Landing)\n_Note: The Forsaken Village is in the east-central part of the zone._\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
