e to fail their initiation to the harbingers in person rather than simply becoming a meal for the naeya.\nKill a few different types of naeya to make the landing a safer place.\n\n---\n\nKill a few wild naeya 0/10 (Shard's Landing)\nEliminate a pair of naeya plainshounds 0/2 (Shard's Landing)\nTake out one elder naeya 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
