 End.\nTravel to the southwest and put down a few of the prowlers and gorals. Don't worry about collecting anything from the bodies, one of the other scouts will be around later to get the necessary samples.\n\n---\n\nClear a path through Corruption's End 0/15 (Shard's Landing)\n_\"Corruption's End\" refers to the valley in the southwestern part of the zone._\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
