      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Breeding Grounds [zone=871]\n**Who:**\n- Foreman Sukar [npc=41317]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dragon Egg Incubator [item=106341]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Eyska Va`Ker, the Broodmother [npc=41319]\n- a fearwing [npc=41492]\n- a fearwing watcher [npc=42161]\n- a hungry terrorwing [npc=42613]\n- a terrorwing [npc=42175]\n- a vicious terrorwing [npc=42614]\n- an elder fearwing [npc=42186]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breeding Grounds #1: A Chilling Rescue [quest=6074]\n- Breeding Grounds #2: Treading Lightly [quest=6075]\n- Raid Expedition: A Feast for Zalikor [quest=6079]\n- Raid Expedition: Velishan's Revenge [quest=6080]\n- The Rise of the Ancients [quest=6077]\n- Zalikor's Lair [quest=6078]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 22:44:17 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of three. It is a solo task that begins with Foreman Sukar ( map) at the zone-in of the Breeding Grounds (-20, 0, 4)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"A Chilling Rescue\"\n\\- Completed \"Treading Lightly\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Sukar'\nForeman Sukar keeps his tone low as he details the plan to find out whom or what is slaughtering the dragon whelps within the Breeding Grounds. 'Use the incubator at various spots within the cavern to [dispense] an un-hatched egg, which will serve as bait. Make sure you stay close and observe what happens. When you've placed all the dragon eggs, report back to me.'\nYou say, 'Dispense?'\nForeman Sukar places the incubator carefully in your grasp, 'I've inspected all the dragon eggs and they appear to be unharmed. I don't like leaving these defenseless eggs out as bait, but I fear it's the only way we'll be able to find out who or what is preying on the dragons' young.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Eggs as Bait'.\nForeman Sukar has asked you to place dragon eggs around the Breeding Grounds to catch who or what is destroying the Va`Ker's young.\n\n---\n\nPlace a dragon egg on the frozen pond 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Use the Dragon Egg Incubator at around 200, 35, -150 (this is in the ice cavern directly below the zone-in area, near the excavator update in a previous task)._\n_Using the incubator at this location triggers the spawn of three mobs (which appear single in increments). They hit for a max ~11,000 and have an average amount of hitpoints. You have two minutes to kill the three mobs, or the task is reset to this step._\nThe incubator rattles slightly as a dragon egg appears before you.\na vicious terrorwing shrieks and flies toward you!\nProtect the dragon egg from predators 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\na vicious terrorwing has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na vicious terrorwing falls to the ground.\n\n---\n\nPlace a dragon egg near the cluster of fear crystals 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Use the Dragon Egg Incubator at around 850, -530, -120 (this is in the northeastern cavern of the zone -- in the vicinity of Charra's spawn point). This triggers the spawn of three mobs (which appear single in increments). You have two minutes to kill the three mobs, or the task is reset to this step._\nProtect the dragon egg from predators 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Repeat as in previous steps._\n\n---\n\nPlace a dragon egg on the middle ledge above the mausoleum 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Use the Dragon Egg Incubator at around 1685, 170, 130 (this is in the northern-most cavern of the zone; the fear area -- click it on the middle balcony that overlooks the treasure room). A hungry drake will fly in and consume the egg._\nThe incubator rattles slightly as a dragon egg appears before you.\nImmediately after it lands, the terrorwing devours the un-hatched dragon, leaving only traces of broken shell behind before flying away.\nProtect the dragon egg from predators 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_There is nothing you can do about the egg! It's gone._\n\n---\n\nReport back to Foreman Sukar with your findings 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Task Window Says:_ You should inform Sukar that the Terrorwing have been eating the Va`Ker's young.\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Sukar'\nForeman Sukar gasps in horror, 'You observed a terrorwing feeding on the eggs of another dragon? Dragon's do not eat their young! This must be some sort of horrible mistake. Are you [sure] that is what you witnessed?'\nYou say, 'I'm sure!'\nForeman Sukar shivers slightly as the memory of a horrific undead dragon flashes through his mind. After a brief moment of stunned silence, he shakes the memory from his thoughts. 'If this is indeed true, the other dragons within these caverns are in grave danger. Eyska and her brood must be warned.'\nTell Eyska Va`Ker of your findings 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Task Window Says:_ Eyska should be informed of what the Terrorwing are doing. _( map)_\nYou say, 'Hail, Eyska Va`Ker, The Broodmother'\nEyska Va`Ker, The Broodmother eyes you carefully, uncertain whether she should trust your words. After a considerable pause, curious fear wins out and she speaks, 'Dragons have a taste for almost any flesh, but we do not feast on our own unborn. However, I have heard of the dragons you speak of; the dragons whose scales are flecked with crystal. Slaughter their kind until you find an enlarged stomach. Bring it to me, and I shall spill its contents to look for evidence of your claims.' Eyska sharpens her claw against the ice in front of you as a warning, 'If the proof cannot be found, I will slice your stomach instead.'\n\n---\n\nSlay fear dragons until you recover an enlarged dragon stomach 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Task Window Says:_ Eyska requires proof that the Terrorwing are devouring her young. She's asked you to slay fear dragons until you recover an enlarged stomach, which she will examine for proof.\n_This is a random update upon kills of terrorwing or fearwing mobs._\nReturn to Eyska Va`Ker with your proof 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_Task Window Says:_ Return with your proof to Eyska Va`Ker, The Broodmother.\nYou say, 'Hail, Eyska Va`Ker, The Broodmother'\nEyska Va`Ker, The Broodmother tosses the enlarged stomach on the ice before her. It slides a few feet away before the Va`Ker leader slashes at it with her claw, spilling the stomach's contents onto the icy floor. Eyska's looks on in horror as the still warm remains of her whelps cause steam to rise within her chambers. 'My children...', she weeps for the loss of her young as the rage builds in her bowels, building as it moves through her body, finally escaping her mouth in violent roar that echoes off the icy walls. 'They will pay for what they have done.'\nYou helped expose the Terrorwing's horrific deeds, while earning slight favor with the Va`Ker.\nYour faction standing with Va`Ker got better.\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
