      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Evantil, the Vile Oak [zone=873]\n**Who:**\n- Gevani Willowsprite [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blessed Fungus Food [item=107904]\n- Fear Fruit Seeds [item=107906]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bloated fungus man [npc=42429]\n- a fungling [npc=42620]\n- a hearty fungus man [npc=42431]\n- a powerful fungus man [npc=42430]\n- a putrid patch of fungus [npc=42212]\n- a robust fungus man [npc=42432]\n- a rotten patch of fungus [npc=42214]\n- a smelly patch of fungus [npc=42217]\n- a stinky patch of fungus [npc=42220]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Evantil #1: Fun With Fungus [quest=6081]\n- Evantil #2: What A Mess [quest=6082]\n- Evantil #3: Forbidden Fruit [quest=6083]\n- Evantil #4: Searching for a Cure [quest=6084]\n- Evantil: Heart of the Oak [quest=6086]\n- Fear Not [quest=6085]\n- Raid Expedition: Heart of the Oak [quest=6087]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 23:02:17 2012\nModified: Fri Jan 31 07:30:20 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the first in a series of four. It is a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Gevani Willowsprite ( map) in Evantil, the Vile Oak. He's found at -590, 3, 2. This is at the base of the tree, just west of the ramp that leads upwards from the ground level._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Gevani Willowsprite'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'Nature cries out to me. This land has become corrupted. The pain this land is feeling saddens me to my very core. You must help me find a way to [cleanse] the evil that has taken hold here!'\nYou say, 'Cleanse the evil?'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'When a fragment of the fear shard struck this area, this vile oak grew from the tainted land. In turn, it continues to spawn fear and evil, corrupting all creatures that dwell here. I am getting ahead of myself however. Let's start with something simple. I would like for you to help me with an [experiment].'\nYou say, 'Experiment?'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'The [seeds] of the fear fruit that the vile oak produces can grow into a myriad of various, fear-tainted creatures. Should we plant some seeds into some of the various fungus patches that grow about, I wonder what effect, if any, that a blessed mixture of fungus food would have on the seeds.'\nYou say, 'Seeds?'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'Collect some fear fruit seeds from any of the creatures that inhabit this area and plant them in the various patches of fungus in the wilderness outside of the tree. Once the seeds have been planted, add this [blessed fungus food] mixture to the fungus patch. The fungus food should greatly accelerate the germination of the seeds, and hopefully the blessing placed upon the fungus food will produce a normal, healthy fungus man. If you somehow misplace your fungus food just let me [know] and I can give you some more.'\n_You receive 8x \"Blessed Fungus Food\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Fun with Fungus'.\nA druid named Gevani Willowsprite would like for you to perform an experiment for him to see how corrupted the lands surrounding Evantil, the Vile Oak, have become.\n\n---\n\n_For \"eviltree.txt\" map file:_\nP 407.0453, 344.4227, 5.6960, 0, 0, 240, 1, smelly\\_patch\\_of\\_fungus\nP -420.0806, 1577.4841, -30.2050, 0, 0, 240, 1, rotten\\_patch\\_of\\_fungus\nP 69.6978, -1199.3391, 56.4474, 0, 0, 240, 1, putrid\\_patch\\_of\\_fungus\nP -986.6259, -560.8813, 47.8706, 0, 0, 240, 1, stinky\\_patch\\_of\\_fungus\n\n---\n\n1\\. Collect some fear fruit seeds 0/4 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Task Window Says:_ Collect some fear fruit seeds. Almost any creature that lives near or within the vile oak has a chance to carry seeds.\n_Kill mobs in the zone until you've looted four of these seeds. Note that these items are NOT pre-lootable._\n\n---\n\n2\\. Find the stinky patch of fungus and plant a seed in it 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n3\\. Give the blessed fungus food to the stinky patch of fungus 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This fungus patch ( map) is found in the northwestern part of the zone (outer area) at 560, 985, 47. This triggers the spawn of \"a bloated fungus man\"._\n4\\. Kill the Bloated Fungus Man 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This mob hits for a max ~12,500, and grows in size as you kill it. Upon its death, 6x \"a fungling\" spawn. These adds each hit for a max ~5,500._\na bloated fungus man has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na bloated fungus man's corpse has exploded and splintered into a mass of tiny funglings!\n\n---\n\n5\\. Find the putrid patch of fungus and plant a seed in it 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n6\\. Give the blessed fungus food to the putrid patch of fungus 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This fungus patch ( map) is found in the north-central part of the zone (outer area) at 1200, -70, 56. This triggers the spawn of a robust fungus man._\n7\\. Kill the Robust Fungus Man 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This mob hits for a max ~12,500._\n\n---\n\n8\\. Find the smelly patch of fungus and plant a seed in it 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n9\\. Give the blessed fungus food to the smelly patch of fungus 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This fungus patch ( map) is found at the base of the tree (inner area), northeast of the quest NPCs at the base of the ramp, at -345, -400, 5. This triggers the spawn of two powerful fungus men._\n10\\. Kill Powerful Fungus Men 0/2 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_These two mobs hit for a max ~11,500._\n\n---\n\n11\\. Find the rotten patch of fungus and plant a seed in it 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n12\\. Give the blessed fungus food to the rotten patch of fungus 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This fungus patch ( map) is found in the southernmost tip of the gorge at about -1575, 420, -30. This triggers the spawn of a hearty fungus man. If u die / evac and mobs despawn, you go back to Gevani Willowsprite, say \"know\" which gets your more Blessed Fungus Food. Then you have to say \"reset\" and choose which fungus you failed on and it will reset it so all you have to do is re-give the Blessed Fungus Food to it._\n13\\. Kill the Hearty Fungus Man 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This mob hits for a max ~12,500._\n\n---\n\n14\\. Return to Gevani Willowsprite and report the results 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gevani Willowsprite'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'The results you report are interesting and most disconcerting. I have underestimated the extent to which the taint of fear has taken hold in this land. I must meditate about this and see what else we can try. Before I forget, do you think you could look for my adventuring companion, Tally? She has a knack for getting into trouble and I haven't seen her lately.'\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n300 platinum\nExperience (4 AAs + 3-4% exp at Level 96)",
    },
