      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Evantil, the Vile Oak [zone=873]\n**Who:**\n- Bally [npc=41322]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bondado [npc=42434]\n- Gevani Willowsprite [ _Quest_]\n- Tally [npc=41321]\n- a wretched gatherer [npc=42226]\n- a wretched hunter [npc=42227]\n- a wretched scavenger [npc=42228]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Evantil #1: Fun With Fungus [quest=6081]\n- Evantil #2: What A Mess [quest=6082]\n- Evantil #4: Searching for a Cure [quest=6084]\n- Evantil: Heart of the Oak [quest=6086]\n- Fear Not [quest=6085]\n- Raid Expedition: Heart of the Oak [quest=6087]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 23:02:23 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of four. It begins with Bally ( map) in Evantil, the Vile Oak. He is located at 80, 10, 1167 (in the center area of the tree's top)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Fun with Fungus\"\n\\- Completed \"What a Mess\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Bally'\nBally says 'This fruit is delicious! I don't feel so well though. Can you see if Gevani has something that can help settle my stomach?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Forbidden Fruit'.\nBally has eaten fear fruit from Evantil, Heart of the Oak and is surely doomed unless a cure can be found.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Gevani Willowsprite 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Gevani ( map) is found at -590, 3, 2. This is at the base of the tree, just west of the ramp that leads upwards from the ground level._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gevani Willowsprite'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'Bally has eaten some fear fruit? That bumbling idiot! This is serious! He is surely doomed unless we can find a way to help him! During my travels in the Beasts' Domain, I met an alaran shaman named Bondado. Perhaps Bondado knows of a way to cure the fruit's poisonous effects.'\nSpeak with Bondado in the Beasts' Domain 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_This is an Alaran found in the Beasts' Domain at location -300, 2755, 27 (due south of Kalda and Mea Treg who are in the zone's northwestern corner)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Bondado'\nBondado says, in Alaran, 'If your friend has eaten the fear fruit of Evantil, he is surely lost. He will be consumed by fear and evil and his life will be forfeit. I do not know of a cure. I am sorry.'\nSpeak with Bally 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Task Window Says:_ Unfortunately, no cure can be found for eating the fear fruit. Return to Bally and let him know the unfortunate news.\nYou say, 'Hail, Bally'\nBally says 'Forget you and your cure! For the first time in my life, I feel powerful! I don't need you! I don't need anybody! Feel the power of fear!'\n_Bally attacks._\nDefeat Bally 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nSpeak with Tally 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Tally ( map) is found at -140, 70, 971 (a fair distance up the tree; past the ants/larva area)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tally'\nTally says 'You had to kill Bally? I knew something bad would happen here! Damn Gevani for bringing us here and damn those wretched alarans. Kill them. They did this to Bally! Kill them and make them suffer for what they have done!'\nKill some wretched alarans 0/10 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nSpeak with Gevani Willowsprite 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gevani Willowsprite'\nGevani Willowsprite says 'This expedition has turned into a disaster. I am sorry you had to kill Bally, but there was no hope for him. He is better off dead. While you were gone, I received a missive from an alaran named Yioan in the Beasts' Domain. Yioan would like to speak with you when you have time.'\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
    },
