      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Beasts' Domain [zone=810]\n**Who:**\n- Yioan [npc=41323]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Brain Fluid Extractor [item=108115]\n- Vial of Brain Fluid [item=107997]\n- Wretched Brain [item=107995]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a wretched gatherer [npc=42226]\n- a wretched hunter [npc=42227]\n- a wretched scavenger [npc=42228]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Evantil #1: Fun With Fungus [quest=6081]\n- Evantil #2: What A Mess [quest=6082]\n- Evantil #3: Forbidden Fruit [quest=6083]\n- Evantil #4: Searching for a Cure [quest=6084]\n- Evantil: Heart of the Oak [quest=6086]\n- Fear Not [quest=6085]\n- Raid Expedition: Heart of the Oak [quest=6087]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 23:02:26 2012\nModified: Fri Jan 31 21:13:43 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the fourth in a series of four. It is a solo task that begins with Yioan in Beasts' Domain. This is an Alaran found at -620, 2755, 10 (due south of Kalda and Mea Treg who are in the zone's northwestern corner)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Fun with Fungus\"\n\\- Completed \"What a Mess\"\n\\- Completed \"Forbidden Fruit\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Yioan'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'Thank you for coming. I did indeed wish to speak with you. I don't condone how you killed my people in Evantil, however, I do understand that they are hopeless and need to be put out of their misery. You should at least know how they came to be known as the [wretched]. We owe them that at least.'\nYou say, 'What about the wretched?'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'When the fear shard struck the area now known as Evantil, the Vile Oak, several members of our tribe ventured out to see what had happened. They never returned. They saw the forbidden fear fruit growing atop Evantil and tasted its nectar. From then on they were hopelessly addicted to its [debilitating effects].'\nYou say, 'What debilitating effects?'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'The fear fruit contains the essence of pure fear and those that consume it are unable to resist what it does to their bodies and minds. The grasp of fear overtakes and consumes them, making them want more and more of the fruit, until they are left a paranoid, fearful shell of their once former selves. It can also mutate the body, making it change into a form more appropriate for the Plane of Fear, than for our plane. Although one of our clan members has made strides in providing temporary relief from the fruit, more has to be done. We need a [cure]. They say it's impossible, but nothing is impossible.'\nYou say, 'What about a cure?'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'I would like to analyze the brains of the wretched. Perhaps I can see what chemicals are at play. Unfortunately this means more of the wretched will need to be killed. This is a grisly task, but I fear it is necessary. Will you [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'I am in your debt. Collect some brains from the wretched, and put them in this brain fluid extractor. Once you have enough brain fluid, return it to me. Try not to lose your brain fluid extractor, but if you do, I will [give] you another one.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Searching for a Cure'.\nYioan wants you to collect some brains of the wretched Alarans that dwell within Evantil, the Vile Oak for experimentation to see if a cure can be made to counteract the effects of the fear fruit.\n_Upon requesting the task, you receive a \"Brain Fluid Extractor\"._\n\n---\n\nKill wretched alarans in Evantil and collect their brains 0/12 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nUse the Brain Fluid Extractor to obtain Vials of Brain Fluid 0/12 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Kill wretched alarans (found throughout the tree) and place their brains inside the Extractor to produce vials of brain fluid._\n_Note: Brains are NOT pre-lootable. They drop maybe once out of every 3-4 kills._\nGive the Vials of Brain Fluid to Yioan 0/12 (Beasts' Domain)\nSpeak with Yioan 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Yioan'\nYioan says, in Alaran, 'Thank you. These samples should hopefully help further the study of a cure for the effects of the fear fruit.'\n_Rewards:_\n300 platinum\nExperience (4 AAs + 3-4% exp at Level 96)",
    },
