      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n**Who:**\n- Reena Kedson [npc=41324]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Swinetor Conquest Map [item=108195]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an expedition prisoner [npc=42140]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Grelleth's #1: Rise of the Swinetor [quest=6088]\n- Grelleth's #2: Dirty Tactics [quest=6089]\n- Grelleth's #3: Double Trouble [quest=6090]\n- Grelleth's #4: Halt of Decay [quest=6091]\n- Grelleth's #5: Raw Aggression [quest=6092]\n- The Machinations of Kotul [quest=6094]\n- The Queen's Decree [quest=6095]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 05:26:49 2012\nModified: Sat Jan 18 05:12:18 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the sixth in a series of six. It's a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Reena Kedson ( map) in Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth. She is located at 1200, 265, 0 (zone-in area)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Rise of the Swinetor\"\n\\- Completed \"Dirty Tactics\"\n\\- Completed \"Double Trouble\n\\- Completed \"Halt of Decay\"\n\\- Completed \"Raw Aggression\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? Nice to see you. I hope you're here to help us out. These Fear Shards are causing more trouble than we expected. Still, I've had enough of these Alaran gods. We have enough trouble with the Norrathian ones. Let's put an end to this together, as one people. And we have a [plan].'\nYou say, 'What plan?'\nReena Kedson says 'It's simple. In theory. First, gather [information] on our enemies. Second, we'll have to take out the [scouts] and any other [defenses]. Then, after we gain [access], we'll have to deal with the palace [forces], and recover any [clues] as to their further plans.'\nYou say, 'What clues?'\nReena Kedson says 'We're almost ready for an all out attack. But this is the perfect time to find out the scope of their true plans before we do. I need you to infiltrate the palace and see what you can find out. We'll keep the swinetor busy while you do.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Art of War'.\nThe Swinetor are on their heels. Find out what you can about Grelleth and her chief advisor Kotul.\nThe swinetor plans will likely be kept in the room of scavenged spell books and scrolls that Kotul and the necromancers use. The prisoners will be held in the dungeons or locked in cells.\n\n---\n\nDispatch swinetor that get in the way 0/3 (Grelleth's Palace)\nFind a swinetor map and give it to Reena Kedson 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_This is a ground spawn in the northwestern part of the palace's top floor: 6650, 190, 417 (last room in the northwest part of top floor, on a shelf)._\nReena Kedson says 'What'd you find? This map. It's outlined to a degree I'd expect from a proper military strategist, not some muck-dwelling swinetor. I'll have Jaris analyze this for the details. Short story, not that I need to tell you, but it's got a full on invasion plan, including taking Sarith and eventually Argath.'\nFind the expedition prisoners the swinetor captured 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Hail an expedition prisoner ( map) in the jail (northwestern part of the palace's second floor)._\nYou say, 'Hail, an expedition prisoner'\nan expedition prisoner says 'Thanks, I owe you for the rescue. I can get out by myself, don't worry. More importantly, you need to tell Ain and Reena about what happened. Kotul, Grelleth's son, is organizing a full-scale invasion. He's even practicing some dark magic using his mother's fear crystal that could summon an army of undead and shadow creatures. We are running out of time. I'll free the others, you worry about getting that information into the right hands.'\nTell Reena Kedson everything you've learned 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says 'This is disturbing. We can't wait any longer. Grelleth's army is going to sweep over this continent if we don't do something. Alright, talk with Ain. He's coordinating the large scale movements. Leading a band of peaceful civillians into a successful uprising is the kind of leadership I can respect.'\nYou have plans, maps, and information, but none of it is good. Grelleth will be need to be stopped if Alaris and Norrath are to be protected.\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
    },
