      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n**Who:**\n- Expedition Elite Guard [npc=41346]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a palace scout [npc=42130]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:12:23 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with \"Expedition Elite Guard\" ( map) in Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth. He is located at 1200, 200, 0 (zone-in area among all the expedition NPCs)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Expedition Elite Guard'\nExpedition Elite Guard says 'Honor to you, friend. I'm Reena Kedson's bodyguard. My name? It's not important. I was hired to... erm... \"watch over\" her and her companions and ensure their success. I am a [pratictal] man, I don't dabble in intricate plots and schemes. Our enemies are all around us, help me make their presence more... scarce. My employer will handsomely reward you for your trouble.'\nYou say, 'Practical?'\nExpedition Elite Guard says 'War is a simple matter really: the less enemies there are left alive, the more likely we are to win. My master... I mean, my employer, needs me to keep a close eye on Reena and her companions so it will be your duty to kill us some swinetor! They are gathering en masse so we must thin out their ranks. You should be taking out their Scouts, their Guard, their evil Casters and their meddling Beastlords with their pets.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Raw Counter Intelligence'.\nReena's bodyguard wants you to eliminate some Swinetor scouts.\nThe Palace Scouts can be found throughout the area.\n\n---\n\nTake out scouts in the surrounding area 0/10 (Grelleth's Palace)\nReturn to the Expedition Elite Guard 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
