t their Scouts, their Guard, their evil Casters and their meddling Beastlords with their pets.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Taming the Tamers'.\nThe Swinetor Beastlords and their pets pose a threat. The shady bodyguard wants you to dispose of them.\n\n---\n\nExplore the area and get rid of any swinetor beastlords and their pets 0/10 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Task Window Says:_ Palace Beast Handlers, Creature Keepers, Guard Gorals, Guard Braxi and Selyrah dwell to the North.\nReturn to the Expedition Elite Guard 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
