      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n**Who:**\n- Atri Kutsha [npc=41347]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a living filth creature [npc=42125]\n- a pollution monster [npc=42133]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:12:33 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Atri Kutsha ( map) in Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth. She is located at 1250, 320, 6 (zone-in area among all the expedition NPCs)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Atri Kutsha'\nAtri Kutsha says 'Peace be with you, wanderer. I am Atri Kutsha. While most people here are concerned about the politics, I am just trying to put a stop to the [corruption] that is spreading like wildfire in this area. Perhaps you could help me.'\nYou say, 'What corruption?'\nAtri Kutsha says 'To the west lies a polluted lake that is helping spread this disease and infuses living creatures with this plague. Go there at once and help eliminate the aberrations that have been spawning in the area. Golems patrol the lake shore and horrific creatures dwell within and around that cradle of filth!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Cradle of Filth'.\nAtri needs help to stop the spread of corruption. Go to the filth lake and eliminate the filth creatures dwelling within and around it.\n\n---\n\nEliminate the living filth creatures and the pollution monsters living in and around the filth lake 0/10 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Task Window Says:_ The polluted lake is located to the west. The living filth creatures live around it and the pollution monsters swim in its filth.\nReturn to Atri Kutsha 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
