      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n**Who:**\n- Celia Brightglade [npc=41348]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Enchanted Seeds [item=108403]\n- Polluted Garbage [item=107516]\n- Purification Tablets [item=108437]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a decaying swinetor corpse [npc=42117]\n- a polluted bunny [npc=42131]\n- a polluted water elemental [npc=42436]\n- a pollution golem [npc=42132]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:12:37 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo task that begins with Celia Brightglade ( map) in Grelleth's Palace. She is located at 2435, 2820, 17 (southwestern corner of the zone, on the west side of the lake, inland)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Celia Brightglade'\nCelia Brightglade frowns. 'I would normally greet you with a smile, but this land makes me weep. As a druid this place is an affront to all of my senses. There are piles of bones, pollution everywhere, and horrible junk golems roaming about. I can hear the land crying out to me to help cleanse it, but my magic has not been very effective. I can't even get a blade of grass to take hold. Perhaps it's time to try something different. Care to [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nCelia Brightglade says 'I appreciate your help. First, take these enchanted seeds and plant them on one of the decaying swinetor corpses near the lake. Hopefully the seeds will grow into beautiful flowers. If you need some more [seeds], just let me know.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Cleanse the Land'.\nCelia Brightglade, a druid, is saddened by the level of corruption and pollution in Grelleth. The land cries out to her to help cleanse it. Celia has asked you to help her with this endeavor.\n\n---\n\nPlant some enchanted seeds in a decaying swinetor corpse 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Corpses ( map) can found along the western coast of the polluted lake._\nSpeak with Celia Brightglade 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\nPick up some polluted garbage 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_\"Polluted Garbage\" can be found as ground spawns around the south and west coasts of the lake. They appear as green-colored wisps._\nGive the polluted garbage to Celia Brightglade 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace)\nSpeak with Celia Brightglade 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\nKill some polluted bunnies 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace)\nSpeak with Celia Brightglade 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\nKill some pollution golems 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace)\nSpeak with Celia Brightglade 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_You receive Purification Tablets._\nUse the Purification Tablets on one of the polluted lake's islands 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Right-click the tablets while standing on the island at around 2875, 2200, 40 (this is the second island from the south). This triggers the spawn of a polluted water elemental._\nKill the polluted water elemental 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\nSpeak with Celia Brightglade 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace)\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience (2 AAs)",
    },
