      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Grelleth's Palace, Chateau of Filth [zone=872]\n**Who:**\n- Bergan Nolain [npc=41349]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Cooked Selyrah Egg [item=108544]\n- Cooked Strip of Swinetor Flesh [item=108456]\n- Selyrah Egg [item=108117]\n- Strip of Swinetor Flesh [item=107510]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a campfire [npc=42112]\n- a guard selyrah [npc=42121]\n- a palace beast handler [npc=42126]\n- a palace decay priest [npc=42127]\n- a palace filthcaster [npc=42128]\n- a palace guard [npc=42129]\n- a palace scout [npc=42130]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:12:40 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo task that begins with Bergan Nolain ( map) in Grelleth's Palace. He is located at 2435, 2820, 17 (southwestern corner of the zone, on the west side of the lake, inland)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Bergan Nolain'\nBergan Nolain says 'Hello! This place may be filled with nothing but corruption and filth, but I think I may have found the newest [taste sensation]!'\nYou say, 'Taste sensation?'\nBergan Nolain says 'Believe it or not, the flesh of the swinetor is actually very tasty! How about you go and [collect some] of it for me?'\nYou say, 'I will collect some...'\nBergan Nolain says 'You would do that for me? Thanks! Just kill any of the swinetor around here and collect their flesh.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Good Eatin'!'.\nBergan Nolain has grown quite fond of the taste of swinetor flesh and has asked you to collect some more for him.\n\n---\n\nCollect strips of swinetor flesh from swinetor 0/8 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\nPut the strips of swinetor flesh into the campfire near Bergan to cook them 0/8 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\n_Out of this, you get Strips of Cooked Swinetor Flesh._\nGive the strips of cooked swinetor flesh to Bergan Nolain 0/8 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\nSpeak with Bergan Nolain 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\nCollect some selyrah eggs from the selyrah in Grelleth 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\nDon't pre collect the eggs. This will bug the quest.\nCook the selyrah eggs in the campfire 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\n_Out of this, you get cooked selyrah eggs. The west-most stone of the campfire in direction of Bergan is the only part which allows the eggs to get cooked._\nGive the cooked eggs to Bergan Nolain 0/4 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\nSpeak with Bergan Nolain 0/1 (Grelleth's Palace, the Chateau of Filth)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (1 AAs)",
    },
