      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Evantil, the Vile Oak [zone=873]\n**Who:**\n- Azkin [npc=41342]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a corrupted sapling [npc=42192]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:23:46 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Azkin ( map) in Evantil, the Vile Oak. He's found at -560, 20, 0. This is at the base of the tree, just west of the ramp that leads upwards from the ground level._\nYou say, 'Hail, Azkin'\nAzkin says 'Oh my. Oh my. You wouldn't happen to have a spare moment would you? This used to be such a beautiful place, but everything I do to try and bring a bit of natural [beauty] back is ruined by these horrors.'\nYou say, 'Beauty?'\nAzkin says 'Everywhere I look I see my hopes dashed to the soil and tread upon by creatures ruined by fear. All I wanted was to return a hint of what nature intended this place to look like!'\n_A task window pops up, offering seven tasks._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Admiring the Obscenery'.\nAzkin is upset that the flowers he planted have been corrupted and would rather they be taken out than let them pervert the environment further.\n\n---\n\nKill corrupted saplings surrounding Evantil 0/10 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\nSpeak with Azkin 0/1 (Evantil, the Vile Oak)\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
