      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Breeding Grounds [zone=871]\n**Who:**\n- Faiz [npc=41337]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:34:46 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Faiz ( map) in the Breeding Grounds (he is located at the zone-in: -20, 0, 4)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Faiz'\nFaiz says 'H-Hey, over here. If you have the time I could use a little [help].'\nYou say, 'My help?'\nFaiz says 'I thought my experience would have better prepared me for this place, but my ego far outweighs my talent at this juncture. If it wouldn't be to much trouble, I could use a little help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Finders of the Lost'.\nDuring Faiz's brief excursion to the depths of the Breeding Grounds, he laid out some survey equipment. The Chetari are curious creatures, so he asks that you clear out a few of their more curious members so the equipment will remain undisturbed.\n\n---\n\nKill Chetari seekers 0/4 (The Breeding Grounds)\nReturn to Faiz 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Faiz'\nFaiz's equipment will remain undisturbed due to the reduced Chetari population.\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
