      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Breeding Grounds [zone=871]\n**Who:**\n- Faiz [npc=41337]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a phase spider [npc=42172]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:34:49 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Faiz ( map) in the Breeding Grounds (he is located at the zone-in: -20, 0, 4)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Faiz'\nFaiz says 'H-Hey, over here. If you have the time I could use a little [help].'\nYou say, 'My help?'\nFaiz says 'I thought my experience would have better prepared me for this place, but my ego far outweighs my talent at this juncture. If it wouldn't be to much trouble, I could use a little help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Faiz's Fear'.\nA hardened soldier, very few things scare Faiz. However, the Breeding Grounds are home to one of the few things that do. If anyone from high command were to make a surprise inspection, he wants to make sure that nothing is around to waive his courage in front of his superiors. Ridding the Breeding Grounds of a few of these horrors would definitely put his mind at rest.\n\n---\n\nKill phase spiders 0/8 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_These spawn in the far northern part of the zone._\nReturn to Faiz 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Faiz'\nFaiz will be able to rest a little easier now with less spectral spiders around.\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience",
