      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Breeding Grounds [zone=871]\n**Who:**\n- Asupi Muksap [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dirty Onion [item=108069]\n- Fire Roasted Garlic [item=106367]\n- Lined Knapsack [item=108690]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an elder ashwing [npc=42185]\n- an elder fearwing [npc=42186]\n- an elder flamewing [npc=42187]\n- an elder icewing [npc=42188]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:34:59 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Asupi Muksap ( map) in the Breeding Grounds. He is located around 200, -350, -99 (from the zone-in area, head east into the narrow tunnels and to the northwestern-most room in those tunnels)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Asupi Muksap'\nAsupi Muksap's whiskers twitch as he speaks to you with a surprising command of the common tongue, 'Hail to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Tell me, do you have a discerning [palette]?\nYou say, 'Palette?'\nAsupi Muksap says 'While the Paebala and [Chetari] share somewhat of the same diet, our tastes are much more refined than our primitive counterparts. They choose to feed off the rancid corpses of dragons, while we prefer to feast on finer [delicacies].'\nYou say, 'What delicacies?'\nAsupi Muksap says 'A personal favorite of mine is dragon pate. It's mixed with a delectable blend of herbs and spices that will dance on your tongue! I'm always happy to share my culinary delights with someone else who appreciates a tasty morsel. If you bring me the [ingredients] I need, I'll be happy to prepare for you my delicious pate!'\nYou say, 'What ingredients?'\nAsupi Muksap hands you a lined knapsack. 'Fills this knapsack with dragon livers. Don't worry, the lining shouldn't leak. I'll also require a Dirty Onion, and some Fire Roasted Garlic, both of which can be foraged around the caverns.'\n_You receive a \"Lined Knapsack\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Delectable Dragon Pate'.\nAsupi Muksap has offered to make you some dragon patte if you bring him the ingredients he needs.\n\n---\n\nKill elder dragons for their plump livers 0/6 (The Breeding Grounds)\nThis isn't an actual drop, the task will just update itself.\nCollect Fire Roasted Garlic 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\nCollect a Dirty Onion 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\n_The above two \"collect\" items are foraged in the zone._\nReturn the Lined Knapsack to Asupi (The Breeding Grounds)\nGive Asupi Fire Roasted Garlic (The Breeding Grounds)\nGive Asupi a Dirty Onion (The Breeding Grounds)\nSpeak to Asupi 0/1 (The Breeding Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Asupi Muksap'\nAsupi Muksap empties the lined knapsack, placing the fresh dragon livers into a bowl before chopping the onion and garlic. He then mixes the vegetables in with the chunks of liver, adding a few pinches of mysterious spices as he forms the meat into a small loaf. With an accomplished grin spread across his face, the ratman extends the freslhy prepared delicacy, 'One bite of this pate, and you'll be back for more!'\nAfter collecting the required ingredients for Asupi Muksap, he made you some Delectable Dragon Pate.\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience + 2 AAs\nDelectable Dragon Pate\nNo Trade, No Storage\nStr: +3 Dex: +3 Sta: +3 Cha: +5 Wis: +5 Int: +5 Agi: +3\nHP: +100 Mana: +75 End: +75\nMana Regen: +1\nSpell Dmg: +2\nThis is a meal.\nWt: 1.0 Size: Small\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALL\n- Delectable Dragon Pate [item=108871]",
    },
