      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Camellia Spiretear [ _Portal Tender_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dire Tuning Crystal [item=106466]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Chelsith Reborn [zone=914]\n- The Grey [zone=131]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 04:30:50 2013\nModified: Wed Jan 22 11:48:48 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with an Erudite named Camellia Spiretear in Shard's Landing (this is the northeastern portal: 915, -525, 1)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Camellia Spiretear'\nCamellia Spiretear says 'Thank you for coming, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. The ancient Shissar city of Chelsith has erupted from the bowels of Luclin, and we feel the presence of our lord, Thule, there. We don't know why yet, but if you're willing to help us investigate, we can help [attune] you to this portal that can take you there.'\nYou say, 'Attune?'\nCamellia Spiretear says 'Excellent. Take this shard with you. Once you're inside the city, tap into the crystal's power and connect the portal to Chelsith Reborn.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Chelsith Reborn Portal Activation'.\n\n---\n\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Chelsith Reborn)\n_Enter Chelsith Reborn from its actual access point. Head to the far northwestern part of The Grey (1475, 1330, -33) and click the purple shard in the middle of the revenant lake._\n_For your \"thegrey.txt\" map:_\nP -1331.0991, -1475.7340, -33.3682, 0, 0, 0, 1, Chelsith\\_Reborn\n_There, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task._\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to Chelsith Reborn",
