      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Achievement\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Eye of Fear [item=112556]\n- Gestation Crystal Shard [item=56897]\n- Heart of Fear [item=56898]\n- Shifting Shard [item=56896]\n- Strange Black Rock [item=56895]\n**Related Quests:**\n- An End to Fear [quest=6930]\n- Breaking the Seal [quest=6832]\n- Hero of Chelsith Reborn [quest=6895]\n- Hero of the Heart of Fear [quest=6948]\n- Hero of the Plane of Shadow [quest=6896]\n- Lesser Hero of Rain of Fear [quest=6201]\n- Menace, Doom, and Horror [quest=6929]\n- Unveiling the Mystery [quest=6821]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 16 05:17:29 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a Rain of Fear \"Collections\" achievement._\nA sampling of the strange things from the deepest dungeons of fear.\nStrange Black Rock\nShifting Shard\nGestation Crystal Shard\nHeart of Fear\nParagon of Fear\nHero of Chelsith Reborn\nHero of Plane of Shadow\nHero of Heart of Fear\n_The \"Strange Black Rock\", \"Shifting Shard\", \"Gestation Crystal Shard\", and \"Heart of Fear\" are items to be collected. They are looted from chests that spawn at the end of the following missions:_\n\\- Unveiling the Mystery _(Chelsith Reborn mission #1 - drops \"Strange Black Rock\")_\n\\- Breaking the Seal _(Plane of Shadow mission #1 - drops \"Shifting Shard\")_\n\\- Menace, Doom, and Horror _(Heart of Fear mission #1 - drops \"Gestation Crystal Shard\")_\n\\- An End to Fear _(Heart of Fear mission #2 - drops \"Heart of Fear\")_\n_\"Paragon of Fear\" involves the completion of all Tier 1 and Tier 2 missions, and the three \"Hero of...\" achievements involve the completion of all Tier 3 and both Tier 4 missions._\n_Mission writeups along with pre-requisite outlines are documented in **this wiki article**._\n_Reward:_\nBard - Dreadstone Minstrel's Rapier\nBeastlord - Dreadstone Primal Claws\nBerserker - Dreadstone Ravager's Scythe\nCleric - Dreadstone Templar's Scepter\nDruid - Dreadstone Warden's Scimitar\nEnchanter - Dreadstone Beguiler's Wand\nMagician - Dreadstone Summoner's Orb\nMonk - Dreadstone Master's Katar\nNecromancer - Dreadstone Defiled Dagger\nPaladin - Dreadstone Crusader's Hammer\nRanger - Dreadstone Huntsman's Axe\nRogue - Dreadstone Assassin's Knife\nShadow Knight - Dreadstone Life Reaver\nShaman - Dreadstone Mystic Spear\nWarrior - Dreadstone Guardian's Blade\nWizard - Dreadstone Evoker's Staff\n_Raid Upgrades:_\n_All of the above class weapons are upgradeable to a raid version. To upgrade, loot an Eye of Fear from one of the three Heart of Fear Tier 4 raids and, inside a Rust-Tinged Box of Fear, combine it with your Dreadstone weapon. This combine results in a \"Possessed Dreadstone\" weapon, the raid version of your class weapon._\nBard - Possessed Dreadstone Minstrel's Rapier\nBeastlord - Possessed Dreadstone Primal Claws\nBerserker - Possessed Dreadstone Ravager's Scythe\nCleric - Possessed Dreadstone Templar's Scepter\nDruid - Possessed Dreadstone Warden's Scimitar\nEnchanter - Possessed Dreadstone Beguiler's Wand\nMagician - Possessed Dreadstone Summoner's Orb\nMonk - Possessed Dreadstone Master's Katar\nNecromancer - Possessed Dreadstone Defiled Dagger\nPaladin - Possessed Dreadstone Crusader's Hammer\nRanger - Possessed Dreadstone Huntsman's Axe\nRogue - Possessed Dreadstone Assassin's Knife\nShadow Knight - Possessed Dreadstone Life Reaver\nShaman - Possessed Dreadstone Mystic Spear\nWarrior - Possessed Dreadstone Guardian's Blade\nWizard - Possessed Dreadstone Evoker's Staff\n- Dreadstone Assassin's Knife [item=112438]\n- Dreadstone Beguiler's Wand [item=112398]\n- Dreadstone Crusader's Hammer [item=112443]\n- Dreadstone Defiled Dagger [item=112536]\n- Dreadstone Evoker's Staff [item=112535]\n- Dreadstone Guardian's Blade [item=112465]\n- Dreadstone Huntsman's Axe [item=112395]\n- Dreadstone Life Reaver [item=112513]\n- Dreadstone Master's Katar [item=112429]\n- Dreadstone Minstrel's Rapier [item=112396]\n- Dreadstone Mystic Spear [item=112397]\n- Dreadstone Primal Claws [item=112533]\n- Dreadstone Ravager's Scythe [item=112534]\n- Dreadstone Summoner's Orb [item=112394]\n- Dreadstone Templar's Scepter [item=112437]\n- Dreadstone Warden's Scimitar [item=112444]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Assassin's Knife [item=111981]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Beguiler's Wand [item=111982]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Crusader's Hammer [item=111978]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Defiled Dagger [item=111973]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Evoker's Staff [item=111985]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Guardian's Blade [item=111974]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Huntsman's Axe [item=111987]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Life Reaver [item=111979]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Master's Katar [item=111976]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Minstrel's Rapier [item=111989]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Mystic Spear [item=111988]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Primal Claws [item=111983]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Ravager's Scythe [item=111984]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Summoner's Orb [item=111986]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Templar's Scepter [item=111977]\n- Possessed Dreadstone Warden's Scimitar [item=111980]",
