ge)\nP 197.9796, 114.2787, -45.2977, 127, 0, 0, 1, Monarch\\_Deathwing\\_(Working\\_Overtime)\nP 1632.2094, 44.4872, -183.7435, 127, 0, 0, 1, Dreadmole\\_(Always\\_Follow\\_the\\_Money)\nP 2295.6174, -129.1931, -49.3643, 127, 0, 0, 1, Arachnox,\\_the\\_Dread\\_Widow\\_(The\\_Great\\_Hunt)\nP 2367.2195, 93.9744, -59.3600, 127, 0, 0, 1, Tleroth,\\_Mistress\\_of\\_the\\_Web\\_(They've\\_Gone\\_Too\\_Far\\_This\\_Time)\nP 2498.0000, 710.0000, 105.0000, 127, 0, 0, 1, Pollenix\\_(They're\\_Everywhere)\nP 978.4092, 943.4443, -260.8394, 127, 0, 0, 1, a\\_Bixie\\_Guardian\\_(Assault\\_the\\_Main\\_Hive)\nP 867.0208, 1256.5886, -198.7253, 127, 0, 0, 1, Princess\\_Honeywing\\_(Jacyll's\\_Jailbreak)\n\n---\n\n_Named NPCs are known to spawn in the specified heroic adventures. They generally start appearing after the fourth or fifth task steps have been completed._\n_Named NPCs don't always spawn. In cases where they don't spawn, a PH mob will spawn instead._\n\"Espionage Starts At Home\"\nan Enraged Bixie Drone\n\"Always Follow the Money\"\nDreadmole\n\"Working Overtime\"\nMonarch Deathwing\n\"Assault the Main Hive\"\na Bixie Guardian\n\"Jacyll's Jailbreak\"\nPrincess Honeywing\n\"The Great Hunt\"\nArachnox, the Dread Widow\n\"They've Gone Too Far This Time\"\nTleroth, Mistress of the Web\n\"They're Everywhere!\"\nPollenix\n\n---\n\n**Missing Nameds**\n_The named mobs \"Firesting\" and \"Gellwing Bladeslinger\" were included with this achievement in the release of \"Call of the Forsaken\", but have since been omitted as they don't actually spawn._",
