      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Neriak Fourth Gate [zone=943]\n**Who:**\n- Arch Lich Eliza [npc=44054]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Guard B`Div [npc=44450]\n- Guard D`Abth [npc=56388]\n- Guard D`Dbth [npc=44451]\n- Guard D`Enib [npc=44452]\n- Guard D`Niky [npc=44453]\n- Guard D`Nox [npc=44454]\n- Guard D`Rynd [npc=44601]\n- Guard D`Unnar [npc=44455]\n- Guard D`Vek [npc=44456]\n- Guard D`Vinn [npc=44457]\n- Guard F`Lor [npc=44458]\n- Guard J`Onit [npc=44459]\n- Guard J`Ran [npc=44460]\n- Guard K`Elom [npc=44461]\n- Guard K`Shin [npc=44462]\n- Guard K`Zad [npc=44463]\n- Guard L`Crit [npc=44464]\n- Guard L`Kalqu [npc=44465]\n- Guard L`Lozz [npc=44466]\n- Guard M`Gana [npc=44467]\n- Guard M`Inat [npc=44468]\n- Guard M`Oretil [npc=44469]\n- Guard M`Rekkor [npc=44470]\n- Guard Mi`Seph [npc=44471]\n- Guard Mi`Vain [npc=44472]\n- Guard N`Lar [npc=44473]\n- Guard N`Mar [npc=44474]\n- Guard N`Tan [npc=44475]\n- Guard Punox [npc=44476]\n- Guard Q`Tentu [npc=44477]\n- Guard Qezz [npc=44478]\n- Guard Quexill [npc=44479]\n- Guard R`Dev [npc=44480]\n- Guard R`Jyen [npc=44481]\n- Guard R`Soro [npc=44482]\n- Guard Ri`Thgar [npc=44483]\n- Guard S`Kan [npc=44484]\n- Guard S`Kor [npc=44485]\n- Guard S`Lon [npc=44486]\n- Guard S`Tai [npc=44487]\n- Guard T`Nyal [npc=44488]\n- Guard T`Plth [npc=44489]\n- Guard T`Uzok [npc=44490]\n- Guard T`Vem [npc=44491]\n- Guard T`Vin [npc=44492]\n- Guard Tolax [npc=44493]\n- Guard V`Hul [npc=44053]\n- Guard V`Lask [npc=2209]\n- Guard V`Lex [npc=29222]\n- Guard V`Ljan [npc=44494]\n- Guard V`Oro [npc=44495]\n- Guard V`Retta [npc=44496]\n- Guard Vi`Jaz [npc=44497]\n- Guard Vi`Rix [npc=44498]\n- Guard Vo`Dani [npc=44499]\n- Guard X`Teria [npc=44500]\n- Guard X`Tiz [npc=44501]\n- Guard Y`Lask [npc=44502]\n- Guard Y`Shyund [npc=44503]\n- Guard Z`Shoen [npc=44504]\n- Guard Z`Tonal [npc=44505]\n- Guard Zaxon [npc=44506]\n- Guard Zexus [npc=44507]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 8 07:12:10 2013\nModified: Mon Mar 11 07:11:27 2024 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Arch Lich Eliza ( **click for map**) in Neriak Fourth Gate. She's located at 775, 580, -32 (first floor of the House of the Dead). You must be in Dark Elf form in order to speak her, otherwise she will brush you off._\nYou say, 'Hail, Arch Lich Eliza'\nArch Lich Eliza speaks without looking away from the bookshelf. 'Tell me, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, are you loyal to the queen or to the king? I try to distance myself from the dramatics of royalty, but her majesty's devotion to the necromantic arts has drawn me to these halls. Her collection of summoning tomes is unrivaled! Of course, it's far from complete. The king refuses to let some of the books leave the palace -- a bit obsessive, if you ask me -- but I digress. If you're inclined to [help] further the research being done here, I have just the task in mind.'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nArch Lich Eliza lowers her voice. 'Find your way to Darklight Palace and recover books from the guards, even if you have to bludgeon them. Your efforts won't go unrewarded.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bludgeoning for Books'.\nArch Lich Eliza would like to add a few books to the almost-complete collection of summoning bones.\nKill guards within Darklight Palace who carry the missing tomes. The entrance to Darklight Palace is located in the southeast corner of Fourth Gate.\n\n---\n\nSlay guards within Darklight Palace to recover tomes 0/8 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\nReturn to Arch Lich Eliza 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n60 platinum",
