      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Neriak Fourth Gate [zone=943]\n**Who:**\n- Keliv N`Ryt [npc=44057]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 8 07:13:05 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Keliv N`Ryt ( **click for map**) in Neriak Fourth Gate. He is located at 250, -2085, 72 (the area in the east-central part of the zone). You must be in Dark Elf form in order to speak him, otherwise he will brush you off._\nYou say, 'Hail, Keliv N`Ryt'\nKeliv N`Ryt looks you over carefully, making note of all your visual characteristics. 'You resemble her a little, though her lips were a bit fuller. I suppose that's what drew me to her at the Maiden's Fancy. Something about [her] said, 'Invite me to your room, Keliv. I'll make all your dreams come true!' Of course, what I got was a nightmare! I went to bed with a beauty and woke up robbed of everything I own!'\nYou say, 'Her?'\nKeliv N`Ryt scratches his head in contemplation. 'Nadine? No, no ... that wasn't it. Natalia? Nalia, maybe? It was something with an 'N.' I know that much, but I won't let something as simple as a name stop me from getting my revenge. I'll just [hire] someone to take out everyone in this city whose name starts with an 'N' until I find my belongings!'\nYou say, 'You can hire me!'\nKeliv N`Ryt lets out a surprised laugh. 'You're willing to do this dirty work for a little coin? You're sick, twisted, and far more appealing than I first thought, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Never Trust a Teir`Dal'.\nKeliv N`Ryt's dreams were crushed when a woman he met at the Maiden's Fancy robbed him blind while he slept. He seeks revenge, but he cannot remember her name...\nKeliv thinks the thief's name starts with an 'N,' and he wants you to kill any dark elf female whose name starts with that letter.\n\n---\n\nKill dark elf females whose names start with N 0/4 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_You'll have to do some searching for this one. As the task says, any female dark elf whose name begins with an 'N' counts towards this step._\nReturn to Keliv N`Ryt 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n45 platinum",
    },
