ard J`Ran [npc=46326]\n- Guard L`Nare [npc=46292]\n- Guard L`Orus [npc=46327]\n- Guard Moros [npc=46293]\n- Guard N`Tan [npc=46328]\n- Guard N`Vul [npc=46294]\n- Guard S`Nez [npc=46321]\n- Guard S`Tai [npc=46322]\n- Guard T`Nyal [npc=46295]\n- Guard V`Rett [npc=46335]\n- Jaleer D`Vinn [npc=45667]\n- Katara C`Luzz [npc=46296]\n- Lynsalai N`Ryt [npc=46297]\n- Psal L`Orus [npc=46298]\n- Rozz T`Ver [npc=46299]\n- Tenso R`Jyen [npc=46300]\n- Vissa D`Estalian [npc=46301]\n- a palace courtier [npc=46255]\n- a palace guest [npc=46256]\n- a sleeping guard [npc=46257]\n- a stonetalon [npc=46258]\n- a visiting noble [npc=46259]\n- an alert guard [npc=46260]\n- an ornate chest - Royal Access [npc=46316]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Daily Task: Heroic Adventures [quest=7988]\n- Rozz #1a: The King's Court [quest=7399]\n- Rozz #1b: Hate Hath No Fury [quest=7400]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Jan 22 03:49:20 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n**About Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Heroic adventures in Call of the Forsaken scale in level: As low as **Level 75** and up to current maximum level.\n\\- Scale is based on the highest level player **present in the zone** and affects difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels.\n\\- There is some variation/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n\\- Time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- Collection items appear as ground spawns midway through tasks (you'll see an emote indicating their appearance).\n\\- Named mobs (or their PHs) spawn midway through tasks (usually, but always, at the same time collection items appear).\n\\- These tasks have individual **3-hour lockout timers** (timer gained upon completion).\n**Experience in Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Mobs in these instances grant some experience, but the bulk of experience is **earned upon task completion**.\n\\- As of a patch in November 2014, less difficult tasks were tuned to reward less experience and more difficult ones were tuned to reward more.\n\\- For an added experience bonus, check out **Guard Hamarn's \"Daily Tasks\"** [quest=7988].\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with Rozz T`Ver ( **click for map image**) in Neriak Fourth Gate._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Level 75\n\\- Completed \"The King's Court\" (heroic adventure)\n\n---\n\n**TASK SUMMARY**\n\\- Say \"intervene\" to request the task and \"ready\" to zone in.\n**Step #1:**\n\\- Speak to Rozz T`Ver just outside the palace barracks 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update (response depends on what step follows).\n**Step #2:**\n\\- Slaughter all the sleeping guards 0/12\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\n\\- Obtain attack plans Dreadguard captains 0/4\n\\-\\-\\- Loot 4x \"Dreadguard Attack Plans\" from the captains (each is in the side rooms and aggro-linked with nearby guards).\n\\- Disarm the Dreadguard 0/8\n\\-\\-\\- Loot 8x \"Sharpened Two-Handed Sword\" (50% drop rate from the Dragoons).\n**Step #3:**\n\\- Report back to Rozz T`Ver just outside the palace barracks 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n**Step #4:**\n\\- Find and use the key to the queen's bedchamber 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Kill guards until you loot \"Queen's Bedchamber Key\", then use the key to unlock the doors.\n\\- Pick the lock on the queen's bedchamber door 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Kill guards until you loot \"Lock Picking Kit\", then use the kit to unlock the doors.\n\\- Break down the queen's bedchamber door 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Click the doors to the queen's chambers to spawn adds; kill four waves (2, then 2, then 2, then 3).\n**\\- At this point in the task, collectibles spawn in the zone (ground spawns) and a named (or its PH) has a chance to spawn.**\n**Step #5:**\n\\- Find the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Click on the painting at -1715, -1185, 115 to receive \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\".\n\\- Find the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Click on the bookshelf to receive \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\".\n\\- Find the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Open the ornate chest and loot \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\".\n**Step #6:**\n\\- Find and unlock the secret escape route after the parlor has been cleared of guards 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Kill the 12 guards, then click on the bookshelf at /loc -1210, -700, 45.\n\\- Create a portal to allow passage into the palace 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Kill dark elves and stonetalons until you've looted 1x \"Dark Elf Blood\" and 3x \"Enchanted Stone\"; right-click the stones in the bedroom; then right-click the blood; then click the portal to port back to Rozz T`Ver.\n\\- As soon as the objective for Step #6 is done, the task completes.\n\n---\n\n**MAP**\n!\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_Jaleer D`Vinn (or its PH, \"Guard D`Lorn\" or \"Guard V`Rett\") spawns after the fourth step is completed. Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 100\nBuckler of the Turncoat's Anguish\nThexian Kite Shield\nLevel 95\n???\nLevel 90\n???\nLevel 85\n???\n\n---\n\n**TASK IN DETAIL**\n========================================================================\nTRIGGERING THE TASK\n========================================================================\nYou say, 'Hail, Rozz T`Ver'\nRozz T`Ver says 'The king's alliances are crumbling. His mysterious visitor has drafted a partnership with someone else, and his majesty believes it to be the queen. Although the queen is determined to get [revenge] by any means, she is not conspiring with the king's short-lived ally. His growing paranoia has left him eager to attack. Naythox will strike the Halls of the Dead if we don't [intervene].'\nYou say, 'We should intervene...'\nRozz T`Ver appears relieved, 'I knew I could count on you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.' The dark elf scans her surroundings before continuing, 'Meet me outside the palace when you're [ready]. We have much to discuss.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Royal Access'.\nEnter Darklight Palace and prevent the king's assault on the Halls of the Dead before finding a way for the queen to regain access to the palace.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nRozz T`Ver says 'Make haste, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Neriak - Fourth Gate.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #1\n========================================================================\nSpeak to Rozz T`Ver just outside the palace barracks 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Meet Rozz just outside the barracks.\n_If You Get This Step: This is a hail update. Her response will depend on which step follows._\n_If she wants you to kill sleeping guards:_\n???\n_If she wants you to obtain attack plans:_\n???\n_If she wants you to obtain weapons:_\nRozz T`Ver lowers her voice to a whisper, 'We're taking quite the risk by meeting so close to the barracks, but it puts us in a better position to destroy the king's forces before he has a chance to attack. An army isn't much without its weapons. Enter the barracks and steal whatever weapons you can. With the Dreadguard weakened, you'll be able to focus your efforts on finding a way for the queen to regain entry to the palace.'\n========================================================================\nSTEP #2\n========================================================================\nSlaughter all the sleeping guards 0/12 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Standard kill update (\"a sleeping guard\")._\n=====================\nObtain attack plans Dreadguard captains 0/4 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Loot 4x \"Dreadguard Attack Plans\" from the captains (each is aggro-linked with nearby guards). The captains are found in the side rooms in the barracks and are aggro-linked with the two guards outside the door to their room. The guards are known to be immune to root/snare._\n=====================\nDisarm the Dreadguard 0/8 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Rozz wants you to stop the king's army before they can mount an attack. Enter the barracks and steal whatever sharpened weapons you can find.\n_If You Get This Step: Loot 8x \"Sharpened Two-Handed Sword\" from Dragoons. The Dragoons here summon; and are stunnable and mezzable, but not rootable/snareable._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #3\n========================================================================\nReport back to Rozz T`Ver just outside the palace barracks 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Rozz would like to hear of your success.\n_If You Get This Step: This is a hail update. Her response depends on what the previous step was._\n_If you killed sleeping guards:_\nRozz T`Ver says 'Excellent work, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I'll take care of whatever reinforcements are sent to the barracks. In the meantime, you need to focus your efforts on finding a way for the queen to regain access to the palace. Thankfully her majesty planned ahead for times just like these. Within her bedchambers you'll find the items you need to help the queen find her way back to Darklight Palace.'\n_If you obtained attack plans:_\n???\n_If you looted sharpened weapons:_\nRozz T`Ver says 'Excellent work, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. The Dreadguard won't be much of a force without their finest weapons, though I'll stay here and fend off any that still wish to fight. In the meantime, you need to focus your efforts on finding a way for the queen to regain access to the palace. Thankfully her majesty planned ahead for times just like these. Within her bedchambers you'll find the items you need to help the queen find her way back to Darklight Palace.'\n========================================================================\nSTEP #4\n========================================================================\nFind and use the key to the queen's bedchamber 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ The queen's bedchambers are locked. You'll need to unlock the doors before you can enter. Check the corpses of palace guards for a key.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill guards until you loot \"Queen's Bedchamber Key\", then use the key to unlock the doors._\n=====================\nPick the lock on the queen's bedchamber door 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill guards until you loot \"Lock Picking Kit\", then use the kit to unlock the doors._\n=====================\nBreak down the queen's bedchamber door 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ The queen's bedchambers are locked. You'll need to break down the doors before you can enter.\n_If You Get This Step: Click on the doors to the queen's chambers to spawn of wave of adds; do this until you've killed nine mobs to open the doors._\n\\- 1st click: two guards\n\\- 2nd click: two guards\n\\- 3rd click: two guards\n\\- 4th click: three guards\n_Guards hit for a max ~14,000; and are mezzable, but not stunnable or rootable. While they auto-aggro on the clicker, their aggro can be dropped, and they can be split-pulled._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #5\n========================================================================\nFind the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Hidden within the queen's bedchamber is an item that may help her majesty regain access to the palace. Check obvious hiding places like bookshelves, paintings, or chests.\n_If You Get This Step: Click on the painting at -1715, -1185, 115 to receive \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\"._\n=====================\nFind the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Hidden within the queen's bedchamber is an item that may help her majesty regain access to the palace. Check obvious hiding places like bookshelves, paintings, or chests.\n_If You Get This Step: Click on the bookshelf to receive \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\"._\n=====================\nFind the queen's escape plan hidden within her bedchamber 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ Hidden within the queen's bedchamber is an item that may help her majesty regain access to the palace. Check obvious hiding places like bookshelves, paintings, or chests.\n_If You Get This Step: Open the ornate chest and loot \"Small Brass Key\" or \"Folded Note\"._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #6\n========================================================================\nFind and unlock the secret escape route after the parlor has been cleared of guards 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill all of the guards (reported between 12-16, could be more), and then click on the bookshelf at /loc -1210, -700, 45._\n=====================\nCreate a portal to allow passage into the palace 0/1 (Neriak Fourth Gate)\n_Task Window Says:_ You found a note with instructions on how to build a portal. Kill stonetalons to collect enchanted stone and dark elf nobles, visitors, guests, or courtiers to collect their blood. Once you have the required items, place the stones on the floor of the queen's bedchamber before covering them with blood.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill named dark elves and stonetalons until you've looted 1x \"Dark Elf Blood\" and 3x \"Enchanted Stone\". Right-click the Enchanted Stones in the queen's bedroom (this places the stones), and then right-click the Dark Elf Blood. Click on the portal to port back to Rozz T`Ver._\nYou place an Enchanted Stone on the floor of the queen's bedchamber.\nYou place an Enchanted Stone on the floor of the queen's bedchamber.\nYou place an Enchanted Stone on the floor of the queen's bedchamber.\nYour task 'Royal Access' has been updated.\n_(Task completes here; there is no completion text.)_\n\n---\n\n**TASK REWARDS**\n\\- a varying amount of platinum\n\\- a varying amount of experience\n\\- a varying number of Marks of Valor (currency used to buy group gear)\n- Buckler of the Turncoat's Anguish [item=114621]\n- Mark of Valor [item=113459]\n- Thexian Kite Shield [item=114613]",
