      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Dead Hills [zone=942]\n**Who:**\n- Adana Baxter [npc=45654]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Related Zones:**\n- Dead Hills: Raid Instance #2 [zone=990]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Adana Baxter [npc=45699]\n- Captain Kanteer [npc=45700]\n- Kyle Bayle [npc=45701]\n- Sergeant Brenn [npc=45702]\n- Sergeant Grady [npc=45703]\n- Sergeant Larenzo [npc=45704]\n- a Qeynos guard chest - The Legacy of Bayle [npc=45683]\n- a royal healer [npc=45695]\n- a royal scout [npc=45696]\n- a royal soldier [npc=45697]\n- a royal wizard [npc=45698]\n**Related Quests:**\n- For the Sake of the Forsaken [quest=7271]\n- Raid Expedition: The Doomscale Horde [quest=7253]\n- Raid Expedition: Xulous Prime [quest=7273]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 6\n**Max. # of Players:** | 54\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Jan 22 04:36:28 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This raid expedition begins with Adana Baxter ( **click for map image**) in the Dead Hills. She's found outside Skulk's tent (western side) at about -1310, -525, 3._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Level 95\n\\- Completed \"For the Sake of the Forsaken\"\n\\- Completed \"The Doomscale Horde\" (raid event)\n\\- Completed \"Xulous Prime\" (raid event)\n_Pre-Requisites for Participating:_\n\\- Completed \"The Doomscale Horde\" (raid event)\n\\- Completed \"Xulous Prime\" (raid event)\nYou say, 'Hail, Adana Baxter'\nAdana Baxter says 'Hey, can't you see I'm busy? Wait a minute. Aren't you \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? Oh, I've heard of you. Listen, I could use a [hand]. I'm working for the Qeynos government.'\nYou say, 'A hand?'\nAdana Baxter says 'Right. You see this Ethernere business? Well, it looks like it's affecting the Tower of Rot. Yes, that Tower. And it appears that the long lost should-be-dead Kyle Bayle is finally emerging from that decaying, festering eyesore. Things are moving quickly here, and if we don't stop him, who knows what would happen next? I was just trying to figure out a way to do it, and then a hero walks right up to me. Convenient, that. So, what do you think? You'll help stop that old Bayle, right? Did you want to bring a small [group] to take care of him quickly or a larger [raid] force to meet those monsters head on?'\nYou say, 'I have a raid'\nAdana Baxter says 'A little risky, but you're still alive so far so I guess you know what you're doing. Are you [ready]?'\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nAdana Baxter says 'This way.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Dead Hills.\n\n---\n\n**Summary**\n\\- Clear undead mobs from the area (a handful of \"a royal \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" in the area - relatively simple mobs).\n\\- Say \"work\" to Kyle Bayle to trigger the event, making the Captain + 3 Sergeants auto-aggro.\n\\- Kill Sergeant Grady, Sergeant Brenn, Sergeant Larenzo, and Captain Kanteer to complete the event.\n\\-\\-\\- Sergeant Grady casts an AE root + melee slow.\n\\-\\-\\- Sergeant Brenn procs a nuke for 75,000 dmg on his target.\n\\-\\-\\- Sergeant Larenzo mitigates incoming melee damage by 50% and is extremely spell-resistant.\n\\-\\-\\- Captain Kanteer spawns 3 adds every 10% health and every 2 minutes; casts Brenn's nuke; and uses Larenzo's buff.\n\n---\n\n**Triggering the Event**\n_On the other side of the tower, you find Kyle Bayle, his Captain, and three Sergeants. Say \"work\" to Kyle Bayle to make them all aggro._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kyle Bayle'\nKyle Bayle speaks with determination, 'Look around you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. The [Tower] lives and breathes, built with the will of my army and the people of Qeynos.'\nYou say, 'What about this tower?'\nKyle Bayle says 'We labor and toil, our work never finished. Yet here you stand before me, wasting precious time with your idle chatter.' If you aren't here to [work], then we'll use your bones the build the tower!'\nYou say, 'Your work will stop!'\nKyle Bayle says 'The delusional ghost of Kyle Bayle calls out to his sergeants, 'Larenzo! Grady! Brenn! We have a visitor who has offered up their blood and bones to help build our tower!''\n_At this time, the Captain and all three Sergeants attack. Kyle Bayle remains non-aggro._\n\n---\n\n**Event Mechanics**\n_\\- Event mobs can be pulled anywhere in the event area; they have no leash range._\n_\\- There are no balance requirements._\n_\\- The Sergeants can be killed in any order._\n_\\- The Captain cannot be killed until all three Sergeants have been killed._\n_\\- None of the mobs summon until damaged below 98%._\n_\\- The Sergeants and Captain are immune to all forms of crowd control (but are kiteable)._\n_\\- The royal guard adds are immune to stuns and roots. Soldiers are mezzable; others are not._\n_\\- All of the royal guard adds are charmable._\n\n---\n\n**The Three Sergeants**\n_Sergeant Grady hits for a max ~65,000 and casts \"Arrows of Rot\" every 20 seconds:_\nArrows of Rot: Area PC 100', Disease (-900)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 9000 per tick\n2: Root\n3: Inhibit Melee Attacks by 15%\n_Sergeant Brenn hits for a max ~65,000 and casts \"Guardsman's Fury\" every 60 seconds:_\nGuardsman's Fury: Single Target, Corruption (-200)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 75000\n2: Stun (0.01 sec)\n_Sergeant Larenzo hits for a max ~65,000 and buffs himself with \"Protection of Bayle\" every 20 seconds (buff lasts 36 seconds, so will remain on him indefinitely):_\nProtection of Bayle: Self 0', Unresistable (0)\n1: Mitigate Melee Damage by 50%\n2: Increase All Resists by 1750\n3: Increase Corruption Resist by 1750\n4: Increase Corruption counter by 99\n5: Increase AC by 60\n\n---\n\n**Captain Kanteer**\n_Captain Kanteer hits for a max ~95,000 and spawns a wave of 3x \"a royal \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" undead adds every 2 minutes and every 10% health. Adds hit for a max ~15,500._\n_Every 60 seconds, he buffs himself with \"Protection of Bayle\":_\nProtection of Bayle: Self 0', Unresistable (0)\n1: Mitigate Melee Damage by 50%\n2: Increase All Resists by 1750\n3: Increase Corruption Resist by 1750\n4: Increase Corruption counter by 99\n5: Increase AC by 60\n_He casts \"Hidden Misericorde\" on random targets (3-tick debuff):_\nHidden Misericorde: Single Target, (-200)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 28000\n2: Decrease Hitpoints by 2500 per tick\n3: Inhibit Melee Attacks by (90%)\n4: Decrease Movement by 5%\n5: Decrease STR by 500\n6: Decrease DEX by 500\n7: Decrease AGI by 500\n8: Decrease STA by 500\n9: Decrease INT by 500\n10: Decrease WIS by 500\n_Every 20 seconds, he casts \"Guardsman's Fury\" on his target:_\nGuardsman's Fury: Single Target, Corruption (-200)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 75000\n2: Stun (0.01 sec)\n_If he is below 75% health and any of the Sergeants are still alive, he casts \"Motivate the Troops\":_\nMotivate the Troops: Self 0', Unresistable (0)\n1: Increase Hitpoints by 1000000\n_If any Sergeants are still alive, Captain Kanteer remains health-locked at 50% health. He is otherwise killable._\n\n---\n\n**Failure & Reset**\n_If the Captain or any of the Sergeants are left idle for a short period of time, the event does a full reset:_\nKyle Bayle's troops have had time to regroup. You have failed.\n\n---\n\n**Event Completion**\n_Kill the three Sergeants and Captain Kanteer to complete the event. Note that the royal undead adds do NOT despawn upon the event's completion._\nCaptain Kanteer has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nIf you stand against me, you stand against Qeynos. Progress cannot be stopped, my friend. This Tower will be completed, and neither you nor the others will stop us.\n_Kyle Bayle disappears into the tower, and a chest appears at Adana Baxter's location near the zone-in._\n\n---\n\n**Loot**\n_NOTE: In addition to chest loot, everyone in the zone receives 20x \"Medal of Heroism\" (used as an alternative way obtain raid drops, from Requisitioner Sheon ( **map image**), the Tier 1 raid vendor in the northwestern Qeynos camp of the Ethernere Tainted West Karana)._\n_Chest loot consists of 2 armor pieces (first list) + 2-3 items (second list) + 1-2 weapons (third list) + 4 \"Captured Essence of Ethernere\" (spell rune):_\nArmguards of Suppressed Ether\nBand of Unquenched Bloodlust\nBrilliant Ring of Empty Oaths\nBuckler of the Roaring Lion\nDirt Stained Band of Twisted Roots\nEmblem of Lost Vows\nEmerald Loop of Salvation\nFallen Corporal's Engagement Band\nGaudy Ruby Encrusted Band\nLoop of Nature's Call\nSycophant's Carved Loop\nTarnished Captain's Wedding Ring\nLance of the Icestorm\nLieutenant's Ornamental Blade\nWand of Wanton Disease\n- Medal of Heroism [item=113132]",
    },
