      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Barindu, Hanging Gardens [zone=240]\n**Who:**\n- Apprentice Udranda [npc=15145]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Related Zones:**\n- Tipt, Treacherous Crags [zone=247]\n- Vxed, the Crumbling Caverns [zone=246]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kyv Heartstriker Jhiru [npc=14542]\n- Master Stonespiritist Okkanu [npc=15336]\n- Rikabi the Riddler [npc=14855]\n- Stonespiritist Ekikoa [npc=15327]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Gates of Discord Progression #1: Sewers of Nihilia [quest=7584]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #3: The Ikkinz Group Trials [quest=7591]\n- Group Expedition: Tipt, Treacherous Crags [quest=7590]\n- Group Expedition: Vxed, the Crumbling Caverns [quest=7589]\n**Era:** | !Gates of Discord\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Jun 28 05:57:28 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Progression into Vxed and Tipt follows the **four expeditions into the Sewers of Nihilia** [quest=7584], after which you are sent to see Apprentice Udrana._\n\n---\n\n**Vxed, the Crumbling Caverns**\n_Find Apprentice Udrana ( **click for map image**) in Barindu at /location 245, -750, -124 (outside the mountain passage in the east-central part of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Apprentice Udranda'\nUdranda looks around sheepishly. 'Greetings. A messenger told me you would come. I believe we owe you our thanks -- though I'm not sure allowing you to face the terror in the mountains is a reward. I will have my stone worker allow you to pass through, but you must [take heed] first and be as quiet as you can.'\nYou say, 'I will take heed'\nUdranda tells you, 'Good. There are many secrets I can't tell you right now for fear the Muramites might hear them, but you must do as I say and trust in me. In the mountain pass, Vxed, you must seek out Stonespiritist Ekikoa. He is my mentor and will help you in your quest to find passage to the peaks. We have created a very unique magic that we will share with you, but you must speak with him. It will all be clear to you when you find him. Tell me when you are [ready to pass] through. I cannot leave a way open for too long.'\nThe direction to the entry to your instanced zone(s) have been marked on your compass.\nVxed, The Crumbling Caverns is now available to you.\n_Complete the expedition \" Vxed, the Crumbling Caverns [quest=7589]\"._\n\n---\n\n**Tipt, the Treacherous Crags**\n_Note: At this point in progression, Apprentice Udranda stops responding to hails. Say \"Tipt\" to her to request the Tipt expedition:_\nYou say, 'I wish to go to Tipt'\nApprentice Udranda subtly commands her stone worker to open the passage for you before any invaders can take notice.\nThe direction to the entry to your instanced zone(s) have been marked on your compass.\nTipt, Treacherous Crags is now available to you.\n_Complete the expedition \" Tipt, the Treacherous Crags [quest=7590]\" (make sure to hail the NPC across the bridge at the end)._\n\n---\n\n**Moving On**\n_This finishes off the Vxed and Tipt portions of Gates of Discord progression._\n_You can now zone into Kod'Taz, the Broken Trial Grounds, and begin the **Ikkinz group trials** [quest=7591]._",
    },
