      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Argin-Hiz [zone=1004]\n**Who:**\n- Restless Spirit [npc=47270]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Argin-Hiz: A Posthumous Proposition [zone=1006]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Inferno Vortex [npc=47326]\n- a blaze vortex [npc=47336]\n- a cinderback spider [npc=47337]\n- a familiar of flame [npc=47338]\n- a keeper of the flame [npc=47339]\n- a laborer [npc=47340]\n- a messenger of Ro [npc=47341]\n- a minion of Ro [npc=47342]\n- a murkweb spider [npc=47343]\n- a restless spirit [npc=47344]\n- a rose viper [npc=47345]\n- a scholar [npc=47346]\n- a singedbones skeleton [npc=47347]\n- a slag golem [npc=47348]\n- a soldier [npc=47349]\n- a steward [npc=47350]\n- a timber wolf [npc=47351]\n- a warden [npc=47352]\n- a wildfire vortex [npc=47353]\n- an ember curator [npc=47354]\n- an ember hunter [npc=47355]\n- an ember huntress [npc=47356]\n- an ember sage [npc=47357]\n- an ember trooper [npc=47358]\n- an onyx wolf [npc=47359]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Daily Task: Heroic Adventures [quest=7988]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 15 23:46:52 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n**About Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Heroic adventures in Call of the Forsaken scale in level: As low as **Level 75** and up to current maximum level.\n\\- Scale is based on the highest level player **present in the zone** and affects difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels.\n\\- There is some variation/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n\\- Time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- Collection items appear as ground spawns midway through tasks (you'll see an emote indicating their appearance).\n\\- Named mobs (or their PHs) spawn midway through tasks (usually, but always, at the same time collection items appear).\n\\- These tasks have individual **3-hour lockout timers** (timer gained upon completion).\n**Experience in Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Mobs in these instances grant some experience, but the bulk of experience is **earned upon task completion**.\n\\- As of a patch in November 2014, less difficult tasks were tuned to reward less experience and more difficult ones were tuned to reward more.\n\\- For an added experience bonus, check out **Guard Hamarn's \"Daily Tasks\"** [quest=7988].\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with the \"Restless Spirit\" ( **click for map image**) along the western boundary of the courtyard area of the Keeper's Tower (far northwestern part of the zone, about 2120, 1405, -150)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Level 75\n\\- No tasks\n\n---\n\n**TASK SUMMARY**\n\\- Say \"willing\" to request the task and \"ready\" to zone in.\n**Step #1:**\n\\- Clear the streets of embers 0/20\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 20x \"an ember \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\".\n\\- Rid the town of Sol`Dal 0/20\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 20 mobs that are NOT \"an ember \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" or \"a laborer\".\n\\- Clear the creatures outside the front gate 0/20\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 20 wolves, snakes, and/or spiders.\n**Step #2:**\n\\- Clear the Keepers around the tower of Ro's Flame 0/10\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 10 \"keeper\" mobs.\n\\- Exterminate any imps you come across 0/6\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 6 fire imps (messengers of Ro, minions of Ro, familiars of flame).\n\\- Free the ash dervishes around the Keeper's Tower 0/8\n\\-\\-\\- Kill any 8 \"vortex\" mobs.\n**\\- At this point in the task, collectibles spawn in the zone (ground spawns) and a named (or its PH) has a chance to spawn.**\n**Step #3:**\n\\- Silence a few ember miners 0/15\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 15x \"a laborer\".\n\\- Eliminate the Sol`Dal soldiers in the mines 0/6\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 6x soldiers in the mines.\n\\- Clear the mines of non-elven inhabitants 0/15\n\\-\\-\\- Kill 15 golems, skeletons, and/or spiders in the mines.\n**Step #4:**\n\\- Speak to a restless spirit 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update to complete.\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_Inferno Vortex (or a PH) has a chance to spawn after the second step is completed. Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 100\nFlickering Jewel\nShroud of the Forgotten\nWhirling Earring\nWhirling Inferno Earring\nLevel 95\n???\nLevel 90\n???\nLevel 85\n???\n\n---\n\n**Triggering the Task**\nYou say, 'Hail, Restless Spirit'\nRestless Spirit's voice booms from a distance, echoing loudly as if speaking from across the field, 'My brothers! This stranger sees me.' The soft whisper of conversation grows louder in the distance. The voice continues, 'We never thought this day would come, stranger. We must make haste with our request, should your vision of us be a fleeting dream. Please, stranger, will you exact [revenge] where we have failed?'\nYou say, 'Revenge?'\nRestless Spirit's voice grows louder but still remains distant, 'Yes stranger, revenge, for we are the fallen, the forgotten, the broken and abused. The children of Ro hide us from sight but we are ever-present and ever-suffering. If you are [willing] to fight on our behalf we will reward you with the last of our worldly remains.'\nYou say, 'I am willing'\nRestless Spirit's voice booms from a distance, 'Your strength shall prove our gratitude. When you are [ready], close your eyes and awaken to see the city as it truly is.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Posthumous Proposition'.\nYour eyes have been opened to the presence of The Extinguished, the children of Ro whose flames have fully burnt out. They wish for you to serve as their arm for exacting revenge upon the living who have transgressed upon them during their lives.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nRestless Spirit's voice booms from a distance, 'May your day be bright and your nights short.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Argin-Hiz.\n\n---\n\n**Step One**\nClear the streets of embers 0/20 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 20x \"an ember \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\"._\n=====================\nRid the town of Sol`Dal 0/20 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 20 mobs that are NOT \"an ember \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" or \"a laborer\"._\n=====================\nClear the creatures outside the front gate 0/20 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ Often times when embers grow too weak to work the mines or carry out their duties in the houses of the Sol`Dal they are dragged out into the field and fed to the spiders, snakes, and wolves that roam outside the city gates. Thin the animal population out so that future embers may be able to escape.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 20 wolves, snakes, and/or spiders._\n\n---\n\n**Step Two**\nClear the Keepers around the tower of Ro's Flame 0/10 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 10 \"keeper\" mobs._\n=====================\nExterminate any imps you come across 0/6 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ The hateful and dimwitted familiars of the Sol`Dal often found pleasure in torturing embers. Their actions were often lauded by their Sol`Dal keepers. Return a number of these foul creatures to the ashes of their birth.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 6 fire imps (messengers of Ro, minions of Ro, familiars of flame)._\n=====================\nFree the ash dervishes around the Keeper's Tower 0/8 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ The embers that have lost the flame of the lord turn to ash and are bound to wander the city without ever finding peace. Help free our brothers from this wayward suffering by dispersing their remains.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill any 8 \"vortex\" mobs (found around the Keeper's Tower in the far northwestern part of the zone)._\n\n---\n\n**Step Three**\nClear the mines of non-elven inhabitants 0/15 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 15 golems, skeletons, and/or spiders in the mines._\n=====================\nEliminate the Sol`Dal soldiers in the mines 0/6 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 6x soldiers in the mines._\n=====================\nSilence a few ember miners 0/15 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill 15x \"a laborer\" in the mines._\n\n---\n\n**Step Four**\nSpeak to a restless spirit 0/1 (Argin-Hiz)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Hail update._\n\n---\n\n**Rewards**\n\\- a varying amount of platinum\n\\- a varying amount of experience\n\\- a varying number of Marks of Valor (currency used to buy group gear)\n- Mark of Valor [item=113459]",
