      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Degmar, the Lost Castle [zone=1019]\n**Who:**\n- Thubr Axebringer [npc=47720]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blank Degmar Scroll [item=119728]\n- Degmar Dwarf Blood [item=119732]\n- Degmar Inkwell [item=119737]\n- Degmar Quill [item=119736]\n- Full Degmar Inkwell [item=119743]\n- Memorial Ceremony Announcement [item=119742]\n- Sticky Mud [item=119739]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Lost Scribe [npc=47787]\n- a Degmar guard [npc=48061]\n- a Degmar guardian [npc=48051]\n- a librarian - Degmar - 1 [npc=48066]\n- a spectral librarian [npc=48072]\n- an angry guard [npc=48076]\n- an enraged guard [npc=48083]\n- an incensed guard [npc=48079]\n- an offended guard [npc=48080]\n- an outraged guard [npc=48081]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Castle Relic [quest=7757]\n- TDS Progression #0: An Overview [quest=7701]\n- TDS Progression #11: The Sacred Profaned [quest=7713]\n- TDS Progression #13: Burden of the Past [quest=7715]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 02:56:11 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Thubr Axebringer ( **click for map image**) in the western wing of Degmar._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Completion of \"A Rising Storm\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"Gathering Clouds\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"Clearer Skies\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"The Edge of Balance\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \"The Abscent Scholar\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \"Just Recompense\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \"The Cover of Night\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \"Loyal is the Heart\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\\- Completion of \"Leave No Brother Behind\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\\- Completion of \"Two Sides of the Shield\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\\- Completion of \"The Sacred Profaned\" (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n**\\- Completion of \"Castle Relic\" (non-progression Degmar Heroic Adventure)**\n_Say \"make\" to request the task._\n_Upon completion of the previous task, you saw:_\nThubr Axebringer beckons you closer. '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, almost time... time to [show] 'em...'\nYou say, 'Hail, Thubr Axebringer'\nThubr Axebringer keeps his eyes closed as he waves you away. 'Let me 'lone. I shouldna been there...' Thubr's breath smells of ale. 'Failed [again]... Will [show] them...'\nYou say, 'Show them?'\nThubr Axebringer says 'Yes, we'll... gather 'em. Come together in worship... ask forgiveness. Unused scrolls, glue, and blood... invite 'em. [Make] 'em look.'\nYou say, 'I'll make 'em look...'\nThubr Axebringer closes his eyes and hits himself in the forehead. 'Make 'em remember...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Crying for the Dead'.\nThubr wants you to proclaim the ceremony to the dwarves. To do so, you must gather the items to create announcements and then place the announcements around Degmar.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nTake a blank scroll from a librarian 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nTake a quill from the lost scribe 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nTake an inkwell from the lost scribe 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nTake drops of blood from the dwarves and combine them in the inkwell 0/10 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nPick up some sticky mud in the library 0/5 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nCreate announcements. Combine the full inkwell, sticky mud, and quill in the scroll 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n_Any \"librarian\" (undead or live) can drop a \"Blank Degmar Scroll\"._\n_The \"Lost Scribe\" is an undead mob found on the upper level of the library's rotunda. It's social with the other undead; is immune to root/snare; and has a lot of hitpoints. It drops \"Degmar Inkwell\" and \"Degmar Quill\"._\n_Any Dwarf mob (except, apparently, the librarians) can drop \"Degmar Dwarf Blood\" if you're on this task._\n_\"Sticky Mud\" is a ground spawn on the floor scattered in the library. It is prelootable._\n_Once you have all the components in hand:_\n\\- Inside a \"Degmar Inkwell\", combine 10x \"Degmar Dwarf Blood\" to produce 1x \"Full Degmar Inkwell\"\n\\- Inside a \"Blank Degmar Scroll\", combine: 5x \"Sticky Mud\" + 1x \"Full Degmar Inkwell\" + 1x \"Degmar Quill\" to produce \"Memorial Ceremony Announcement\"\n\n---\n\nPlace a memorial announcement in the throne room and defeat opposition 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nPlace a memorial announcement in the armory and defeat opposition 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nPlace a memorial announcement in the brewery and defeat opposition 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nPlace a memorial announcement in the forge and defeat opposition 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nPlace a memorial announcement in the prison and defeat opposition 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n_Head to the above areas and right-click the announcement. There doesn't appear to be specific location requirements other than being inside the room (other than not having any guards too close), so you can be choosy if you want. Doing so spawns 1x \"a \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ guard\", a fairly straightforward fight (mezzable; lots of hitpoints; Levels 105-106)._\nYou stick the announcement scroll to the wall.\n_Throne Room:_ an angry guard\n_Armory:_ an enraged guard\n_Brewery:_ an outraged guard\n_Forge:_ an incensed guard\n_Prison:_ an offended guard\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Thubr 0/1 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Thubr Axebringer'\nThubr Axebringer says 'You'll see... now they'll come... We'll show 'em all at the [memorial]. We'll make 'em see. Ya can't forgive unless ya see...'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n150 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout from the time of request._",
