to kill him. His solution is to have you kill them first.\n\n---\n\nKill 4 partying ghosts 0/4 (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n_Kill 4x \"a spectral reveler\" (\"an angry spectral reveler\" also counts) in the dining room (marked on **this map**)._\n_Note: If you stand in the dining room for five minutes without having \"danced\" with the revelers, they all auto-aggro you. To avoid this scenario, you can pull these mobs outside the room._\n_Upon the last kill, you see:_\nRanpodia Stonewalker seems slightly calmer. He eyes you with some suspicion.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n22 platinum, 5 gold",
