      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Health [zone=1057]\n**Who:**\n- Tarl Punox [npc=50209]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Adventure\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- City Plans [item=125038]\n- Crypt Fungus [item=125037]\n- Dealer's Debt Book [item=125059]\n- Dealer's Marker [item=125792]\n- Decorative Plate [item=125062]\n- Encrypted Message [item=124675]\n- Jewelry [item=125114]\n- Mystic Ink Well [item=125061]\n- Ornate Vase [item=124582]\n- Pamphlet of Decay [item=125053]\n- Recipe Book [item=124623]\n- Sacred Object [item=124543]\n- Sacred Vestment [item=125060]\n- Sigil of Sul [item=125115]\n- Teeth [item=124624]\n- Undead Romance Novel [item=124700]\n- Unholy Remnant [item=125368]\n- Vial of Caustic Fluid [item=124584]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay: Fate Rewards the Bold [zone=1079]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- High Bokon Cleret [npc=50469]\n- a chest - Fate Rewards the Bold [npc=50655]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:53:45 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Who: Tarl Punox\nWhere: Plane of Health\nThe Mission is in Demi-Plane of Decay but the Request NPC is in Plane of Health\nYou say, 'Hail, Tarl Punox'\nTarl Punox says 'Well, now isn't this a pretty place? So calm and annoyingly peaceful. Bothersome, isn't it? No matter, there is [business] to be found anywhere.'\nYou say, 'business'\nTarl Punox says 'Business here is pretty bad. These folks have no needs and no desires, it seems. But I know of others not so far away that can use the services of an adventurer like yourself. I know the people and can put the right ones in touch with each other. You might able to benefit from my information, if you are [interested].'\nYou say, 'interested'\nTarl Punox says 'There are a few places where [trinkets] and other [interesting things] can be found, and I know the people that would find such things valuable. I keep myself busy, and as long as there is profit to be made, I'll be there.'\nYou say, 'trinkets'\nTarl Punox says 'I have a near limitless supply of customers that will pay well for unique trinkets like those that can be found in Sul Vius. If you can gather some, I can pay. These should be found in Sul Vius, the Demiplane of Decay.'\nYou have received a request timer for 'Fate Rewards the Bold': 0d:0h:5m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Fate Rewards the Bold'.\n\n---\n\nThere are different versions of this task:\n**Version #1**\nFrom Plane of health go to Demi- Plane of Life then use the Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul to Zone in to the Mission in Demi- Plane of Decay. It Shows on EQ quest Log.\nDeliver 4 Mystic ink Well to Karth Punox\nMystic Ink Well's Drop in the Office's to the south West\nDeliver 3 Recipe Book to Karth Punox / the Named or PHer will Spawn at this Point\nRecipe Book Drop in the Housing Area North West\nDeliver 5 Teeth to Karth Punox\nTeeth Drop in Underground Area From the First Building to the Bottom of the Pit\nOpen the Chest\n\n---\n\n**Version #2**\nDeliver 5 Crypt Fungus to Karth Punox 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nTake some Crypt Fungus from, obviously, the Crypts in the south.\nDeliver 3 City Plans to Karth Punox 0/3 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nLiberate some City Plans from the Mayor's Officers in the south west.\nDeliver 5 Sacred Object to Karth Punox 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nPick up some Sacred Objects. You should be able to find some in their underground housing.\n**Your shared task is now locked. You may no longer add or remove players.**\nOpen the chest 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nReward: Lesser Spirit of Decay (Collectible)\nIn the chest was Buckler of Shimmering Light, Lesser Essence of Life, and Minor Essence of Life.\nI suggest going after High Bokon Cleret before you open the chest. I was taking my time about it and got kicked out of the instance 30 minutes after opening the chest.\nNamed: High Bokon Cleret\nHP: more then 10 million\nHigh Bokon Cleret casts both Mind Break and Exalted Decay.\n\n---\n\n**Version #3**\nDeliver 4 Jewelry to Karth Punox (0/4)\n\\- Dropped off \"a bloodythirsty citizen\" in the NE part of instanced\nDeliver 3 Encrypted Message to Karth Punox (0/3)\n\\- Dropped off \"a neglected citizen\" outside the mayor's building\n\\- Dropped off \"a terror sentinel\" inside the mayor's building\n\\- Dropped from a bokon inside the mayor's house\nDeliver 5 Sigil of Sul to Karth Punox (0/5)\n\\- Dropped off \"a bar patron\" (I went down 1 ramp into the crater and inside the building to the left for these mobs)\n\\- Dropped off \"a neglected citizen\" from a side room just off of the bar\n\\- Dropped off \"a neglected citizen\" (had to go across another ramp after clearing the bar into the next building for this guy)\n\\- Dropped off \"a forgotten guktan\" in the same room as the above neglected citizen (a theater type room)\nOpen the chest\n\n---\n\n**Version #4**\nDealer debt book (5) got drops from squeaking sneak and a thug\nUnholy remnant (5) drops from pile of decomposed flesh, tsetse swarmer, or a stitched monstrosity.\nSacred vestment (5) drops from pile of decomposed flesh\n\n---\n\n**Version #5**\nDeliver 3 Undead Romance Novel to Karth Punox 0/3 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nDropped from the gardener behind the mayor house\nDropped from a follower inside\nDeliver 4 Decorative Plate to Karth Punox 0/4 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\ndropped for the trash in the yard of the house west of the mayors\nDeliver 4 Pamphlet of Decay to Karth Punox 0/4 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\ndropped from mobs in and outside the temple in the pit\nSide Note: From the sound of the description under the quest I would guess that any mobs in the NE can drop Jewelry, any mobs in/around the mayor's building can drop the Encrypted Message and that any mobs found in the crater can drop the Sigil of Sul. The mobs listed above are simply the ones that gave me the drops.\n\n---\n\n**Version #6**\nDiscover Ornate Vases from the heights in the north east and deliver them to Karth 0/3\nUncover a few Dealer's Markers from the merchant's quarters in the south east and deliver them to Karth 0/4\n? ? ? ?\nWe went to the merchant's quarters and got the Markers rather fast, the do drop from a spiritualist, a Thug.\nThen we adventured to the north east and did find a bloodthirsty citizen and they did drop the Ornate Vases and got thous in a few kills.\nHeading back to Karth and hand them in and the chest popped.\nDrop in chest was 2 x Lesser essence of life\nand Bulwark of Vanity (War, Pal, shd, bard) Shield\nand the reward was exp or 4 aa's and the Lesser spirit of decay.\n\n---\n\n**Version #7**\nLoot Boxes from the merchant's quarters 0/4\nLoot Religious Scrolls from the place they call the Testaments.\n\n---\n\n**Version #8**\nCollect some Inkwells from the government offices in the south west and deliver them to Karth. 0/3\nInkwells drops from a Bokon or an elected official.\nPluck some Recipe Books from the housed in the north west and deliver them to Karth. 0/2\nRecipe Books drops from a functionary and a beleaguered functionary.\nHarvest Unholy Remnanets from crypt to the south and deliver them to Karth 0/4\nShuffle up some Dealer's Debt Books from the merchant's quarters to the south east and deliver them to Karth 0/4\nÂ¨Â¨Â¨Â¨ the Unholy Remnents also drops from a ravenous citizen or a stitched monstrosityÂ¨Â¨Â¨Â¨\n\n---\n\n**Version #9**\nGather Romance Novels from the Mayor's Offices to the north and deliver them to Karth 0/2\nDescription reads: Fulfill and(sp?) order for the Romantic Novels for Tarl's educated clients. Rumor has it that some can be found in the Mayor's Offices to the north.\nGet Decorative Plates from houses to the north west and deliver them to Karth 0/3\nDescription reads: Produce a few Decorative Plates for domestic customers. You might find them in the housing area to the north west.\nThe Romance Novels dropped from a rotten servant and a gaunt follower in the Mayor's office.\nDecorative plates dropped off of a functionary, disintegrated functionary, and an overworked functionary in the north-northwest area.\nBoth steps appear at once. After the turn-ins, collectibles dropped and named spawned.\nOpen the chest\nCompletes the mission. Chest contained two median essences of life and Pauldrons of the Dark Side.\n\n---\n\n**Version #10**\nRetrieve Jewelry from the place they call The Heights to the northeast and deliver them to Karth.\nI headed northeast from Karth, and found the jewelry on citizens, and Bloodthirsty Citizen's.\nFind encrypted messages in the mayor's offices to the north and deliver them to Karth.\nI went to the northern building at the top of the staircases. I opened the main doors and started clearing, and had no luck until I cleared two bokons who both had the encrypted messages.\nThese bokon were not social with the citizens inside the building and were not difficult to pull, but they were higher level and had more HP than citizens.\nThe skeleton guards that were just inside the doors were social with citizens though, and they were also tougher.\n\n---\n\nReward:\nExperience\n300pp\n1125 Remnants of Tranquility\nLesser Spirit of Decay\n- Buckler of Shimmering Light [item=124488]\n- Cudgel of the Stranger [item=124608]\n- Cyclical Impetuator [item=124607]\n- Fists of the Stranger [item=124555]\n- Lesser Spirit of Decay [item=125073]\n- Oscillating Stone [item=124652]\n- Peacock's Charm [item=124611]\n- Severed Head of Severity [item=124559]\n- Severed Hooplet [item=124612]\n- Shadowthorn [item=124489]\n- Strifetorn Faceguard [item=124206]",
