    {
      id = "8414",
      title = "Atrebe",
      exp = "23",
      exp_name = "Empires of Kunark",
      min_lvl = 1,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "",
      repeatable = false,
      group_size = "",
      npc = "Praetor Tellik",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "_Raids_",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 126370, name = "Sha Laboratory\n- Black Claw Fragment", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Gates of Kor-Sha [zone=1091]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Tellik [ _Raids_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Kor-Sha Laboratory: Atrebe [zone=1102]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Atrebe, the Lost King [npc=51724]\n- Garssilor, Cinderscale [npc=51726]\n- a dead ancient iksar [npc=51725]\n- a dead skeleton [npc=51729]\n- a guardian [npc=51720]\n- a hauler [npc=51717]\n- a jagged bone dervish [npc=51730]\n- a power siphon [npc=51721]\n- a servant [npc=51719]\n- a shissar remnant [npc=51722]\n- a skeleton - Kor-Sha Laboratory [npc=51728]\n- an ancient iksar [npc=51723]\n- an iron chest [npc=51727]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Hero of Kor-Sha Laboratory [quest=8346]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n**Appropriate Races:**\nEntered: Sat Dec 3 10:37:38 2016\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _There is a 1 hour lockout between different missions._\n_This is a group mission. Say **smaller number** to Praetor Tellik in Gates of Kor-Sha to trigger the mission. The person triggering must have the Partisan of Lceanium [quest=8274], Partisan of The Scorched Woods [quest=8348], Partisan of Frontier Mountains [quest=8350], Partisan of the Temple of Droga [quest=8352], Partisan of Chardok [quest=8354], Mercenary of Gates of Kor-Sha [quest=8355] and Partisan of Kor-Sha Laboratory achievements_\n_Say **can** to enter the instance._\nThis mission takes place in the researcher lab and blasted area in the far Eastern end of the zone. Do not try to take mobs on aggro outside of the main room, or they will summon you back and dispel most of your buffs with Balance of the Nameless. All aggressive mobs originate from the floating island. The mobs will take the teleport pad to come down to you, or they may warp directly down to you if you get on aggro too early by being too close to the island.\nThe event is started by speaking to an iksar slave.\nThe undead shissar can be slain anywhere you like in the event area.\nOnce slain, the iksar leave a \"corpse\" mob behind. There are haulers, sebilite golem models, on the floating island that will take the teleport pad and come to retrieve the corpses. The haulers cannot be snared, but you can push them with forced movement abilities and attack them. Like all sebilite golem models in this expansion, they have extra HPs and take reduced damage from slashing attacks, so be prepared to put forth some effort on these. One hauler comes for each iksar corpse.\nUpon the death of the first hauler, Garssilor will spawn. He repeatedly casts Searing Scales, a 300-ish point damage shield.\nYou will want to fight the ancient iksar either close to the teleport pad (to expedite the hauler's work) or far away in the blasted area (to give maximum time to kill the haulers) depending on which achievement you are trying to earn. If you are trying to prevent the haulers from doing their work, kill one iksar, kill the hauler that comes to retrieve the corpse, kill Garssilor, then alternate killing an iksar and a hauler until no more haulers come for the corpses. This method means you will be tanking Garssilor and multiple iksar at the same time.\nIf you are allowing the haulers to do their work, you will have to fight an additional four skeletons (these cast the Bone Curse spell like all other skeletons in this expansion). Haulers will come to drag away the defeated skeletons, and you will have to fight three jagged bone dervishes.\nTake the teleport pad up to the floating island. If you let the haulers drag corpses to be reanimated, you need to kill the haulers up on the island to progress the mission. They still do not fight back.\nThere are two guardians, skorpikis models, and these must be slain to affect the power siphon. The power siphon fights back, not just simple ripostes, but is the final mob of the mission.\nThroughout the event, Atrebe occasionally teleports down from the floating island to cast a number of spells: Touch of Death (9K DD and 45% snare for 3 ticks), Eroding Blast (5K AE DoT that slows spell casts by 5% and melee by 35% for 3 ticks), and Forced Displacement (shadowstep). The power siphon casts Pulsing Siphon, an AE that covers the event area (6K DD, 200 mana drain, 100 endurance drain) every minute and 55 seconds after event start.\nThe reward chest can drop any of the visible armor or Black Claw Fragment.\nThere are three achievements for this mission.\nNo Return: Win without allowing any of the ancient iksar to be animated.\nEverything Reborn: Win after allowing all of the corpses to be animated.\nFire Control: Win without allowing the gathering flames to expand.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with someone about what is going on here. 0/1\nDefeat the undead shissar. 0/4\nDefeat the ancient iksar. 0/4\nStop the haulers from bringing corpses to Atrebe to raise. 0/4\nDefeat Garssilor, Cinderscale 0/1\nDefeat the guardians so you can destroy the siphon. 0/2\nDestroy the siphon. 0/1\nOpen the chest. 0/1\nReward(s):\n283 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!!\nAchievement: Hero of Kor-Sha Laboratory\n- Black Claw Fragment [item=126370]",
    },
    {
      id = "8889",
      title = "Stomp the Invaders",
      exp = "24",
      exp_name = "Ring of Scale",
      min_lvl = 1,
