      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sathir's Tomb [zone=1188]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Noctis Torg [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Sathir's Tomb [quest=8927]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 2 11:19:05 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** None.\nFind Praetor Noctis Torg at the entrance of Sathir's Tomb.\nYou say, 'Hail, Praetor Noctis Torg'\nPraetor Noctis Torg says, 'You should not be here. Too dangerous. Stupid sarnak come to kill dead things, but dead things fight back. Much battle. Would be good for Combine if fighting stopped so we can look inside, see what old iksar [emperor] leave behind. Torg not enough people to [fight] war.'\nYou say, 'emperor'\nPraetor Noctis Torg says, 'Stupid dead old emperor. They say he live still, but Torg think that stupid. Torg hear that stupid dead things wait for old emperor to come back, maybe dead like them, Torg not know. Torg not care. But magic types in Combine care. Want Torg to look for clues about dead old emperor, if he come here to talk to dead things. Torg not care, so Torg not do. You [care] you do.'\nYou say, 'fight'\nPraetor Noctis Torg says, 'You, army? Torg not think so, you not army. But me not stop you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Stomp the Invaders'.\n\n---\n\n2. Kill 12 sarnak 0/12 Sathir's Tomb\nKill 12 sarnak, found throughout the zone.\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nMercenary of Sathir's Tomb [quest=8927]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
