oughout the zone, with a lot in the west most room, this will update on a kill\nKill sarnaks until everyone gets a Dirty Scrap of Paper on their cursor.\nA Wulthan Assayer is reported to update this step.\n6\\. See if the Arisen that you talked to previously knows why there is nothing. 0/1 (Sathir's Tomb)\nReturn to the disenchanted arisen (as above ) and say 'Why is there nothing of value here?'\n7\\. Let Torg know what you have learned. Give him that note you found. 0/1 (Sathir's Tomb)\nReturn to and Turn in the scrap of paper to Torg.\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nPartisan of Sathir's Tomb [quest=8928]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
