      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Trials of Smoke [zone=1216]\n**Who:**\n- Waves of Saffron Sky [npc=54415]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dark Waters Sing [npc=54478]\n- Shadows of Stone [npc=54480]\n- Warm Heart Flickers [npc=54479]\n- an elemental chest [npc=54423]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 9 04:27:43 2018\nModified: Sat Oct 5 21:47:53 2024 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Soldier of Air and Fight Fire.\n1st Quest Giver is at the zone line into the Plane of Smoke from Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\nGroup task pops up Trials of Smoke.\nDefeat any Trial that you have not already defeated and claim your reward.\nThere are 5 NPCS along the spider web pathing. Each have the same name and look alike each give a different quest. As you face the gate straight from zone in you want the bottom left path on the map for the Trial of Three.\nHail, 'Waves of Saffron Sky'\nYour Location is 24.46, 363.52, -70.37\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'Ah, so we have another that must prove their worth. If this is the challenge you chose, simply tell me when you are [prepared]. And should you be in need, I can tell you what you [must do] as soon as it has begun.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'Until you are [prepared] to make this your chosen challenge, I cannot tell you what you must do.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'We have already begun. Choosing to remain here and chat will not help you. Is it that you do not know what [must do]?'\nIf you say that you are, then so you must be.'\nYou say, 'prepared'\nThese are a few examples of the hints she will give you to determine the order you need to kill the three mephits in:\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'You must first defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' implies great strength by displaying little.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'And only lastly shall you defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' that stands foremost, least afraid to fight.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'You must first defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' that brings with it the greatest of arms.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'And only lastly shall you defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' that is not distracted by unfamiliar surroundings.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'You must first defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' that believes in moderation in war.'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'And only lastly shall you defeat the one'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, ' greatest in size.'\nInvis and move as a group to the middle of the 3 rooms. take stock of all 3 mobs and choose one to kill 1st.\nbe invis and move into the mob's room. If any toons stay in the center area they will be blind and dotted (you can use the map to move, coth is not available in this zone)\nMephit names are Dark Waters Sing, Warm heart Flickers, and Shadows of Stone.\nIf you kill the correct one then you must decide the 2nd to kill.\nif you kill the 2nd on correctly you can now kill the 3rd one for a Chest.\nChest spawns in the center room near Grieving Soul Scent.\nYour need to win all 5 Trials of Smoke to enter the normal Plane of Smoke zone.\n\n---\n\nChest Drops:\nAn Elemental Chest:\nGreater Spellbound Lamp\nMortal Corporeal Equilibrium Zephyr\nSky Hammer\nWeeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Wrist Muhbis\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Exp, 212 Platinum, 5 Gold",
