      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Trials of Smoke [zone=1216]\n**Who:**\n- Waves of Saffron Sky [npc=54415]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Sigil of the Darkening Depths [item=134783]\n- Sigil of the Golden Flame [item=134781]\n- Sigil of the Hardening Heart [item=134784]\n- Sigil of the Overlord of Ash [item=134785]\n- Sigil of the Soaring Heart [item=134782]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Alabaster Moonbreeze [npc=54432]\n- Diamond Earthshaker [npc=54431]\n- Grinning Monsoon [npc=54430]\n- Rumbling Rock Spirit [npc=54438]\n- Sand Spray [npc=54429]\n- Seafoam Spray [npc=54428]\n- Soot Spray [npc=54426]\n- Striding Obsidian Destroyer [npc=54434]\n- Sunbird of the Dawn [npc=54433]\n- Wind Spray [npc=54427]\n- a bulky chest [npc=54515]\n**Related Quests:**\n- A Matter of Timing (10 Points) [quest=9294]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Following Orders (10 Points) [quest=9295]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Tumble Dry (10 Points) [quest=10473]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Nov 10 08:15:42 2018\nModified: Sun Feb 15 02:26:34 2026 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Soldier of Air and Fight Fire.\nThere are 5 NPC's along the spider web pathing. Each have the same name and look alike each give a different trial. **(Which path do we take to get this trial?)**\nYou say, 'Hail, Waves of Saffron Sky'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'If you say that you are, then so you must be. You seem rather dull, so if you do not know what you [must do] to pass this trial, I am allowed to grant you a hint.'\nYou say, 'prepared'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'It is rather simple, perfect for your tiny mortal mind. Simply defeat Whistful Wind Calls. Of course you will have to prove your worth to him by defeating what remains of his command. Do not hesitate, for if any of them become bored they will retreat and you shall fail.'\n\n---\n\n3. Defeat any trial that you have not already defeated and claim your reward. 0/1 (Plane of Smoke)\n\n\n\nThis quest has adds that drop clickies. The adds are,\n\n\n\n\nSoot Spray\n\n\nWind Spray\n\n\nSeafoam Spray\n\n\nSand Spray\n\n\n\n\nThe clickies are,\n\n\n\n\nSigil of the Golden Flame\n\n\nSigil of the Darkening Depths.\n\n\nSigil of the Soaring Heart\n\n\nSigil of the Hardening Heart\n\n\nSigil of the Overlord of Ash\n\n\n\n\n5 platforms in the air main mob,\n\n\n\n\nGrinning Monsoon\n\n\nDiamond Earthshaker\n\n\nAlabaster Moonbreeze\n\n\nSunbird of the Dawn\n\n\nStriding Obsidian Destroyer\n\n\n\n\nBasically two sets of adds spawn each will have a clicky drop each group member will need one. You need to click the same clicky to be ported up to a Named and kill it. You are then are ported down.\n\n\n\n\nClickies disappear if anyone in the group dies.\n\n\n\n\nWarning the last main mob will port to random peeps so if you have peeps not on the platform it will heal to 100%\n\n\n---\n\nChest Loot: a bulky chest [npc=54515]\n\\- Happy Stone [item=134079]\n\\- Iron Ring of the Cavalry [item=134224]\n\\- Mephit Symbol of the Sky Djinn [item=134231]\n\\- Planetary Dagger Medallion [item=134080]\n\\- Shield of Stratos [item=134053]\n\\- Storm Glass [item=134221]\n\\- Wind Dirk [item=134060]\nas well as\n\\- Mortal Corporeal \\_\\_\\_ Zephyr\n\\- \\_\\_\\_ Spellbound Lamp\n\\- Weaping Undefeated Heaven Binding \\_\\_\\_ Muhbis\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExp\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**(We need all details, related creatures, items used, dialogue and etc...)**\n\n---\n\nTrial of the Speaker's Amphitheater - A Matter of Timing - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nTrial of the Speaker's Amphitheater - A Matter of Timing jimmyw404\njimmyw404219 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Mortal Corporeal Incisive Zephyr [item=134089]\n- Mortal Corporeal Light Zephyr [item=134082]\n- Mortal Corporeal Nimble Zephyr [item=134087]\n- Mortal Corporeal Shrewd Zephyr [item=134090]\n- Mortal Corporeal Vigorous Zephyr [item=134088]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Arms Muhbis [item=134624]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Chest Muhbis [item=134632]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Feet Muhbis [item=134628]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Hands Muhbis [item=134631]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Head Muhbis [item=134623]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Legs Muhbis [item=134378]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Wrist Muhbis [item=134619]",
