      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Trials of Smoke [zone=1216]\n**Who:**\n- Waves of Saffron Sky [npc=54415]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Whispers of Indomitable Onyx [npc=54513]\n- a swirl of disturbed crust [npc=54548]\n- an ashen chest [npc=54512]\n- an ashen elemental [npc=54514]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 11 05:33:48 2018\nModified: Sun Feb 15 02:20:11 2026 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Soldier of Air and Fight Fire.\n1st Quest Giver is the zone line into the Plane of Smoke from Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\nGroup task pops up Trials of Smoke\nDefeat any Trial that you have not already defeated and claim your reward.\nThere are 5 NPCS named Waves of Saffron Sky along the spider web pathing. They look alike but each one triggers a specific trial.\nQ.Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory\nYou say, 'Hail, Waves of Saffron Sky'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'And so it begins. If you truly wish to succeed, I can tell you something of what you [must do].'\nYou say, 'must do'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'As with anything here, defeating Whispers of Indomitable Onyx will be a challenge. This particular challenge will require to you keep your eyes open and watch where you step.'\nA phoenix flies over the rusted cliffs. It is out of reach and sometimes triggers an AE centered on a player :\nEmote: \"The tethered phoenix screeches and targets \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ with a fireball.\"\nObjective : to kill Whispers of Indomitable Onyx, a named golem. He has a PB AE named Volcanic Eruption : Decrease HP by 125125 + Stun.\nSome yellow con elementals (\"an ashen elemental\") roam the island and may aggro your group. You must kill them since they continue to spawn throughout the event.\nThe named will despawn twice, then 6 green con \"a swirl of disturbed crust\" will spawn and roam the island. They don't aggro and don't fight back. Kill them, one of them will make the named respawn.\nHint: it's actually the #5 swirl that makes the named respawn. You can target it with /target a\\_swirl\\_of\\_disturbed\\_crust05.\nDuring the 3rd and last named spawn, there will be a knockback AE. Be careful to not fall down the island, but then you are ported to the zone in and can come back fast.\nYou have defeated the Trail of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory. You may continue your journey.\n212 platinum, 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n\n---\n\nTrial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory - All Alone - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nTrial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory - All Alone jimmyw404\njimmyw404219 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Experience, Money",
