u must be. You seem rather dull, so if you do not know what you [must do] to pass this trial, I am allowed to grant you a hint.'\nYou say, 'must do'\nWaves of Saffron Sky says, 'You must defeat Disappointed Heart's Torrent. His minions are his strength and they keep him safe. But beware, his minions are volatile and interact with each other in interesting and dangerous ways.'\nBug if all members go to the island they can not start the event.\nThere are two areas where there are mobs.\nThe goal is to kill the main mob to get a win must have to groups DPS split to accomplish this.\nMain mob - Disappointed Heart`s Torrent is up the spiral of wind\nAdds the island is where the 2 adds will re-pop.\na freezing wind\na gritty blast\na blazing breeze\nEmotes\nDisappointed Heart's Torrent gains invulnerability with the presence of his minions.\nAs Disappointed Heart's Torrent minions die, the great elemental grows vulnerable.\nYou have defeated the Trial of the Eternal Cyclone. You may continue your journey.\nYou have completed achievement: Fireproof\nYou have completed achievement: All Alone\nExp\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\nYou say, 'Hail, a dusty chest '\nYour Location is 264.28, 356.13, 91.72\n- Diminished Inhabited Muhbis [item=133142]\n- Glowing Spellbound Lamp [item=134305]\n- Greater Spellbound Lamp [item=134304]\n- Lesser Spellbound Lamp [item=134302]\n- Median Spellbound Lamp [item=134303]\n- Minor Spellbound Lamp [item=134301]\n- Mortal Corporeal Brawny Zephyr [item=134085]\n- Mortal Corporeal Deft Zephyr [item=134086]\n- Mortal Corporeal Equilibrium Zephyr [item=134084]\n- Mortal Corporeal Gusting Zephyr [item=134083]\n- Mortal Corporeal Incisive Zephyr [item=134089]\n- Mortal Corporeal Light Zephyr [item=134082]\n- Mortal Corporeal Nimble Zephyr [item=134087]\n- Mortal Corporeal Shrewd Zephyr [item=134090]\n- Mortal Corporeal Vigorous Zephyr [item=134088]\n- Weeping Undefeated Heaven Binding Legs Muhbis [item=134378]",
