      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Doomfire, the Burning Lands [zone=168]\n**Who:**\n- Unrepentant Sunrise [ _Quests and Raid_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Related Zones:**\n- Doomfire, the Burning Lands [TBL]: Delivery\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Blazing Sorrow`s Darkness - Doomfire - TBL - 2 [npc=54588]\n- Fennin Ro - Doomfire, the Burning Lands - TBL - 2 [ _Tyrant of Fire_]\n- Guardian of Doomfire - Doomfire - TBL - 1 [npc=54589]\n- a charred chest - Doomfire - TBL - Delivery [npc=54553]\n- a jopal defender - Doomfire - TBL - 1 [npc=54594]\n- a jopal guardian [npc=54595]\n- a throne guardian - Doomfire - TBL - 1 [npc=54590]\n- an imp - Doomfire, the Burning Lands - TBL - 1 [npc=54593]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Hail the King [quest=9267]\n- Brass Palace [quest=9445]\n- Contract of War [quest=9446]\n- Don't Stand in the Fire (10 Points) [quest=9320]\n- Earthen Dirge [quest=9454]\n- Enter Mearatas [quest=9444]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Firelings [Delivery] (10 Points)\n- Key to the Kingdom [quest=9264]\n- Mold Seeker [quest=9465]\n- Palace of Embers [quest=9433]\n- Prisoner's Dilemma [quest=9265]\n- Relic Raider [quest=9462]\n- Royal Visits [quest=9448]\n- Serving Another Master [quest=9453]\n- Slugish (10 Points) [quest=9475]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Trial of Three (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9281]\n- Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9335]\n- Trial of the Eternal Cyclone (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9336]\n- Trial of the Speaker's Amphitheater (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9282]\n- Trial of the Wending Ways (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9337]\n- Tyrant of Fire [quest=9463]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 5 23:15:28 2018\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Soldier of Air, Fight Fire, and any one Trail of Smoke, Prisoner's Dilemma, Palace of Embers, Brass Palace, Key to the Kingdom, Contract of War, All Hail the King, Royal Visits, Tyrant of Fire, Enter Mearatas, Serving Another Master, Earthen Dirge, Mold Seeker, and Relic Raider.\nYou say, 'Hail, Unrepentant Sunrise'\nUnrepentant Sunrise rolls his eyes as approach. 'Yes, yes, hail indeed. I know you seek to speak with Lord Fennin, but I really do not think he wishes to speak with you anymore, not about any sort of [delivery] nor any kind of [remodeling]. I, of course, cannot know my lord's mind, and have been told to allow you in if you have anything important to say. You, of course, will tell me that you do, indeed, have [something important] to tell Lord Fennin. If, as I suspect, you simply wish to continue to kill and maim the servants of fire, who am I to care? As long as I am not one of those servants, I am happy to let you pass. After all, destruction is what we are all about here.'\nYou say, 'delivery'\nUnrepentant Sunrise says, 'Of course you are. As I said, I do not care. Just tell me when you are [ready] and I can send you into the presence of the Lord of Flames.'\n(You will be given a Duende Female Mold [quest=9466] if you do not have one and are eligible for the task. - There is a thought that having an old Deunda Female Mold either from a prior attempt or the prior quest can bug this task so that Fennin does not spawn.)\n\n---\n\n1a. You will have to fight your way to the throne room to speak with Fennin Ro. 0/3 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\n> **Task Window:** Speak with Unrepentant Sunrise, the efreeti that managed to arrange your first meeting with the Tyrant of Fire. Maybe he can provide the same again.\n> **Task Window:** You have found the mold form of the female duende. Find Fennin Ro in the Plane of Fire and deliver it to him. It looks like you will have to fight your way to the throne room. Apparently no one gets to just want into the Plane of Fire. Defeat any guardians between you and the throneroom.\nThe jopals at zone in see through invis, in the starting hallway, Various mobs (mainly horses see invis in the field and many mobs inside the castle see invis, clear as needed to Guardian of Doomfire..\n1b. You will have to fight your way to the throne room to speak with Fennin Ro. 1/3 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\nKill Guardian of Doomfire. He spawns adds, \"an imp\".\n1c. You will have to fight your way to the throne room to speak with Fennin Ro. 2/3 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\nKill the 2 \"a throne guardian\" (Giant flaming snails, mezzable, do not see invis) at the entrance to the throne room.\n2\\. Deliver the duende mold to Fennin Ro. 0/1 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\n_Give the mold to Fennin Ro._\nFennin Ro shouts, 'Be silent! Your task is incomplete. It is not possible to recreate your kind with that foolish mold. The magic required to do so is no longer readily available. Prismatic magic was stronger in the days when the mortal races were being made by the gods of influence, less so when the jann were created. But now it has faded from most planes. I have information that it, or portions of it, exist on the Plane of Magic.'\nBlazing Sorrow`s Darkness shouts, 'What must we do? How does one steal a type of magic? Are we to somehow bring that magic back?'\nBlazing Sorrow`s Darkness shouts, 'If this is what is required, then it shall be done. The mortals will find this hidden or lost magic and return with it.'\n3\\. Open the Chest 0/1 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\nOpen \"a charred chest\"\nA rough, delicate stone appears in your hands. A deep, burning voice speaks in your mind, 'This will allow you to gather what I need. It is fragile and rare, do not lose or break it before you return here. Fill it with the right magic and bring it here.'\nYour task 'Delivery' has been updated.\nYou have been given: Infused Sandstone Siphon [quest=9466]\n\n---\n\n**Chest rewards:**\n(a charred chest)\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Chest Muhbis\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Foot Muhbis\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Head Muhbis\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Leg Muhbis\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Wrist Muhbis\nCrystalline Flame\nDiminished Inhabited Muhbis\nLucky Empyrean Hoop\nGlowing Spellbound Lamp\nGreater Spellbound Lamp\nLesser Spellbound Lamp\nMedian Spellbound Lamp\nMinor Spellbound Lamp\nMortal Celestial Incisive Spark\nMortal Celestial Equilibrium Spark\nMortal Celestial Nimble Spark\nMortal Celestial Shrewd Spark\nMortal Celestial Vigorous Spark\nScintillating Ribbon of Power\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n318 platinum 7 gold 5 silver\nYou gain experience!\n143 Fettered Ifrit Coins\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Crystalline Flame [item=133880]\n- Diminished Inhabited Muhbis [item=133142]\n- Fettered Ifrit Coin [item=134362]\n- Frostbitten Nugget [item=133891]\n- Glowing Spellbound Lamp [item=134305]\n- Greater Spellbound Lamp [item=134304]\n- Lesser Spellbound Lamp [item=134302]\n- Lucky Empyrean Hoop [item=134018]\n- Median Spellbound Lamp [item=134303]\n- Minor Spellbound Lamp [item=134301]\n- Mortal Celestial Brawny Spark [item=133896]\n- Mortal Celestial Deft Spark [item=133897]\n- Mortal Celestial Equilibrium Spark [item=133895]\n- Mortal Celestial Incisive Spark [item=133900]\n- Mortal Celestial Nimble Spark [item=133898]\n- Mortal Celestial Shrewd Spark [item=133901]\n- Mortal Celestial Vigorous Spark [item=133899]\n- Scintillating Ribbon of Power [item=134044]",
