      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Doomfire, the Burning Lands [zone=168]\n**Who:**\n- Unrepentant Sunrise [ _Quests and Raid_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Saturated Infused Sandstone Siphon [item=134753]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Doomfire, the Burning Lands [TBL]: Remodeling\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Fennin Ro - Doomfire, the Burning Lands - TBL - 3 [ _Tyrant of Fire_]\n- General Reparm - Doomfire - TBL - 1 [npc=54532]\n- Guardian of Doomfire - Doomfire - TBL - 2 [npc=54527]\n- a fire slug - Doomfire - TBL - 2 [npc=54529]\n- a pyroniling [npc=54533]\n- a throne guardian - Doomfire - TBL - 2 [npc=54528]\n- an ember chest - Doomfire - TBL - Remodeling [npc=54534]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Hail the King [quest=9267]\n- Brass Palace [quest=9445]\n- Contract of War [quest=9446]\n- Delivery [quest=9466]\n- Earthen Dirge [quest=9454]\n- Enter Mearatas [quest=9444]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Key to the Kingdom [quest=9264]\n- Mold Seeker [quest=9465]\n- Palace of Embers [quest=9433]\n- Prisoner's Dilemma [quest=9265]\n- Relic Raider [quest=9462]\n- Royal Visits [quest=9448]\n- Serving Another Master [quest=9453]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Strange Magic [quest=9468]\n- Trial of Three (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9281]\n- Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9335]\n- Trial of the Eternal Cyclone (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9336]\n- Trial of the Speaker's Amphitheater (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9282]\n- Trial of the Wending Ways (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9337]\n- Tyrant of Fire [quest=9463]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 5 23:17:56 2018\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisite Quests: Soldier of Air, Fight Fire, and any one Trail of Smoke, Prisoner's Dilemma, Palace of Embers, Brass Palace, Key to the Kingdom, Contract of War, All Hail the King, Royal Visits, Tyrant of Fire, Enter Mearatas, Serving Another Master, Earthen Dirge, Mold Seeker, Relic Raider, Delivery, and Strange Magic.\nYou say, 'Hail, Unrepentant Sunrise'\nUnrepentant Sunrise rolls his eyes as approach. 'Yes, yes, hail indeed. I know you seek to speak with Lord Fennin, but I really do not think he wishes to speak with you anymore, not about any sort of [delivery] nor any kind of [remodeling]. I, of course, cannot know my lord's mind, and have been told to allow you in if you have anything important to say. You, of course, will tell me that you do, indeed, have [something important] to tell Lord Fennin. If, as I suspect, you simply wish to continue to kill and maim the servants of fire, who am I to care? As long as I am not one of those servants, I am happy to let you pass. After all, destruction is what we are all about here.\nYou say, 'remodeling'\nUnrepentant Sunrise says, 'Of course you are. As I said, I do not care. Just tell me when you are [ready] and I can send you into the presence of the Lord of Flames.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Remodeling'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nUnrepentant Sunrise says, 'Go and be useful for once then.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Doomfire, the Burning Lands.\n\n---\n\n1\\. You will have to fight your way to the throne room to speak with Fennin Ro. 0/4 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\n**Task Window:** ?\nKill Guardian of Doomfire [npc=54527], kill 2 throne guardian [npc=54528] snails before Fennin Ro's room, kill 2 fire slugs [npc=54529] inside the room, then fight General Reparm [npc=54532] who is next to Fennin Ro.\n2\\. Deliver 1 Saturated Infused Sandstone Siphon to Fennin Ro. 0/1 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\n**Task Window:** ?\nThe Saturated Infused Sandstone Siphon [item=134753] comes from the previous task, Strange Magic [quest=9468]. Upon turn in of Saturated Infused Sandstone Siphon:\nFennin Ro shouts, 'Well, you have found it. With this power I can indeed re-create the efreeti. I could, in fact, do many things. But I will do as I promised. First, the mold.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'Now, to use the magic you have stolen. I suggest that you never do so again. You do not know what you might be bringing back into the world.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'Come forth. You will be the first to be changed.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'Enter the mold and be forever changed.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'It has begun. Now I may allow the worthy to enter the mold, for as long as the magic lasts.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'You have earned your freedom. That should be enough for you.'\nFennin Ro shouts, 'You mortals have earned a reward. Take it and leave. Do not return.'\n3\\. Open the chest. 0/1 Doomfire, the Burning Lands\nOpen an ember chest [npc=54534].\n\n---\n\nReward(s)\n318 platinum, 7 gold, 5 silver\nYou gain experience!\n143 Fettered Ifrit Coins [item=134362]\n\n---\n\nRemodeling - 8 Minutes - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nRemodeling - 8 Minutes jimmyw404\njimmyw404219 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Arms Muhbis [item=134652]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Chest Muhbis [item=134633]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Feet Muhbis [item=134630]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Hands Muhbis [item=134462]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Head Muhbis [item=134662]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Legs Muhbis [item=134739]\n- Battleworn Stalwart Moon Binding Wrist Muhbis [item=134629]\n- Escargot Anneau De Feu [item=134042]\n- Fettered Ifrit Coin [item=134362]\n- Glowing Spellbound Lamp [item=134305]\n- Golden Ruby and Garnet Ring [item=134050]\n- Greater Spellbound Lamp [item=134304]\n- Incarnadine Shell of the Dawdler [item=133864]\n- Lesser Spellbound Lamp [item=134302]\n- Median Spellbound Lamp [item=134303]\n- Minor Sp