      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Velketor's Labyrinth [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Radiwol Perpin [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a mindless orc [npc=55148]\n- a restless orc [npc=55150]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Velketor's Labyrinth (10 Points) [quest=9802]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 25 01:04:18 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can get this task from Radiwol Perpin at the entrance of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Radiwol Perpin'\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'I appreciate you checking in on me Gidonorog, but you really must get going with the task at hand and start clearing out those [ **monsters**]. Lack of initiative will only result in our demise.'\nYou say, 'monsters'\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'Aye! You see, the restless [ **orcs**] somehow got in here and made it their home. I can't fathom why, but it isn't like we can just ask them now, can we? The magic that has spread has gotten into the [gargoyles] here as well, changing them. If they are not properly destroyed, they will simply spread the infection even further. Finally, the [spiders] here have also become corrupted. Because of how fast they can multiply, we must lessen their numbers, or they will build a massive nest and take over the land.'\nYou say, ' **orcs**'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Restless Orc Syndrome'.\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'Great! Remember now, they are much tougher than they were before their corruption. The magic in this area seems to be empowering them even further. Good luck'\n\n---\n\n_The orcs have somehow found their way into Velketor's Labyrinth. They present a particularly insidious threat due to their brutality. Their numbers must be culled._\nSlay the restless orcs who have invaded Velketor's Labyrinth 0/5 Velketor's Labyrinth\nYour task 'Restless Orc Syndrome' has been updated.\n_The orcs have been dispatched for now, but you know they could return again at any moment and will need more culling._\nYou receive 6 copper.\nYou receive 6 silver.\nYou receive 6 gold.\nYou receive 141 platinum.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nEXP\n141 Platinum, 6 Gold, 6 Silver, 6 Copper\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 141 Platinum, 6 Gold, 6 Silver, 6 Copper",
