yrinth. In order to cut out the infection, they need to be destroyed._\nSteam the infection of the restless ice by destroying the gargoyles. 0/10 Velketor's Labyrinth\nYour task 'Invisible Complement' has been updated.\n_Things are safer now that you have destroyed the gargoyles._\nYou receive 6 copper.\nYou receive 6 silver.\nYou receive 6 gold.\nYou receive 141 platinum.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 212 platinum",
