      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Velketor's Labyrinth [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Radiwol Perpin [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a restless tarantula [npc=55151]\n- a wandering arachnid [npc=55155]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Velketor's Labyrinth (10 Points) [quest=9802]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 25 01:27:25 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis solo task is from Radiwol Perpin at the entrance of Velketor's Labyrinth.\nYou say, 'Hail, Radiwol Perpin'\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'I appreciate you checking in on me Gidonorog, but you really must get going with the task at hand and start clearing out those [ **monsters**]. Lack of initiative will only result in our demise.'\nYou say, ' **monsters**'\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'Aye! You see, the restless [orcs] somehow got in here and made it their home. I can't fathom why, but it isn't like we can just ask them now, can we? The magic that has spread has gotten into the [gargoyles] here as well, changing them. If they are not properly destroyed, they will simply spread the infection even further. Finally, the [ **spiders**] here have also become corrupted. Because of how fast they can multiply, we must lessen their numbers, or they will build a massive nest and take over the land.'\nYou say, ' **spiders**'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Glacial Apophysis'.\nRadiwol Perpin says, 'Not too long ago I met a gnome who I asked to help with this. She just screamed and ran off. It seems spiders really... bugged her. Make sure that they stop moving fully after you kill them. They have been known to just get back up and scurry off.'\n\n---\n\n_The spiders in Velketor's Labyrinth have grown out of control. They have been infected by the restless ice and need to be extinguished._\nDestroy restless spiders that have made the labyrinth their home. 0/10 Velketor's Labyrinth\nYour task 'Glacial Apophysis' has been updated.\n_The labyrinth is quiter now that you have crushed the spiders._\nYou receive 6 copper.\nYou receive 6 silver.\nYou receive 6 gold.\nYou receive 141 platinum.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141 platinum 6 gold 6 silver 6 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 141 platinum 6 gold 6 silver 6 copper",
