      factions = {
        { name = "Vah Shir Crusaders", change = 10 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nPrerequisite: You must have just finished the Grimling War [quest=8240] event to get this task.\nThis quest starts with Lieutenant Venris. He is located in Grimling Forest at +1100, -754, +147 in the Grimling Village after the Grimling War event has been completed.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Venris'\nLieutenant Venris says, 'Ah, _______, we've heard tell of you. The forces of Shar Vahl have need of your skills. But can you live up to your [reputation]?'\nYou say, 'reputation'\nLieutenant Venris says, 'Very good. I have other less experienced adventurers scouring the upper mine for information. But I need to know what goes on in the deep mine. It's a dangerous mission, but I'm sure you're up to the challenge. Find any orders that guards may carry from within Acrylia Caverns. Put them in this satchel and return them to me. I'll need at least two different examples. Good luck.'\nGiven Warded Courier's Satchel on your cursor. (2-slot combinable container)\n- 1. You must loot Elite Guard's Orders and Death Guard's Orders 0/1 Grimling Forest\nThese drop off \"a grimling elite guard\" and \"a grimling deathguard\".\nCombine both orders to in the Warded Courier's Satchel to receive Filled Warded Satchel.\n- 2. Return to Filled Warded Satchel to Lieutenant Venris 0/1 Grimling Forest\nUpon returning the filled satchel to Venris:\nYou receive 150 platinum .\nLieutenant Venris says, 'Hmm... These orders only confuse things. They say that any of the 'lesser kin' should be slain on sight. Apparently none of the Grimlings from the forest are even allowed into the caverns without some right of passage. Odd. This changes our picture of the horde. Ah well.'\nYour faction standing with Vah Shir Crusaders has been adjusted by 10.\nYou gain experience! ( 10.475% AA (@lvl 93) )Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Elite Guard's Orders [item=23086]\n[",
