      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Collection\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nCurious jelly beans have been spread throughout the Eastern Wastes and Western Wastes. These items can only be found during the Stomples Day event.\nThese ground spawns can be found in The Eastern Wastes (ToV), Eastern Wastes (Velious), and in Western Wastes (CoV), and Western Wastes (Velious).\nBlack Jelly Beans (EW Velious, EW ToV)\nRed Jelly Beans (WW Velious, EW ToV)\nBlue Jelly Beans (EW Velious, EW ToV)\nBrown Jelly Beans (WW Velious, EW ToV)\nOrange Jelly Beans (EW Velious, WW CoV)\nGreen Jelly Beans (WW Velious, WW CoV)\nMini Jelly Beans (EW Velious, WW CoV)\nMixed Jelly Beans (WW Velious, WW CoV)\nReward(s):\nOption 1:\n13 AA points at level 112 (Scales to your level)\nOption 2:\n3% of the experience required to go from level 112 to 113 and 1.38 mercenary AA points. (Scales to your level)\nIf you have it, Spirit of the Lost [item=144650] is very useful since these zones are big, collectibles are not easily visible from far away and they are often found in stacks of 2-3.\nMap File Locations: Put this in westwastestwo_1.txt\nP -1172.0000, 1913.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -1696.0000, 602.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -2549.0000, 1220.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -2433.0000, -2921.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -1887.0000, -1175.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP 3003.0000, -2163.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP 2712.0000, -3499.0000, 0.0000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP 2633.8848, 1450.7290, -83.7966, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -3421.8853, 1362.5719, -112.8000, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP 2684.2964, 1897.2218, -57.6597, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP 789.0602, 1747.6996, -197.5842, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nP -2973.8149, -334.6500, -124.3183, 240, 0, 0, 2, X\nSubmitted by: Less3DRewards:\n[",
