      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 115\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is a seasonal quest that occurs during the Tempest Festival event in early May.\nYou can obtain this quest from Ralph Mischeva in Jaggedpine Forest at 294, -1781, -13. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Ralph Mischeva'\nRalph Mischeva says, 'Hear me and rejoice. The Tempest is no gentle storm, he is a righteous squalling force. [Celebrate] and be awed by his power. All should cower and [fear him].'\nYou say, 'I have come to celebrate Karana's power.'\nRalph Mischeva says, 'The storm rages on. Do you dare [challenge] it?'\nYou say, 'I will challenge the storm.'\nRalph Mischeva says, 'The storms cannot be stopped but they can be appeased. If you can, [fight the rains] and your name will be carried upon the winds.'\nYou say, 'I will fight the rains.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Reign of Rain'.\nRalph Mischeva says, 'May the Tempest bless your path.'\nRalph Mischeva believes in the awesome power of the Tempest. He has tasked you with defeating the rain elementals to provie your might.\nDefeat the rain elementals.\n- 1. Defeat 20 rain elementals 0/20\nThere are variant types of rain elementals (a drained rain elemental, a weak rain elemental, a surging rain elemental, to the north and south of Ralph Mischeva, along the river. They vary from Level 90 to Level 94, do not see invis, average hit around 9k on a tank merc but can hit as hard as 50K+, and have a load of Hit Points. Kill 20 of them.\nMap File Locations of the above elementals: Put these in your jaggedpine_1.txt map file.\nP 1751.4269, 864.9802, -16.5051,  0, 0, 0,  3,  a_drained_rain_elemental\nP 1793.0126, -50.8220, -16.3938,  0, 0, 0,  3,  a_drained_rain_elemental\nP 1807.0326, 1483.9637, -16.3938,  0, 0, 0,  3,  a_surging_rain_elemental\nP 1837.7882, -1290.9412, -16.3938,  0, 0, 0,  3,  a_weak_rain_elemental\nThese spawn very quickly after being killed so make sure to pull them away from their spawn point.\n- 2. Defeat the bursting rain elemental 0/1 Jaggedpine Forest\nOnce the first step is done, a bursting rain elemental (level 94) will span just north of Ralph Mischeva (Your location is 545.47, -1774.44, -11.84). Kill it.\n- 3. Defeat the swell of Karana 0/1 Jaggedpine Forest\nOnce a bursting rain elemental, a swell of Karana (Level 96) will spawn to the southwest, run in and attack you. Kill it.\n- 4. Report to Ralph about your success 0/1 Jaggedpine Forest\nYou say, 'Hail, Ralph Mischeva'\nYour task 'Reign of Rain' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'Reign of Rain': 0d:18h:0m remaining.\nYou have defeated the rain elementals and proven that you are a contender.\nRalph Mischeva says, 'The Tempest has surely blessed your path. May the winds bring your favor.'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Here Comes the Rain\nReward(s):\n1237p, 5g at level 120\n0.01% of the experience required to go from Level 120 to 121 (or 67.94% of an AA point) and 1.01% of a mercenary AA point.\n5 Sugary Short Bread [item=144364] (Rec. Level 90 enduring Stat Food --> 10 AC, 250HP, 300 Mana, 200 End).Submitted by: GOMNRewards:\n- Sugary Shortbread [item=144364]\n[",
