      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task is available during the Champion's Festival event runs starting November 3rd through November 14th.\nYou can obtain this task from Balhalyne Treherth [npc=59623] in Qeynos Hills at /way +325,-1104,-4 in the southeast part of the zone up against the wall next to a hut. She is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Balhalyne Treherth'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'The Festival of Champions is here. I have been waiting all year for this. I have been looking forward to the tales of champions. I have been writing a few tales of my own. Like a version of Norrath that is different than our own, and how [that world would] be different.'\nYou say, 'That world would be different.'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'I imagine a world where the moon has been ripped apart and put back together. I would dig in that rubble and look for long-forgotten artifacts. I would find swords of unknown origin and study them. Wouldn't that be so much [fun]?'\nYou say, 'That does sound like fun.'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'Oh, to spend time dreaming and writing down stories to share. Too bad that I have so many [chores] to work on. '\nYou say, 'What chores do you have left to do?'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'Great. Here is the list. I will see you when you get back. '\nYou have been assigned the task 'Qeynos Champions' Tale'.\n- 1. Harvest Shadeweaver Tubers 0/5 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nHead to Shadeweaver's Thicket and harvest some tubers.\nThese are ground spawns (Shadeweaver Tubers) that look like blue collectibles and are at the base of trees. These do respawn in the same areas.\nSome locations include:\n/waypoint -234, -1698, -164\n/waypoint -620, -1444, -206\n/waypoint 765, -2042, -188\n/waypoint 1521, 1994, 269\n/waypoint 149, -1932, -182\n- 2. Harvest Warsliks Carrots 0/5 The Warsliks Woods\nThese are ground spawns (Warsliks Carrots) that look like blue collectibles and are at the base of trees and rocks. Due to the amount of trees in the zone, these can be difficult to spot. These do respawn in the same areas.\nSome locations include:\n/waypoint -508, -183, -114\n/waypoint -222, -462, 8\n/waypoint -824, -315, 93\n/way/point 74, -812, -18\n/waypoint 920, -533, -89\n- 3. Harvest Highpass Kelp 0/4 Highpass Hold\nThese are ground spawns (Highpass Kelp) that look like blue collectibles and are located underwater and are very easy to spot. They do respawn in the same areas.\nSome locations include:\n/waypoint -252, 569, -50\n/waypoint -111, 528, -49\n/waypoint -224, 354, -47\n/waypoint -202, 436, -47\n/waypoint -536, 346, -86\n/waypoint -668, 419, -84\n- 4. Harvest Shardwurm Meat 0/5 The Great Divide\nThese (rarely) drop off shardwurms outside the caves (mostly to the south).\n- 5. Harvest Innovation Mushrooms 0/5 The Plane of Innovation\nThese are ground spawns (Innovation Mushrooms) that can be found near see invis mobs around the zone. You may need to clear the area around them before you can get near enough to loot.\nSome locations include:\n/waypoint 456, 450, -50\n/waypoint 631, 497, -50\n/waypoint 882, 643, -49\n/waypoint 843, 844, -49i\n/waypoint 1073, 923, -50\n/waypoint 1349, 1064, -49\n/waypoint 1574, 933, -50\n- 6. Deliver the Shadweaver Tubers                                                   0/5  Qeynos Hills\n- 7. Deliver the Warsliks Carrots                                                  0/5  Qeynos  Hills\n- 8. Deliver the Highpass Kelp                                                     0/5  Qeynos  Hills\n- 9. Deliver the Shardwurm Meat                                                0/5  Qeynos  Hills\n- 10. Deliver the Innovation Mushrooms                                     0/5  Qeynos  Hills\nDeliver these all to Balhalyne.\n- 11. Speak with Balhalyne about her meat pie                                  0/1  Qeynos Hills\nYou say, 'Hail, Balhalyne Treherth'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'It might need a few more minutes to set, but they should be good to go. Take one to each of the judges and I will share something I found with you. '\nYour task 'Qeynos Champions' Tale' has been updated.\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'Thank you for your help. Now I will be able to deliver my finished story to them. I can't wait to win.'\nYou receive 5 Celebratory Meat Pie(s).\n- 12. Deliver a Celebratory Meat Pie to Mira                                0/1  Qeynos Hills\nMira Sayer can be found inside the house that sets by the path at  /waypoint 1404, 305, 8.\nMira Sayer says, 'That smells delightful. Belhalyne always knows what to serve.'\n- 13. Deliver a Celebratory Meat Pie to Ziska                              0/1  North Qeynos\nZiska Ironforge can be located inside of Ironforge, next to the counter in the backroom at /waypoint 51, 60, 6.\nZiska Ironforge says, 'Well, I am not hungry just yet. But this should keep.'\n- 14. Deliver a Celebratory Meat Pie to Shenro                           0/1  North Qeynos\nShenro Kazpur is located inside of the monk guild at /waypoint 256, 302, 16.\nShenro Kazpur says, 'My vote can't be bought.'\ns\n- 15. Deliver a Celebratory Meat Pie to Warehnn                        0/1  South Qeynos\nWarehnn Awlne is located inside the Mermaid's Lure at /waypoint -10, -35, 5.\nWarehnn Awlne says, 'I do like a tasty snack when I am reading.'\n- 16. Deliver a Celebratory Meat Pie to Fellesha                         0/1  South Qeynos\nFellisha Varshen is located inside of Bag n Barrels at /waypoint 483, -307, 4.\nFellesha Varshen says, 'Treats won't sway the vote.'\n- 17.  Speak to Balhalyne about her progress.                          0/1 Qeynos Hills\nYou say, 'Hail, Balhalyne Treherth'\nBalhalyne Treherth says, 'Thank you for your help. Now I will be able to deliver my finished story to them. I can't wait to win.'\nYour task 'Qeynos Champions' Tale' has been updated.\nBalhalyne was so happy that you helped her catch up on her chores. She was able to finish her entry for the Champions' Festival tales contest. She appreciated your help so much that she dug out a relic just for you.\nReward(s):\nEchoforged Enoxus Ornament [item=146168] (Weapon Ornamentation)Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Echoforged Enoxus Ornament [item=146168]\n[",
