      walkthrough = "**Time:** 30\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task starts from looting the Broken Key of Jungle ground spawn near the door on the 7th level of Tides of Time. Once you loot, right click it to get the quest and for the item to turn into a container. Loot items to put into the container.\nYou found a piece of a broken key in front of a door on the seventh level of the mysterious tower.\nHolding this key, you hear drums beating.\nYou feel the need to investigate the ruins of the Emerald Jungle.\nYou know that this key can be repaired. Investigate the broken chests in the ruins.\n- 1. Collect the Broken Key Blade of the Jungle 0/1 The Emerald Jungle\nMultiple chests can be found in the ruins around the zone. Each chest will randomly give you each piece so you might get the same thing in each chest.\nYou can find these chests at these waypoints. I'm sure there are more, post them if you have a different location.\n/way 73, -1744, -334\n/way 524, -1914, -334\n/way 689, -2193, -338\n- 2. Collect the Broken Key Bow of the Jungle 0/1 The Emerald Jungle\n- 3. Collect the Broken Key Bitting of the Jungle 0/1 The Emerald Jungle\n- 3. Repair the Broken Key of the Jungle 0/1 ALL\nPut all the pieces in the container and hit combine.\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Repaired Key of the Jungle.\nYour task 'Broken Key of the Jungle' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'Broken Key of the Jungle': 0d:0h:30m:0s remaining.\nYou have successfully repaired the broken key and now have the Repaired Key of the Jungle. What mysteries will this key unlock?\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (2.000%)\nYou have completed achievement: Broken Key of the Jungle (Emerald Jungle)\nYou have gained 21 ability point(s)!\nYou have gained 2 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (2.000%)\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Broken Key of the Jungle (Emerald Jungle)\nReward(s):\nExperience for your levelSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Repaired Key of the Jungle [item=149291]\n[",
