      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 30\n**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nTides of Time Overview.\nThis is the 8th task in August 2024 of the Year of Darkpaw Tower tasks on the 8th level.\nIt starts with the collection looking item on the floor near the door, loot it and right click the Broken Key of Fire.\nYou found a piece of broken key in front of a door on the eighth level of the mystenous tower This melted piece of key hums with power that bums and fills you with a sense of dread You feel a sense of urgency to investigate the Skyfire Mountains.\nHead North to look for disturbed wyvem nests. Inspect the disturbed nest and kill the ravenous devourer.\nHead Northeast to look for disturbed wyvem nests. Inspect the disturbed nest and kill the ravenous devourer.\nHead Northwest to look for disturbed wyvem nests. Inspect the disturbed nest and kill the ravenous devourer.\n- 1. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nHead North to look for disturbed wyvem nests. Inspect the disturbed nest and kill the ravenous devourer.\nYou can find this nest at /way 98, -898, -157 which is straight east of the big lava pit in the middle of the zone, not far from it.\na ravenous devourer spawns and attacks. It's level 26.\nThen an enraged wyvern spawns and attacks. It is level 120.\n- 2. Kill the ravenous devourer 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 3. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 4. Kill the enraged wyvern 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 5. Loot the Broken Key Blade of Fire 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 6. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nWe found this next at /way 2191, -2935, -29 in the far northeast part of the zone on the side of a hill.\nAn enraged wyvern spawned and attacked. It is level 120. It drops the Broken Key Bow of Fire. Loot from its corpse.\nA ravenous devourer also spawns and attacks. It is level 26.\n- 7. Kill the ravenous devourer 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 8. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 9. Kill the enraged wyvern 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 10. Loot the Broken Key Bow of Fire 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 11. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nWe found this next at /way 3361, 331, -167 in the north center part of the zone.\nAn enraged wyvern spawned and attacked. It is level 120. It drops the Broken Key Bitting of Fire. Loot from its corpse.\nA ravenous devourer also spawns and attacks. It is level 26.\n- 12. Kill the ravenous devourer 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 13. Inspect the disturbed nest 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 14. Kill the enraged wyvern 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 15. Loot the Broken Key of Bitting of Fire 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\n- 16. Repair the Broken Key of Fire 0/1 ALL\nCombine all the drops into the key container, Broken Key of Fire.\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 125 - 1237p, 5g, 0s, 0c\nExperience - At Level 125 - 2% of the experience required to go from level 125 to 126 and 1.54% of a mercenary AA point.\nExperience - At Level 125 - 21 AA points\n10 Timeless Tokens\nRepaired Key of FireSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Repaired Key of Fire [item=149367]\n[",
