      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nYou can obtain this Erollisi Day task from Toxon Frennor in The Overthere (old kunark zone) at /way 3084, 1939, -48 outside the east wall of the city. He is on the find tool as well.\nYou say, 'Hail, Toxon Frennor'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Hello. I guess that I really do need to work on my ability to hide. People keep coming up to me to chat about Erollisi Day. What do you want to [talk] about?'\nYou say, 'I want to talk about Muku.'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Ha Muku? He's a good friend. He lets me practice my [roguish skills] on him. He is the most patient big guy that I know.'\nYou say, ' Now I am curious. What roguish skills?'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Oh, you know; pick pocketing, sneaking, hiding, and backstabbing. Everything really but [poison] making.'\nYou say, 'No poison?'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Correct. I have to sneak out on my own to [test] new concoctions, but as you can tell, I am still working on my hiding.'\nYou say, 'I could test some for you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Crazy Little Thing'.\nToxon Frennor says, 'I'd ask why you would want to help me, but I don't care. Here take these. I want to know if they work.'\nYou are given: Phosphoric Gnomish Poison Vial\nToxon Frennor is a bit distracted by his poison making. If you help test his new batch, you might be able to steer the conversation towards Darenne's missing treats.\nHead south towards the Frontier Mountains and splash the gnomish poison on broken clockworks.\nKill poison clockworks.\n- 1. Splash the gnomish poison on a clockwork 0/5 The Overthere\nan addled clockwork and a rattled clockwork are roaming around the southern part of the zone. They are level 25. Get very close to them and right click the Phosphoric Gnomish Poison Vial on them.\nOnce you get the task update you can kill them.\n- 2. Kill the poisoned clockwork 0/5 The Overthere\n- 3. Talk to Toxon about the results 0/1 The Overthere\nYou say, 'Hail, Toxon Frennor'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Tell me. How did my phosphoric [toxin] do'\nYou say, 'The toxin made your clockworks more efficient.'\nToxon Frennor says, 'Improved performance you say? Well, that's not what I was going for.  Hrrm... Up for some more? I will reward you for your troubles. I need new [components].'\nYou say, 'I can get your components'\nYour task 'Crazy Little Thing' has been updated.\nToxon Frennor says, 'Great, head towards the Frontier Mountains. There are rare flowers that I need to try a new formula.'\n- 4. Search near the Frontier Mountains 0/1 The Overthere\nSearch near the Frontier Mountains step updates around /way -2257, 3192, 51.\n- 5. Collect the Golden Thevetia Flower 0/1 The Overthere\nThis is a collectible (Golden Thevetia Flower) in one of the bushes nearby.  Once you loot one, a defective clockwork spawns and attacks.\n- 6. Kill the defective clockwork 0/1 The Overthere\n- 7. Search near Frontier Mountains 0/1 The Overthere\nLocation update around /way -3494, 268, 279\n- 8. Collect the Roseus Thevetia Flower 0/1 The Overthere\nThis is a collectible in the bush near the way point above. Loot it. Kill the a malfunctioning clockwork that spawns and attacks you.\n- 9. Kill the malfunctioning clockwork 0/1 The Overthere\n- 10. Deliver the Golden Thevetia Flower 0/1 The Overthere\nGive to Toxon.\n- 11. Deliver the Roseus Thevetia Flower 0/1 The Overthere\nGive to Toxon.\n- 12. Deliver the Phosphoric Gnomish Poison 0/1 The Overthere\nGive to Toxon.\n- 13. Talk to Toxon about the deliveries 0/1 The Overthere\nYou say, 'Hail, Toxon Frennor'\nYou have been given: Nut Your Day Cookie\nYour task 'Crazy Little Thing' has been updated.\nYou helped Toxon with his poison testing and gathering of new supplies to make more poison. You did such a good job that he gave you his present, one Nut Your Day Cookie.\nToxon Frennor says, 'I have been saving this for someone, but you can have it.'\nReward(s):\nBox of Scrumpious Sassy Candy Hearts - Converts to 6X Scrumpious Sassy Candy Heart (Level Req: 105 - AC: 2, HP: 250, Mana: 250, End: 150, STR: 14, STA: 14, INT: 15, WIS: 15, AGI: 14, DEX: 14, CHA: 12 - Miraculous meal)Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Box of Scrumpious Sassy Candy Hearts [item=151170]\n- Scrumpious Sassy Candy Heart [item=151169]\n[",
    },
