      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis Erollisi Day task can be obtained by speaking to Lithxn in The Overthere (old kunark zone) at /way 3036, 1896, -48 outside the city against the east wall.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lithxn'\nLithxn says, 'Hello Dark Elf. It is such a [lovely day]. The sun is shining, and Erollisi Day is here.'\nYou say, 'It is a lovely day, but what are you doing?'\nLithxn says, 'I am just admiring the view and trying to make plans. I want to do something special for [Darenne]. But all I can think of are the usual Erollisi Day things.'\nYou say, 'Darenne? She's worried about some missing undertested treats that have gone missing. Besides that, she seems to be bit a of an alchemist.'\nLithxn says, 'Missing treats? Hrrm. I received a funny one. You can give it to her and see if it's one of them. But only if you help me with my new idea. She is an alchemist, not too much I can do with that. But I have friends that have [rare extracts] that may help her with her cooking.'\nYou say, 'What rare extracts?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'I Think I Love You'.\nLithxn says, 'My friend Sweetzie has a nifty spice extract in her shop. That would be a good place to start.'\nLithxn has a longing to brighten Darenne's day. He wants your help to track down some rare spice extracts, so he can gift them to Darenne.\nHead to Klok Sweetzie's shop in Cabailis Habenero Extra.\nVisit Brewer Prixal's shop in Cabilis East and pick up the Cabilis Serrano Extract.\nVisit Klok Sirus's shop in Cabilis West and pick up the Cabilis Garlic Extract.\nVisit Gemcrafter Anuk's shop in East Freeport and pick up the Toxxulian Sesame Extract.\n- 1. Collect the Cabilis Habenero Extract 0/1 Cabilis East\nGo to Cabilis East and look for Klok Sweetzie, she is located at /way 551, 161, 6. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nLoot the ground spawn that looks like a collectible (Cabilis Habenero Extract) on the ground near her.\n- 2. Collect the Cabilis Serrano Extract 0/1 Cabilis East\nNot far from Klok Sweetzie is Brewer Prixal, he is on the find tool CTRL F.\nLoot the ground spawn that looks like a collectible (Cabilis Serrano Extract) on the ground near him.\n- 3. Collect the Cabilis Garlic Extract 0/1 Cabilis West\nGo to Cabilis West  and find Klok Sirus. He is in the area where all the alchemy vendors are at /way 442, 514, 5. He is on the Find tool CTRL F.\nLoot the ground spawn that looks like a collectible (Cabilis Garlic Extract) on the ground near him.\n- 4. Collect the Toxxulian Sesame Extract 0/1 East Freeport\nFind Gemcrafter Anuk in East Freeport, he is on the find tool CTRL F.\nLoot the ground spawn that looks like a collectible (Toxxulian Sesame Extract) on the ground near him.\n- 5. Deliver the Cabilis Habenero Extra 0/1 The Overthere\nTurn in all of the extracts to Lithxn in The Overthere.\n- 6. Deliver the Cabilis Habenero Extract 0/1 The Overthere\n- 7. Deliver the Cabilis Serrano Extract 0/1 The Overthere\n- 8. Deliver the Cabilis Garlic Extract 0/1 The Overthere\n- 9. Deliver the Toxxulian Sesame Extract 0/1 The Overthere\n- 10. Check in with Lithxn about the extracts 0/1 The Overthere\nYou say, 'Hail, Lithxn'\nYou have been given: Frisky Fudge Brownie\nYour task 'I Think I Love You' has been updated.\nYou helped Lithxn collect rare spice extracts so he can give them to Darenne as a gift. As a thank you, he gave you Frisky Fudge Brownie that he had been gifted.\nLithxn says, 'That is a mighty fine set of extracts. Now I just have to wrap them. Now don't forget to give this brownie to Darenne.'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: I Think I Love You\nReward(s):\n3624p, 5g, 0s, 0c\nExperience\n6 Scrumptious Sweet Candy Heart (AC: 2, STR: 12, DEX: 12, STA: 12, CHA: 10, WIS: 18, INT: +18, AGI: +12, HP: 225, MANA: 300, END: 135, Req Level: 75, This is a miraculous meal!)Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Box of Scrumpious Sultry Candy Hearts [item=151168]\n- Scrumpious Sultry Candy Heart [item=151167]\n- Scrumptious Sweet Candy Heart [item=151185]\n[",
    },
