      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 60\n**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nYou can obtain this 26th anniversary task from Firiona Vie in Shadeweaver's Thicket. She can be found at /way -1699, 2149, -157 (standing next to the Loda Kai Embassy building). She is on the Find Tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie says, 'Adventurer, I see you have come to look over the jade collection, as well. If I may have a moment of your time, I have a [request] of you.'\nYou say, 'I will be happy to fulfill a request for you, Lady Firiona Vie.'\nFiriona Vie says, 'I appreciate that. I was hoping to find a specific jade [piece] that doesn't seem to be part of this collection. I cannot get into why I need it just yet, but I assure you it's more important than simply wanting to appreciate its artistic qualities.'\nYou say, 'What piece were you seeking?'\nFiriona Vie says, 'There is a one-of-a-kind jade tiger statue, where its uniqueness and inherent power might have made it worthy enough for the display here. We sit disappointed.' Firiona Vie gives a humored smile. 'If you don't mind doing a bit of a treasure [hunt], I can point you to someone who might have a lead as to where it might be.'\nYou say, 'I'm up for the hunt.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery'.\nFiriona Vie says, 'I appreciate your willingness, especially in light of, well, you being in the dark. I apologize for that.' A prepared letter is pulled from a small pack, sealed with wax, and is offered to _____. 'Take this letter to Dreezil Pocketdip in Misty Thicket. I imagine a man of his skills is bound to have a lead on its whereabouts.'\nNote: You receive a 'Letter from Firiona.'\nMake sure you buy some Gouda Cheese before you get started on this task.\nTunare's Champion, the Lady Firiona Vie, has requested information on the mythical Jade Tiger statue that wasn't present at the large jade showing in Shadeweaver's Thicket. Her interest in the statue goes beyond collecting, not interested in the superficial elements, there's far more involved in the matter. For Plan B of her search, she has requested that you reach out to her crafty friend Dreezil Stickens for information and see where things take you from there.\nFiriona Vie has supplied a letter sealed in wax and stamped with her personal seal. She has entrusted you in bringing the information to her good friend, and oft travel companion, Dreezil \"Pocketdip\" Stickens.\n- 1. Deliver Firiona Vie's letter to Dreezil Stickens 0/1 Misty Thicket\nYou can find Dreezil Stickens in Misty Thicket at /way -445, 695, 24. He is in the southwestern part of the zone on the west side of the wall, near a tree stump.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dreezil Stickens'\nDreezil Stickens hisses in an urgent whisper, 'Go 'way. Unless yer here on [urgent] business, I can't talk right now.'\nYou say, 'It's urgent.'\nDreezil Stickens turns his head to directly face _____. 'What d'ya got?'\nYou offered 1 Letter from Firiona Vie to Dreezil Stickens.\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nDreezil Stickens warily takes the letter, and his eyes immediately catch on the seal binding the envelope closed. 'It looks like we 'ave a mutual acquaintance.' Meeting _____s eyes only a brief moment, his attention shifts back to the letter as he breaks the seal and unfolds it. 'Oh. Ooooh. OH! Excellent. I love a good mystery.' He smiles mischeviously and pockets the letter, which will get a nice disposal by fire later. 'But - I [can't help] ye directly. I'm needed 'ere.'\nYou complete the trade with Dreezil Stickens.\n- 2. Get your instructions from Dreezil Stickens 0/1 Misty Thicket\nYou say, 'You can't help? What do you recommend then?'\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nDreezil Stickens muses thoughtfully, voice still low, 'Ah, me Lady Firiona has certainly unique an' varied interests.' With a look directly at ______, he answers more on-topic, 'I know someone who might 'ave some clues as to the last known location of the Jade Tiger. Ye'll need to talk to her first. It's a bit of a trek to get there, to a Paebala named Chex in the Dragon Necropolis. So, good luck wi' that, I guess.' Quickly, he adds, 'Bring some gouda.' He turns back towards the near-by camp and his intent surveillance.\n- 3. Persuade Chex to help 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nYou can find Chex in Dragon Necropolis (old Velious version). He is one of the paebala rats in the tunnels on the west side of the zone. You can find him at /way 568, 454, -160\nYou say, 'Hail, Chex'\nChex screeches and waves _____ away.\nYou offered 1 Gouda Cheese to Chex.\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nChex sniffs the offering of cheese, and deeming it acceptable, gives a nod. 'Friend of Dreezil, yes? He knows me quites well. Sos, what are yous [here for]?'\nYou complete the trade with Chex.\n- 4. Check with Chex to see if she has information about the Jade Tiger 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nYou say, 'I'm here for information about the Jade Tiger.'\nYou have been given: Diary of the Jade Binding\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nChex says, 'Is that sos? Yous out of luck, I thinks. A few someones, Chetari, took my resource fors it.' Her nose twitches momentarily, the whiskers flicking with the movement. 'What yous needs is the Diary. I have the binding, but yous'll need the pages back from the Chetari and whos knows where. Takes it, fix it, and bring it backs here, and I'll confirm its all theres.''\n- 5. Find the pieces of the Diary and re-compile them in the binding 0/1 ALL\nThe pages, there are 8 of them. They are both drops and ground spawns.\nPut these in your necropolis_3.txt map file:\nP 389.7536, -222.0719, -218.3894,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_1\nP 448.9032, 6.8164, -258.2552,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_1\nP 514.0206, -229.7778, -258.2398,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_1\nP 681.1442, -469.9269, -258.2638,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_2\nP 265.0708, -975.0045, -258.2605,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_2\nP 443.0628, -592.2065, -258.2566,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_2\nP 135.7651, -890.6268, -258.2270,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_3\nP 567.8535, -477.6079, -258.2661,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_3\nP 145.2369, -324.2993, -218.2610,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_3\nP 522.1143, -1136.9905, -258.2273,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_4\nP 1302.3999, -805.2735, -258.2704,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_4\nP 513.9579, -1156.2188, -258.2792,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_5\nP 1758.0770, -194.5262, -260.7284,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_6\nP 1876.7479, 142.7381, -258.2528,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_6\nP 1639.0369, 131.0974, -258.2658,  127, 64, 0,  2,  a_chetari_scrounger_-_Page_6\nP 2005.7258, -561.6771, -258.2656,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_7\nP 1599.3289, 175.6840, -258.2762,  0, 0, 240,  2,  Page_8\nThe drops are from stationary Chetari scroungers down in the tunnels on the eastern half of the zone and at the far east end of the zone on the surface. They don't drop from the Paebala rebels on the west half of the tunnels, those rats are on opposing factions from the Chetari. Chex is on his own faction.\nPut all of the pages in the Diary of the Jade Binding and hit combine.\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nThe pages fit well within the original binding of the Diary of the Jade. All is in its place.\nThe container turns into Diary of the Jade, Recompiled\n- 6. Check in with Chex regarding the reassembled Diary 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nYou say, 'Hail, Chex'\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nChex peers over and forcibly flips through the pages of the diary as _____ holds it. 'Yes. Yes! This is its. Yous found it! Hahaha! I thoughts I had lost it for goods. Hey, um, thing is... I can't decrypts it. Yous have to talk to someone else for that. There's a guy who has the cypher. Looks for him in the Emerald Jungle.' There is no additional information given as she gorges herself on the gouda given to her prior.\n- 7. Speak with Chex's unnamed contact on decrypting the Diary 0/1 The Emerald Jungle\nYou are looking for Asarrus in The Emerald Jungle. He can be found at /way 3924, 325, -339 in the north central part of the zone in a ruined building.\nYou say, 'Hail, Asarrus'\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nAsarrus inhales sharply through his nose. 'What?' Perhaps now is a good time to produce the [diary].\n- 8. Hand over the encrypted Diary to Asarrus 0/1 The Emerald Jungle\nYou say, 'I have a diary. Do you know anything of it?'\nAsarrus says, 'I care not about a diary...' His words trail off as he looks at the cover of the book. 'Except that one. You'll [sell it] to me.'\nYou say, 'I will not sell it. I need it decrypted.'\nAsarrus sighs with the same sharpness the conversation started with. 'Damned rat. She owes me then.' Digging into a belt pouch, the Iksar pulls out a rolled up bit of leather with strange markings over it. 'Give it to me. For now. It will take a moment, but I can do this for you.'\nYou offered 1 Diary of the Jade, Recompiled to Asarrus.\nYou have been given: Diary of the Jade, Decrypted\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nAsarrus puts the leather over the top of the diary, and murmurs into the worn and marked material. It begins to glow first green, and then black. The leather is taken off just as swiftly without any noticeable modification to the book below. It's handed back. 'The notes are in the margins. If anything is missing, blame it on the passage of time. Take it to your keeper.' He doesn't even verify his work.\nYou complete the trade with Asarrus.\n- 9. Update Dreezil Stickens on the status of finding the Jade Tiger 0/1 Misty Thicket\nYou say, 'Hail, Dreezil Stickens'\nYour task 'Diary of the Jade - The Discovery' has been updated.\nDreezil Stickens will update Firiona Vie on your behalf, as well as look into a few other parts of this little adventure. Keep hold of the Diary of the Jade, as you may need it again.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nReward(s):\n2 platinum, 2 gold, 5 silver\n10 Commemorative CoinsSubmitted by: Gidono, IventheassassinRewards:\n- Commemorative Coin [item=116720]\n[",
