      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nPrerequisite Task: Bristlebane Day: Cold Blooded [quest=13310]\nYou can get this Bristlebane Day task from Kotunm in Twilight Sea at /way 1049, -764, 71 in north part of the zone if you didn't get it from him in the previous task along the western shore of Twilight Sea.\nYour task 'Cold Blooded' has been updated.\nYou successfully found and spoke with Kotunm about Kiroric and learned that it was just a prank gone wrong. Maybe you can help Kotunm turn Kiroric back to his normal self.\nKotunm says, 'I didn't think it was a good idea, but he can be stubborn. So here I am out here looking for the little polliwog.  Do you want to [help] me look for it?'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Cold Blooded\nYou say, 'I will help you look for it.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Home Sweet Foam'.\nKotunm says, 'Great! I think the little grey salientian came from the Fungus Grove. You could look in there for clues as to what it is up to.'\nKotunm asked for help finding the frog who had given him the recipe for turning his friend into a frog. Something funny is going on here and it is for the best if you figure it out. Explore the Fungus Grove and look for anything a frog may have left behind.\nExplore near the Tarmoks.\nExplore the small tunnel near the small mushrooms.\nExplore the hunting ground of the Chakta fungusbeasts.\nExplore the Glowater pond.\n- 1. Search the camps 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nThis step in Fungus Grove updated at /way -325, -465, -260 right north and east of the mouth of the tunnel that connects the lower part of the zone to the mid part of the zone, just south of the Tarmok mobs.\nLoot the Abandoned Frog Nest item that appears on the ground there, looks like a collectible item. It updates the next step.\n- 2. Collect the abandoned frog nest 0/1 The Fungus Grove\n- 3. Search the tunnels 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nThis step updates near /way 971, 902, -257 in the tunnel to the far northwest portion of the zone on the way to Twilight Sea.\nLoot the Forsaken Frog Nest nearby, it looks like a collectible on the ground. This updates the next step.\n- 4. Collect the forsaken frog nest 0/1 The Fungus Grove\n- 5. Search the hunting grounds 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nThis step updates near /way 1967, 2156, -260 in the far northwest corner of the zone near the Fungusbeasts.\nDeserted Frog Nest is a ground spawn nearby, loot it, it updates the next step.\n- 6. Collect the deserted frog nest 0/1 The Fungus Grove\n- 7. Search the water 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nThis step updates at the bottom of the pond at the mid section of the zone at /way 350, 857, -308\nLoot the Rejected Frog Nest item there that looks like a collectible, it updates the next step.\n- 8. Collect the rejected frog nest 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nCollectible looking item at the bottom of the pond at /way 350, 857, -308\n- 9. Kill the glowater kraken 0/1 The Fungus Grove\nIn the same spot where you got the collectible, Glowater Kraken spawns and attacks. It was level 121 for me, my pet took care of it easily.\n- 10. Deliver the abandoned frog nest to Kotunm 0/1 The Twilight Sea\n- 11. Deliver the forsaken frog nest to Kotunm 0/1 The Twilight Sea\n- 12. Deliver the deserted frog nest to Kotunm 0/1 The Twilight Sea\n- 13. Deliver the rejected frog nest to Kotunm 0/1 The Twilight Sea\n- 14. Speak with Kotunm 0/1 The Twilight Sea\nYou say, 'Hail, Kotunm'\nYour task 'Home Sweet Foam' has been updated.\nYou helped Kotunm investigate the Fungus Grove for frogs. Not sure it will lead to any answers.\nKotunm says, 'Hail, _______. Ah, that foam there, it has a bit of magic to it. I will have to take time studying it. I did see interesting tracks heading into the Scarlet Desert. You should go look [into them].'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Home Sweet Foam\nReward(s):\nMoney for your level - At level 125 - 3624p, 5g, 0s, 0c\nExperience for your level - At level 125 - 0.02% (or 59.63% of an AA point), 1.22% of a merc AA point.\n6 - Fizzlethorpe's Fantastic FizzSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Fizzlethorpe's Fantastic Fizz [item=151370]\n[",
