      walkthrough = "**Time:** 30\n**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task you can get some Faeta Glor in Shadeweaver's Thicket at /way -1744, 2137, -162 in the southwestern portion of the zone. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Faeta Glor'\nFaeta Glor says, 'Ah, welcome, welcome, esteemed guest to the Shadeweaver Jade Gallery. Thank you for attending this glorious event. The event is sponsored by various art enthusiasts, but especially the Doke Collective. Please peruse the various [pieces] in the venue.'\nYou say, 'What art pieces do you have?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Something Unexpected'.\nFaeta Glor says, 'Our small collection of art comes from across Norrath. There are various pieces around, but a highlight would be the six statues within the venue. Please take a look around.'\nYou are welcomed into the Shadeweaver Jade Gallery. This space has been decorated with pieces from around Norrath. The organizer Faeta Glor who greeted you has asked you to acquaint yourself with the art within the gallery.\nWander around the gallery and check out the statues.\n- 1. View statues in the venue 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nIn the Loda Kai Embassy building, /inspect the statues up close.\n- 2. Come back to Faeta Glor 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nSay jade to Faeta Glor.\nYou say, 'jade'\nYour task 'Something Unexpected' has been updated.\nFaeta Glor says, 'Ah, I see. Well, how very surprising. You have found something not many have uncovered. You have been given a chance to have a meeting with our secret donor. They do not normally meet folks, but they left this keyword, and anyone that mutters it to me, the organizer, will have that chance. So, with that you can meet this donor, but you cannot go there empty-handed. Recently jade has been a unique gemstone that they have been fascinated with. I'll give you a tip. I heard there is some jade found in the Mines of Nurga. Go and find some jade to give as a gift.'\n- 3. Explore the Mines of Nurga for jade 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nThis is a location update at /way -1898, -915, -219 in the center room at the bottom where the rails are overhead.\n- 4. Inspect the jade node 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nThere are piles of mineral deposits in several areas in the mine, get close to them and /inspect\nWhen you inspect them, 3 goblins spawn and attack. 2 a haughty goblin and 1 a greedy goblin. Kill them.\n- 5. Kill the goblins who have come for your shinies 0/3 The Mines of Nurga\n- 6. Explore the Mines of Nurga for jade 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nThis step updates at /way -1540, -579, -187 in the same room where the Bloodthirsty Rat spawns.\n- 7. Inspect the jade node 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nAgain, a pile of mineral deposits, get close and /inspect it.\n- 8. Kill the goblins who have come for your shinies 0/3 The Mines of Nurga\nKill the spawned goblins again.\n- 9. Explore the Mines of Nurga for jade 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nThis step updates at /way -1245, -900, -171 on the way to the zoneline for the mines of droga.\n- 10. Inspect the jade node 0/1 The Mines of Nurga\nSame thing, inspect a nearby mineral deposit and kill the goblins.\n- 11. Kill the goblins who have come for your shinies 0/3 The Mines of Nurga\n- 12. Return to Faeta Glor 01 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou say, 'Hail, Faeta Glor'\nYour task 'Something Unexpected' has been updated.\nFaeta Glor has introduced you to one of the sponsors from the Doke Collective. They need a favor and you seem to be the perfect fit to help them. You also uncovered a secret sponsor and will gift them jade that you went out to find. Jade, from what you found, appears to be running low in the mines, but surprisingly was abundant at the gallery. Go see the sponsor from Doke Collective to see what they need.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nFaeta Glor says, 'Ah, you have returned. I see, so you were not able to acquire any jade. We'll put that on hold for now. I do have a favor of you first. Please speak one of our sponsors. Beside me is Alaston Dianthus. He is one of the Doke Collective and he is need of some aid.'\nReward(s):\n2 platinum 2 gold 5 silver\n10 Commemorative CoinsSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n[",
