      walkthrough = "**Time:** 15\n**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis Anniversary task starts with Alaston Dianthus in Shadeweaver's Thicket. You can find him outside the Loda Kai Embassy building in the southwestern corner of the zone at /way -1751, 2132, -161. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Alaston Dianthus'\nAlaston Dianthus says, 'Greetings, Faeta seems to vouch that you have some worth. Does not say much, but you will do. So, my name is Alaston Dianthus, I head the Doke Collective and I am the major sponsor among my colleagues. Some criminals have took some supplies from one of my stash houses. I need you to slay these criminals. So, will you [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Doke Trio'.\nAlaston Dianthus says, 'Good, my scouts say they are hold up at the north east part of the Shadeweaver Thicket. Surely they have camped there and the supplies are close by. Clear them out and come back to me when the deed is done. I'll have my guards take care of the supplies once you give word that you killed them.'\nFaeta Glor asked you to help the major sponsor of the gallery, Doke Collective. They appear to run into some trouble and need tasks done for them while they are at the gallery event. Help the Doke Collective with what they ask before meeting the secret sponsor.\nAlaston requested to get rid of a group of criminals that have taken some of their supplies. He mentioned that it was the north eastern part of Shadeweaver Thicket.\n- 1. Locate the suspected criminals and dispatch them 0/10 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis camp of an unknowing civilian's are located around /way 1831, -2740, -213. Kill 10 of them. They range from level 30 to level 40.\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nAn unknowing civilian says, 'You have slain the criminals, but they did not seem armed. Even the so called supplies do not feel like they were even stolen. Return to Alaston Dianthus that you have completed your task.'\n- 2. Return to Alaston to let him know the deed is done 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou say, 'Hail, Alaston Dianthus'\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nAlaston Dianthus says, 'You have returned and completed the task. Very good, I will have my guards take care of the clean up. The Doke Collective appreciates your efforts. Now I have received a message from my colleague Neetor. Go see him on the second floor of the gallery. He also needs a task taken care of.'\n- 3. Find Neetor on the second floor of the gallery 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou can find Neetor at /way -1740, 2203, -115 on the 2nd floor of the Loda Kai Embassy building that Alaston is standing in front of.\nYou say, 'Hail, Neetor Ikadiff'\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nNeetor Ikadiff says, 'Ah, are you the hired help Alaston spoke of. You seem to be good enough. If you helped Alaston with his task, what I need done is a cake walk. Go north of here and before the soldier`s camp some folk have taken shelter there. I have used a sum of my wealth to those soldier's to protect these folk. Now it is time for the folk to pay their share though it is late. Since I am so generous and virtuous I have given them some leeway, but this time they need to pay up. If they do not well, you can kill them all and loot their corpses. Either way get me my money.'\n- 4. Head north west past the soldier's camp and collect the money 0/10 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThere is a big group of a duressed civilians around /way 246, 2098, -256 on the west side near the wall of the zone.\nKill 10 of them and loot 5 Money Sack off them.\n- 5. Collect money 0/5 Shadeweaver's Thicket\n- 6. Return the collected money to Neetor 0/5 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou offered 1 Money Sack to Neetor Ikadiff.\nYou offered 1 Money Sack to Neetor Ikadiff.\nYou offered 1 Money Sack to Neetor Ikadiff.\nYou offered 1 Money Sack to Neetor Ikadiff.\nYou offered 1 Money Sack to Neetor Ikadiff.\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nNeetor Ikadiff says, 'Good, payment is accounted for. See, it was a very easy task to take care of. Now help Vileor Wilkern with his missing shipment. He is standing next to me and something happened that acquires your assistance.'\nYou complete the trade with Neetor Ikadiff.\n- 7. Speak with Vileor for the next task 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nVileor Wilkern is standing right next to Neetor.\nYou say, 'Hail, Vileor Wilkern'\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nVileor Wilkern says, 'As Neetor said, I am need of assistance on seeing what happened to my latest supply run. One of my close aids, Artwen, was overseeing a shipment of supplies and I have not heard from them. I assume something happened. I assume the worst so please go and search for any clues on what happened.'\n- 8. Go find the supply caravan east for the route heading north 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis updated for me around /way 766, -2257, -189 in the northeastern section of the zone. You'll see broken crates on the ground. These are on the find tool CTRL F under a supply crate.\n- 9. You have found the caravan now find clues on what happened 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nOn the ground at /way 772, -2231, -185 is Bloodied Note. It is near some of the broken crates and looks like a rolled up scroll.\n- 10. Return to Vileor with what you have found 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou offered 1 Bloodied Note to Vileor Wilkern.\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nVileor Wilkern says, 'Ah, thank you _____. I appreciate you handing this to me. We of the Doke Collective appreciate your efforts. I have suspicions on who the perpetrator might be and the Doke Collective will not stand to be pushed around. Faeta had something to mention to you. Goodbye _____.'\nYou complete the trade with Vileor Wilkern.\n- 11. Speak with Faeta for your chance to meet the secret donor 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou say, 'Hail, Faeta Glor'\nYour task 'The Doke Trio' has been updated.\nYou have completed a series of tasks for the Doke Collective, the major sponsor for the gallery. They seem to have questionable lines of work. They also have an enemy that have been disrupting their business. Go back to Faeta Glor and see if it is time to meet the secret sponsor.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nFaeta Glor says, 'Welcome back _____, seems you have helped the Doke Collective with various tasks. They have taken me in since I was young and I am able to earn a living even if it is small through them. Now that you have taken some time to do that. The secret sponsor seems to have responded to your summons. It is quite funny because the Doke Collective were heading in the same location with their guards. I wonder if that was coincidence. Anyways head towards tunnels within the Shadeweaver Gallery and from what they said you will recognize something familiar to guide your way in. Not sure what that means, but I can not leave my post here. Good luck _____.'Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Commemorative Coin [item=116720]\n[",
