      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nPrerequisite Task: 26th Anniversary: Back to Square One [quest=13316]\nThis Anniversary task starts with  Firiona Vie in Shadeweaver's Thicket near the Loda Kai Embassy building in the southwestern corner of the zone. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie says, 'Thank you for giving me a moment to think, ______. Now, perhaps I am being overly [cautious], but the thief was clever enough take the journal from us and prudent enough to communicate through an intermediary. While that intermediary was lax in his discretion, it would still be best for us to know what we are getting into.'\nYou say, 'I don't think you are being overly cautious, so what did you have in mind?'\nFiriona Vie smiles and nods her approval. 'You did well in discerning the location of the thief's hideout, but we still need more [information] before we can move forward with recovering the Diary of the Jade or at the very least know what Jade Bandit wants with the Jade Tiger statue, and I fear time is not on our side.'\nYou say, 'What kind of information do we need?'\nFiriona Vie says, 'If we are to move quickly, I believe it will be vital for us to pinpoint the hideout's location and [scout] the immediate area.'\nYou say, 'I can scout out the area and investigate if the place has any security.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail'.\nFiriona Vie says, 'All right, while you do that, I will start reaching out to my other contacts to see if anyone can give us any further insight. Good luck, _______, and please do not take any unnecessary risks.'\nAfter piecing together the clues and tracking down an informant you now have a solid idea of the thief's hideout location. Firiona Vie has now tasked you with scouting out the location to get a better idea of what and who you are dealing with.\nScout the north side of the thief's hideout in Kithicor Forest.\n- 1. Scout the north side of the thief's hideout 0/1 Kithicor Forest\nThis step updated at /way 500, 207, 18. Northwest of the lake.\n- 2. Scout the south side of the thief's hideout 0/1 Kithicor Forest\nThis step updated at /way 0, 63, -15\n- 3. Inspect the door to the thief's hideout 0/1 Kithicor Forest\nGet near the door of the cabin nearby, a security golem (level 120) spawns and attacks. Kill it.\nOnce dead, Fractured Security Core ends up on your cursor.\n- 4. Deliver the fractured security core to Firiona Via 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou offered 1 Fractured Security Core to Firiona Vie.\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nFiriona Vie turns over the fractured security core in her hands. 'This is a rather complex security core. I had no idea the thief would have something so sophisticated. I think we are going to need the help of an [expert].'\nYou complete the trade with Firiona Vie.\n- 5. Consult with Firiona about the security at the hideout 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou say, 'Did you have an expert in mind?'\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nFiriona Vie says, 'Yes, I have an associate that is well versed in a variety of security systems. Her name is Nulna and she has taken up a temporary residence at the inn in the Plane of Knowledge. Take the core to her and see if she can help you figure out a way to bypass that security.'\n- 6. Meet with the security specialist 0/1 Plane of Knowledge\nNulna is located at /way 393, 970, -91 among the pottery merchants not far from the big bank. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Nulna'\nNulna says, 'Firiona said I should be expecting you. Do you have the core?'\nYou offered 1 Fractured Security Core to Nulna.\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nNulna looks over the fractured security core. 'Well, look at this beautiful little thing. The compact sophistication in its [design], the intricate blending of magic and crystal. This was not cheap, and you broke it.'\nYou complete the trade with Nulna.\n- 7. Collect and deliver the Pepper and the Tip-tap Bunny book 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nYou say, 'Have you seen anything like this design before?'\nNulna says, 'Well, yes and no. I've seen designs similar, but I've never seen this specific design. [Cracking] this baby is going to be tough.'\nYou say, 'But you will be able to crack it, right?'\nNulna says, 'Yeah, of course I can. Maybe. Probably? I'll [need] a few things.'\nYou say, 'need'\nNulna says, 'Yeah, just a few things that will help me crack this security. A [book] that goes into detail on arcane ciphers and I will also need the [schematic] for this device or that is similar.'\nYou say, 'Hail, Nulna'\nNulna says, 'Did you find the [book] and the [schematic] for me yet?'\nYou say, 'book'\nNulna says, 'You know, boring thing with lots of words. Just poke around the library for the book titled 'Pepper and the Tip-tap Bunny.' I'm sure they have a copy of it sitting around and won't mind if it just walks away.'\nThis book can be found at /way -68, 963, -27 in the library. It's not far from Ulin Velnik that sells Paladin Tomes. You'll see it on top of one of the sections that divide the Wizard spells. A black book with white details.\nYou offered 1 Pepper and the Tip-tap Bunny to Nulna.\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Nulna.\n- 8. Collect and deliver the Old Worn Schematic to the security specialist 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nYou say, 'schematic'\nNulna says, 'This one may be a little more complicated. The schematic in question is of an older, but similar design to the device you brought me. These sorts of things don't really travel in many circles, but it just so happens that I have a 'cousin' that works in 'procurement' that should be able to help us out. I'll get into contact with him, and he will drop the schematic in our usual [dead drop]. You just need to pick it up for me.'\nYou say, 'Where is this dead drop?'\nNulna says, 'Northwestern part of the Plane of Innovation near that rusty hut. He usually leaves the item hidden away near some scrap or large piece of metal. Just make sure you aren't followed. I'm not sure how hot the item will be.'\nIn the northwest section of Plane of Innovation, there is a big rusty building. On the backside of that building you'll see a big slab that looks like a robots face in the middle. On the back right of that slab (/way 1522, 1062,-49) you'll see a hidden chest. Right click it and receive that Old Worn Schematic on your mouse cursor, also 2 a clockwork retrieval unit's spawn (level 121) and attack.\nKill them.\nYou offered 1 Old Worn Schematic to Nulna.\nNulna says, 'Book, check. Schematic, check. No one chasing you screaming, check. Good job. Now give me a moment to [calibrate] this device and it will be all yours.'\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Nulna.\n- 9. Speak with the security specialist about the bypass 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nYou say, 'calibrate'\nNulna tinkers with the security device. 'All right, this thing is going to take me longer than I thought to get working, but when I do I [think] it will get you where you want to go.'\nYou say, 'You think?'\nNulna says, 'Yeah, well, the device is a bit more complicated than I anticipated. I don't think it will help you disable the security as completely [bypass] the security all together.'\nYou say, 'Wait, what do you mean bypass the security?'\nNulna says, 'Well, that's the fun part. The device has some kind of transport homer attached to it. Don't worry, I mostly disabled it. And when I give it just the right amount of juice. Bam! Bypass that security and right into wherever it is going to take you. But uh, right now it's not [ready]. If you press this button the only place you'll be going is into a pile of ash.'\nYou say, 'When will it be ready?'\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nNulna says, 'Well, that's a good question that I don't have an answer for just yet. Why don't you head on back to Firiona and let her know it is going to be a little bit and when the device is done, I'll send it her way. Just ah, tell Firiona I expect payment in full through the usual discretionary channels.'\n- 10. Inform Fironia Via of the status of the bypass 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nYour task 'On the Jade Thief's Trail' has been updated.\nThe thief's hideout was more secured than you were expecting, but thanks to the help from Nulna the security specialist you will soon have a way of bypassing the security. For now, you need to wait.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nFiriona Vie nods sternly. 'Nulna is a little eccentric, but she is reliable. I have no doubt she will be able to finish the device she is working on. When she does, I will reach out to you.'\nReward(s):\n2 platinum, 2 gold, 5 silver\n10 Commemorative CoinsSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n[",
