      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Ulorin Galestrider'\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Hail, Gebbe. That rot you found, I have never seen anything like it. I can barely keep it [contained].'\nYou say, 'You can't keep it contained?'\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Well, no. It chews through everything I put it in. The only thing I have found that works is this relic of Rainkeeper's Stormwater.  It well just destroys [the rot].'\nYou say, 'I can destroy the rot.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Wash Away the Stain'.\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Oh. Well in that case you will need this. Once you reach the stain release the storm and then let me know what happens.'\nYou are given: The Rainkeeper's Stormwater\nUlorin Galestrider wants you to return to where you found the rot and try to cleanse it with the Rainkeeper's Stormwater.\nReturn to Dulak's Harbor and the stain of rot.\nReturn to the Stonebrunt Mountains and the stain of rot.\nReturn to Gulf of Gunthak and the stain of rot.\n- 1. Return to the site of the stain in Dulak's Harbor 0/1 Dulak's Harbor\nGo to the stain at /way 898, -161, -76 which is through the fake wall and the first right, you'll see the green blob on the floor with the plague rats. Stand on top of it to get the location update.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 2. Release the Rainkeeper's Stormwater 0/1 Dulak's Harbor\nMake sure you're standing right on top of it or else it will waste a charge on the potion and it won't take effect on the stain. Target the a stain of rot and right click The Rainkeeper's Stormwater.\nI'm releasing the storm onto the stain.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 3. Return to the site of the stain in the Stonebrunt Mountains 0/1 The Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis location update is at /way -4305, 3395, -42 on the far west side of the zone up against the wall near a kobold camp. You'll see the stain on the ground.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 4. Release the Rainkeeper's Stormwater 0/1 The Stonebrunt Mountains\nStand on top of the stain, target it and right click The Rainkeeper's Stormwater.\nI'm releasing the storm onto the stain.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 5. Return to the site of the stain in the Gulf of Gunthak 0/1 The Gulf of Gunthak\nThis location update is at /way -525, 2501, 72 in the shack north of Dulak's Harbor zoneline.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 6. Release the Rainkeeper's Stormwater 0/1 The Gulf of Gunthak\nStand on top of the stain, target it and right click The Rainkeeper's Stormwater.\nI'm releasing the storm onto the stain.\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\n- 7. Let Ulorin know what you learned 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nYou say, 'Hail, Ulorin Galestrider'\nYour task 'Wash Away the Stain' has been updated.\nYou have used the Rainkeeper's Stormwater on the rot, only for plague rats to gather. Ulorin is not happy with this information and thinks that they have something to do with the spread of he stain.\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Hello, ______. What happened when you [released] the stormwater?'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Wash Away the Stain\nYou have gained 21 ability point(s)!\nYou have gained 2 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (2.000%)\nReward(s):\n5 - Rainy Day RationSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Rainy Day Ration [item=151430]\n[",
