      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis seasonal task starts with Ulorin Galestrider in Plane of Knowledge on the far west side of the zone, he is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Ulorin Galestrider'\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Hello, ______. What happened when you [released] the stormwater?'\nYou say, 'When I released the stormwater. The stain remained and rats started to gather.'\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'How interesting. This does require some thought. Hrrm. Maybe those pests are contributing to the stain. How would you feel about killing some [of them]?'\nYou say, 'I can kill some of them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Root Out the Rot'.\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'Maybe getting rid of some of those vermin might get rid of the stain. Please let me know if it helps.'\nUlorin Galestrider wants to cleanse the gulf of the plague rats. Head back to where you found them and exterminate the vile vermin.\n- 1. Kill plague rats in Dulak Harbor 0/7 Dulak's Harbor\nYou can find plague rats in Dulak's Harbor back behind the fake wall that leads to /way 899, -161, -76 to the stain of rot. Plague rats spawn from it and walk off.\nYou can either kill them as they spawn or find them in the zone and kill them. Once you kill them all, a mouldering rat spawns near the stain of rot.\n- 2. Kill the attacking mouldering rat 0/1 Dulak's Harbor\n- 3. Kill plague rats in the Stonebrunt Mountains 0/7 The Stonebrunt Mountains\nplague rats will spawn at the stain of rot on the far west side of the zone in one of the kobold camps at /way -4305, 3395, -42 and then walk away. You can kill them as they spawn from the stain of rot or find them in the zone.\nOnce you kill them all, get near the stain of rot and a mouldering rat spawns and attacks, kill it.\n- 4. Kill the attacking mouldering rat 0/1 The Stonebrunt Mountains\n- 5. Kill plague rats in the Gulf of Gunthak 0/7 The Gulf of Gunthak\nThe stain of rot is at /way -525, 2501, 72 at a shack north of the Dulak's Harbor zoneline. Plague rats will spawn from it and walk away, kill them there or find them up in the zone.\nOnce you kill them all, get near the stain of rot and a mouldering rat spawns and attacks, kill it.\n- 6. Kill the attacking mouldering rat 0/1 The Gulf of Gunthak\n- 7. Let Ulorin know that you killed the rats 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nYou say, 'Hail, Ulorin Galestrider'\nYour task 'Root Out the Rot' has been updated.\nYou have successfully killed the plague and mouldering rats. Ulorin and Rosalind will handle the rest of the clean up from here.\nUlorin Galestrider says, 'More rats, how foul. Rosalind is going to help me cleanse the gulf. Thank you for your assistance. May the wind be always at your back.'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Root Out the Rot\nYou have completed achievement: Tempest Festival: From Stagnant to Saltation\nReward(s):\n5 - Rainy Day RationSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Rainy Day Ration [item=151430]\n[",
