      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nPrerequisite Task: Stone Cold Summer: Blood for Stone [quest=13361]\nThis seasonal task is given to you by Inis Zidas [npc=60694] in Field of Bone at /way -1952, 2719, 7 in front of the ruins that lead to East Cabilis in the south western part of the zone\nYou say, 'Hail, Inis Zidas'\nInis Zidas says, 'This [Ink Stained Hand] being so close to the Kaesora makes me think it belongs there.'\nYou say, 'The Ink Stained Hand wasn't the only relic I gave you.'\nInis Zidas says, 'Yes, the talisman. It's so worn and frankly a bit [troublesome]. Every time I find the will to focus on it, I start working on something else.'\nYou say, 'That does sound troublesome. Could I investigate them for you?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Write With Me'.\nYou are given: Ink Stained Hand\nInis Zidas says, 'That sounds like a fine idea. Here, take this to Kaesora and see that you can find.'\n[The relics have been elusive In revealing their history to Inis. She thinks you can track down more Information by taking the Ink Stained Hand of an ancient librarian into the ruins of Kaesora.\nSearch the floors for something that can give you more information.\nInvestigate the southern spider caves, find and collect the first Quill of the Librarian\n- 1. Collect the first Quill of the Librarian 0/1 Kaesora\n/way -219.02, 275.47, -108.59\nLoot a GROUND spawn looks like a BLUE BALL.\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\n- 2. Use the quill to find hidden notes 0/1 Kaesora\nClick the 'Quill of the Librarian'\nThe Ink Stained Hand begins to tremble in your inventory, as the quill begins to write.\nThe quill dips into the Blood of Chosooth as if it is ink and starts to write. The words are angry and broken. They speak of being disturbed and the work being unfinished.\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\n- 3. Collect the second Quill of the Librarian 0/1 Kaesora\nThis quill can be found in the west part of the zone straight across from where Xalgoz spawns in his temple in the ruined building. Go to the back room where a busted down down is, go up the ramp to /way 72, 542, -266, you'll see the ground spawn.\n- 4. Use the quill to find hidden notes 0/1 Kaesora\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\nThe Ink Stained Hand begins to tremble in your inventory, as the quill begins to write.\n- 5. Collect the third Quill of the Librarian 0/1 Kaesora\nThis quill can be found at the ruins on the east part of the zone in the library at /way +75,-396,-100\n- 6. Use the quill to find hidden notes 0/1 Kaesora\nClicking the quill did not delete the Quill and you have to move around the room to get the update.\nYou gather from the quills words that grave robbers woke an abandoned librarian. And now that spirit demands to be put back to rest.\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\n- 7. Search upstairs for the ossuary 0/1 Kaesora\nClimbing the stairs of the same building you found the 3rd quill in, you see what remains of a broken ossuary.\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\n/way 68.42, -376.09, -74.59\n- 8. Collect the broken ossuary 0/1 Kaesora\nLoot the ground spawn.\n- 9. Deliver the broken ossuary to Inis 0/1 The Field of Bone\nYou offered 1 Broken Ossuary to Inis Zidas.\nYour task 'Write With Me' has been updated.\nYou have successfully investigated the Ink Stained Hand for Inis Zidas.\nInis Zidas says, 'You found this broken ossuary in the [library]?'\nYou complete the trade with Inis Zidas.\nYou say, 'Yes, the library.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Patience, Purification, and Peace'.\nInis Zidas says, 'It's possible that these bothersome remnants belong in it. But before we could even try laying them to rest, the ossuary  would have to be purified, repaired and blessed in the way they were previously laid to rest. I don't know many one with that kind of [patience].'\nReward(s):\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Blood for Stone\n'Sanguine Seltzer' x5 Drink\nSubmitted by: larthRewards:\n- Sanguine Seltzer [item=151716]\n[",
