      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nLarref can be found at  /way -357, 1099, 24, just down a bit from the tunnel entrance to Kerra Ridge in Toxxulia Forest. She is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\nThis quest can be picked up along with the others and can be done in any particular order.\nYou say, 'Hail, Larref'\nLarref says, 'Hello! Do you like scary stories? My friends and I are sharing our favorite [scary stories]. '\nYou say, 'I like scary stories.'\nLarref says, 'My favorite story is about the [lost handkerchief]. '\nYou say, 'The lost handkerchief?'\nLarref says, 'Yes! See, a long time ago. There was a fair maiden who was in love with a simple soldier. Her father didn't approve of the match and arranged for the soldier to be sent in to patrol the Warrens. The maiden knew her father was sending the soldier off to die and enchanted a favor for him to wear. That if he carried it, he would [never die].'\nYou say, 'Never die? That doesn't sound good.'\nLarref says, 'They say that he never returned from that patrol and that maybe her father had a hand in his disappearance. The daughter never recovered from her loss. Some say she went mad. Some say that she pushed her father off in the Hole. However, they all agree that she entered the Warrens and never returned. And on the [anniversary] of her death, she can be seen wandering the paths of the Warrens, looking for her love.'\nYou say, 'When is this anniversary?'\nLarref says, 'No one knows for sure, but the sightings have started again. Did you want to go look for the [lady in white]?'\nYou say, 'Yes, I want to look for the lady in white.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Lost Handkerchief'.\nLarref says, 'They say she can be found wandering in the tunnels of the Warrens.'\n- 1. Search the Warrens for the ghost 0/1 The Warrens\nLocation update /way 754, -125, -78.\n- 2. Hail Constance's ghost 0/1 The Warrens\nConstance's ghost(s) can be found at /way 911, -33, -78.\nYou say, 'Hail, Constance'\nYour task 'The Lost Handkerchief' has been updated.\nConstance says, 'Philip... Philip... Where... Where are you?'\n- 3. Follow Constance's ghost 0/1 The Warrens\nLocation update: /way 675, -113, -78.\n- 4. Kill the lost trainees 0/1 The Warrens\nOne at a time, 4 'a lost trainee' attack. Kill them.\n- 5. Find and follow Constance's ghost 0/1 The Warrens\nLocation update /way 339, -48, -74.\n- 6. Kill the lost trainees 0/1 The Warrens\nOnce again, you are attacked by 3 'a lost trainee,' one at a time. Kill them.\n- 7. Find and follow Constance's ghost 0/1 The Warrens\nLocation update /way -33, 365, -88.\n- 8. End Philip's suffering 0/1 The Warrens\nPhilip attacks. Kill him.\n- 9. Return Constance's Lost Handkerchief 0/1 The Warrens\nLoot Philip's corpse, retrieve the handkerchief and return it to Constance.\nReward(s):\nMoney - At Level 125 - 2416p, 0g, 0s, 0c\nExperience - At Level 125 - Less than 0.01% of the experience required to go from level 125 to 126 (or 1.10% of an AA point) and 0.04% of a mercenary AA point.\n6 - Larref's Terrifying Treat (Food: Miraculous meal. AC: 2, HP: 275, Mana: 275, End: 150, Base Stats: 14, STA: 11, Effect: Terrifying Treat: Looks like it casts a spell animation)Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n[",
