      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nWonto Paanche is located in The Plane of Knowledge at /waypoint +473, +853, -125 .\nYou say, 'Hail, Wonto Paanche'\nWonto Paanche says, 'Hey, you there. The name is Wonto, Wonto Paanche. See here, I run a delivery service and these busy times have got me going everywhere. I am a little short-handed and you seem to look the part that can get stuff done. Do you have some [free] time on your hands, to help a little ol' gnome out?'\nYou say, 'Yes, I am free.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Not So Speedy Delivery'.\nWonto Paanche says, 'Great! Go to the outside of the tailor shop that is south of the entrance to the Bazaar. The package should be near the stacked boxes. Go and deliver it to its drop-off location.'\nYou say, 'Hail, Wonto Paanche'\nWonto Paanche says, 'I am busy! If you need another package, just pick another backup where you found it the first time.'\n1. Collect the package near the tailor's shop - The Plane of Knowledge\n/waypoint +160, +1416, -126\nTargeted (Merchant): Tailor Kujen\nThe shop has three packages. Pick one up!\n2. Find the first drop-off location - The Great Divide\n/waypoint -5577, -2653, -461\n3. Deliver the package to the drop-off - The Great Divide\n/waypoint -5577, -2653, -461\nTargeted (NPC): a drop-off box\n4. Clear out your pursuers - The Great Divide\nKill the three attacking mobs that spawn:\nA frost giant mercenary (Lvl: 125)\nA coldain assassin      (Lvl: 125)\nA coldain assassin      (Lvl: 125)\nNOTE : If you die, you can regive the package to the drop-off to spawn the three mobs.\n5. Collect the note that was on your assailants - The Great Divide\nLoot a Torn Scrap Note.\nThe LORE tab of the note has info about three spots to look for the next step NPC in the quest.\n6. Find the next location to deliver - The Great Divide\n/waypoint -4016, -1894, +37\n7. Speak with the mysterious figure - The Great Divide\nTargeted (NPC): A mysterious figure (Lvl: 130)\nYou say, 'Hail, a mysterious figure'\nA mysterious figure says, 'AH! Who goes there? Why have you come [looking] for me?'\nYou say, 'looking'\nA mysterious figure says, 'A package? Well why didn't you say so? I was not really expecting a package. Hmm, well, hand it over. Wait, oh no, you were [followed]!'\nYou say, 'What do you mean followed?'\nYour task 'A Not So Speedy Delivery' has been updated.\nA mysterious figure says, 'Oh gods, behind you.'\n8. Dispatch the attackers that followed you - The Great Divide\nKill the three attacking mobs that spawn:\nA frost giant mercenary (Lvl: 125)\nA coldain assassin      (Lvl: 125)\nA coldain assassin      (Lvl: 125)\n9. Find the location where the mysterious figure said to meet - The Great Divide\n10. Speak with Laverer Krass - The Great Divide\n11. Give the package to Laveer Krass - The Great Divide\n2 platinum 2 gold 5 silver\nMusic Box: Anthem of Norrath\n10 Commemorate Coins\nMap locations (greatdivide_1.txt) in Great Divide:\nP 2635.1716, 5566.9468, -454.7328,  0, 0, 0,  1,  A_Drop_of_Box\nP 1894.1833, 4017.4709, 35.5454,  0, 0, 0,  1,  A_Mysterious_Figure\nP 1315.8209, 3326.3840, -143.6528,  0, 0, 0,  1,  Laveer_Krass\nSubmitted by: larth ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Commemorate Coins; Music Box: Anthem of Norrath\n[",
