      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 59\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nSkizz Skazz may be found at -2900, +3100.\n1. There is buried treasure around here somewhere. You're going to have to find it and make sure it doesn't fall into the wrong hands. Unfortunately, the map you'd need to find the treasure was lost years ago, so you're going to have to search without one. If you were the one who buried it, you'd explore the southern side of the courtyard right? Hurry to it, before someone else has a chance.\nObjective: Explore the southern side of the courtyard garden in City of Mist. /loc -250, -40, 3\n2. Explore the ruins just east of the lake.\nObjective: Explore the ruins just east of the Lake in Emerald Jungle. /loc 3776, -1925, -341\n3. It's reprehensible that you weren't able to find anything at all buried. You should be wallowing in treasure right now. No matter, make sure you speak with Zuikzan Moorkan, as the map was theirs to begin with.\nObjective: Speak with Zuikzan Moorkan in Trakanon's Teeth. /loc -2588, 3176, -333 by the spectral undead.\nIf not for the poor tracking skills of the brigands who left the map lying around, there'd be treasure in your pockets right now. Oh well, mercenaries can't always be victors, but at least you get a small token for your work here today.\nReward: 3.2 % Regular Experience and 58 platinum, 7 gold, 2 silver and 4 copper\nNeed all task stages and descriptions (these are transcriptions), /loc of quest mobs, any other missing information like faction hits.Submitted by: Lady Cenyana Erinyes of Firiona VieRewards:\n[",
