      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 59\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nSkizz Skazz may be found at -2900, +3100.\n1. The only road left for someone like you is the road less travelled. It's high time you extended your reach, which is why you should take this opportunity to explore the dragon mouth on the lava flow in the west. Heck, you might even enjoy the adventure.\nObjective: Explore the dragon mouth on the lava flow in the west in Skyfire. /loc 284, 4071, 25\n2. It's interesting that what you can find when you just take the time to look around you, isn't it? Besides, there is more to life than just putting sword to skin and hoping you come out the victor, right? To prove the point, why not explore the large Iksar Statue in the east? It'll be worth the effort, rest assured.\nObjective: Explore the large Iksar Statue in the East in the Overthere. /loc -184, -2809, 28\n3. Speak with Leramas Feston in the Plane of Knowledge for your reward.\nObjective: Speak with Leramas Feston in the Plane of Knowledge. /loc -111, 75, -124 - large building next to the soulbinder that has the staircase to the library.\nReward: 3.2 % Regular Experience and 58 platinum, 7 gold, 2 silver and 4 copper\nNeed all task stages and descriptions (these are transcriptions), /loc of quest mobs, any other missing information like faction hits.Submitted by: Lady Cenyana Erinyes of Firiona VieRewards:\n[",
