      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is just a placeholder as we have almost no information about this quest. We need all task stages and descriptions; levels and /loc for all quest mobs; quest items; faction hits if any; list of quest rewards; any other missing information.\nExplore the hornets nest in the southwest - Burning Woods\nThe only road left for someone like you is the road less traveled. It's high time you extended your reach, which is why you should take this opportunity to explore the hornets nest in the southwest. Heck you might even enjoy the adventure.\nRun across the base of the tree, near -2465, +2640.\nExplore the Royal Library - Chardok\nIt's interesting what you can find when you just take the time to look around, isn't it? Besides, there's more to life than just putting sword to skin and hoping you come out the victor, right? To prove the point, why not explore the royal library,? It'll be worth the effort, rest assured.\nUnsolved from here.Submitted by: SukrasisxRewards:\n[",
