      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is just a placeholder as we have almost no information about this quest. We need all task stages and descriptions, levels and /loc for all quest mobs, any other missing information.\nBroad outline:\nStep 1: Talk to Khieka Ripclaw (in Frontier Mountains outside the Burning Woods zoneline).  The tasks says I'm to \"let them know I'm the Red Beetle.  Your contact will know what it means.\"  But the NPC does not in fact respond to \"I'm the Red Beetle\"; you have to hail them as usual.\nStep 2: Explore the giant fort in Burning Woods.  (I had to run up the ramp and reach the middle of the \"plaza\" inside the fort for it to count.  By then I was sort of busy evading giants so I didn't remember to check the coordinates!  I ran back out and zoned to clear aggro.)\nStep 3: Kill 10 greater war boned skeletons in Burning Woods.\nStep 4: Talk to Korriz Stillripple in the Dreadlands.  He's in one of the buildings in the secret valley.  Again, the Task text says his codename is \"Black Bixie\", but he only responds to a simple Hail.\nReward was 117p 4g 4s 8c and I'm afraid I didn't catch how much xp.Submitted by: SukrasisxRewards:\n[",
