        { id = 55245, name = "Toy Skates", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 41\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis series of tasks is available during the Christmas season, starting in 2006.\n/loc of Fireworks Engineer Fabdabus?\nYou say, 'Hail, Fireworks Engineer Fabdabus'\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'Oh, come to see the fireworks, yes?  That's unfortunate, I'm afraid there might not be a [fireworks show] this Frostfell.'\nYou say, 'Fireworks show?'\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'I'm in charge of putting on a spectacular fireworks show for every city in Norrath!  However almost all my fireworks have been stolen!  I don't have enough fireworks to complete my work in this city!  I don't suppose you could [help] by returning some of my fireworks?'\nYou say, 'I will help.'\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'Hooray!  I knew you had the Frostfell spirit in you!  The grimps are the ones who stole my fireworks.  The Grinnuch did not want us to get them back so the grimps hid them in various dungeons!  There are several types of fireworks I need, if you are willing to retrieve them, I will tell you [where] to find them!'\nYou say, 'Tell me where to find them.'\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'Hmm, you're strong!  You can go to the toughest of places!  A shipment of Ak'anon Skylighters was taken to Nagafen's Lair, a bundle of Steamfont Geysers was smuggled into Old Sebilis, and my Big 'Sploder fireworks were delivered to Chardok!  Are you [ready] to get these for me?'\nYou say, 'I am ready.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Frostfell - Fireworks'.\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'Very well then!  Search the dungeons, find the creatures who have my fireworks, and bring them back!  Good luck!'\nLoot 4 Ak'anon Skylights from Nagafen's Lair - Nagafen's Lair\nLoot 4 Steamfont Geysers from Old Sebilis - Old Sebilis\nLoot 4 Big 'Sploder Fireworks from Chardok - Chardok\nBring 4 Ak'anon Skylights to Fireworks Engineer Fabdabus - Plane of Knowledge\nBring 4 Steamfont Geysers to Fireworks Engineer Fabdabus - Plane of Knowledge\nBring 4 Big 'Sploder Fireworks to Fireworks Engineer Fabdabus - Plane of Knowledge\nUpon handing in the items:\nYour task 'Frostfell - Fireworks' has been updated.\nFireworks Engineer Fabdabus says 'Well done!  Keep any extra fireworks you found as your reward.  Also take a pair of these skates, these are what I like to make when I'm not making fireworks!'\nYou have returned all the fireworks to Fabdabus.  Fabdabus was very pleased and has enough fireworks for the end of Frostfell fireworks show.\nYou have been given: Toy SkatesSubmitted by: Aftercure, StrommRewards:\n- Toy Skates [item=55245]\n[",
