      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task is no longer offered but is still available to complete if you received it previously.  It has been replaced by \"Sacred Impressions\"\nFind Artisan Kjell Sunrunner in Halas at location +155, +390 inside The Golden Torc.\nYou say, 'Hail, Artisan Kjell Sunrunner'\n'Aye, hail,' the barbarian says as he raises a fist in salute.  'Have you returned for the [funeral], ______?'\nYou say, 'What funeral?'\nArtisan Kjell Sunrunner says, 'The funeral of Fellroon Skene.  He's one of the last of the Skene clan.  The lad fell in battle.  It was a proud death, a warrior's death!  Too bad there are so few of his kin left to mourn him.  That's why I've returned to Halas, to pay tribute to a great [warrior]!'\nYou say, 'What great warrior?'\nArtisan Kjell Sunrunner says 'Aye, all the Skenes had a penchant for warfare.  That's probably why there are so few of them left.  Before he died, Fellroon told me where to find his clan's armor pattern book.  Their ancestral designs were a long kept secret, but Fellroon said he didn't want these patterns to die with him.  He told me to pass them on to all Barbarians across Norrath.  Would you be interested in a pattern [book] or perhaps some armor [patterns]?'\nYou say, 'I am interested in some armor patterns.'\nKjell Sunrunner says 'Well then, ______.  Now that the Fellroon is dead, a blood feud has began between his family and the goblins that slew him.  If you are interested in joining their effort, they may be able to reward you with more of their ancestral pattern designs.  Let me know if you are interested in expeditions for the Skene clan into [Everfrost], the Mines of [Nurga], the [Maiden's Eye], or the [valley] beyond the Lavastorm mountains.  I have also heard about a new [underground] place.'\nYou say, 'I am interested in an expedition to The Maiden's Eye.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Essence of Darkness'.\nKjell Sunrunner says 'In an effort to curb the power of the goblins, our shamans require further study of the magical essences used by the goblin warlocks.  It is said that the essence of darkness can be found in Maiden's Eye.  Go there, slay eighty shades and return to me with their dark essence.  We can use what you recover to study the nature of the goblins' magic.'\nKill 80 Xi Xaui or Xi Vius - The Maiden's Eye\nLoot 20 Essence of Darkness - The Maiden's Eye\nDeliver 4 Essence of Darkness to Artisan Kjell Sunrunner - Halas\nKill 5 coterie vampyres - The Maiden's Eye\nLoot 1 Vampyre Ashes - The Maiden's Eye\nDeliver 1 Vampyre Ashes to Artisan Kjell Sunrunner - Halas\nUpon handing in the Vampyre Ashes:\nKjell Sunrunner says, 'Well done.  As promised, here's your reward.  Let me know if you are interested in any more of these [patterns].  The blood feud between the Skenes and the goblins rages on!'\nYou receive a Master's Book of Barbarian Culture.\nAre we missing any dialogues?Rewards:\n- Sacred Book of Barbarian Culture [item=34027]\n[",
