      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest has now been replaced by \"Revered Impressions\".  However, if you requested it before the change then you can complete it.\nArtisan Irisi may be found on the second floor of Crescent Reach, at -1350, -1590.\nYou say, 'Hail, Artisan Irisi'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Oh dear, that just won't do. Tell me you have come for [armor] more suited to the Drakkin?'\nYou say, 'I have come for armor more suited to the Drakkin.'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Oh good. You had me worried for a moment. So you are [interested] in some of the armor specifically made for our culture?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Well then, let's get started. You will need various [books] that hold patterns you will need in order to make the armor. There is the [basic] book of armor patterns, and five different books to make [symbols] to augment the efficacy of the armor.'\nYou say, 'What symbols?'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Once you have your armor, you will want to reinforce it with these symbols. Fetch me a few things so I can make the symbol patterns. There's reagents I need in [Crescent Reach], [Dreadlands], [The Dragon Necropolis], and the [valley] beyond the Lavastorm mountains. I have also heard about the [underground] place called Darkhollow.'\nYou say, 'Dreadlands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dreading the Dreadlands'.\nArtisan Irisi says 'I have nightmares about the drachnids. Help soothe my nights by killing some of the drachnids in the Dreadlands. When you have completed that, come back with some hairs from the drachnids, and I will send you back to Dreadlands with another task. Do you wish to gain this [book]?'\nYou say, 'What book?'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Here is a list of the tasks that you will need to complete to get each book. You will only be offered that chance to get books that you will have enough experience to attain.'\nKill 50 Drachnids - Dreadlands\nLoot 10 Urticating Hairs - Dreadlands\nDeliver 4 Urticating Hairs to Artisan Irisi - Crescent Reach\nKill 5 Tundra Yeti - Dreadlands\nLoot 1 Essence of Winter - Dreadlands\nDeliver 1 Essence of Winter to Artisan Irisi - Crescent Reach\nUpon completing the last step:\nArtisan Irisi says 'You have helped Artisan Moswin with her dreams.' (need confirmation of this dialog)\nYou receive an Expert's Book of Drakkin Culture.Rewards:\n- Revered Book of Drakkin Culture [item=64708]\n[",
