      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nCaerlyna may be found in The Bazaar, in front of the central building, at -30, 0.\nShe accepts old, no-longer-craftable DoN cultural bars, sheets, and swatches and converts them to the appropriate Loam or Marrow by level.\nElaborate Frostwarded Steel Bar -> Soluble Loam\nElaborate Sheet of Stalwart Steel -> Soluble Loam\nIntricate Actuated Bronze Sheet -> Bonded Loam\nIntricate Brambleborn Swatch -> Hemic Marrow\nIntricate Driftwalker Swatch -> Hemic Marrow\nIntricate Frostwarded Steel Bar -> Bonded Loam\nIntricate Runeseeker Swatch -> Hemic Marrow\nIntricate Servolink Bronze Bar -> Bonded Loam\nIntricate Twoscale Skyiron Bar -> Bonded Loam\nIntricate Wayguard Rilsteel Sheet -> Bonded Loam\nIntricate Wirewood Mithril Bar -> Bonded Loam\nOrnate Moonsilver Swatch -> Crude Spinneret Fluid\nOrnate Seashine Titanium Sheet -> Malleable Loam\nOrnate Servolink Bronze Bar -> Malleable Loam\nOrnate Twoscale Skyiron Bar -> Malleable Loam (common), Alkaline Loam (rare)\nOrnate Trooper Skyiron Sheet -> Malleable Loam\nOrnate Wirewood Bar -> Malleable Loam\nSimple Crystalweave Swatch -> Sullied Spinneret Fluid\nSimple Driftwalker Swatch -> Dusty Marrow\nSimple Servolink Bronze Bar -> Alkaline Loam\nSimple Twoscale Skyiron bar -> Alkaline Loam\nCaerlyna says 'Enjoy your new item.'\nNeed all items that work, all rewards, links from item to rewards.Rewards:\n- Alkaline Loam [item=68304]\n- Bonded Loam [item=68490]\n- Crude Spinneret Fluid [item=68310]\n- Dusty Marrow [item=68302]\n- Hemic Marrow [item=68497]\n- Malleable Loam [item=68326]\n- Soluble Loam [item=68825]\n- Sullied Spinneret Fluid [item=68299]\n[",
