      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest is active during the 2007 holiday season.\nFind Zoog, a troll, in the frost giant fortress in the Great Divide near the Spires (/loc?). Santug has cleared out the fortress and turned it into a toy factory. Zoog is located in the main building in the middle of the fortress. Hail him to start the quest.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nZoog says 'Hello Human. I'm afraid I don't have much time to talk. We've had some of our best toymakers turn up missing, and I'm trying to figure out what to do. I don't have the dwarfpower to spare to go hunting for them and really could use some help. Would you be [willing] to help me?'\nYou say, 'I am willing to help you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Search for Bram Bandyboot'.\nFind Zott, a troll located in the same building near the fire next to Zoog.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zott'\nZott says 'Hello Human, forgive me if I seem a bit frazzled. Last week I was startled awake from a deep sleep by something going [bump] in the night, and I haven't gotten much rest since.'\nYou say, 'Bump?'\nZott says 'Yes yes, a great bump. Clatter even! Somehow during all the commotion my friend Bram, a toymaker at Santug's workshop, vanished! He was [kidnapped] while we were sleeping!'\nYou say, 'Kidnapped?'\nZott says 'I didn't get a good look at them. I was hiding under my bed and MUCH too frightened to see anything! The only clue we found was a piece of a map with an X marked near Velketor's Labyrinth, but I'm certainly not going down there. That old wizard is crazy! Perhaps you might [try to find] him?'\nYou say, 'I will try to find him.'\nYour task 'Search for Bram Bandyboot' has been updated.\nBram Bandyboot is found in the kodiak cave complex where the entrance to Velk is located, at -6300, +3000. He is in the northeast chamber and is guarded by two frostheart snowmen. When you kill the two your task will update. Note that when you kill a snowman a new one spawns in his place. This occurs once per snowman.  Their drops include:\nFrosty Snow Globe\nIcicle Cake\nOfficial Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow\nRed Velvet Ice Skates\nThe Fruit Cake\nYou say, 'Hail, Bram Bandyboot'\nYour task 'Search for Bram Bandyboot' has been updated.\nBram Bandyboot says 'Thank you stranger! I would have tried to run away but I was much too frightened by these snowmen. I cannot thank you enough!'\nReturn to the frost giant fortress and talk to Zoog.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nYour task 'Search for Bram Bandyboot' has been updated.\nYou gain experience!!\nZoog says 'You found him! Most excellent work ______! Most excellent work indeed. I have [more] work for you if you're brave enough.'\nThe next task in the series is now unlocked.\nNeed all task stages and descriptions.Submitted by: Tarmuar Shadowstalker, Valorious, PrexusRewards:\n- Frosty Snow Globe [item=72682]\n- Icicle Cake [item=72683]\n- Official Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow [item=72684]\n- Red Velvet Ice Skates [item=72687]\n- The Fruit Cake [item=72685]\n[",
