      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest is active during the 2007 holiday season.\nFind Zoog, a troll, in the frost giant fortress in the Great Divide near the Spires (/loc?). Santug has cleared out the fortress and turned it into a toy factory. Zoog is located in the main building in the middle of the fortress.  At the end of the previous quest, he mentioned that he had [more] work for you to do.\nYou say, 'More?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rescue Hailie Biggeyes'.\n- Speak to Zobb about the missing Snow Dwarf. (0/1) - Great Divide\nFind Zobb, a troll located in the same building near the fire next to Zoog.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zobb'\nZobb says 'Humph.. What do you want? Can't you see I'm [busy] here?'\nYou say, 'Busy?'\nZobb says 'Well, not right this second, but ever since Hailie went [missing], I've had to take over her shifts making toys for Santug, and I'm really not happy about it.'\nYou say, 'Missing?'\nZobb says 'Yes I said missing. You have wax in your ears or what? A few days ago, Hailie took a snack break, and just never came back. We searched around, but the only thing we found were some odd tracks in the snow that headed off to the northeast. I'd go looking for her, but I'm stuck making these toys. Would you be [interested] in searching for her?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nYour task 'Rescue Hailie Biggeyes' has been updated.\nZobb says 'Excellent. Most helpful even! I'm far too busy to go looking for her myself. Please hurry! Santug must have his helpers to finish making all the toys for good little Norrathian girls and boys.'\n- Discover where Hailie Biggeyes has been taken. (0/1) - Great Divide\n- Kill the guards keeping Hailie prisoner. (0/2) - Great Divide\nHailie Biggeyes is located in the northeastern corner of the zone at -825, -4015. Like Bram, she is guarded by two frostheart snowmen. Kill them and their repops and hail her.\nTheir drops include:\nFrosty Snow Globe\nIcicle Cake\nOfficial Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow\nThe Fruit Cake\nYou can hail the dwarves while invisible.\n- Speak to Hailie Biggeyes. (0/1) - Great Divide\nYou say, 'Hail, Hailie Biggeyes'\nThis works while invisible.\nYour task 'Rescue Hailie Biggeyes' has been updated.\nHailie Biggeyes says 'My Hero! These snowmen grabbed me when I was eating. So rude! Don't you agree? I can't understand why anyone would do such a horrible thing. I really must get back to the workshop and tell Santug I'm ok.'\n- Return to Zoog and deliver the news of Hailie's rescue (0/1) - Great Divide\nReturn to Zoog for the update and next mission.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nYour task 'Rescue Hailie Biggeyes' has been updated.\nYou gain experience!!\nZoog says 'Santug will be so happy to hear Hailie is safe. More importantly, she's back to work making toys! I have [more] work for you if you can spare the time.'\nThe next task in the series is now unlocked.\nNeed all task stages and descriptions.Submitted by: Tarmuar Shadowstalker, Valorious, PrexusRewards:\n- Frosty Snow Globe [item=72682]\n- Icicle Cake [item=72683]\n- Official Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow [item=72684]\n- Red Velvet Ice Skates [item=72687]\n- The Fruit Cake [item=72685]\n[",
