      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest is active during the 2007 holiday season.\nFind Zoog, a troll, in the frost giant fortress in the Great Divide near the Spires (/loc?). Santug has cleared out the fortress and turned it into a toy factory. Zoog is located in the main building in the middle of the fortress.  At the end of the previous quest, he mentioned that he had [more] work for you to do.\nYou say, 'More?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Freedom of Kanf Shadowhands'.\n- Speak to Zipp about the missing Snow Dwarf. (0/1) - Great Divide\nFind Zipp, yet another troll in the main building next to the fire.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zipp'\nZipp fumbles around a bit, 'What? Who's there? Is that you [Kanf]?'\nYou say, 'Kanf?'\nZipp turns his eyes to you, though it's clear he cannot see. 'No no. You're not Kanf. You don't smell like Kanf. Always eating he is. I can smell him coming a hundred yards away. Come to think of it, I haven't smelled his tubbyness in several days. I hope he hasn't gotten himself [stuck] again. He's supposed to be here building toys for Santug.'\nYou say, 'Stuck?'\nZipp chuckles a bit. 'Yes stuck. Many years ago that fat litle dwarf got himself stuck under a tree and would have certainly died that day had I not come along and pulled him out. Do you think you could [look] for him? I'm afraid I won't be much help with my bad eyes.'\nYou say, 'I will look for him.'\nYour task 'The Freedom of Kanf Shadowhands' has been updated.\nZipp says 'Why yes! You should go find him! The last time we spoke, he kept talking about some wonderful pie he'd stolen from the Tizmaks to the west of here. Always thinking of food that one. I'd start searching there if I was able.'\n- Discover where Kanf Shadowhands has been taken. (0/1) - Great Divide\n- Kill the guards keeping Kanf prisoner. (0/2) - Great Divide\nFind Kanf Shadowhands in the Tizmak caves in the northwestern corner of the zone (/loc?). Take the northern entrance. He is located in the first big room on your left as you go down the passage at -1205, +2435. As before, kill the frostheart snowmen.  Their drops include:\nFrosty Snow Globe\nIcicle Cake\nOfficial Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow\nThe Fruit Cake\n- Speak to Kanf Shadowhands. (0/1) - Great Divide\nYou say, 'Hail, Kanf Shadowhands'\nYour task 'The Freedom of Kanf Shadowhands' has been updated.\nKanf Shadowhands says 'Bah! I was going to dispatch these snowmen myself if you hadn't come along. I was just waiting for my chance to strike! I really must be getting back to the workshop now. Please tell Zoog you found me. I'm sure he's very worried.'\n- Return to Zoog and deliver the news of Kanf's rescue (0/1) - Great Divide\nZoog is located at -2892, -2631, 282.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nYour task 'The Freedom of Kanf Shadowhands' has been updated.\nYou gain experience!!\nZoog says 'Great work in finding Kanf ______! We're very nearly back on schedule here at the workshop thanks to you! I have [more] work for you if you feel up to the task.'\nThe next task in the series is now unlocked.\nNeed all task stages and descriptions.Submitted by: Tarmuar Shadowstalker, Valorious, PrexusRewards:\n- Frosty Snow Globe [item=72682]\n- Icicle Cake [item=72683]\n- Official Red Runner Piston Action 10 Shot Crossbow [item=72684]\n- Red Velvet Ice Skates [item=72687]\n- The Fruit Cake [item=72685]\n[",
    },
