      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest is active during the 2007 holiday season.\nFind Zoog, a troll, in the frost giant fortress in the Great Divide near the Spires (/loc?). Santug has cleared out the fortress and turned it into a toy factory. Zoog is located in the main building in the middle of the fortress.  At the end of the previous quest, he mentioned that he had [more] work for you to do.\nYou say, 'More?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Savior of Gemmi Goodkin'.\nSpeak to Zoog about the missing Snow Dwarf. (0/1) - Great Divide\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nZoog says 'You're getting quite the reputation around here as a missing person finder and there has been no shortage of Santug's workers getting kidnapped these days. First Bram vanishes, then Hailie and Kanf, and just yesterday, Santug's lead toymaker [Gemmi] was abducted in broad daylight.'\nYou say, 'Gemmi?'\nZoog says 'Some rather large creatures made of ice just walked into the workshop and grabbed her. She tried to fight them off but they dragged her away to the southwest. We need someone to [rescue] her ______! Santug will NEVER get his toys made in time without her!'\nYou say, 'I will rescue her.'\nYour task 'The Savior of Gemmi Goodkin' has been updated.\nDiscover where Gemmi Goodkin has been taken. (0/1) - Great Divide\nKill the guards keeping Gemmi prisoner. (0/3) - Great Divide\nZoog says 'Do you think you could? I wouldn't try it alone ______. I certainly wouldn't want to run into whomever is causing all this ruckus! Someone must really be unhappy with Santug! Please hurry! Santug must have his helpers to finish making all the toys for good little Norrathian girls and boys.'\nGemmi Goodkin is located in the wurm cave complex center zone. She is located in the largest Chamber along the southern wall. You may want to clear out the wurms in the chamber first before hailing Gemmi. You can also kill the guards (are these also \"a frostheart snowman?\"), but don't hail Gemmi until you are ready. At level 71, the wurms are not a problem, but can be a nuisance when you fight Father Frostheart.\nOnce you clear the chamber, get close enough to Gemmi to get the task update that you found her. Then kill the guards. When ready, hail Gemmi.\nSpeak to Gemmi Goodkin. (0/1) - Great Divide\nYou say, 'Hail, Gemmi Goodkin'\nGemmi Goodkin says 'Thank you! Thank you! I was so scared. I'd love to stay and chat but I think I should be getting back to the workshop now.'\nYour task 'The Savior of Gemmi Goodkin' has been updated.\nKill Father Frostheart. (0/1) - Great Divide\nAs soon as you hail Gemmi, you hear the following.\nFather Frostheart shouts 'Norrathians! The time of eternal winter has come and not even Santug Claugg can save you!'\nFather Frostheart pops in the middle of the chamber and will not move unless engaged.  He does not remain up long and will despawn if not engaged.  If this occurs you will have to remove yourself from the task and return to Zoog to get it over again. Luckily, you don't have to do all the rescues over again, just Gemmi.  While he is up, no one else may hail Gemmi for a task update (preventing a second instance of Father Frostheart from popping).\nFather Frostheart's level is relative to the person who hailed Gemmi.  He procs Icicle Spike and is rootable and snareable.  After he dies you get a task update. He drops the Red Velvet Ice Skates.\nYour task 'The Savior of Gemmi Goodkin' has been updated.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou hit Father Frostheart for 88 points of damage.\nYou have slain Father Frostheart!\n--You have looted a Red Velvet Ice Skates.--\nOther drops:\nFrosty Snow Globe\nIcicle Cake\nReturn to Zoog. (0/1) - Great Divide\nYou say, 'Hail, Zoog'\nYour task 'The Savior of Gemmi Goodkin' has been updated.\nYou gain experience!!\nZoog says 'Hello ______! Santug and I are so thankful. Because of your help, Santug will be able to deliver his toys on time, and Frostfell is saved.'\nReward is 5 x Potion of Adventure.Submitted by: Tarmuar Shadowstalker, Valorious, PrexusRewards:\n- Frosty Snow Globe [item=72682]\n- Icicle Cake [item=72683]\n- Potion of Adventure [item=68275]\n- Red Velvet Ice Skates [item=72687]\n[",
    },
