      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest is identical for the following races and is given by the Artisan in your home city....\nBarbarian\nOgre\nTroll\nUsing Ogres as an example...\nYou say, 'Hail, Artisan Garth Okken'\nArtisan Garth Okken says 'Hrmph!  What der you want?  A [clubbin]?'\nYou say, 'just joo try clubbin me'\nArtisan Garth Okken says 'You do wants a clubbin!  Ha ha!  You pass da test den!  Anyone who wants a clubbin' from me must be too tuff for a clubbin!  Leave me with jusa broken club!  How you get to be so tuff, Tumytuk?  You don't even wear da good [armor]!'\nYou say, 'whut? me armor is grate'\nArtisan Garth Okken says 'Aye, ha ha.  Da gud armor!  Normally ogres not good at making tings, just breakin' tings, ya? But dis one ogre, a crazy war face named Kizrak da Tyrant, he design da gud armor and gave me da [pattern] book.  Told me to pass it out to da other tuff ogres.  Since you tuff enough to ask me for a clubbin', you tuff enough for dis armor! Mebbe you even tuff enough to earn [medals].'\nYou say, 'whut medals?'\nArtisan Garth Okken says 'Yah. If'n you think you ready fer something a lil more challengin', I can send you on many missions.  You take as many as you want.  To prove you good, you make impressions in book.  Da book do da work so you no worry about it.'\nYou are offered a number of \"Impressions\" tasks.  For Revered...\nTo find the patterns that will inspire you, you will need to kill Chetari warriors in Dragon Necropolis, and Lictors in the Heart of Sanctus Seru. The patterns you will need are the tooth impressions of the Chetari warriors and the breastplate symbols of the Lictors of the Heart.\nReceive Sacred Impression Book\nKill 20 Chetari warriors 0/20 (Dragon Necropolis)\nMake impressions of the teeth of Chetari warriors. 0/5 (Dragon Necropolis)\nAn \"impression\" is a random update that can come from any kill... as long as you have your Impression Book in your inventory. It may be necessary to kill in excess of the required kill quota in order to complete the impressions stage. That's why it's called random.\nKill 10 Lictors of the Heart 0/10 (Sanctus Seru)\nMake impressions of the symbols on the breastplates of the Lictors 0/2 (Sanctus Seru)\nDeliver the impression book to an artisan of your race 0/1 (ALL)\nReturn Sacred Impression Book to the same Artisan you gave you the quest.\nReceive Sacred Book of xxx Culture appropriate to your race.Submitted by: Lias Roxx, Defiant, ZekRewards:\n- Revered Book of Barbarian Culture [item=34012]\n- Revered Book of Erudite Culture [item=34011]\n- Revered Book of Froglok Culture [item=34020]\n- Revered Book of Gnomish Culture [item=34014]\n- Revered Book of Half Elven Culture [item=34007]\n- Revered Book of Halfling Culture [item=34010]\n- Revered Book of Human Culture [item=34006]\n- Revered Book of Ogre Culture [item=34016]\n- Revered Book of Troll Culture [item=34015]\n- Revered Book of Vah Shir Culture [item=34019]\n[",
