      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nWorg Master Krellog can be located in the Merchant's rotunda of the Bazaar at -53.31, -53.54, 4.48.\nYou say, 'Hail, Worg Master Krellog'\nWorg Master Krellog says 'Hail to yourself as well! Have ya seen me worg [mounts] yet? Quite the trusty steed if ya ask me, and a might better than those monstrous horses.'\nYou say, 'What mounts?'\nWorg Master Krellog says 'Aye.. Worgs. Feisty and strong, but dun call them wolves if ya value yer hide. They're a wee bit sensitive about such things. If you have a mount now, I could be talked into some sort of [trade].'\nYou say, 'What kind of trade?'\nWorg Master Krellog says 'Well, not really a trade. More like an [upgrade] to one of my CLEARLY superior worgs.'\nYou say, 'What kind of upgrade?'\nWorg Master Krellog says 'Aye, an upgrade. What'cha do is put your old and busted bridle mount, along with the new hotness Worg mount into this here locker. Worgs are smart ya see. They'll run at whatever speed your old and busted bridle mount did. Not a bad deal I think!'\nYou receive: Locker of Lupine Linking\nYou can use this to create (or uncreate) worg mounts by combining the mount-summoning item and the bridle in the locker .\nFor example:\nMottled Worg Bridle +  Black Ornate Chain Bridle = Black Ornate Chain Worg Bridle\nMany other bridles can be made, look at the quested items on the left to see a listing of which bridles you can combine. The recipes will be attached to the worg bridles listed as the rewards from the quest.Submitted by: Lord Elbribon L'Abattage, Tunare's Guilded Knights, TunareRewards:\n- Black Chain Worg Bridle [item=70506]\n- Black Ornate Chain Worg Bridle [item=71312]\n- Black Ornate Chain Worg Bridle [item=71905]\n- Brown Chain Worg Bridle [item=73615]\n- Brown Chain Worg Bridle [item=69939]\n- White Ornate Chain Worg Bridle [item=76766]\n[",
