      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task starts with Poison Masters in various cities and has a seven-day lockout timer. This is the second \"Small Favor\" task for rogues (the first being \"A Small Favor - Endoc Cron\").\nYou say, 'Hail, Poison Master Skuk'\nPoison Master Skuk looks you up and down as if assessing your worth. 'Hello there, _____. It's good that you have come to me today. I was just saying to myself, Self, I said, who is worthy of this [opportunity] that I could offer? And now, here you are!'\nYou say, 'What opportunity?'\nPoison Master Skuk nods. 'Yes, a most fantastic opportunity. I happen to have in my possession certain compounds. These compounds, when combined together, form [toxins] of various types. You might apply one of these toxics to a blade and if your hand happened to slip and the blade pierced the side of your enemy, why that enemy might begin to suffer in terrible agony. And that would be a terrible shame, wouldn't it?'\nYou say, 'What toxins?'\nPoison Master Skuk laughs. 'You're interested? Of course you are! But I'm a businessman first and foremost. You would need to perform a [service] for me first. Consider it a small token of your appreciation for the gift that I will bestow upon you.'\nYou say, 'What service?'\nPoison Master Skuk smiles grimly, the glint in his eye hinting at what a dangerous person you are dealing with. 'Here is your task, young one. Do not disappoint me. Never forget the tools of your craft - you must be invisible to detection or you will surely die. And you're no good to me dead!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Small Favor - Eldrith Tenk'.\nThe Poison Master has asked you to do a simple task and promised ample rewards for your small service. Travel to West Freeport and resolve a small misunderstanding between the Poison Master and one Louis Stull.\nIt would be in your best interests to be hidden from view while undertaking this task as the Poison Master's informants report the Freeport Militia are on high alert.\nMake sure you're SOS before entering Freeport. Watch out for the Militia Patrol which can see through SOS and hit for ~95,000.\nEnter the West Gate of Freeport near the Common Lands 0/1 (West Freeport)\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint +1, -138, -83\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint +23, -207, -83\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint -96, -306, -83\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint -208, -473, -87\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint -187, -540, -87\nSneak along the path precisely to avoid detection! 0/1 (West Freeport)\n* Your Location is /waypoint -229, -513, -87\nKill 1 Eldrith Tenk 0/1 (West Freeport)\nEldrith Tenk is a very quick kill.\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: A Small Favor - Eldrith Tenk\n- Consigned Bite of the Shissar VIII\n- Consigned Unadorned Sealed Poison Vial\n- Concentrated Grade B Mamba Venom\n- Suspension Fluid\n- Emulsifier\nSubmitted by: KudladarRewards:\n- Concentrated Grade B Mamba Venom [item=84032]\n- Consigned Bite of the Shissar VIII [item=84694]\n- Consigned Unadorned Sealed Poison Vial [item=84276]\n- Emulsifier [item=84129]\n- Suspension Fluid [item=84125]\n[",
