      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nWhen your new character enters Norrath for the first time, you might receive this message:\nMissing message\nYour new character spawns with \"Guild Summons\" in its inventory. Right-clicking this item opens a window showing the following text:\nIt is the time of your rebirth. You are no longer a broodling. You are now an apprentice of the dark circle. Your lessons shall begin immediately. Return this note to me. I await within your new home, The Tower of Death. The Harbinger\nHarbinger Glosk is located on the 5th floor of the necromancer guild tower in West Cabilis at /waypoint +316, +778, +77 . He stands in front of your new character when it enters Norrath for the first time.\nUpon giving him the Guild Summons:\nHarbinger Glosk says 'Another apprentice has achieved rebirth. You have now become one with the Brood of Kotiz. We study the ancient writing of Kotiz. Through his writings, we have found the power of the dark circles. Listen well to the scholars within this tower and seek the [Keepers Grotto] for knowledge of our spells. This drape shall be the sign to all Iksar that you walk with the Brood. Now go speak with Xydoz.'\nYour faction standing with Brood of Kotiz has been adjusted by ?.\nYour faction standing with Legion Of Cabilis has been adjusted by ?.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive Drape of the Brood*.\nSubmitted by: iventheassassinRewards:\n- Drape of the Brood* [item=58734]\n[",
