      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is a Short task given by Cadale Brohat in the Gulf of Gunthak.\nBounty hunter extraordinaire.  How does that sound?  It's time to test your skills and to do so you're going to need to kill 10 pestilent troll zombies, and quickly.  You only receive the bounty if you make sure to loot 4 Zombie Skin, though, so donâ€™t forget.  You're going to have to prove yourself if you want everyone to start calling you extraordinary.\nKill 10 emaciated zombies (0/10) Gulf of Gunthak\nLoot 4 Zombie Skin (0/4) Gulf of Gunthak\nDid you stop to breathe at all?  Your prowess in the field of hunting far exceeded everyone's expectations.  To receive your bounty, just deliver 4 Zombie Skin to Dellthuea.\nDeliver 4 Zombie Skin to Dellthuea (0/4) Gulf of Gunthak\nYou really are on the path to becoming extraordinary.  Everyone believed the title you donned was fictional, but you really are almost worthy to hold the title.  Here's your bounty, and who knows?  If you keep up the good work, there may be more bounties for you to collect in the near future.\nYou receive 4 copper.\nYou receive 1 silver.\nYou receive 2 gold.\nYou receive 27 platinum.\nYou gain experience!!\nSubmitted by: LovejoyRewards:\n[",
