      walkthrough = "**Level:** 60\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Event\n**Group Size:** Raid\n\nThis event has been removed on most servers, but is still available on Al'Kabor (Mac) server.\nNeed all dialogues, faction hits, quest items, quest mobs (including fight info, /loc, faction hits, etc.), rewards, minimum/maximum raid size other event info.Submitted by: GnosticaRewards:\n- Bloodstained Robes [item=64630]\n- Bone Ring of Disharmony [item=12626]\n- Crown of the Defender [item=16222]\n- Emaciated Maul of the Overseer [item=12625]\n- Short Bone Blade of the Grimling [item=12627]\n[",
