      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Achievement\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is a \"Quests\" achievement under the \"Tradeskill\" tab.\nFor an overview and listing of Tradeskill achievements, click here.\nThis achievement was stealth patched on or around the June 15, 2016 patch by Dzarn.\nThis achievement does not require speaking with anyone prior; you may start it at anytime.\nThis achievement is gained upon recovering all of Lebounde's lost equipment:\nYou say, 'Hail, Lebounde ab Dolmen'\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'Gooddeh t' yeh, friend.\nThis is all he says to begin with. Hand in one of the required items (the easiest is the Halas item at the bottom of the well). Upon handing this in:\nLebounde ab Dolmen thanks you gratefully, 'A fine thing yeh did in findin' this. If yeh find anythin' else they took from meh, make haste back with it.'\nYou receive a \"Scribbled Directions\" (readable book describing the lost item locations).\nIf you hail Lebounde ab Dolmen now, he replies with:\nYou say, 'Hail, Lebounde ab Dolmen'\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'Gooddeh t' yeh, friend. Wouldn't happen t' be lookin' fer [work], would ye?\nYou say, 'I'm looking for work.'\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'Could use help finidin' some of meh lost equipment. Yeh see, a group of thugs ran off with most of it, left meh with nothin' but a handful of riddles. Bandits ain't never made much sense t' meh, but maybe yeh'll have some luck decipherin' meanin' outta this.'\nRecover all 16 pieces of Lebounde's lost equipment:\n- Deliver Outcast's Coal - \"above the yakmen where the guilty hide\"\nIcewell Keep (Outcast's Coal). Get into the area near The Dain, drop down the well, head to the zone out to greater divide. approx. location (12, 882, -20). You zone out into the Tizmak cave.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP -881.8168, -12.8408, -24.8417, 99, 0, 255, 1, Outcast's_Coal\nin thurgadinb_3.txt\n- Deliver Timeless Oil - \"West of Maelin standing between VI and V.\"\nPlane of Innovation (Timeless Oil) - Maelin room past Chronographer Muon ( say yes) in the western cubby, north side loc ( -830, 1082, -1882) - Note Muon will only port your group if the person that says yes to Muon has a Quintessence of Elements on them.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP -1084.7336, 833.7087, -1884.4360, 93, 0, 255, 1, Timeless_Oil\nin poinnovation_3.txt\n- Deliver Lava Gem - \"through the eye and the lair, past the gatekeeper\"\nSol-C (Lava Gem). Come in from bat 2 in Sol-B ( stay in the lava when zoning in or you go to Aol-A). Head south, west then north to the farthest north area. Looks like an apple at (900, -430, 5)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 430.2330, -901.1746, -0.4782, 109, 0, 255, 1, Lava_Gem\nin soldungc_3.txt\n- Deliver Kuuan Light - \"Atop the heart of the Kuuan spire.\"\nHarbinger's Spire (Kuuan Light) - literally top of the spire. Have to do some climbing and floating. loc (205, -1450, 675)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 1450.6029, -202.9220, 671.9164, 103, 0, 255, 1, Kuuan_Light\nin harbingers_3.txt\n- Deliver Blood Clay - \"a nightmare under the disarmed ocean lord\"\nErudin Burning (Blood Clay) - Paladin guild, upper floor, lower blood pool on left. loc (-1255, -50, 48). Look down from above watch for hole in moving liquid.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 50.5516, 1255.6361, 47.0982, 99, 0, 255, 1, Blood_Clay\nin fallen_3.txt\n- Deliver Iridescent Frond - \"obscured by fog, where dawn strikes alaris\"\nBeasts' Domain (Iridescent Frond) east wall in the tube like pathways - currently a dead end. loc ( -1750, -1375, 0). A bright green leaf on the ground.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 1379.7740, 1745.1154, -4.4437, 99, 0, 255, 1, Iridescent_Frond\nin beastdomain_3.txt\n- Deliver Questionable Cheese - \"impaled, neither rat, gopher, nor maggot\"\nClan RunnyEye (Questionable Cheese) - bottom floor east of the banker. loc ( -43, -70, -128)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 68.7316, 41.0624, -130.3631, 99, 0, 255, 1, Questionable_Cheese\nin runnyeye_3.txt\n- Deliver Icy Rune - \"Where a frozen king's servant scrys\"\nPermafrost (Icy Rune) - back of scryers room.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 607.5514, -182.8284, 1.5428, 99, 0, 255, 1, Icy_Rune\nin permafrost_3.txt\n- Deliver Royal Linens - \"a frog surrounded by snakes under the court of a king\"\nHigh Keep (Royal Linens) - enter the main keep, stay on same level. South side halfway in are 3 rooms. center room has a box on the bed. loc ( -105, -250, 5)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 250.8352, 103.1590, 3.7962, 103, 0, 255, 1, Royal_Linens\nin highkeep_3.txt\n- Deliver Irresistible Lure - \"A vase at the Top of the World\"\nHighpass Hold (Irresistible Lure) - Top of the World Bar ( west central area of the zone). Use main entrance, opposite Maigin Greyeagle, top shelf inside vase. loc (235, 603, 48)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP -603.9972, -233.8661, 46.6986, 103, 0, 255, 1, Irresistible_Lure\nin highpasshold_3.txt\n- Deliver Blood Suspension - \"A crimson pool near a blue pawn\"\nClan Crushbone (Blood Suspension) - enter the keep and drop right into that fountain to the bottom loc ( 78, -20, -45)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 21.1915, -78.6416, -46.4667, 99, 0, 255, 1, Blood_Suspension\nin crushbone_3.txt\n- Deliver Worn Chisel - \"a cold fall from my forge\"\nHalas (Worn Chisel) - literally at the bottom of the well. Eastern half of the zone, center of all the buildings, loc ( 185, -212, -128)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 211.8415, -185.0195, -130.4342, 96, 0, 255, 1, Worn_Chisel\nin halas_3.txt\n- Deliver Cursed Arrowheads - \"where the haggle baron does not sleep\"\nDalnir (Cursed Arrowhead). Plane of Knowledge to Overthere to Warslik Woods to Dalnir. Found in the lower level, south from the entry area at loc ( -52, -754, -94) rear of the coffin.\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 753.8333, 51.6732, -96.4215, 96, 0, 255, 1, Cursed_Arrowheads\nin dalnir_3.txt\n- Deliver Sweat-Stained Headband - \"A foundry in a delve past the lair.\"\nTirranun's Delve (Sweat-Stained Headband) - west section of the map, southern room, behind the center forge loc ( 586, 356, 4)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP -357.2279, -585.0943, 1.3606, 99, 0, 255, 1, Sweat-Stained_Headband\nin delveb_3.txt\n- Deliver Oily Gear - \"beneath a skull where oil flows like water\"\nMeldrath's Majestic Mansion (Oily Gear) - main entry, stay on same level and head north into the next room with the pool half oil/water. In the oil loc ( 225, 16, 6). (I had to shrink to see it and take off lev).\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP -13.6344, -228.8613, 5.5776, 96, 0, 255, 3, Oily_Gear\nin mansion_3.txt\n- Deliver Eerie Ore - \"where the caged struggle and the crazed mine\"\nTorgiran Mines (Eerie Ore) - found it in the southern part in the mines nearer Dulak's Harbor zone. loc (40, -700, 0)\nCopy and paste the below location into the map file indicated.\nP 404.5580, -79.5711, 1.0445, 103, 0, 255, 1, Eerie_Ore\nin torgiran_3.txt\nGoodurden's map pack has labels for the ground spawns.\nIf this quest hasn't been completed on a server yet, turn in the items to a bewildered artisan in Everfrost. After turning in all 16 items gathered using the above clues, Lebounde ab Dolmen (aka this bewildered artisan) becomes active in Halas.\nHowever if not a server first, then turn in the items to Lebounde ab Dolmen.\nLebounde ab Dolmen's eyes light up with excitement, 'This! This is it, Laurana! The last thing them bandits took from meh! Now it's time we get to [work]!\nYou have completed achievement: The Artisan's Wares\nYou say, 'What work?\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'Yeh've proven t' be a quite the explorer in recoverin' meh equipment. If yeh can prove t' be a true craftsman then meh finest prize is yer's.'\nA Task Window pops up with a selection of tasks, all based around the nine basic tradeskills.\nIn your tell window, Lebounde will give you advice on any past information you may be missing in order to move forward.\nKnown messages include:\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'I'd recommend yeh read through the 10 chapters of Liber Brassica Felix when yeh get the chance.'\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'I suggest yeh have a chat with Aid Grimel out in New Tanaan.'\nLebounde ab Dolmen says 'Yeh should speak t' Eron Nurwistle next time yeh head through Dragonscale Hills.'\nSubmitted by: Cylius & LauranaRewards:\n[",
