      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nInformation on how to access Lceanium Portal from Empires of Kunark  to The Nexus.\nGreater Okula [npc=50922] is located in the northwest corner of Lceanium.\nYou say, 'Hail, Greeter Okula'\nGreeter Okula says 'Hello Gidono! It's a honor to be able to greet you. Welcome to Lceanium. The city itself is to the south, though I must warn you that it isn't exactly a safe trip. If you would prefer, I can offer you a (Spire Stone of Lceanium) if you wish to return to the Nexus.'\nYou say, 'Spire Stone of Lceanium'\nHe hands you a Spire Stone of Lceanium [item=126769]. Put this in your inventory and wait at the spires to be ported back to The Nexus.\n[",
