      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar is located in to the left, in a room past the maze in Skyshrine for paladins to obtain a set of Scaled Knight's Armor. Approx location: 130, 650\nYou must be at least ALLY with Claws of Veeshan in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Adwetram Fe`Dhar'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says, 'I wish to speak only to the knights called paladins. If you are what I seek do you wish to partake of my quests?'\nYou say, 'I wish to partake of your quests'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says, 'Excellent. By serving my cause, you in turn will further your own. I require certain components to aid me and if you bring them to me, I shall reward you for your honorable service. You may choose from among these items: a helm, a breastplate, armplates, bracers, gauntlets, greaves, and boots.'\nUnadorned Armor molds drop from zone trash inside of the Halls of Testing(East Wing) in The Temple of Veeshan. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Unadorned Plate Bracelet\nBoots  - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Unadorned Plate Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Unadorned Plate Vambraces\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Unadorned Plate Gauntlets\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Unadorned Plate Helmet\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Unadorned Plate Greaves\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Unadorned Breastplate\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracer'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'Bracers for the mighty? Retrieve these components and I shall forge the item for you. Bring me Unadorned plate bracers and three crushed flame emeralds.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Unadorned Plate Bracelet\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Bracers\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'A pair of boots you shall have once you have acquired a pair of Unadorned plate boots and three crushed black marbles.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Crushed Black Marble and an Unadorned Plate Boots\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Boots\nArms\nYou say, 'armplates'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'So, a pair of armplates, is what you require? Well, I require Unadorned plate vambraces, and three flawed emeralds before you may receive it. May your deeds be spread throughout the lands!'\nGive Adwetram 3x Flawed Emerald and an Unadorned Plate Vambraces\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Vambraces\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'Mighty gauntlets to aid in obliterating your foes, eh? It is no easy task but I shall require a pair of Unadorned plate gauntlets and three crushed topazes. Hurry along, manling.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Crushed Topaz and an Unadorned Plate Gauntlets\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Gauntlets\nHelm\nYou say, 'helm'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'All I require are an Unadorned plate helmet and three crushed coral pieces. This should be a small task for one such as you. Go now and I shall await your return.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Crushed Coral and a Unadorned Plate Helmet\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Crown\nLegs\nYou say, 'greaves'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'Strength and balance are important, are they not? I shall help give you an advantage with these greaves. Gather three flawed sea sapphires and Unadorned plate greaves.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and an Unadorned Plate Greaves\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Greaves\nChest\nYou say, 'breastplate'\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'As the resolve of your discipline and strength shall endure through a battle, so shall this breastplate. All that is required are an Unadorned breastplate, and three flawless diamonds. Do this quickly so that you may return to the field of battle.'\nGive Adwetram 3x Flawless Diamond and a Unadorned Breastplate\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nAdwetram Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Scaled Knight's Breastplate\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Scaled Knight's Boots [item=5728]\n- Scaled Knight's Bracer [item=5451]\n- Scaled Knight's Breastplate [item=5735]\n- Scaled Knight's Gauntlets [item=5993]\n- Scaled Knight's Greaves [item=5452]\n- Scaled Knight's Helm [item=5791]\n- Scaled Knight's Vambraces [item=5232]\n[",
