 Emerald and a Unadorned Plate Bracelet\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Bracer of Twilight\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'A fancy pair of boots you want is it? Yes, I can see the pair you have now looks a bit worn from running so much. All I require is a set of three crushed pieces of black marble and a pair of Unadorned plate boots.'\nGive Umykith 3x Crushed Black Marble and an Unadorned Plate Boots\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Boots of Twilight\nArms\nYou say, 'armplates'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'A gorgeous pair of armplates shall be yours once you have retrieved a pair of Unadorned plate vambraces and three flawed emeralds. The detail and craftsmanship is stunning!'\nGive Umykith 3x Flawed Emerald and an Unadorned Plate Vambraces\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Vambraces of Twilight\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'It would be a shame if your hands were to be injured and not be able to play your instruments wouldn't it? I shall craft some gauntlets so that your nimble digits remain intact. Bring me a pair of Unadorned plate gauntlets as well as three crushed topaz.'\nGive Umykith 3x Crushed Topaz and an Unadorned Plate Gauntlets\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Gauntlets of Twilight\nHelm\nYou say, 'helm'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'A brand new shiny helm shall be yours once I have an Unadorned plate helmet and three pieces of crushed coral. May the audience swoon in your presence.'\nGive Umykith 3x Crushed Coral and a Unadorned Plate Helmet\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Helm of Twilight\nLegs\nYou say, 'greaves'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'Some new greaves would do you some good. The pair you have now looks quite stained and worn. Nevermind, fetch me a pair of Unadorned plate greaves and three flawed sea sapphires.'\nGive Umykith 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and an Unadorned Plate Greaves\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Greaves of Twilight\nChest\nYou say, 'breastplate'\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'I have need of an Unadorned breastplate and three flawless diamonds. Find these for me and I shall craft you a breastplate, minstrel. May it protect you from unruly audiences with rotten vegetables.'\nGive Umykith 3x Flawless Diamond and a Unadorned Breastplate\nUmykith Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nUmykith Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Breastplate of Twilight\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Boots of Twilight [item=5978]\n- Bracer of Twilight [item=5824]\n- Breastplate of Twilight [item=5648]\n- Gauntlets of Twilight [item=5596]\n- Greaves of Twilight [item=5615]\n- Helm of Twilight [item=5979]\n- Vambraces of Twilight [item=5649]\n[",
