      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nKomawin Fe`Dhar is located in to the left, in a room past the maze in Skyshrine for monks to obtain a set of White Lotus Armor. Approx location: 130, 650\nYou must be at least ALLY with Claws of Veeshan in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Komawin Fe`Dhar'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says, 'Greetings to you. I seek one that has chosen the path of monkhood. What do you call yourself?' '\nYou say, 'I am a monk'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says, 'Good. I had hoped you were one. As seeker of the way you are in constant training to push yourself to your physical and mental limits. It is an admirable quality and I wish to aid you. I will provide you with a cap, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gloves, leggings and boots.'\nUnadorned Armor molds drop from zone trash inside of the Halls of Testing(East Wing) in The Temple of Veeshan. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Unadorned Leather Bracelet\nBoots  - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Unadorned Leather Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Unadorned Leather Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Unadorned Leather Gloves\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Unadorned Leather Cap\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Unadorned Leather Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Unadorned Leather Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracer'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'For a bracer I shall require an Unadorned leather bracelet and a set of three crushed flame emeralds. Do this and the reward shall be yours to keep.'\nGive Komawin 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Unadorned Leather Bracelet\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Wrist Wraps\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'Your feet are hard as any stone and as swift as a coiled serpent but even the swiftest feet require protection so I shall provide you with these. They should help. Acquire a pair of Unadorned tarnished boots and three crushed pieces of black marble.'\nGive Komawin 3x Crushed Black Marble and an Unadorned Leather Boots\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Slippers\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'As the mighty stone that parts the flow of water, so shall these sleeves divert harm against you. Bring me three flawed emeralds and a pair of Unadorned leather sleeves.'\nGive Komawin 3x Flawed Emerald and an Unadorned Leather Sleeves\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Arm Wraps\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'Your hands are like the wind, everflowing and moving. Subtle one moment, then a howling wind raining blow upon blow to your foes. These gloves shall aid you. In order to complete them I require a pair of Unadorned leather gloves and three crushed topaz.'\nGive Komawin 3x Crushed Topaz and an Unadorned Leather Gloves\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Fist of the White Lotus\nHelm\nYou say, 'cap'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'I shall weave one of exceptional quality for you but you must gather the items first. I require an Unadorned leather cap and a set of three pieces of crushed coral.'\nGive Komawin 3x Crushed Coral and a Unadorned Leather Cap\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Headband\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'The leggings shall protect you, as the valley shelters the still pool within its center from the howling winds. Furnish a pair of Unadorned leather leggings and a set of three flawed sea sapphires for me and they are yours.'\nGive Komawin 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and an Unadorned Leather Leggings\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Pants\nChest\nYou say, 'Tunic'\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You shall be an imposing force with this tunic. Solid as the unmoving mountains, it shall protect you. Once I have gained an Unadorned leather tunic and three flawless diamonds, the item is yours.'\nGive Komawin 3x Flawless Diamond and a Unadorned Leather Tunic\nKomawin Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nKomawin Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: White Lotus Chest Wraps\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Fist of the White Lotus [item=6440]\n- White Lotus Arm Wraps [item=5482]\n- White Lotus Chest Wraps [item=5652]\n- White Lotus Headband [item=6218]\n- White Lotus Pants [item=5763]\n- White Lotus Slippers [item=5555]\n- White Lotus Wrist Wraps [item=5450]\n[",
