      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nFardonad Fe`Dhar is located in to the left, in a room past the maze in Skyshrine for clerics to obtain a set of Akkirus' Armor of the Risen. Approx location: 130, 650\nYou must be at least ALLY with Claws of Veeshan in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Fardonad Fe`Dhar'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says, 'Hail, most pious one. I sense the aura of your devotion and conviction and it is strong about you. A shame you are so short lived, mortal. But I see potential in you and for that I shall aid you in your calling if you are a cleric. Do you wish my aid?'\nYou say, 'i wish your aid'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says, 'Then I have a set of goals for you. Once you have achieved them, you shall be rewarded with a helm, a breastplate, armplates, bracers, gauntlets, greaves and boots. May they protect you from your enemies.'\nUnadorned Armor molds drop from zone trash inside of the Halls of Testing(East Wing) in The Temple of Veeshan. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Opal + Unadorned Plate Bracer\nBoots  - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Unadorned Plate Boots\nArms - 3x Jaundice Gem + Unadorned Plate Vambraces\nGloves - 3x Crushed Lava Ruby + Unadorned Plate Gauntlets\nHelm - 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire + Unadorned Plate Helmet\nLegs - 3x Chipped Onyx Sapphire + Unadorned Plate Greaves\nChest - 3x Black Marble + Unadorned Breastplate\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracer'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'For the bracers, faithful one, I shall require the acquisition of an Unadorned plate bracer and three crushed opals.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Crushed Opal and a Unadorned Plate Bracer\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Bracer of the Risen\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'With your aid I shall make a pair of fine boots for you. All that is needed is a pair of an Unadorned plate boots and a trilogy of crushed flame emeralds.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and an Unadorned Plate Boots\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Boots of the Risen\nArms\nYou say, 'armplates'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'For the armplates, I shall require a pair of an Unadorned plate armplates as well as three jaundice gems. Go forth and seek these out.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Jaundice Gem and an Unadorned Plate Vambraces\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Vambraces of the Risen\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'I will need a pair of a Unadorned gauntlets three crushed lava rubys, so that I may make your reward.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Crushed Lava Ruby and an Unadorned Plate Gauntlets\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Gauntlets of the Risen\nHelm\nYou say, 'helm'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'I shall craft a helm for you but you must seek these items out for me first. I have need of an Unadorned plate helmet and three crushed onyx sapphires.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire and a Unadorned Plate Helmet\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Crown of the Risen\nLegs\nYou say, 'greaves'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You shall acquire a pair of an Unadorned plate greaves and three chipped onyx sapphires for me. I await your return.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Chipped Onyx Sapphire and an Unadorned Plate Greaves\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Greaves of the Risen\nChest\nYou say, 'breastplate'\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'Such as your faith protects you so shall this breastplate. I must have an Unadorned breastplate and three pieces of black marble.'\nGive Fardonad 3x Black Marble and a Unadorned Breastplate\nFardonad Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nFardonad Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Akkirus' Breastplate of the Risen\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Akkirus' Boots of the Risen [item=5385]\n- Akkirus' Bracelet of the Risen [item=5154]\n- Akkirus' Chestplate of the Risen [item=5352]\n- Akkirus' Crown of the Risen [item=5135]\n- Akkirus' Gauntlets of the Risen [item=5504]\n- Akkirus' Greaves of the Risen [item=5079]\n- Akkirus' Vambraces of the Risen [item=5390]\n[",
