      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nLothieder Fe`Dhar is located in to the left, in a room past the maze in Skyshrine for enchanters to obtain a set of Illusionist's Armor. Approx location: 130, 650\nYou must be at least ALLY with Claws of Veeshan in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lothieder Fe`Dhar'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says, 'Greetings to you. I seek those who call themselves enchanters. Are you what I seek?'\nYou say, 'I am an enchanter'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says, 'I thought so. I have several tasks for you accomplish. Once you have completed them I will have a cap, a robe, sleeves, wristbands, gloves, leggings and boots to reward you with.'\nUnadorned Armor molds drop from zone trash inside of the Halls of Testing(East Wing) in The Temple of Veeshan. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire + Tattered Silk Wristband\nBoots  - 3x Crushed Jaundice Gem + Tattered Silk Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Topaz + Tattered Silk Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Tattered Silk Gloves\nHelm - 3x Crushed Flame Opal + Tattered Silk Turban\nLegs - 3x Nephrite + Tattered Silk Pantaloons\nChest - 3x Pristine Emerald + Tattered Silk Robe\nBracer\nYou say, 'wristband'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'The crafting of this wristband requires that you bring me an Tattered Silk wristband and three crushed onyx sapphire pieces.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire and a Tattered Silk Wristband\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Wristguard\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'These supple boots shall be yours upon receipt of a pair of Tattered Silk boots and three crushed jaundice gems.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Crushed Jaundice Gem and a Tattered Silk Boots\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Slippers\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'For these durable sleeves, you must fetch me a pair of Tattered Silk sleeves and three flawed topaz.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Flawed Topaz and a Tattered Silk Sleeves\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Sleeves\nGloves\nYou say, 'gloves'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'For this fine pair of gloves you must seek out and return to me a pair of Tattered Silk gloves and three crushed topaz.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Crushed Topaz and a Tattered Silk Gloves\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Gloves\nHelm\nYou say, 'cap'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'For you to receive my gift, I shall require an Tattered Silk turban and three crushed flame opals.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Crushed Flame Opal and an Tattered Silk Turban\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Headband\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'This pair of leggings will yours provided you supply me with a pair of Tattered Silk pantaloons as well as three nephrites.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Nephrite and a Tattered Silk Pantaloons\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Pantaloons\nChest\nYou say, 'robe'\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'This exquisite robe shall be yours in exchange for an Tattered Silk robe and three pristine emeralds.'\nGive Lothieder 3x Pristine Emerald and a Tattered Silk Robe\nLothieder Fe`Dhar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLothieder Fe`Dhar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Illusionist's Robe\nSubmitted by: BobbybcikRewards:\n- Illusionist's Gloves [item=5383]\n- Illusionist's Headband [item=5736]\n- Illusionist's Pantaloons [item=5384]\n- Illusionist's Robe [item=5534]\n- Illusionist's Sleeves [item=5340]\n- Illusionist's Slippers [item=5171]\n- Illusionist's Wristguard [item=5172]\n[",
