      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis quest was added around August 2015 so it may not be available on progression servers.\n1. Kill Praetorian Myral\nPraetorian Myral [npc=7586] is located towards the Scarlet Desert zone line in the southern most room at /loc -450, +1400.\nLoot the Divine Hammer of Consternation [item=12657] and the Scythe of Sundering [item=11385]. You will need both.\n1b (Optional) Find Crumpled Torn Pages, Illegible Torn Pages and Damaged Torn Pages.\nThese pages drop off various NPCs in Mons Letalis Combine these 3 pages in a Tattered Expedition Log [item=132722] to get a Reconstructed Expedition Log [item=125805] that gives you clues as to why you must rend flesh using the Scythe of Sundering and turn them in.\n2. Spawn a shade in Mons Letalis\nIn order to do this, you (or someone else) will need a Scythe of Sundering [item=11385] to summon 4 Chunk of Flesh [item=29992]. Turn these 4 Chunks of Flesh into a pile of fleshless bones [npc=51799] in Mons Letalis. This will spawn a shade named Praetorian K`Tikrn [npc=54555].\n3. Turn in your Divine Hammer of Consternation to the shade\nOnce the shade spawns, turn in your Divine Hammer of Consternation and you will receive the Corrupted Hammer of Consternation [item=123584].\nSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Corrupted Hammer of Consternation [item=123584]\n[",
