      items_required = {
        { name = "the Decorative Bone Staff", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 128063, name = "Staff of Pain", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
        { name = "Swift Tails", change = 5 },
        { name = "Legion of Cabilis", change = 1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is one of the finished Kunark quests added on the February 15, 2017, update.\nFind Zreksan in the East Cabilis monk guild, /waypoint +253, -47\nYou say, 'Hail, Zreksan'\nZreksan gives a short nod of his head and wide swoop of his tail in greetings to Bobbybick, 'Yes? You must have come in search of something, have you not? Perhaps you seek to further your knowledge of [the realm of Pain:I do seek to further my knowledge of the realm of Pain.], yes?'\nYou say, 'I do seek to further my knowledge of the realm of Pain.'\nZreksan says, 'Of course you have, Bobbybick, and I shall be more than willing to oblige your search. First, you must trek deep into the Burning Woods and find one known as Nadira. She is a human monk, one who has come to our homeland in the hopes of vanquishing our people because she feels our art is only worthy to those who follow the way of tranquility. Reave her of that thought, and all thoughts, Bobbybick. Return to me her femur as proof of your success in this task. I shall also need you to acquire Goblin Bone Beads from the goblin mines and a Fine Sheet of Black Ore from the goblin temple.'\nFine Sheet of Black Ore drops from named goblins in revamped Droga or Soothsayer Dregzak in Droga 1.0, Goblin Bone Beads drop from \"The Bone Seer\" in the Mines of Nurga, and Nadira's Femur comes from Nadira who wanders the eastern side of Burning Woods.\nHand Zreksan the Sheet of Black Ore, Goblin Bone Beads, and Nadira's Femur.\nZreksan says, 'Well done, Bobbybick. I do hope that Nadira's demise was a most educational one for you in teaching the ways of pain.' The monk chuckles, a hissing, sinister laughter, as he eyes the femur cradled within his clutching claws, 'I have secured our... departed Soldier of Tranquility's remains into a staff that shall be the beginning of your furthered knowledge in our ways, Bobbybick. It is incomplete, however, and we must enlist the assistance of one known as Tikesh. She shall aid in furthering its completion. Take the staff, as well as a Small Froglok Bone Vial and the Blood of the Arisen Soldier, to Tikesh.'\nReceive: Decorative Bone Staff\nTikesh can be found inside the Court of Pain, the Cabilis Monk Guild.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tikesh'\nNo response to hails.\nSmall Froglok Bone Vial can be found from Krup Ghoul Knights in the crypt of Sebilis (requires a lockpicker), and the Blood of the Arisen Soldier comes from \"The Arisen Soldier\" a named skeleton that spawns just inside the gates of Karnor's Castle.\nGive the Decorative Bone Staff, Small Froglok Bone Vial, and Blood of the Arisen Soldier to Tikesh.\nTikesh says, 'I see that Zreksan has removed the pest in the Burning Wood, yes? The news that Nadira has been taught the ways of pain is quite pleasing. Aaah, and you have brought me bone and blood! How marvelous! Allow me to apply a series of blood runes to your staff... and my work is complete, Bobbybick. Should you wish to improve the staff further, return it to Zreksan along with the Chant of Pain, an item lost to our Order for some time.'\nReceive: Blood Runed Staff\nChant of Pain can be found on \"Pain-Wracked Skeleton\" which spawns in Howling stones (confirmed East Wing unknown if it can appear elsewhere).\nTurn in Blood Runed Staff and the Chant of Pain to Zreksan in the Cabilis monk guild.\nZreksan says, 'Well done, Bobbybick. Well done indeed.' Zreksan holds the staff in one hand and the chant in the other. As he reads the chant, the beads upon the staff begin to sway, as if an ethereal wind were passing through the chamber. As the chant fades to an end, all settles and is calm. He hands you the staff and grins, 'Your instruction in pain continues, Bobbybick. Consider this staff your teacher and heed its lessons.'\nReceive: Staff of Pain\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 1.\n- Staff of Pain\n- Kunark Archaeologist player title suffix if first per server\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Staff of Pain [item=128063]\n[",
