      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Achievement\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis achievement is gained upon defeating the following monsters in The Plane of Hate:\nAll of these attached mobs are from the Plane of Hate B version of the zone. Daybreak lumped all the versions of this zone together into one achievement for some reason.\nIf you want individual listings for the different versions of this zone, click on the zone names at the top left of this quest entry.\nSo you won't be able to complete this achievement until LDoN unlocks on progression servers.\nArcanist V`Gimis\nArch Lich T`Vaxok\nArchon G`Uvin\nan ashenbone broodmaster\nAssassin Z`Jrix\nAvatar of Abhorrence\nCoercer T`Vala\nDread Knight T`Kamax\nDread Lord M`Noxin\nan eerie chest\nEvangelist W`Rixxus\na frightful chest\nGrandmaster H`Qilm\nGrim Abhorrent Kaltik\na grotesque rat\na hatebone broodlord\na hideous rat\nLord of Fury\nLord of Ire\nLord of Loathing\nMagi P`Tasa\nMaster D`Samni\nMaster of Spite\nMaster of Vengeance\nMaster R`Tal\nMistress A`Zara\nMistress of Malevolence\nMistress of Scorn\nOverlord R`Gahbsa\nSorcerer C`Gazin\nSpy Master I`Kavin\nTemplar J`Rosix\nthought destroyer\nVicar M`Kari\nWarlock J`Rath\nWarlord E`Prosio\nSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n[",
