    {
      id = "8607",
      title = "Subversion",
      exp = "05",
      exp_name = "The Legacy of Ykesha",
      min_lvl = 50,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "Unknown",
      loc = { y = 1385.0, x = 75.0, z = 3.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Assistant Vagli",
        "What task?",
        "task",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 60\n**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task was available at level 50\nAssistant Vagli can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Subversion:\nMedium length task, begins in Dulak's Harbor\nObjective Instructions\n- Explore the ship Oceancrasher at one of the eastern docks.\n- Kill 10 subverted miners (Torgiran Mines)\n- Loot 4 Pristine Ore Sample (Torgiran Mines)\n- Explore Overlod Ngrub's room in the east halls of the mine complex (loc for update was +1255, -1306, -146)\n- Deliver 4 Pristine Ore Sample to Calambra (Gulf of Gunthak) (on the boat beside the light house at loc +1480, -1043, +41)\nTask description in Quest Journal:\nThere are books that speak of a place of mystical origins. It has yet to be found, but the belief is that you can find it if you explore the ship Oceancrasher at one of the eastern docks. Stay on your guard while you search for these mystical ruins, for there are stones of someone... or something that doesn't want you around.\n* Pristine Ore Sample is a No Drop item that can be obtained from an mob with \"miner\" in its name.\nUpon turn in,\nYour task 'Subversion' has been updated.\nYour task 'Subversion' has been updated.\nYour task 'Subversion' has been updated.\nYour task 'Subversion' has been updated.\nThis is a historic day for literary minds all over the world. You were finally able to uncover the truth behind the mystical ruins and the beasts that guard it. You must have been terribly fascinated and frightened by the whole prospect, but you certainly kepy your wits about you. The literary society is willing to offer you a good fee for collecting those relics, so please do accept this.\nYou receive Experience\nYou receive 7 copper\nYou receive 2 silver\nYou receive 4 gold\nYou receive 54 platinum Submitted by: SentientShamanRewards:\n[",
    },
    {
      id = "8611",
      title = "Conqueror of The Great Divide",
      exp = "02",
      exp_name = "The Scars of Velious",
      min_lvl = 1,
