oll just inside the door on the right.\nPreceptor Grakomus loc -3905, 2537\nIn the castle, in throne room, on the throne.\nRite Master Kvimimn loc -1913, -259\nIn round building with Kalii Brokenskull spawn. a Luggald PH.\nSea Captain Azobus loc -1217, -933\nInside the broken ship in the SE corner of beach area.\nSoothsayer Hunter Doxok roamer in fort.\nTreasure Hunter Eranil loc -433, -825\nHis PH's are a cast out survivor, a Broken Skull scorpion, a Broken Skull mosquito, a Broken Skull nifilik.\nYou will find by killing these they respawn as different ph. My loc for TH Eranil was one possible.\nDid not get it to respawn to confirm that it was only spawn site. Also spawns by fort too.\nWarmaster Mragoc loc -551, 2309\nFrom the far NW corner of village 4th hut.\nP -2320.8140, 545.9596, 67.4200, 240, 0, 0, 3, Warmaster_Mragoc\nP -2831.3525, 2900.8572, 476.8769, 240, 0, 0, 3, a_human_recruit\nP -2643.8904, 3909.4573, 564.9144, 240, 0, 0, 3, Preceptor_Grakomus\nP -1781.6432, 774.5885, 67.5404, 240, 0, 0, 3, Oracle_Pagrossa\nP -2807.2258, 2998.1206, 457.9511, 240, 0, 0, 3, Harbringer_Stimka\nP -2299.3005, 2914.0103, 476.7820, 240, 0, 0, 3, Dreadmaster_Jrup\nP -2694.0137, 2902.6860, 476.5280, 240, 0, 0, 3, a_mutant_cohort\nP -1981.8442, 871.0886, 70.6252, 240, 0, 0, 3, Blood_Tusk``\nP -1165.2151, 745.3542, 45.0260, 240, 0, 0, 3, Hatethorn\nP -1529.6718, 2222.2285, -53.4644, 240, 0, 0, 3, Guard_Dragrik\nP 418.2851, 1673.2057, 41.5394, 240, 0, 0, 3, an_old_sea_dog\nP 933.8809, 1217.5375, 17.6076, 240, 0, 0, 3, Sea_Captain_Azobus\nP 144.3831, 1974.0129, 42.3901, 240, 0, 0, 3, Soothsayer_Mrugg_Doxok_-_Roamer\nP 238.1427, 1877.9916, 41.7839, 240, 0, 0, 3, Kalii_Brokenskull\nP -1724.6248, 1052.4965, 67.5367, 240, 0, 0, 3, Magus_Evana_Bavomon\nP 237.1934, 2273.2444, 41.7233, 240, 0, 0, 3, a_dastardly_scoundrel\nP 1030.1356, 188.5680, -46.9393, 240, 0, 0, 3, Mokon_Brokenskull\nP 825.8667, 433.0221, 17.5409, 240, 0, 0, 3, Treasure_Hunter_Eranil\nP 259.7961, 1913.0072, 41.5399, 2