      factions = {
        { name = "Kromzek", change = 2 },
        { name = "Kromrif", change = 1 },
        { name = "King Tormax", change = 1 },
        { name = "Claws of Veeshan", change = -1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 50\n**Level:** 30\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\na storm giant surveyor is an uncommon spawn from the giants located outside of Kael in the Wakening Lands.  He can spawn in either the small house a bit south-southwest or the work site directly west of Kael.\nYou say, 'Hail, a storm giant surveyor'\nA storm giant surveyor says, 'You had best be careful about sneaking up on me like that! I nearly squashed you thinking you were one of those pesky Sifaye! They are constantly flittering around me and sticking me with their darts while I survey the forest for Kael's expansion. At least I make a profit off of them by selling their dust to our sorcerers. Hey! Why don't you fill this bag with Sifaye dust for me? I'll not only spare your life but possibly also reward you for the work.'\nYou receive: Empty Sifaye Dust Bag\nSifaye dust is a uncommon/rare drop from Sifaye faeries found throughout Wakening Lands.  There is a small village northwest of the pond and a small encampment along the wall northeast of the pond, along with a number of roamers all over the area.\nCombine 8 Sifaye Dust inside the empty bag to create \"Sifaye Dust Bag\"\nGive Sifaye Dust Bag to a storm giant surveyor\nA storm giant surveyor says, 'Thanks for the assistance, Bobbybic. I'm sure the sorcerers will be pleased. I wonder what it is they do with this stuff anyway.'\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with King Tormax has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!\nReceive: Potion of Kromzek Strength\nUnknown if there are other possible rewards.Submitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Potion of Kromzek Strength [item=58396]\n[",
    },
    {
      id = "8762",
      title = "Yimmrek's Shadow Walker Boots",
      exp = "02",
      exp_name = "The Scars of Velious",
      min_lvl = 1,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "Unknown",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Yimmrek the Herald",
        "Tell me the news.",
        "I am a shadowknight",
        "Is",
        "Tell me more of the boots.",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 3778, name = "Boots of Dark Passage", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nOne of the new Velious quests added in the update on July 19th, 2017.\nYimmrek the Herald can be found towards the center of Kael Drakkel on the Wakening Lands side.\nYou say, 'Hail, Yimmrek the Herald'\nYimmrek the Herald says, 'Hello, hello! I am Yimmrek the small, herald of Kael Drakkel. Do you wish to hear the [news:Tell me the news.]?'\nYou say, 'Tell me the news.'\nYimmrek the Herald says, 'King Tormax has been enlisting the aid of outlanders such as yourself. Rumor has it that he will not speak to you unless you can prove that you are loyal and powerful. Many of our kind resent the recruitment of your kind to fight the dragons and the Coldain. I, however, see it differently. Better on our side than against us, eh? So what is your profession, Bobbybic, or are you just a simple mercenary?'\nYou say, 'I am a shadowknight'\nYimmrek the Herald says, 'So you are a shadow-walker. Quite impressive. There's a Kromrif noble named Clrakk Blackfist who visits Kael every so often. He's a rather odd man... plays with corpses and carries a sword. However, he does not have any [skill with the stones:Is 'the stones' some sort of game?]!'\nYou say, 'Is 'the stones' some sort of game?'\nYimmrek the Herald says, 'Yes, it's a game we giants play. We roll specially shaped stones and try to beat each other's rolls. It's more complicated than that, but I won't bore you with the details. Last time he was in town, Clrakk lost his [boots:Tell me more of the boots.] to me in a heated game. Unfortunately, they are of no use to me.'\nYou say, 'Tell me more of the boots.'\nYimmrek the Herald pulls out a pair of pitch black boots. 'These are the boots. They look nice but something about them bothers me. Maybe a shadow walker like you wouldn't feel so bad about wearing them. I could trade them to you for something. It would have to be worthwhile, though. I have heard rumors of great musicians from Antonica...'\nYimmrek wants something from great Antonican Musicians,  this happens to be some old instruments that came from dragons.  The Selo's Drums of the March and McVaxius' Horn of War.\nGive Yimmrek Selo's Drums of the March and McVaxius' Horn of War.\nYimmrek the Herald says, 'Wonderful! You've brought me the instruments I desire! Now, take these dark boots... I'm happy to be rid of them!'\nReceive: Boots of the Dark Passage.\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Boots of Dark Passage [item=3778]\n[",
    },
