      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nExterminator Jaliss in the northwest section of the zone has a task for you. A level 1 can do this task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Exterminator Jaliss'\nExterminator Jaliss says, 'Can you not see I am busy here, fool? I am devising a plan to get rid of all these young chokidai that have infested our town. You could be of some use to me however. Go kill as many of the young chokidai as you can and bring me four loose scales and I will give you some spare change. Now run along, young one.'\nA few young scaled wolves [npc=12165] roam around. Kill them and loot 4 Loose Scales [item=2984].\nUpon Hand In:\nExterminator Jaliss says, 'Perhapss you are not as uselesss as I thought you were.  Here is your money.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist has been adjusted by 1.\nour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive 1 copper from Exterminator Jaliss.\nYou receive 1 silver from Exterminator Jaliss.\nYou receive 1 gold from Exterminator Jaliss.\nYou have completed Cabilis Quests - Exterminate the Vermin for JalissSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Experience, Faction and Coin\n[",
