        { name = "Goblins of Mountain Death", change = 50 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is a new quest added in the May 2018 Patch.\nYou will need AT LEAST apprehensive faction for this quest (Tested and confirmed that Dubious will not work and Indifferent will work).\nZusuu the Mineralist is a common spawn in the western section of the Mines of Nurga, he has many potential placeholders.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zusuu the Mineralist'\nZusuu the Mineralist says, 'Hello there, Bobbybick.  I trust you are here to assist with the mining.  I am just now in the process of [cleansing] a new batch of stones.'\nYou say, 'Cleansing?'\nZusuu the Mineralist says, 'Well... it is actually quite a funny story. Barkeep Sagaag created a special drink.  It doesn't go down smoothly, but the aftertaste has a great kick to it.  Oddly enough when I accidentally spilt my drink on a bag of stones one day, they began to glimmer.  Ever since then, I dip the rare stones of the Mines of Nurga in Sagaag's Finest to give them a glowing coat.  I seem to be out of Sagaag's Finest though. Perhaps if someone can ask him for some, I can continue this process.'\nSagaag can be found in the eastern section of Nurga, just past the dropdown into the pool of water from Frontier Mountains.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sagaag'\nSagaag says, 'Hi there. Sagaag mix good drinks. You drink some and you will see. Try the Nurgan Herbal Ale. It tastes real good.  At least that's what they tell me.'\nYou say, 'finest'\nSagaag says, 'Sagaag can't make Sagaag's Finest right now.  Sagaag needs some of Poguu's Herbal Growth to make it. Bring Sagaag the herbs and Sagaag make good drink for you.'\nPoguu the Herbalist is a common spawn in the Western/Central section of Nurga.  Like Zusuu, he has many potential placeholders.\nYou say, 'Hail, Poguu the Herbalist'\nPoguu the Herbalist says, 'Greetings, Bobbybick. Speak to my assistant if you wish to purchase some herbs or potions.'\nYou say, 'Herbal Growth'\nPoguu the Herbalist says, 'In order to get the herbal growth to rise, I will need some Mt. Death Mineral Salts to spread over the crops.  Bring me four piles of the salt from the Drogans and I will be able to cultivate my herbs.'\nMt. Death Mineral Salts are a common drop from any goblin in Droga and revamped nurga.\nGive 4 Mt. Death Mineral Salts to Poguu the Herbalist.\nPoguu the Herbalist says, 'Ah, you found the salt. I will use it to plow the field... There, now my herbal growth will rise.'\nYour faction standing with Goblins of Mountain Death has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Brood of Di`Zok has been adjusted by -1.\nReceive: Poguu's Herbal Growth\nGive Poguu's Herbal Growth to Sagaag\nSagaag says, 'Just what Sagaag needs to make Sagaa's Finest! Here you are.'\nYour faction standing with Goblins of Mountain Death has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Brood of Di`Zok has been adjusted by -1.\nReceive: Sagaag's Finest\nGive Sagaag's Finest to Zusuu the Mineralist\nZusuu the Mineralist says, 'Excellent! Thank you for bringing me a fresh supply of Sagaag's Finest. Now I will attempt to coat the stones. It doesn't always work the same, but I will give you the outcome of the dipping.'\nYour faction standing with Goblins of Mountain Death has been adjusted by 50.\nYour faction standing with Brood of Di`Zok has been adjusted by -2.\nYou gain experience!\nReceive random mid-level gem (Star Ruby, Fire Opal, Peridot, Fire Emerald confirmed possible rewards)\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Fire Emerald [item=2833]\n- Fire Opal [item=2836]\n- Peridot [item=7783]\n- Star Ruby [item=3142]\n[",
