      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 60:00:00\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis is a seasonal quest. You can get this quest from M.C. Tinkerton in PoK next to the Great Divide stone. He is on the Find tool as well.\nYou say, 'Hail, M.C. Tinkerton'\nM.C. Tinkerton says, 'Hello, _____!  You've caught me in a bit of a [bind].'\nYou say, 'bind'\nM.C. Tinkerton says, 'I'm trying to get my clockwork party machine up and running but the dang thing just wont move!  Its primary party motivator was stolen by the [Dark Mistletoe giants]!'\nYou say, 'Dark Mistletoe giants'\nM.C. Tinkerton says, 'The Dark Mistletoe giants are a grumpy old clan that lives in the Great Divide.  Their leader, Old Frostbeard, complained my party machine was keeping him up at night!  Bah!  The old geezer goes to bed at five thirty in the afternoon!  We'd be well within our rights to [steal it back]!'\nYou say, 'steal it back'\nM.C. Tinkerton says, 'Wait a minute, _____!  Steal it back?  That's a great idea!  Why didn't I think of that?  Here's what you need to do!  Once you return with that motivator, we're going to party like it's 3199!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Frostbeard's Greater Minions'.\n1. Kill 10 Dark Mistletoe Clan Guards 0/10 The Great Divide\nTask Window: The Dark Mistletoe Clan lives in the Great Divide. Careful, these giants are well versed in the use of poisons and other forms of nastiness. They once threw a pinecone at some kid and then laughed about it later! Does their wickedness know no bounds?\nThe Dark Mistletoe Clan guards are located west side of wurm cave mountain in the center of the zone. Champion Stinging Nettle might be among them, if he's not then you have to wait for respawn.\n2. Kill Champion Stinging Nettle 0/1 The Great Divide\nTask Window: Venture to the Great Divide and take out 10 Dark Mistletoe Clan guards. Then give Champion Stinging Nettle a holiday beating from me! With those guards out of the way, the Dark Mistletoe Clan won't have much defense against your next attack!\nHe is located at -4800 -160 -180 in the middle of Great Divide. This is where the Dark mistletoe guards are.\n3. Return to M. C. Tinkerton with news of your success 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nHail M. C. Tinkerton to get your reward.\n(Dialogue?)\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!\nJadestone of the New Year [item=62457]Submitted by: GOMNRewards:\n- Champagne [item=50393]\n- Firework: Dancing Lights [item=61737]\n- Firework: Phantom Fire [item=61623]\n- Jadestone of the New Year [item=62457]\n- Mist of the Ant [item=47822]\n- Potion of Invisibility [item=25297]\n[",
