ready to get my motivator back from Old Man Frostbeard\nLocated west side of wurm cave mountain with the other mistletoe elders, if he's not then you have to wait for respawn.\n3. Return to M. C. Tinkerton with news of your success 0/1 The Plane of Knowledge\nHail M. C. Tinkerton to get your reward.\nYou say, 'Hail, M.C. Tinkerton'\nM.C. Tinkerton gives you his thanks for clearing out the Dark Mistletoe Clan elders.\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!\nGemstone of the New Year [item=65838]Submitted by: GOMNRewards:\n- Champagne [item=50393]\n- Firework: Dancing Lights [item=61737]\n- Firework: Phantom Fire [item=61623]\n- Gemstone of the New Year [item=65838]\n- Mist of the Ant [item=47822]\n- Potion of Invisibility [item=25297]\n[",
