      loc = { y = 1515.0, x = -244.0, z = 5.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Cadale Brohat",
        "tasks",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 65\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nThis task can be obtained from Cadale Brohat in Gulf of Gunthak at +1515, -244, +5 inside the light house in the far northern part of the zone. She is on the find tool.\nThere is a level limit on this task. I wasn't able to get it on a level 85 but was able to on a level 64.\nYou say, 'Hail, Cadale Brohat'\nCadale Brohat smiles widely at you. 'Welcome. You are brave to venture to Broken Skull Rock. Don't mind the others. Everyone is a bit touchy around here. If you are interested in dyes, feel free to peruse what I have to offer. Playing with them has given me hours of entertainment! Just be careful on this rock, and watch your back. Oh, before I forget, I'm looking for someone to help me with some [tasks] that I need to get done. All my time with the dyes has kept me from some of the more important things I need to take care of.'\nYou say, 'tasks'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Oh Captain...'.\n1. Explore the captain's quarters 0/1 Hate's Fury\nTask Window: You're about to embark on an adventure that will keep your sense clear and focused. There are no words to describe what you'll uncover, but know that when you arrive, you will find everything you had hoped for and more. To begin this amazing journey, just explore the captain's quarters. You'll have the time of your life.\n2. ??? ???\nTask Window: ?\n3. ??? ???\nTask Window: ?\n4. ??? ???\nTask Window: ?\n5. ??? ???\nTask Window: ?\nReward(s):\n?Submitted by: GidonoRewards:\n[",
    },
